hain currency pairs to their users.\par \par \uc2 By using an automated market maker (AMM) mechanism, Lunex Network will ensure all of the trading gets matched against the liquidity pool, not traditional order books. As a reward, investors can receive millions of dollars in revenue through trading fees and cashback, in return for providing the needed liquidity and obtaining LP tokens.\par \par \uc2 Additionally, staking the $LNEX will yield passive income as high as 18% APY. The Lunex Network ensures users stay in control of their assets while ensuring a secure and private setting sans any intermediaries. Rewards for liquidity providers can also be enhanced through trading fees and cashback in native tokens like \uc2 SOL\uc2  and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 New Cardano Protocol Negatively Impacts \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  Price\par \par \uc2 Despite the optimism expressed by Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) founder \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  token has not matched other leading cryptocurrencies. Since January 2024, several cryptocurrencies have leapt to new heights, yet \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price declined by 42.12%. In the current greed market, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is one of the few to register below 16 green days in the past 30 days.\par \par \uc2 Over the course of the last 7 days, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) peaked at $0.367 but quickly fell by 6.29%, continuing its known up-and-down trend. Many new implementations have been ongoing on the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  network, which Charles stated would massively improve Cardano. However, the Ouroboros Peras protocol has yet to deliver on its promises, with over {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://app.intotheblock.com/coin/ADA/quick-view"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 85% of \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  addresses}}}\uc2  currently holding losses.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Inflation Prompts \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Sentiments\par \par \uc2 With over $73 billion in market capitalization, \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) has established its dominance as a top-five cryptocurrency. However, much remains to be relished about its fundamentals. According to CoinMarketCap, \uc2 SOL\uc2  has an infinite maximum supply, putting its inflation rate at a whopping 12.56%.\par \par \uc2 Despite a 9.8% price increase in the past week, \uc2 SOL\uc2  still trades 26.48% below its cycle high. \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) has only grown 51% since January 2024, a year that saw many cryptocurrencies reach new heights. Public sentiments also weigh on \uc2 Solana\uc2  as the platform faces backlash for the long chain of dApp scams and centralization accusations.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 Currently in the third stage of its presale, one LNEX token goes for as low as $0.0015. With the highly anticipated launch, there will be much interest mainly from those searching for secure and user-friendly DeFi. Where else would you want to invest other than a platform that provides crypto rewards for engaging its ecosystem?\par \par \uc2 You can find more information about Lunex Network (LNEX) here:\par \par \uc2 Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://lunexnetwork.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://lunexnetwork.com}}}\par \par \uc2 Socials: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://linktr.ee/lunexnetwork"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://linktr.ee/lunexnetwork}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241021ekak0000g\par }\page {\