\par\par \b \uc2 Beyond Bitcoin: 3 Altcoins Expected to Explode During the Bull Run\b0\par\par\uc2 Jana Serfontein \par \uc2 1,007 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 October 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin ($BTC) Asserts its Position as Market Leader}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investors Look to Altcoins}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu ($HINU) Presale Explodes}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano ($\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bonk ($BONK)}}}\par \par \uc2 The crypto market has grown momentum in the past few days, with market leader Bitcoin ($BTC) leading the charge. While Bitcoin continues in its stride, numerous altcoins are expected to surge during the bull run, positioning themselves as worthy investment options.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ($BTC) Asserts its Position as Market Leader\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has faced months of sideways price action but is finally breaking out. In the past week, $BTC has gained over 11.8%, currently trading at $67,859. Market sentiment appears to have changed as the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://alternative.me/crypto/fear-and-greed-index/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto Fear and Greed Index}}}\uc2  now rates market sentiment at 73 (greed) as opposed to last week\u8217\'20\'19s reading of 32 (fear).\par \par \uc2 The US elections will soon take place, and many market onlookers wonder whether the outcome will affect the crypto market, given each candidate\u8217\'20\'19s opposing views on crypto.\par \par \uc2 Blackrock\uc2  CEO {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/EricBalchunas/status/1845944946991276494?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1845944946991276494%7Ctwgr%5E4096bfe8d478fc50d85ebacc65612e0a32d90997%7Ctwcon%5Es1_&ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Fbitcoinmagazine.com%2Fbusiness%2Fblackrock-ceo-is-right-trump-and-kamala-cant-stop-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Larry Fink}}}\uc2  recently commented on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s growing legitimacy as an investment, comparing Bitcoin to commodities such as gold. Fink declared:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI'm not sure if either president would make a difference" on Bitcoin's growth,\u8221\'20\'1D adding, "I don't believe [Bitcoin's rise] is a function of \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Fink\u8217\'20\'19s views are refreshing coming from a Wall Street leader. Wall Street hot-shot such as \uc2 Jamie Dimon\uc2  has been vocal and dismissive of Bitcoin for a long time, making Fink\u8217\'20\'19s remarks all the more favourable. Fink appears to understand that political outcomes do not change Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s long-term performance and that it thrives on its technical merits rather than regulatory changes.\par \par \uc2 Investors Look to Altcoins\par \par \uc2 As the dominant store of value, BTC remains the go-to choice for institutional investors. However, its recent price fluctuations have left some questioning whether {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  can continue to dominate the market in the long term. In light of the valid concerns of market participants, more and more investors are looking at alternatives to Bitcoin to make the most of the bull run.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s look at 3 altcoin projects expected to surge in the upcoming cycle.\par \par \uc2 Husky Inu ($HINU) Presale Explodes\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/10/overnight-memecoin-rally-likely-to-spur-husky-inu-hinu-presale-growth"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu ($HINU)}}}\uc2  recently joined the crypto scene, significantly impacting the industry. The project\u8217\'20\'19s recently launched {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/husky-inu-hinu-presale-generates-over-260000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 presale}}}\uc2  has gone very well, with the first stage selling out within days. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/husky-inus-hinu-second-presale-stage-sells-out"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second stage}}}\uc2  of its presale sold out, and the project is undertaking its third fundraising round with great enthusiasm. Since going live, the presale has generated almost $447,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/shiba-inu-shib-and-new-best-friend-husky-inu-hinu-ready-to-rocket"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  ($HINU) entered the crypto space with a bang to compete with industry giants, including Dogecoin and its new best friend, Shiba Inu. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/solanas-superstar-memecoins-hinu-wif-bonk-and-maga"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 project}}}\uc2  has an Earn App in the works and a Decentralized Exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/why-husky-inu-hinu-is-the-hottest-crypto-investment-in-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  ($HINU) and its native token were designed to improve utility and value for its holders by harnessing the power of the Solana ecosystem. The project aims to conquer the industry to create a robust and supportive community with improved features and rewards. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/10/cheap-memecoins-under-1-to-boost-your-portfolio-in-the-bull-run"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu}}}\uc2  made a name for itself thanks to its commitment to a reliable token ecosystem. It achieves this through a carefully designed distribution model and capped maximum supply. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/10/bitcoin-alternatives-to-turn-1000-into-100000-this-bull-run"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 project}}}\uc2  boasts several unique features that set it apart from traditional investment opportunities, including a capped token supply, a deflationary mechanism, speedy transactions, and charity voting. It is, of course, still an early investment opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehuskyinu.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click here}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano ($\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 )\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cardano.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano}}}\uc2  is a blockchain platform providing a secure and scalable infrastructure to develop dApps and smart contracts. The Cardano blockchain was created through a rigorous research-driven approach and focuses on scalability, sustainability, and interoperability to address the limitations of existing blockchain technologies. It is a prominent third-generation blockchain that prioritizes technological concerns like sustainability, scalability, and security. It is one of the most sophisticated and effective blockchain systems owing to its Design For Telecom (DFT) architecture and unique proof of stake (PoS) consensus mechanism, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cardano.org/ouroboros/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ouroboros}}}\uc2 . Ouroboros ensure network security and energy efficiency by allowing participants to earn rewards through staking the platform\u8217\'20\'19s native token, $\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 $\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  serves multiple purposes within Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ecosystem and can be used for transactions and participating in platform governance through voting proposals and upgrades. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano ($\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2  currently ranks as the 11th biggest crypto by market cap, boasting over 40% growth in the past year.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) trades at $0.3472, below the 200-day and 50-day Daily Moving Averages. Over the last 24 hours, Cardano ($\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has dropped 0.06% in price.\par \par \uc2 Bonk ($BONK)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bonk1/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BONK}}}\uc2  is marketed as the first dog-themed token on the Solana blockchain \u8220\'20\'1Cfor the people, by the people,\u8221\'20\'1D with 50% of its total supply airdropped to members of the Solana community. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/05/bonk-price-prediction-bonk-pumps-28-but-investors-are-shifting-attention-to-this-multichain-meme-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BONK}}}\uc2  launched in December 2022, and its launch caused $\uc2 SOL\uc2  to gain 34% in 48 hours. The project\u8217\'20\'19s goal is to bring liquidity back to Solana-based DEXs. With a market cap exceeding $1.76 billion, $BONK currently ranks 54th.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://u.today/778-million-in-bonk-bonk-in-24-hours-as-price-skyrockets-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bonk (BONK)}}}\uc2 , like other meme coins, has exploded in popularity thanks to its strong community backing and viral potential. Initially seen as just another speculative token, Bonk (BONK) has surprised many by delivering significant returns to early investors. Much like Pepe ($PEPE) before it, Bonk ($BONK) is capitalizing on the meme-coin phenomenon, where coins with robust community support can achieve meteoric rises in value.\par \par \uc2 While {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/10/bonk-bonk-and-mpeppe-are-two-cryptos-that-are-booming-right-experts-dive-in"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bonk's (BONK)}}}\uc2  success is primarily tied to social media hype and community engagement, it offers high-risk, high-reward opportunities for traders looking to capitalize on short-term gains. In the past week, $BONK has gained almost 15% and is poised for immense growth during the bull run.\par \par \uc2 Visit the following links for more information on Husky Inu:\par \par \uc2 Website: Husky Inu Official Website\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/huskyinureal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Twitter}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/thehuskyinu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Husky Inu Telegram}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241019ekai00003\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/18: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,833 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 October 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally toward $70,000 is pulling altcoins higher and signaling that the bull market is back in full swing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTAvMDE5MmEwNjktN2YyNi03NDcyLThlOTAtMDllYjI2YWVkZDlj.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 10/18: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers have pushed Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) above the near-term resistance of $68,500 on Oct. 18, signaling resumption of the up move. The rally of the past few days has been backed by solid buying. United States-based Bitcoin exchange-traded funds have witnessed sharp inflows of $2.1 billion in the past five trading days, per Farside Investors {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://farside.co.uk/btc/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 data}}}\uc2 . That has pushed the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etfs-cross-record-20-b-net-flows-but-btc-subdued-under-68k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 total net inflows to more than $20 billion}}}\uc2 , according to Bloomberg senior ETF analyst \uc2 Eric Balchunas\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 However, there is no consensus among analysts {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-are-bitcoin-traders-worried-painful-btc-price-dip"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 about Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s short-term price action}}}\uc2 . Some believe that the surging Bitcoin futures open interest is a cause for concern, as that could result in a sharp pullback. On the other hand, Coinglass said that the increase in open interest \u8220\'20\'1Csignals a significant price movement ahead.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192a062-990b-776b-960a-cb5c384912f4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 As Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price nears the all-time high, traders may take a cautious approach. Bitcoin has been in a sideways price action for several months, so bears are likely to sell aggressively as the price nears the resistance of the range.\par \par \uc2 If the price remains in the upper half of the $54,000 to $73,777 range, the sentiment could improve, benefiting the altcoins. Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to spot the crucial support and resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 After a minor pullback on Oct. 17, Bitcoin bulls have reasserted their supremacy by pushing the price above $68,500 on Oct. 18.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192a063-2fd9-7921-9047-453308ddd577"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair is likely to reach $70,000 and then $72,000. Sellers are expected to fiercely defend this zone, but if the bulls prevail, the pair could surge to the all-time high at $73,777. This level is again expected to act as a formidable hurdle.\par \par \uc2 Any pullback is likely to find support at the 20-day exponential moving average ($64,268). Sellers will have to yank the price below the 20-day EMA to weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. The short-term trend will turn \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on a break below $60,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the triangle\u8217\'20\'19s resistance line for the past five days, signaling that the bulls are maintaining their pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192a063-d56d-7e19-baab-1fddc27d0777"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers thrust the price above the triangle, the ETH/USDT pair could rise to $2,850. This level may act as a resistance, but on the way down, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA ($2,523), it will suggest a change in trend. The pair may then attempt a rally to $3,400.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages. Such a move will suggest that the pair may remain inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is gradually climbing toward the overhead resistance of $635, where the bears are likely to step in.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192a064-6628-786b-a4fb-e3c5e2c9abe2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually upsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) in the positive territory give a slight edge to the buyers. If bulls pierce the $635 resistance, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to $722 and then to $810.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down sharply from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the moving averages, it will signal that the pair may spend some more time inside the $460 to $635 range.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is trying to take support at the 20-day EMA ($148), indicating that the bulls are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192a064-ebb7-771e-a161-5e4898dd37ed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will make one more attempt to propel the price above the $164 overhead resistance. If they succeed, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair will complete an ascending triangle pattern. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup could start a rally to $189.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is the immediate support, and below that the uptrend line. Sellers will have to yank the price below the uptrend line to invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern. The pair may then slump to $127.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the moving averages on Oct. 17 but could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192a065-69b2-7a02-9d43-c7bcc04b455f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The uptrend line is the nearby support to keep an eye on. If the price breaks below the uptrend line, it will suggest that the bulls have given up. The pair could then fall to the critical support at $0.50.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off the uptrend line, it will suggest that the bulls are buying on dips. That will increase the likelihood of a break above the 50-day simple moving average ($0.56). The XRP/USDT pair may then attempt a rally to $0.64.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rose above the symmetrical triangle pattern on Oct. 18, indicating that the bulls have overpowered the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192a065-ec7e-7076-9371-e8ab6d6a0d7a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price holds above the triangle, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to $0.17 and subsequently to the pattern target of $0.19.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and re-enters the triangle, it will signal that the markets have rejected the breakout. The pair may fall to the 20-day EMA, an important near-term support to watch out for. If the price bounces off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again attempt to start the up move.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers are finding it difficult to push Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) above the moving averages, but a minor positive is that the bulls have not ceded ground to the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192a066-80ff-705a-a7a7-b166475068f0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 That improves the prospects of a rally above the moving averages. If that happens, the TON/USDT pair could rally to $6, where the bears may again mount a strong defense. However, if buyers bulldoze their way through, the pair may rally to $7.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, if the $5 level fails to hold, the pair may drop to the $4.72 to $4.44 support zone. Buyers are expected to protect this zone with all their might because a break below it will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern. The pair may then descend to $3.50.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dogwifhat-price-comeback-wif-76-rally-30-days"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogwifhat price makes a comeback as WIF price rallies 76% in 30 days \u8212\'20\'14 What\u8217\'20\'19s next?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading in a tight range between $0.33 and $0.37 for the past few days, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192a067-087e-7661-aa43-f8419c978f62"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the $0.33 support cracks, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could retest the crucial support at $0.31. The bulls are expected to defend this level with strength, but if the bears prevail, the pair may skid to $0.27.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price rises from the current level and breaks above $0.37, it will suggest that the bulls are attempting a comeback. The pair could then rally to $0.40. This level may be a solid hurdle, but if the bulls overcome it, the pair may rise to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on Oct. 14, but the bulls are trying to defend the 20-day EMA ($27.30).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192a067-a1a1-73a8-98c8-fa7fe255a6f0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with strength, the bulls will again attempt to drive the AVAX/USDT pair above the resistance line. If they can pull it off, the pair could rally to $37 and then to $42.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to sink the pair to the support line. A break and close below the triangle will open the doors for a possible decline to $17.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading just below the $0.000020 overhead resistance, indicating that the bulls have maintained their pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192a068-329c-7878-a671-1c3d458bea14"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bloomberg, Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.000017) is sloping up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the positive territory, indicating the possibility of a breakout. If the price closes above $0.000020, the SHIB/USDT pair will complete an inverted H&S pattern. This reversal setup has a target objective of $0.000028.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to swiftly pull the price below the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the pair may drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.000015), extending its stay inside the $0.000012 to $0.000020 range.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTAvMDE5MmEwNjktN2YyNi03NDcyLThlOTAtMDllYjI2YWVkZDlj.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241018ekai000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Crypto.com\par \b \uc2 Crypto.com sees \u8216\'20\'18strong legal footing\u8217\'20\'19 in crypto rulings against SEC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Helen Partz \par \uc2 792 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 October 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The company claims that the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s action exemplifies \u8220\'20\'1Cunauthorized and unjust \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTAvMDE5MjlmMDktMDQ4ZS03NzM3LWJiMWEtYTIyYzlmMGM2OWVm.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto.com sees \u8216\'20\'18strong legal footing\u8217\'20\'19 in crypto rulings against SEC}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com, a cryptocurrency exchange and service provider, has cited recent court rulings against the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC) as potentially aiding its legal battle with the regulator.\par \par \uc2 On Oct. 8, Crypto.com\u8217\'20\'19s co-founder and CEO {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/top-people-in-crypto-and-blockchain-2023/kris-marszalek"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kris Marszalek}}}\uc2  announced that the exchange {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-com-sues-sec-protect-future-crypto-us"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 filed a lawsuit against the SEC}}}\uc2  in response to a Wells notice from the agency.\par \par \uc2 The company claims that the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s action exemplifies \u8220\'20\'1Cunauthorized and unjust \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D even as the next US presidential administration may take a \u8220\'20\'1Cmore constructive and effective approach\u8221\'20\'1D to cryptocurrency.\par \par \uc2 Legal rulings offer hope\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency industry has seen significant legal victories over the SEC in recent years, setting important precedents for companies like Crypto.com.\par \par \uc2 One such victory was made by crypto asset manager Grayscale Investments, which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-wins-sec-lawsuit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 won a case against the SEC}}}\uc2  in August 2024. The legal win allowed Grayscale to convert its over-the-counter \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2  (GBTC) into a spot Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) exchange-traded fund (ETF), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-spot-etf-volumes-break-records-blackrock-fidelity-grayscale"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 which started trading in January}}}\uc2  alongside a dozen other spot BTC ETFs.\par \par \uc2 Another {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-wins-case-against-sec-as-judge-rules-xrp-is-not-a-security"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crucial ruling came in July 2023}}}\uc2  with a court deciding that XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is not a security when sold on \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchanges, prompting XRP\u8217\'20\'19s return to global exchanges after numerous delistings\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01929f82-b924-7b1b-9969-244fdcbeee36"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC, United States, Crypto.com, Companies, Policy}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/BlockchainAssn/status/1843703305668895068"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Blockchain Association}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CUS Courts have provided the crypto industry much-needed relief from the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s enforcement by \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  overreach by confirming what we\u8217\'20\'19ve known all along \u8212\'20\'14 that crypto is not itself a security,\u8221\'20\'1D Crypto.com\u8217\'20\'19s chief legal officer Nick Lundgren told Cointelegraph on Oct. 17.\par \par \uc2 He added:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThese rulings against the SEC put us on strong legal footing to prevail in our suit. We trust the US Judicial Branch will ultimately provide the regulatory certainty the SEC has failed to deliver.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Wells notice doesn\u8217\'20\'19t halt US operations\par \par \uc2 By definition, the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s Wells notice is a communication informing a company that the regulator has concluded that they should be charged with violating securities laws.\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com\u8217\'20\'19s receipt of a Wells notice does not mean that the company should halt operations in the US.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWells notice is not a final determination that prevents a defendant from continuing its business,\u8221\'20\'1D Michael Gold, partner at Securities, Regulatory and Transactional group, told Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 He mentioned that the recipient has the opportunity to respond to the Wells notice with a Wells Submission containing its arguments about why the charges should not be brought against the target. Gold added:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIn essence, they are taking the position that what they are doing is lawful and they are going to continue to do it. If they win in court, no harm no foul.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com\u8217\'20\'19s US presence\par \par \uc2 Headquartered in Singapore, Crypto.com officially {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-com-rolls-out-its-exchange-platform-in-the-united-states"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rolled out exchange services}}}\uc2  in the US in March 2022, initially opening its platform exclusively to select institutional investors.\par \par \uc2 However, in June 2023, Crypto.com {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-com-suspends-us-institutional-exchange-service"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 suspended its institutional platform in the US}}}\uc2 , citing limited demand. The move came shortly after the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-sues-coinbase-crypto-exchange"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC sued US-based exchange Coinbase}}}\uc2  over the alleged offering of unregistered securities in the form of tokens like Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) and others.\par \par \uc2 While shutting down its institutional offering, Crypto.com allegedly continued offering retail services, according to social media commentary. Some users on reddit {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reddit.com/r/CryptoCurrency/comments/14597kn/cryptocom_suspends_us_institutional_exchange/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 claimed}}}\uc2  that the platform remained \u8220\'20\'1Cfully operational\u8221\'20\'1D in the US for retail users.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-ripple-appeal-no-challenge-xrp-not-a-security"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC\u8217\'20\'19s Ripple appeal doesn\u8217\'20\'19t challenge XRP non-security status}}}\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s unclear which Crypto.com products and services are currently available to either retail or institutional clients in the US.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01929f81-dc1c-75a6-be48-fefcd566568a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC, United States, Crypto.com, Companies, Policy}}}\par \par \uc2 An excerpt from the list of Crypto.com-supported US jurisdictions. Source. Crypto.com\par \par \uc2 On its website, Crypto.com {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://help.crypto.com/en/articles/2692288-in-which-u-s-states-the-crypto-com-app-is-available"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 states}}}\uc2  that it is currently available in 49 US states, as well as US territories. The company maintains a local headquarters in Texas. The list of supported jurisdictions doesn\u8217\'20\'19t include New York, as Crypto.com is working to receive the necessary approvals there:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19ll continue to evaluate the steps required to offer our services in New York (our goal) and will provide updates when and if the status in this restricted state changes,\u8221\'20\'1D the website reads.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-com-surpasses-coinbase-trading-volume-institutional-growth"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto.com surpassed Coinbase in trading volume}}}\uc2  in August, reportedly reaching $3.2 billion in daily trading. Crypto.com\u8217\'20\'19s managing director, Giuseppe Giuliani, attributed the growth to stronger market conditions and acquisitions of new institutional clients.\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/3ac-three-arrowz-capitel-edgelord-memecoin-fat-girlfriend-asia-express/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Edgelord 3AC\u8217\'20\'19s bet on memecoin supercycle \u8212\'20\'14 seeks \u8216\'20\'18racist cult leader\u8217\'20\'19: Asia Express}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTAvMDE5MjlmMDktMDQ4ZS03NzM3LWJiMWEtYTIyYzlmMGM2OWVm.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241018ekai0008l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
