he evolving landscape and deliver impressive results.\par \par \uc2 Join BlockDAG - Act Now Before Prices Increase:\par \par \uc2 Presale: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://purchase.blockdag.network/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://purchase.blockdag.network}}}\par \par \uc2 Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://blockdag.network"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://blockdag.network}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/blockDAGnetwork"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/blockDAGnetwork}}}\par \par \uc2 Discord: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://discord.gg/Q7BxghMVyu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://discord.gg/Q7BxghMVyu}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241018ekah0000p\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 insider trading\par \b \uc2 What is insider trading? Meaning, examples and penalties\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Marcel Deer \par \uc2 1,577 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 October 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Understand what insider trading means, the penalties and famous cases, including how governments are cracking down on such tactics.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy83Y2Y2MWQ3ZmEwNjU2ZTQ1MDAwZDk2Nzg1MDM0YTRmNi5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 What is insider trading? Meaning, examples and penalties}}}\par \par \uc2 What is insider trading?\par \par \uc2 Insider trading is the process of buying or selling a company\u8217\'20\'19s stock or security based on private, nonpublic information or owning at least 10% of a public company stock.\par \par \uc2 In many countries, certain forms of insider trading in stock markets are illegal as they are viewed as unfair advantages to other investors.\par \par \uc2 Not all forms of insider trading are illegal, and regulatory bodies have very strict rules about what is and isn\u8217\'20\'19t allowed. In the United States, the \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC) governs the insider trading law. They allow insiders to buy and sell shares of a company legally, but they must be correctly registered in advance with the SEC.\par \par \uc2 Examples of legal insider trading include a CEO buying back shares in their company or employers buying stock in the company they work for.\par \par \uc2 When you think of insider trading, it invokes a darker image - the illegal kind where people have secret information they use to their advantage. Illegal insider trading doesn\u8217\'20\'19t just apply to company executives and staff. Relatives, friends and people on the street can partake in insider trading if the information is not publicly available.\par \par \uc2 For instance, a barber could overhear a confidential phone call while cutting a CEO\u8217\'20\'19s hair. He learns private information about the company\u8217\'20\'19s annual earnings and decides to buy the stock. That\u8217\'20\'19s illegal insider trading, and he could be prosecuted by the SEC. The SEC uses sophisticated insider trading detection methods, including monitoring of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/on-chain-volume-vs-trading-volume-differences-explained"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 trading volumes}}}\uc2 , particularly any spikes when there is no news released about a particular company.\par \par \uc2 In recent years, the SEC has declared certain {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/what-is-a-cryptocurrency-a-beginners-guide-to-digital-money"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cryptocurrencies}}}\uc2  as securities, including \uc2 Ripple\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ). That means insider trading rules are being applied to these assets and others.\par \par \uc2 For example, a sharp, triple-digit surge in the Sui token led to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sui-price-rally-400-m-insider-selling-allegations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 allegations of insider selling}}}\uc2  among crypto investors. Sui ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/sui-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SUI}}}\uc2  ) climbed more than 120% over the past month, reaching $2.25 as of 10:13 am UTC on Oct. 14. In an Oct. 14 statement shared on the X platform, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/sui-blockchain-explained-is-it-the-future-of-decentralized-networks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Sui}}}\uc2  addressed and denied insider trading allegations, as shown in the image below.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/099fe1d68893a85544e4a6cf45d81cde.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SuiNetwork on X}}}\par \par \uc2 Did you know? In 1909, the \uc2 US Supreme Court\uc2  ruled that a company director buying the company\u8217\'20\'19s stock with undisclosed inside information leading to a price increase was committing fraud.\par \par \uc2 How does insider trading work in crypto?\par \par \uc2 For a long time, the crypto world was the digital Wild West. The market was largely unregulated and unmonitored, making it fertile ground for shady practices and unfair insider trading.\par \par \uc2 If you\u8217\'20\'19ve spent time trading cryptocurrency, you\u8217\'20\'19ve probably noticed that insider trading is a problem.\par \par \uc2 * You\u8217\'20\'19ll often see big owners of cryptocurrency (specifically {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-are-bitcoin-whales-and-how-to-spot-them"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 whales}}}\uc2  ), often project founders and developers, manipulating the market by buying or selling large quantities of a coin. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-are-crypto-pump-and-dump-groups-are-they-legal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pump and dumps}}}\uc2  are common, with cryptocurrencies being driven up in price with excessive buying and fake promotional news while a group of insiders collude to sell at a predetermined time.\par \par \uc2 * Prior knowledge about a coin being listed on a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/crypto-exchanges-explained"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 major exchange}}}\uc2  is also used to profit from insider information. Usually, these individuals work on a crypto project or exchange and start trading the asset ahead of its launch on a leading trading platform.\par \par \uc2 * Information about upcoming technical updates for a project, like {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/soft-fork-vs-hard-fork-differences-explained"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 forks}}}\uc2 , can also be used to gain a trading advantage. Still, the decentralized design of many cryptocurrencies does help to keep most information in this area transparent and public.\par \par \uc2 Did you know? Evidence shows systematic insider trading in the crypto markets, where people use confidential information to buy coins before exchange listing announcements. A study from the \uc2 University of Technology Sydney\uc2  (\uc2 UTS\uc2 ) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://papers.ssrn.com/sol3/papers.cfm?abstract_id=4184367"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 estimates}}}\uc2  that \u8220\'20\'1Cinsider trading occurs in 27% - 48% of cryptocurrency listings\u8221\'20\'1D despite increasing regulatory scrutiny.\par \par \uc2 Penalties for illegal insider trading\par \par \uc2 Insider trading legal consequences for violations can be harsh, including prison sentences and hefty fines.\par \par \uc2 In the US, insider trading penalties include:\par \par \uc2 * Prison sentences of up to 20 years per violation are possible. The amount of profit gained and the history of offenses determine whether a prison sentence is handed out and its length.\par \par \uc2 * Criminal fines for individuals can reach $5 million, depending on the severity of crimes, while corporations face up to $25 million per violation.\par \par \uc2 * Civil fines can be up to three times the profit (or loss) avoided.\par \par \uc2 * Individuals can be disbarred, meaning they aren't allowed to be a public company director or serve as a company officer.\par \par \uc2 * Public announcements are also often made that can destroy an individual\u8217\'20\'19s or company\u8217\'20\'19s reputation.\par \par \uc2 * Disgorgement can be ordered, forcing guilty traders to return the money they receive and repossess the stock.\par \par \uc2 Did you know? Criminal fines are penalties imposed after a conviction for breaking the law that may also involve jail time or probation. Civil fines are usually financial penalties for regulatory or non-criminal violations, where the offender isn\u8217\'20\'19t imprisoned but must pay damages or restitution. In cryptocurrency \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 , civil fines are commonly used to address market violations, while criminal fines may be applied for fraudulent or illegal activities.\par \par \uc2 Real-world examples of insider trading in crypto\par \par \uc2 There have been several major crypto high-profile insider trading cases that have involved some of the industry\u8217\'20\'19s biggest operators, including \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  and \uc2 OpenSea\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  insider trading scandal\par \par \uc2 In 2022, the SEC charged a former \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  product manager, along with his brother and a friend, with crypto asset insider trading. The SEC alleged that during his employment at \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 , Ishan Wahi was part of a team coordinating the announcements of what cryptocurrencies and tokens were going to be added to the trading platform.\par \par \uc2 Ishan was found to have regularly tipped his brother and friend about upcoming announcements. They used the information to buy at least 25 cryptos, nine of which were securities, to generate profits of more than $1.1 million. Ishan was found guilty and sentenced to two years in prison and his brother was sentenced to 10 months. The friend was ordered to pay a penalty of over $1.6 million\par \par \uc2 Long Blockchain Corp.\par \par \uc2 In 2017, drink manufacturer Long Island Ice Tea made a bizarre announcement, rebranding its name to \uc2 Long Blockchain Corp.\uc2  The company said it was transitioning from drink manufacturing to focus on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/how-does-blockchain-work-everything-there-is-to-know"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 blockchain technology}}}\uc2 . It was a time of \u8220\'20\'1Ccrypto mania,\u8221\'20\'1D and the rebrand sparked shares to soar 380%.\par \par \uc2 Long Blockchain\uc2  never actually began producing blockchain technology. Three people who were involved in sharing information and purchasing shares before the announcement were charged with insider trading. Two of the defendants, Oliver-Barret Lindsay and Gannon Giguire, were found guilty and ordered to pay penalties for insider trading totaling $400,000.\par \par \uc2 OpenSea\par \par \uc2 In 2021, head of product at \uc2 OpenSea\uc2 , Nate Chastain, was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/opensea-manager-accused-insider-trading-sentenced-months-prison-50k-fine"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 charged with insider trading.}}}\uc2  It was a major scandal for the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/what-are-nfts-and-why-are-they-revolutionizing-the-art-world"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 NFT}}}\uc2  marketplace as Chastain used his insider knowledge to buy NFT collections he knew would be featured on the platform\u8217\'20\'19s homepage. He would sell the NFTs as their trading volume and value spiked. He made $57,000 in the process, was convicted, and received a three-month custodial sentence and a $50,000 fine.\par \par \uc2 Did you know? \uc2 Binance\uc2  is offering up to a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-insider-trading-reward"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $5 million reward}}}\uc2  for tip-offs about insider trading on the exchange. This came after a crypto whale bought 314 million BOME tokens before their listing on Binance. Post listing, the trade was identified and flagged, sparking discussions in the community. Some thought it was a lucky trade, while others alleged it was insider trading.\par \par \uc2 Future outlook of insider trading in crypto markets\par \par \uc2 The SEC is resolute on pressing forward in its insider trading \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  and motoring of the cryptocurrency industry. A growing number of cryptocurrencies and blockchain assets are being classed as securities, which puts any illicit trading in the agency\u8217\'20\'19s cross hairs.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/who-is-gary-gensler-regulating-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Gary Gensler}}}\uc2 , SEC chair, continues to reiterate the insider trading SEC definition: \u8220\'20\'1CIf somebody is raising money selling a token and the buyer is anticipating profits based on the efforts of that group to sponsor the seller, that fits into something that's a security\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 So, anybody privy to confidential, non-public information in the industry needs to be careful before trading coins and tokens. Blockchain technology is not as anonymous as often believed; its public transparency can actually be used to monitor, track and prevent insider trading.\par \par \uc2 Insider trading in the cryptocurrency world has been rife for years, but authorities are cracking down on the behavior, especially since the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/initial-coin-offering"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ICO}}}\uc2  boom in 2017. It\u8217\'20\'19s not surprising, since 56% of \uc2 ICO\uc2  token listings show evidence of insider trading, according to \uc2 Solidus Labs\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Crypto exchanges and companies are adopting tougher self-\b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  measures to protect against insider trading court cases and maintain market integrity. In many developed countries, centralized exchanges are required to perform {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/what-is-kyc-and-why-do-crypto-exchanges-require-it"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 know-your-customer (KYC)}}}\uc2  and anti-money-laundering (AML) checks to help pinpoint illegal trading. However, lesser regulated and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/what-are-decentralized-exchanges-and-how-do-dexs-work"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 decentralized exchanges (DEX)}}}\uc2  still make it hard to identify insider trading activity.\par \par \uc2 As the industry matures, there is growing pressure for even decentralized platforms to implement more robust safeguards to ensure fair practices and protect investors.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS9zdG9yYWdlL3VwbG9hZHMvdmlldy83Y2Y2MWQ3ZmEwNjU2ZTQ1MDAwZDk2Nzg1MDM0YTRmNi5qcGc=.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241017ekah0005u\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/16: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,755 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 October 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin traders are sprinting toward $70,000 but is the market ready for potential selling at this level?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTAvMDE5Mjk2M2EtNWFlYy03ZjM2LWFiYjYtNDIzZTZjYWQxYmM1.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 10/16: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) rally above $66,500 cleared the final hurdle on its journey to $70,000. According to Farside Investors data, the move was accompanied by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-spot-bitcoin-etfs-556m-inflows-biggest-day-since-june"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 solid inflows of $555.9 million}}}\uc2  into United States spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds on Oct. 14 and $371 million on Oct. 15.\par \par \uc2 After the latest rise, analysts have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-brace-for-new-highs-after-btc-rallies-to-68-k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 turned \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s prospects}}}\uc2  of hitting a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/these-5-bitcoin-price-metrics-hint-new-all-time-high-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new all-time high in 2024}}}\uc2 . Independent analyst Bitcoindata21 is uber \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and he anticipates {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/different-this-time-bitcoin-rsi-233k-btc-price-2025"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin to skyrocket to $233,000}}}\uc2  as early as Q1 2025.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01929624-a3a9-729e-bad5-cd524bfdb23e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  narrative is understandable, traders need to be watchful. Buyers will face significant heat from the bears as the price nears the all-time high. A strong rejection near the all-time high could tempt the short-term bulls to book profits. That could keep the price stuck inside the large $54,000 to $73,777 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rise to $70,000 trigger a strong buying in altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin surged above the $65,000 overhead resistance on Oct. 14 and followed that up with another strong up move above $66,500 on Oct. 15.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01929625-49bd-7a50-999d-837589b8bcb0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The critical support to watch on the downside is $65,000. If buyers flip this level into support, a rally to $70,000 is possible. Sellers are expected to fiercely defend the $70,000 to $73,777 zone.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below $65,000. The BTC/USDT pair could then drop to the 20-day exponential moving average ($63,417). If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again attempt to push the pair to $70,000.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break below the 20-day EMA will suggest that the bulls have given up. The pair may then drop to the 50-day simple moving average ($61,023).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has reached the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle pattern, where the bears are trying to halt the up move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01929626-1452-7cb3-8280-8c1e10fd4da3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers do not give up much ground from the current level, the likelihood of a breakout above the resistance line increases. The ETH/USDT pair could rise to $2,850 and thereafter to $3,400.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated in the near term if the price turns down from the resistance line and dives below the moving averages. The pair may extend its stay inside the triangle for some more time.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to push BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) to the stiff overhead resistance of $635, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01929626-d89d-7c98-962a-36df362a5c0b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead resistance but finds support at the 20-day EMA ($575), it will suggest that the bulls remain buyers on dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle. If they can pull it off, the BNB/USDT pair may rally to $722.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the range-bound action may continue for a few more days. The short-term advantage will tilt in favor of the bears on a break below the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is facing selling near the $164 overhead resistance, but bulls have not allowed the price to dip below the 20-day EMA ($147).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01929627-a238-75d5-83b1-f132f2b10b39"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the sentiment has turned positive. That will improve the prospects of a break above $164. If that happens, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle will complete, and the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could climb to $189 and eventually to $210.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price slips below the 20-day EMA, the pair could drop to the uptrend line. Sellers will have to yank the price below the uptrend line to invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have been trying to push XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the moving averages, but the bears have held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01929628-5d91-77e3-991d-81044ac7e5bf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive for the bulls is that they have not ceded much ground to the bears. This suggests that the bulls may make one more attempt to propel the price above the moving averages. If they can pull it off, the XRP/USDT pair may rally to the overhead resistance of $0.64.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below $0.50. That could start a down move to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has reached the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating that the bulls are attempting a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01929629-2b12-739c-a4b4-c7601be306fb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers pierce the resistance line, it will signal the start of a new uptrend. The DOGE/USDT pair could rise to $0.14 and thereafter to $0.17. The pattern target of the breakout from the triangle is $0.19.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down sharply from the resistance line, it will suggest that the bears remain sellers on rallies. That could keep the pair stuck inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) has been clinging to the moving averages, indicating that the bulls are trying to overcome the obstacle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01929629-e779-7365-b526-eb1017d1b189"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the bulls succeed, the TON/USDT pair could rise to $6. This level is likely to behave as a formidable hurdle, but if the bulls overcome it, the rally could extend to $7. Such a move will suggest that the pair may swing between $4.72 and $8.29 for a while.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the moving averages and breaks below $5, it will signal that the bears remain in command. The pair may then retest the $4.72 to $4.44 support zone.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dogecoin-god-candle-doge-price-suddenly-jumps-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin 'god candle' coming? DOGE price jumps 10%}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been clinging to the moving averages for the past few days, indicating a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192962a-9fd1-7e8f-8a36-264fa6250a6e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price remains above the moving averages, the bulls will try to push the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair to the overhead resistance of $0.40. This is an essential level for the bears to defend because a break above it could start a new up move. The pair may rise to $0.45 and subsequently to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price sustains below the moving averages, the bears will try to sink the pair to the $0.31 support. If this level gives way, the pair could descend to $0.27.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside the symmetrical triangle pattern for several days, indicating indecision about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192962b-5ffc-7e60-a93f-07a03cb958b7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The AVAX/USDT pair turned down from the resistance line on Oct. 14, indicating that the bears are protecting the level. A break below the 20-day EMA ($27.24) could sink the pair to the support line.\par \par \uc2 If the price plummets below the support line, it will signal that the bears have overpowered the bulls. The pair may drop to $17. On the other hand, a break above the triangle will tilt the advantage in favor of the bulls. The pair may rise to $37 and later to $42.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) has formed an inverse H&S pattern, which will complete on a break and close above $0.000020.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/0192962c-1cea-7f8a-a008-fdba92f126c1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Bitcoin ETF, ETF}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory indicate that the bulls have the edge. A break and close above $0.000020 could open the doors for a rally to the pattern target of $0.000028.\par \par \uc2 Sellers are likely to have other plans. They will try to defend the overhead resistance and pull the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.000017). If they do that, it will signal that the SHIB/USDT pair may remain inside the $0.000012 to $0.000020 range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTAvMDE5Mjk2M2EtNWFlYy03ZjM2LWFiYjYtNDIzZTZjYWQxYmM1.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241016ekag000e3\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/14: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,779 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 October 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally above $66,000 has triggered buying in several altcoins, indicating the return of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTAvMDE5MjhjMGEtNjk0Yi03YTI0LWIxZTctZTllYjY0MTU1YTFj.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 10/14: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has started the week on a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note, clearing the closely watched $65,000 overhead resistance with ease. This indicates that the bulls are back in the game and ready to challenge the next resistance at $66,500.\par \par \uc2 October has historically been the most \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  month for Bitcoin, and the Oct. 14 rally has pushed the monthly gains to 4%. That has triggered hopes that the worst may be behind us. Analysts expect {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-break-loose-70k-uptober-flips-green"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin to pick up momentum}}}\uc2  if it clears the $70,000 overhead resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01928bf8-9113-74a3-9ef0-0244b8b82de8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund Flows Weekly Report on Oct. 14 shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/political-shift-407-million-inflow-crypto-coinshares"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin investment products witnessed inflows of $419 million}}}\uc2 . The firm\u8217\'20\'19s head of research, James Butterfill, said in the report that the inflows into crypto investment products were primarily influenced by the United States elections rather than by the monetary policy outlook.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally has triggered buying in several altcoins, which are attempting to rise above their respective overhead resistance levels. Could the up move sustain? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) picked up momentum after breaking above the 20-day exponential moving average (5,727) on Oct. 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01928bf9-392a-7674-83b2-b4fb5a384bf8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to propel the index to 6,000, where the sellers are expected to mount a strong defense. However, if the buyers do not give up much ground from 6,000, the up move could extend to 6,221.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is at the 20-day EMA and, after that, at the breakout level of 5,670. Sellers will have to sink and maintain the price below 5,670 to indicate the start of a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 US Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The US Dollar Index (DXY) extended its recovery last week, rising toward the 103.54 overhead resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01928bf9-ff08-7276-ab9a-bc42e14a0ba3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is near the overbought zone, signaling that the bulls are in firm control. If buyers overcome the barrier at 103.54, the up move may reach 105.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA (101.99) is the crucial support to watch for on the downside. A break and close below this support will suggest that the bears are selling on rallies. The index may then skid to the 50-day simple moving average (101.69).\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Sellers tried to pull the price below the 20-day EMA ($62,500) on Oct. 13, but the bulls held their ground and started a strong rally on Oct. 14.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01928bfa-ba93-7691-8e30-7dcf7e5544f6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair is facing resistance at $66,500, but if buyers do not allow the price to remain below $65,000, the likelihood of a breakout will increase. The pair could then swiftly rise to $70,000. Sellers are expected to fiercely defend the zone between $70,000 and $73,777.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to make a comeback, they will have to drag the price back below the moving averages. If they do that, the psychologically critical support at $60,000 may be tested.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 After several failed attempts, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) finally broke above the moving averages on Oct. 14, indicating advantage to buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01928bfb-4c8b-773a-983b-620520ba2791"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair has reached the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle, where sellers will try to halt the up move. If buyers overcome the resistance, the ETH/USDT pair could rise to $2,850 and thereafter to $3,400.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down sharply from the resistance line and breaks below the moving averages, it will signal that bears remain sellers on rallies. That could keep the pair inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Sellers pulled BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day EMA ($570) on Oct. 14, but the bulls bought the dips to the 50-day SMA ($553).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01928bfc-05b6-753b-b3a4-0866ae9d4227"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains above $587, the BNB/USDT pair is likely to rally to the stiff overhead resistance of $635. Buyers may find it challenging to propel the price above $635, but if they can pull it off, the next stop is likely to be $722.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the $527 support. The pair may then descend to the support of the range at $460, where buyers are expected to step in.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern, which will complete on a break and close above $164.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01928bfc-d465-7fe4-8555-3580bcb862d2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers succeed in piercing the $164 resistance, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair is likely to rally to $189. This level may act as a minor obstacle, but if the bulls prevail, the pair could stretch the up move to the pattern target of $218.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from $164, it will suggest that the pair may remain inside the triangle for a while longer. The bears will have to tug the price below the uptrend line to invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the moving averages for the past several days, but the failure to pull the price below $0.50 suggests that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01928bfd-7dc0-754c-9e38-d4f5fd19f0f1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to build their strength by pushing the price above the moving averages. If they manage to do that, the XRP/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $0.64. Sellers are expected to vigorously defend the $0.64 level as they have done in the past.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will signal that the bears remain sellers on every rise. A break below $0.50 could start a downward leg to the solid support at $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-hits-66k-analysis-uptober-begun"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price hits $66K as analysis asks: 'Has Uptober begun?'}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) closed above the 20-day EMA ($0.11) on Oct. 11, and the bulls thwarted the bears\u8217\'20\'19 attempts to pull the price lower.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01928bfe-3809-7cc3-a034-72764b66b0cd"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to push the price to the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle pattern. If the price turns down sharply from the resistance line, it will signal that the DOGE/USDT pair may extend its stay inside the triangle.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move will begin on a break above or below the triangle. If buyers thrust the price above the resistance line, the pair could rise to $0.14 and then to $0.18. On the downside, a break below the support line could sink the pair to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the moving averages for the past two days, indicating buying by the bulls at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01928bfe-e88c-7285-a595-107815cd281c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 RSI\uc2  is gradually moving toward the midpoint, signaling that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening. That increases the possibility of a break above the moving averages. The TON/USDT pair may climb to $6, which is expected to act as a barrier.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a close below $5. That could sink the pair to the $4.72 to $4.44 support zone. Buyers are expected to guard this zone with all their might because a break below it could start a new downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers finally pushed Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the moving averages on Oct. 14, suggesting that the bears have given up.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01928bff-9768-7e7b-924c-927ea65a843c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Market Analysis, CoinShares, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500, US Elections 2024}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 There is minor resistance at $0.37, but that is likely to be crossed. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then rally to the overhead resistance of $0.40, where bears will try to halt the up move. If the price turns down sharply from $0.40 and breaks below the moving averages, it will signal that the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if buyers drive the price above $0.40, it will signal the start of a new up move. The pair may rise to $0.45 and subsequently to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTAvMDE5MjhjMGEtNjk0Yi03YTI0LWIxZTctZTllYjY0MTU1YTFj.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241014ekae000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
