 Today, a spinning top candlestick pattern has emerged on the daily chart for \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP).\par \par \uc2 Currently, \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) trades below the 50-day DMA and very close below the 200-day DMA. The Relative Strength Index (RSI) for \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) is 38.3, decreasing towards the underbought region.\par \par \uc2 The support level at $0.50457 for \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) could become an entry point for the bulls to increase pressure. Further below, another support is at the $0.48751 price mark. \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) has two significant resistance levels: $0.62644 and $0.65492.\par \par \uc2 PropiChain (PCHAIN): Invest In The Future Of Real Estate\par \par \uc2 PropiChain is a real estate platform that helps users gain exposure to the global real estate markets by tokenizing property investments. It is the future of real estate ownership at a global level. Using PropiChain, you can own fractional shares of real estate properties worldwide.\par \par \uc2 It leverages blockchain technology to fractionalize ownership and reduce the entry barrier, making real estate investments more liquid and accessible.\par \par \uc2 It uses decentralization and blockchain technology to revolutionize the $300 trillion global real estate industry. PropiChain (PCHAIN) will provide solutions to the issues associated with real estate and property ownership, which arise due to the outdated and inefficient system.\par \par \uc2 PropiChain blends Blockchain, NFTs, Artificial Intelligence, and the Metaverse. This Platform will transform the real estate industry, making it more transparent, efficient, and secure.\par \par \uc2 Owners can manage their properties using a single point of contact in a simplified way. The properties are transformed into digital assets using the power of NFT tokenization. AI will help make market predictions and automate valuation and transactions.\par \par \uc2 Integrating the Metaverse PropiChain helps users explore real properties virtua