://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241014ekad0000p\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/7: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,744 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 October 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin's strong weekly open spread to altcoins but will traders be able to clear BTC's resistance at $65,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTAvMDE5MjY3YzUtYjQ1MS03MDU2LWJjMzYtMTJiNmY3MGQ4MjY1.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 10/7: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) picked up momentum after crossing above $62,000 and is closing in on the $65,000 overhead resistance. According to the New York Digital Investment Group, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-best-performing-asset-after-weak-q3-nydig"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin remains the best-performing asset for the year}}}\uc2  despite the \u8220\'20\'1Cseasonally weak\u8221\'20\'1D third quarter.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been sideways for several months but that has not stopped the Japanese investment company \uc2 Metaplanet\uc2  from building up its stockpile. The firm announced on Oct. 7 that it had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/metaplanet-7-million-bitcoin-buy-holds-40-million"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 acquired 108.78 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  at an average price of about $63,600, taking its total to almost 640 Bitcoin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/019267bd-4726-7471-94e6-782bf0b057e5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, not everyone is \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Bitcoin in the short term. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  said in its latest \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund Flows Weekly Report on Oct. 7 that digital investment products witnessed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-products-147-million-outflow-weaker-rate-cut-probability"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $147 million in outflows last week}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  believes the stronger-than-expected economic data \u8220\'20\'1Creduced the probabilities for significant rate cuts\u8221\'20\'1D in the near future, and that could be the reason for the strong outflows.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s strength attract buyers into altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index successfully held the retest of the breakout level of 5,670, indicating that the sentiment remains positive, and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/019267be-5135-70dd-ae30-c6265bf86de3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers thrust the price above 5,768, it will signal the resumption of the uptrend. The index could rally to the psychologically important level of 6,000, where the bears may mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated in the near term if the price turns down sharply and breaks below 5,670. That will be the first sign of profit-booking by the bulls. The selling could intensify on a drop below the 50-day simple moving average (5,559).\par \par \uc2 US Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The US Dollar Index (DXY) made a strong comeback last week, and the recovery accelerated after buyers pushed the price above the 20-day exponential moving average (101.40) on Oct. 1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/019267bf-0f29-7f12-9354-e9f6138a93eb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn up, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) has risen into the positive territory, indicating that the momentum has turned positive. However, sellers are unlikely to give up easily and will try to pull the price lower. The bears will have to yank the price below the 20-day EMA to halt the recovery.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off 102, it will signal that the bulls have flipped the level into support. The index could then rally to 103.50.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin cleared the 20-day EMA ($62,382) hurdle on Oct. 6, indicating that the bulls are on a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/019267bf-b501-75a8-96ea-94d9189d117d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair could rise to $65,000 and thereafter to $66,500. Sellers will try to defend this zone, but if the bulls have their way, the pair could rally to $70,000. Buyers may struggle to overcome the zone between $70,000 and $73,777.\par \par \uc2 The essential support levels to watch on the downside are the 20-day EMA and the 50-day SMA ($60,696). A break and close below $60,000 will signal that the bulls are losing their grip. The pair could then descend to $57,500.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating inside the symmetrical triangle pattern for the past few days, indicating indecision between the buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/019267c0-4a36-7be7-b6d2-5ec83f78151e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rises above the moving averages, the ETH/USDT pair could climb to the resistance line. This is an essential level for the bears to defend because a break above it could propel the pair to $3,400. There is resistance at $2,850, but it is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down sharply from the resistance line, it will signal that the pair may remain stuck inside the triangle for a while. The bears will have to sink the price below the uptrend line to start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside the large range between $460 and $635 for the past several days, indicating a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/019267c0-cf83-7e40-888b-e878008a794f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price remains above the 20-day EMA ($566), the BNB/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance of $635. The bears are expected to defend this level with all their might. If the price turns down from $635 and breaks below the moving averages, the pair may remain inside the range for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls propel the price above $635, it will indicate the start of a new up move. The pair could then soar to $722.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($145) on Oct. 6, signaling demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/019267c1-5d75-7430-a438-99a6a759140c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to $164, which is an important level to watch out for. If bulls push the price above $164, the pair will complete an inverted head-and-shoulders pattern. That could start a rally to the target objective of $208.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the moving averages. That could extend the stay inside the $116 to $164 range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck in the upper half of the $0.41 to $0.64 range for the past few days, indicating that the bulls are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/019267c1-fbcc-7616-b0a6-dad7f7a17ccb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to start a recovery from $0.50, which could face selling at the 20-day EMA ($0.56). If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the likelihood of a break below $0.50 increases. The XRP/USDT pair could slump to the support of the range at $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if bulls push the price above the moving averages, the pair could attempt a rally to $0.64. This remains the critical level to watch out for in the near term. If bulls pierce this resistance, the pair may surge to $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern, signaling uncertainty about the next trending move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/019267c2-9c51-7179-9bb1-98e24bafdb02"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Generally, inside the triangle, the price swings between the resistance line and the support line. A break above the 20-day EMA ($0.11) opens the door for a rise to the resistance line, where bears are expected to sell aggressively. However, if bulls overcome this barrier, the DOGE/USDT pair could start a new uptrend to $0.14 and subsequently to $0.18.\par \par \uc2 Sellers will have to yank the price below the support line to start the next leg of the downtrend to $0.08 and then $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the moving averages, but the bears have failed to sink the price to the $4.72 support. This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/019267c3-2c81-7617-8246-70998846b355"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to push the price above the moving averages and start a recovery. If they can pull it off, the TON/USDT pair is likely to attempt a rally to $7. There is resistance at $6, but it is expected to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from the moving averages and breaks below $5.10, it will indicate that bears remain in control. The pair could then slump to the $4.72 to $4.44 support zone.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading between $0.31 and $0.40 for several days, indicating that the bulls are trying to form a base.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/019267c3-cf2a-7850-ab45-ac8cff965f46"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Dollar, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Ether Price, Solana, S&P 500}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers push the price above the moving averages, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance of $0.40. This is an important level to watch out for because a break above it will suggest the start of a new up move. The pair may rally to $0.45 and thereafter to $0.49.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may remain inside the range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTAvMDE5MjY3YzUtYjQ1MS03MDU2LWJjMzYtMTJiNmY3MGQ4MjY1.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241007eka7000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
