ions-us-elections-bitcoin-debasement-trade-jpmorgan"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 investors are turning toward gold and Bitcoin}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C[R]ising geopolitical tensions and the coming [United States] election are likely to reinforce the \u8216\'20\'18debasement trade\u8217\'20\'19 thus favoring both gold and Bitcoin,\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2  said in a report shared with Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01925887-73a1-799b-b258-54c841f5f812"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The recent fall to $60,000 seems to have dented sentiment. Onchain analytics provider Santiment said in a post on X that mentions of Uptober had declined since the beginning of the month, indicating that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/uptober-mentions-plummet-traders-turn-bearish-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 traders had become \b  \highlight22bearish\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 . Some analysts believe {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bullish-bitcoin-traders-switch-sides-and-target-new-btc-lows-under-60-k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could drop to $52,000}}}\uc2  if the $60,000 support is violated.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin hold the bounce off the $60,000 support, or will bears have their way? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to defend the 50-day simple moving average ($60,461), signaling demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01925888-ee30-76c2-adfe-693f5546