 \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price skids and sustains below the 50-day SMA ($0.10), the bears will try to sink the DOGE/USDT pair below the support line. If they succeed, the pair could descend to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if buyers kick the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.11), the pair could attempt a rally to the resistance line. Buyers will have to overcome this barrier to signal the start of a new up move.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are finding it difficult to push Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) back above the moving averages, indicating a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01925890-534c-7c9e-8a3e-b01776077fb5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position further by pulling the price to the solid support at $4.72. Buyers are expected to defend this level with all their might because a break below it will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern. That could start a new downtrend toward $3.50.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to prevent the decline, they will have to swiftly push the price above $6.14. The TON/USDT pair could then rally to $7.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-us-employment-btc-price-snatches-62k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin gets US employment boost as BTC price eyes $300M ask liquidity}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound between $0.31 and $0.40 for several days, indicating buying on dips and selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01925891-08d4-7267-9d00-5df6eae3db15"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price action inside the range can be random and volatile. If buyers drive the price above the moving averages, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could move up to $0.40, where short-term traders are expected to sell aggressively. Buyers will have to overcome this barrier to signal the start of a new up move to $0.45 and then to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, bears will have to sink and sustain the price below $0.31 to resume the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has reached the 50-day SMA ($24.66), an important near-term support to watch out for.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01925891-950d-705e-b4aa-70b349cf834b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA ($26.42), the bulls will try to push the AVAX/USDT pair to the $31 to $33 overhead zone. Sellers will try to stall the up move in the zone, but if the bulls prevail, the pair could rally to $36.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks below the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that the bears have taken charge. The pair could then slide to the solid support at $19.50, where buyers are likely to step in.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the 20-day EMA ($0.000016).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01925892-310b-7d93-96bc-04fd34809113"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin, Cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin Price, XRP, Markets, Cryptocurrency Exchange, Cardano, TON, Price Analysis, Binance Coin, Ether Price, Solana, Avalanche, Shiba Inu}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the current bounce sustains, it will suggest that the bulls are trying to form a higher low. Buyers will then try to push the price to $0.000022, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the rebound fails to hold, it will signal a lack of demand from the bulls. That increases the likelihood of a break below the moving averages. The SHIB/USDT pair may then slump to $0.000012.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTAvMDE5MjU4OGItMTQwZi03OTk1LTliZDktNWQwMjQzYWM5YmZh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241004eka4000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
