ed. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s selloff was accelerated by outflows from the BTC ETFs and altcoins followed suit. Will the market remain soft amid escalating global tension?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTAvMDE5MjRlMjItN2FhOS03YjU0LWIyMDQtNjRhMWM5NzZmMzBi.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 10/2: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Rising Middle East tensions resulted in a sell-off in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-safe-haven-status-questioned-amid-middle-east-conflict"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dropped near the psychological support of $60,000}}}\uc2  on Oct. 1. A minor positive for the bulls is they have managed to push the price back above $62,000 on Oct. 2. The real test of the bulls will be to sustain the higher levels and build upon it.\par \par \uc2 The sentiment has turned cautious, and the institutional investors seem to be reducing risk from their portfolio. According to Farside Investors data, United States spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds witnessed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etfs-largest-outflow-in-nearly-month-iran-israel-conflict"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 outflows of $242.6 million on Oct. 1}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01924e1b-ecb7-7abf-827b-9844059aaba5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 10/2: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Trading firm QCP Capital said in a note to its Telegram channel subscribers that any further escalation in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-54k-btc-price-lower-middle-east-tensions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 geopolitical tensions could sink Bitcoin to $55,000}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 However, it is worth noting that Bitcoin has not seen a negative monthly close in October in the past five years. That is likely to attract buyers at lower levels, who will expect history to repeat itself.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin hang on to the bounce off the $60,000 support? Will that attract buying in altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure to maintain the price above $65,000 resulted in a sell-off in Bitcoin, which pulled the price below the 20-day exponential moving average ($62,490) on Oct. 1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01924e1c-86da-77d1-8a29-e827fa073d73"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 10/2: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair reached the 50-day simple moving average ($60,357), which is an important level for the bulls to defend. If the price turns up and rises above the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again attempt to drive the pair above the $65,000 to $66.500 resistance zone. If they can pull it off, the pair may climb to $70,000.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price tanks below the 50-day SMA, it will clear the path for a fall to $57,500. Buyers are expected to vigorously defend this level because if they fail to do that, the pair may slump to $54,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) tight-range trading between the resistance line and the moving averages resolved to the downside on Oct. 1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01924e1d-42e4-71d7-a8a1-ee3e271032d0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 10/2: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position by pulling the price to the uptrend line. This is a crucial level to watch out for in the near term because a break and close below it will signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to prevent the downside, they will have to quickly push the ETH/USDT pair above the resistance line. That will complete the symmetrical triangle pattern, which has a pattern target of $3,409. The bears may pose a strong challenge at $2,850, but the resistance is expected to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) failure to rise above $635 shows that traders continue to sell near the overhead resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01924e1d-e975-72e4-9f69-ebd4e648ca4b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 10/2: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest that the BNB/USDT pair may extend its stay inside the range for a while. If the 50-day SMA ($550) cracks, the pair could slump toward the support of the range at $460.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rises from the 50-day SMA and breaks above the 20-day EMA ($570), it will suggest that the bulls have not given up. The pair could then make one more attempt to rise above $635.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the $164 resistance, indicating that the range-bound action remains intact.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01924e1e-7a2c-7e77-84c5-d890e9300d36"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 10/2: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the 50-day SMA ($142), the bulls will again try to propel the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair above the $164 resistance. If they manage to do that, the pair will complete an inverted head-and-shoulders pattern. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup could attract buyers, sending the pair toward $189 and then to the pattern target of $208.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price skids below the 50-day SMA. That could sink the pair to $127 and eventually to $116.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rose above the $0.64 overhead resistance on Sept. 29 and Sept. 30, but the bulls failed to sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01924e1f-0a9f-7080-950e-ae34a0502b33"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 10/2: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the bears continue to sell near the $0.64 level. Sellers will try to pull the price to the uptrend line, which is an essential level for the bulls to defend. If the price rebounds off the uptrend line, the bulls will again try to push the XRP/USDT pair above the $0.64 resistance.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break and close below the uptrend line will suggest that the bulls are rushing to the exit. That could sink the pair to $0.50, bringing the large $0.41 to $0.64 range into play.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $0.13 on Sept. 29 and fell below the breakout level of $0.12 on Sept. 30, indicating that the bears continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01924e1f-acd4-776d-b11e-1c617e839bb5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 10/2: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair has dropped to the 50-day SMA ($0.10), which is an important level for the bulls to defend. If the price turns up from the 50-day SMA, the bulls will again try to push the pair to $0.14.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price fails to achieve a strong rebound off the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that demand has dried up. That increases the risk of a fall to $0.09 and, after that, to the Aug. 5 intraday low of $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) dropped back below the moving averages on Oct. 1, indicating that the bears are attempting a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01924e20-4f46-730b-a629-c11894ffee05"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 10/2: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 There is small support at $5.16, but if this level gives way, the TON/USDT pair could descend to the solid support zone between $4.72 and $4.44. Buyers are expected to defend this zone with all their might because if they fail in their endeavor, the pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern. That may start a downward move to $3.50.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the downside, they will have to push the price back above the overhead resistance of $6.14. The pair may then climb to $7.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-solana-sol-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Solana (SOL) price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) close above the $0.40 resistance on Sept. 27 proved to be a bull trap as the bears pulled the price back below the breakout level on Sept. 29.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01924e21-0aee-74fb-af50-cea6532ab214"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 10/2: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair fell below the 20-day EMA ($0.36) on Oct. 1, indicating that the bulls have given up. The flattish moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest that the pair may remain stuck between $0.31 and $0.40.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to gain the upper hand, they will have to swiftly push and maintain the price above $0.40. If they do that, the pair will complete a double bottom pattern, opening the doors for a rally to $0.49.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers could not maintain Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) above the breakout level of $29, indicating a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01924e21-984e-702e-96a2-73e48a82c5ef"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 10/2: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned down and plunged below the 20-day EMA ($26.78) on Oct. 1, indicating that the bulls are losing their grip. There is minor support at the 50-day SMA ($24.49), but if the bears prevail, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could plunge to $19.50.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rises above the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again attempt to shove the price above the $29 to $31 resistance zone. If they manage to do that, the pair could rise to $33 and thereafter attempt a rally to $40.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) closed above the $0.000020 resistance on Sept. 27, but the breakout proved to be a bull trap.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-10/01924e22-41ff-77e9-894a-d01937c69aa1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 10/2: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has turned down sharply and reached the 20-day EMA ($0.000016). This is an important level for the bulls to defend. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with strength, the buyers will make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, the SHIB/USDT pair could slide to the support at $0.000012. A bounce off this level will signal a range-bound action between $0.000012 and $0.000020 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMTAvMDE5MjRlMjItN2FhOS03YjU0LWIyMDQtNjRhMWM5NzZmMzBi.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020241002eka2000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
