nt, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020241003eka10000y\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/30: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,715 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 September 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The crypto market is correcting today, but Bitcoin is still on track to close September with strong gains.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDkvMDE5MjQzZDAtNGJlNi03MDI2LWE1YjctNTc0YTNhZjVhYjg5.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/30: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and has succumbed to selling pressure on Sept. 30, falling below $64,000. Even after giving back its gains, Bitcoin is on track to record its best monthly gains in September, topping the 6.04% rise in 2016, according to CoinGlass data.\par \par \uc2 Traders are likely to be upbeat about Bitcoin entering the fourth quarter as October has been one of the strongest months, with an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-all-time-high-uptober-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 average gain of 22.90%}}}\uc2  and median gains of 27.70%. If history repeats itself, then a new high is likely to be hit within the next couple of months.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/019243c7-8bc2-7150-8bd8-81c8fbdd4f47"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/30: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 ZX Squared Capital chief investment officer CK Zheng told Cointelegraph that the United States presidential {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-election-wont-hamstring-bitcoins-q4-rally-toward-new-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 election is another \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  trigger for Bitcoin}}}\uc2  as both the Republican and Democratic parties have failed to \u8220\'20\'1Cappropriately address the ever-increasing US debts and deficits during this election.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Interestingly, Bitcoin rallied 168% in the fourth quarter of 2020, which witnessed the halving event and the US presidential elections.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins rally sharply in October? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index has been maintaining above the breakout level of 5,670, but the up-move lacks momentum. This shows hesitation in continuing to buy at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/019243cc-0131-7a78-bf2d-c52b050913f5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/30: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price could correct to 5,670, which is likely to act as a strong support. If the price rebounds off 5,670 with strength, it will signal that the bulls have flipped the level into support. That will improve the prospects of a rally to 6,000.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day exponential moving average (5,653), it will suggest profit-booking by the short-term traders. If this support also cracks, the index could plummet to the uptrend line. This is a crucial level to watch out for because a break below it could accelerate selling.\par \par \uc2 US Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears have repeatedly stalled recovery attempts at the 20-day exponential moving average (100.99), indicating that the US Dollar Index (DXY) remains in a downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/019243cc-c252-7ed9-ac6c-67033a08875d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/30: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers will try to strengthen their position by pulling the price to the critical support at 99.57. This level had previously acted as a solid support, hence the bulls will again try to defend it aggressively. If the price rebounds off 99.57 but fails to break above the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bears continue to sell on rallies. That will increase the risk of break below 99.57.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to prevent the downside, they will have to push and maintain the price above the 20-day EMA. The upside could pick up momentum above 102.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin closed above $65,000 on Sept. 26, but the failure to push the price higher attracted profit booking by short-term traders. That has pulled the price back below the breakout level on Sept. 30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/019243cd-666c-79f8-9205-17a640c74fe9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/30: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($62,722) is the crucial level for the bulls to defend. If the price bounces off the 20-day EMA, the buyers will try to kick the price above $66,500. If they can pull it off, the BTC/USDT pair may jump to $70,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break below the 20-day EMA will signal that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening. The pair could then drop to the 50-day SMA ($60,300). That could keep the pair inside the $54,000 to $65,000 range for some time.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls could not thrust and maintain Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the resistance line on Sept. 27, indicating that the bears are defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/019243ce-219e-7141-b2f1-4fe5d2a5601a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/30: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price is currently stuck between the 20-day EMA ($2,559) and the resistance line. This tight-range trading is unlikely to continue for long. If the price resolves to the upside, the ETH/USDT pair could rise to $2,850 and, after that, to $3,400.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated in the near term if the price continues lower and breaks below the moving averages. That may keep the pair inside the symmetrical triangle pattern for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $618 on Sept. 28, indicating that the traders are selling near the overhead resistance of $635.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/019243ce-e099-7535-bfbe-010d7ac2b9e8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/30: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has reached the 20-day EMA ($575), an important level to watch out for. If the price turns up sharply from the 20-day EMA, the bulls will make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle. If they manage to do that, the BNB/USDT pair could surge to $722.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price closes below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bulls have given up. That could keep the pair stuck inside the $460 to $635 range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to propel Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the $164 overhead resistance, indicating selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/019243cf-c47f-7f37-83f1-52712c5181dd"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/30: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive for the bulls is that they have not ceded much ground to the bears. The rising 20-day EMA ($147) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If bulls push the price above $164, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to $188.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the pair may continue to range between $116 and $164 for a while.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rose above the $0.64 resistance on Sept. 29, but the long wick on the candlestick shows the bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/019243d1-59c8-785b-a209-8f61524b6aca"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/30: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls again attempted to maintain the price above $0.64 on Sept. 30, but the bears did not relent. This suggests that the markets have rejected the breakout. The XRP/USDT pair could plunge to the 20-day EMA ($0.59).\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level or the 20-day EMA with strength, it will suggest that the bulls remain buyers on dips. Buyers will have to kick the price above $0.66 to clear the path for a rally to $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) recovery is facing selling at $0.13, which has pulled the price to the breakout level near $0.12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/019243d2-4a04-75f6-8cbf-c243e0e0e0e8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/30: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.11) has started to turn up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the positive zone, indicating a minor advantage for the bulls. If the price bounces off the 20-day EMA and rises above $0.13, the DOGE/USDT pair could reach $0.14. This level may act as a resistance, but if cleared, the rally could reach $0.18.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are active at higher levels. That may lead to a possible range formation between $0.09 and $0.13 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) is facing selling above $6, but a positive sign is that the bulls have not allowed the price to slip below the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/019243d4-2688-7bb7-a53a-63b7650affc2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/30: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the moving averages and breaks above $6, it will signal the start of a move to $7. The bears may pose a strong challenge at $7, but if the bulls prevail, the rally could stretch to $8.29.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the TON/USDT pair plummets below the moving averages and the $5.37 support. That could open the doors for a possible drop to the $4.72 to $4.44 support zone.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rose above the $0.40 resistance on Sept. 27, but the long wick on the candlestick shows strong selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/019243d6-2417-7aeb-8db0-921182c589f4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/30: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has turned down toward the 20-day EMA ($0.37). If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA with strength, the bulls will again attempt to drive the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair above $0.40. If they succeed, the pair may climb to $0.46. Buyers will have to overcome this barrier to signal the start of a new up move.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price skids below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the $0.31 to $0.40 range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDkvMDE5MjQzZDAtNGJlNi03MDI2LWE1YjctNTc0YTNhZjVhYjg5.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240930ek9u000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
