rds\par \uc2 26 September 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price meets selling near $65,000, but a breakout above the level could bring new all-time highs.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDkvMDE5MjJhMWMtZmUyYi03YzM0LWE0OTgtYmZkNDRiYmZlM2Fh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/25: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) faces rejection near $65,000 again, making it an essential overhead resistance to cross. A positive sign for the bulls is that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s classic Puell Multiple metric has hit the \u8220\'20\'1Cgreen\u8221\'20\'1D zone for the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-support-62k-hold-bitcoin-bears-traders"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 first time since the end of 2022}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHistorically, when the green zone was reached, it was followed by an upward price movement,\u8221\'20\'1D said CryptoQuant contributor Darkfost in a blog post.\par \par \uc2 Analyst Rekt Capital highlighted another historical pattern favoring the bulls. He said that Bitcoin breaks out from its reaccumulation range between 154 and 161 days after halving. The analyst added that the most recent Bitcoin halving occurred on April 20, 157 days ago, which puts it {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/history-suggests-breakout-time-bitcoin-rekt-capital"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 within striking distance of a breakout}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01922a0c-0e22-75aa-97a9-2e03176cac9d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/25: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin exchange-traded fund buyers are returning, as seen from the four days of consecutive inflows, according to Farside Investors data. \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2  analysts said in a Sept. 23 report that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-inflows-buoy-price-slowing-spot-buying"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could rally}}}\uc2  if traditional finance markets like the S&P 500 are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  inflows remain positive.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin surpass the $65,000 resistance, attracting buying in select altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been facing resistance at $65,000 for the past two days, but a positive sign is that the bulls have not ceded much ground to the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01922a0c-adde-71f9-af31-6232af6748ed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/25: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day exponential moving average ($61,202) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers propel the price above $65,000, the BTC/USDT pair is likely to accelerate to $70,000. The bears are expected to fiercely protect the $70,000 to $73,777 zone.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the up move, they will have to swiftly yank the price back below the moving averages. If they do that, the pair could slide to the support line.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $2,702 on Sept. 23, indicating that the bears are selling near the overhead resistance of $2,850.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01922a0d-5d99-7870-8cc4-ab830eac502b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/25: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair could drop to the moving averages, an important level to watch out for. If the price rebounds off the moving averages with strength, it will increase the possibility of a breakout above $2,850. If that happens, it will suggest that the downtrend may be over. The pair could climb to $3,400.\par \par \uc2 Instead, suppose the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages. In that case, it will suggest that the pair could be forming a symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is facing selling near the overhead resistance of $635, signaling that the bears are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01922a0e-28a1-7824-a176-6c12bf921852"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/25: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($563). If the price rebounds off this level, it will suggest that lower levels are attracting buyers. The bulls will then make another attempt to overcome the barrier at $635. If they can pull it off, the BNB/USDT pair could soar to $722.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price continues lower and breaks below the moving averages, it will signal that the pair may remain range-bound between $460 and $635 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the moving averages on Sept. 23, indicating that the bulls are buying the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01922a0e-e859-75a5-b747-1d220cbcf5c6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/25: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The critical level to watch out for on the upside is $164, as the bears are expected to defend it aggressively. If the price turns down from $164, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair may dip to the moving averages. The pair could then spend some time between $116 and $164.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns up and pierces the $164 resistance. The pair could then rally to $190, where the bears are expected to pose a substantial challenge.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears have not allowed XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) to maintain above the $0.60 resistance, indicating selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01922a0f-b94c-708b-9d31-868b512a5df8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/25: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will again try to sink the price below the moving averages. If they manage to do that, the XRP/USDT pair could descend to the uptrend line. This is a critical short-term support to watch out for because a close below it may drag the pair to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up from the current level or the moving averages, the bulls will again attempt to clear the hurdle at $0.60. If they succeed, the pair may climb to the overhead resistance at $0.64.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) back into the falling wedge pattern on Sept. 22, but the bulls held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01922a10-c26b-7fc5-954b-5c69ad48b094"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/25: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.10) has started to turn up and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the positive territory, indicating that the bulls have an edge. There is minor resistance at $0.12, but if it is crossed, the next stop may be $0.14.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that bears remain active at higher levels. The DOGE/USDT pair could then decline to $0.09 and later to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) remains stuck between the moving averages, but the tight range trading suggests that a breakout could happen soon.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01922a13-2c48-787e-943e-7eb2d53402f6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/25: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rises and maintains above the 50-day SMA ($5.76), it will signal the start of an up move toward the overhead resistance of $7. Buyers may find it difficult to pierce the $7 level with ease.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to gain control, they will have to yank and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA ($5.56). If they do that, the TON/USDT pair could plunge to the $4.72 to $4.44 support zone. A break below the support zone could start a free fall.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the downtrend line of the descending triangle pattern on Sept. 24.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01922a14-0e9e-7946-9c01-5207855c90dd"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/25: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern is usually a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign, as aggressive bears who take up short positions close them, and buyers who had been waiting on the sidelines enter the markets. That could drive the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair to $0.40 and then to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages. Such a move will indicate that the markets have rejected the breakout. That could increase the risk of a breakdown below $0.31.\par \par \u