inted out that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-significant-rally-2024-10x-research"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin is ready for a rally}}}\uc2 , considering that it is entering the historically strong season from October to March.\par \par \uc2 Another \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  development for the cryptocurrency markets could be the aggressive 50 basis point rate cut by the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  on Sept. 18. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 latest weekly \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  fund flows report said the rate cut could have triggered {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-321-million-inflows-fed-50-bp-rate-cut"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inflows of $321 million}}}\uc2  into \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment products last week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01921fae-5d23-7ef2-a3c1-36f477626e8d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/23: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 According to K33 Research, Bitcoin is nearing another historically crucial period. During the two previous bull market cycles, the trough-to-peak lasted for more than 1,050 days, and the most significant {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/rsi-classic-btc-price-breakout-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 gains were seen during the final 365 days}}}\uc2 . The current peak-to-trough has completed 672 days, putting the cycle in the zone when it could start surging.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin pierce the $65,000 resistance and march toward $70,000? Will that trigger buying in altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index skyrocketed to a new all-time high on Sept. 19, indicating that the bulls remain firmly in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01921faf-0254-766f-ba7b-5048b2a91afc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/23: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price back below the breakout level of 5,670, while the bulls will attempt to flip the level into support. If buyers come out on top by pushing the price above 5,734, the index could rally to 6,000.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price dips below 5,670, the short-term bulls may close their positions, pulling the index to the moving averages. A break and close below the uptrend line will tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 US Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The US Dollar Index (DXY) once again turned down from the 20-day exponential moving average (101.25) on Sept. 23, indicating that the bears continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01921faf-a22e-7bdf-b84b-e67bfae36464"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/23: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears may find it difficult to sink the price below the 101 to 99.57 support zone because the bulls are expected to defend it fiercely. Still, if the bears prevail, the index may start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA. If that happens, it will suggest that the bears are losing their grip. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up after the bulls push the price above the 50-day simple moving average (102.38).\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to drive Bitcoin above the $65,000 overhead resistance, but the bears have held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01921fb0-3eb7-7d82-a735-2872ffbd3314"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/23: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the bulls do not cede much ground to the bears, the likelihood of a rally above $65,000 increases. The BTC/USDT pair could surge to $70,000, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($60,621). The pair may slide to the 50-day SMA ($59,382) and later to $57,500.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 50-day SMA ($2,512) on Sept. 20, indicating that the bears are losing their grip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01921fb0-d9de-7124-84de-f277d459fdb2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/23: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to push the price to the breakdown level of $2,850. This is an important level for the bears to guard because a break and close above it will suggest a potential trend change. The ETH/USDT pair may attempt a rally to $3,400.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to retain control, they will have to swiftly yank the price back below the moving averages. The next leg of the downtrend could begin if bears pull and maintain the price below $2,111.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been gradually moving higher toward $635, the resistance of the large range it has been stuck in for several months.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01921fb1-7638-7688-990f-5129a308858e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/23: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Usually, traders sell near the resistance and buy at the support. If the price turns down sharply from the $600 to $635 resistance zone, it will signal that the BNB/USDT pair may extend its stay inside the range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if buyers thrust the price above $635, it will suggest the start of a new up move. The pair could pick up momentum and rally to $722, which is again likely to act as a formidable barrier.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has pulled back to the moving averages, which is an important support to watch out for in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01921fb2-12b0-76ee-a8ce-31c412925e57"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/23: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the moving averages and breaks above $152, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to $164. This level may pose a strong challenge, but if bulls overcome this obstacle, the pair could travel to $180 and later to $210.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down sharply and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($139), it will suggest that the bears continue to sell on relief rallies. The pair could swing between $164 and $116 for some time.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been maintaining above the moving averages in the past few days, but the bulls have failed to clear the hurdle at $0.60.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01921fb2-b918-7c93-a027-99f17783b1c3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/23: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the rising 20-day EMA ($0.57) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers kick the price above $0.60, the XRP/USDT pair may reach $0.64. The bears are expected to aggressively defend the level, but if the bulls prevail, the rally could stretch to $0.74.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down sharply and skids below the uptrend line. That could sink the pair to $0.50 and later to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-new-price-target-80k-all-time-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s new price targets of over $80K may not actually be the 'all-time high'}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the downtrend line of the falling wedge pattern on Sept. 21, indicating that bulls are attempting a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01921fb3-65de-741c-8eb5-3898e6475b3d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/23: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to pull the price back into the wedge, trapping the aggressive bulls. If they succeed, the selling could pick up, and the DOGE/USDT pair could tumble to $0.09 and after that to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $0.12, it will suggest the start of a new up move. The pair could rally to $0.14 and subsequently to $0.18.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) is getting squeezed between the moving averages, indicating that a range expansion is possible in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01921fb4-0c86-776a-a62d-cd5f6693cf20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/23: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks and closes above the 50-day SMA ($5.76), it will signal the start of an up move toward $7. Buyers may face solid resistance at $7, but if they bulldoze their way through, the rally could reach $8.29.\par \par \uc2 If the uncertainty resolves to the downside by breaking below the 20-day EMA ($5.54), it will suggest that the bears remain sellers on minor rallies. The TON/USDT pair could plunge to the $4.72 to $4.44 support zone.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is finding it difficult to climb above the downtrend line of the descending triangle pattern, but a minor positive is that the bulls have not allowed the price to dip below the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01921fb4-bc5b-786e-a3d5-70bb181a901a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/23: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will make one more attempt to propel the price above the downtrend line. If they can pull it off, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup, which is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to $0.40 and then to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may continue to trade inside the triangle for a few more days. The trend will turn negative on a break and close below the triangle.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDkvMDE5MjFmYTItNGNjNC03YmEwLTkxMDEtYWRmYTJhMWI5MmQz.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240923ek9n000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
