\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Weekly Roundup: CZ Gets Reduced Sentence, Azuki Moves To Anime, & More\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 463 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 September 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Business}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Altcoins}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 NFT}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Web3}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22Regulation\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 This week's crypto roundup highlights several key developments, including \uc2 DBS Bank\uc2 's plans to launch Bitcoin and Ethereum options trading, Bhutan's $780M Bitcoin holdings, and Ethereum's resurgence after hitting a low of $2,000.\par \par \uc2 Bitget secures a multi-million dollar La Liga partnership, while Chiru Labs expands into anime by acquiring Anime.com. Additionally, \uc2 Binance\uc2  founder CZ receives a reduced sentence, and Prager Metis settles with the SEC for $1.95M over \uc2 FTX\uc2  audit failures.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\par \par \uc2 DBS, Singapore's largest bank, is launching {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/09/singapores-dbs-bank-to-offer-otc-btc-and-eth-trading-for-institutional-clients"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 over-the-counter}}}\uc2  Bitcoin and Ethereum options trading for its institutional and accredited wealth clients in Q4 2024.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin dominance is continuing to rise. Currently, at 58.47%, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/09/bitcoin-dominance-heads-to-60-are-altcoins-getting-squeezed-out"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC dominance}}}\uc2  has just powered through resistance and is now heading for the next resistance at 60%.\par \par \uc2 Bhutan has accumulated {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/09/from-mountains-to-mining-bhutans-780m-bitcoin-portfolio"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $780 million worth of Bitcoin}}}\uc2  through its renewable energy-powered mining operations, making it one of the top government holders of the cryptocurrency.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) looks to have finally found a bottom at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/09/ethereum-eth-starts-to-break-downtrend"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $2,000}}}\uc2  as $ETH is now starting to claw its way back up with a 17% increase to its current price level of $2,433.\par \par \uc2 Business\par \par \uc2 In a multi-million dollar deal announced on its sixth anniversary, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/09/bitget-and-la-liga-collaborate-to-advance-crypto-in-the-sports-industry"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitget}}}\uc2  has emerged as the official crypto partner of the leading football league, La Liga.\par \par \uc2 Altcoins\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/09/blockdags-1-target-premier-league-deal-rumors-amp-up-excitement-for-30000x-roi-while-ada-wavers-doge-gears-up-for-a-run"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BlockDAG}}}\uc2  is making headlines as a rising star in the crypto world, with buzz about a possible Premier League partnership driving significant attention.\par \par \uc2 A surge of excitement is brewing in the crypto world as several {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cr