\par\par \b \uc2 2 Cryptocurrencies You Must Sell and 1 You Must Buy Heading into October 2024\b0\par\par\uc2 Adrian Barkley \par \uc2 987 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 September 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Sell: $2 Billion Sell-Off Risk for Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Sell: Weak On-Chain Metrics Indicate a 9% Decline for Solana (SOL)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Buy: Rexas Finance (RXS) Is Expected to Increase Despite Market Uncertainty}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Conclusion}}}\par \par \uc2 Many cryptocurrencies are seeing a change in fate as October 2024 approaches. Some tokens have a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend, but others appear to have growth potential. Here, we talk about two cryptocurrencies that investors must sell: Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and, Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), and Rexas Finance (RXS), which is a great place to acquire.\par \par \uc2 Sell: $2 Billion Sell-Off Risk for Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 Presently, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is in a risky situation as short-term investors consider a possible $2 billion sell-off. Because \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't been able to overcome the crucial $0.39 resistance level, market concern is growing. With a little rise of 0.19% over the past day, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is currently trading at $0.3323. Its price has, however, declined 1.65% over the last month and by 2.44% over the past week, which fuels a negative prediction of the near future.\par \par \uc2 It appears from the consolidation between $0.31 and $0.39 that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is having trouble building up enough steam for a breakout. Short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  holders have a higher chance of profiting than long-term holders, according to Market Value Realized Value (MVRV) statistics; the current MVRV long/short difference is -20%. Approximately $1.9 billion worth of 5.7 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tokens are held by short-term investors, who plan to sell as soon as a profit is indicated. Should this significant amount of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  supply enter the market, it may cause \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  to plunge precipitously, below its crucial support level of $0.31.\par \par \uc2 If \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is unable to recapture its \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum, analysts estimate that it could fall in value by up to 33 percent. The altcoin is now a high-risk investment due to its failure to gain traction and its flat or declining value. Given the gloomy forecast for the market, investors may be able to prevent additional losses by selling \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  at this time.\par \par \uc2 Sell: Weak On-Chain Metrics Indicate a 9% Decline for Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 Another cryptocurrency that is exhibiting weakness is Solana (SOL). SOL, which is presently trading at $132, is in a declining trend following its rejection from the ascending trendline that was earlier broken at $139.80. A long-to-short ratio below one and a decrease in development activities reinforce the gloomy view. The Awesome Oscillator (AO) and the Relative Strength Index (RSI) both trade below their neutral levels, suggesting that the bears are gaining ground.\