 /X: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/rexasfinance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://x.com/rexasfinance}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/rexasfinance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/rexasfinance}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240922ek9l00005\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\u160\'00\'A0\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,608 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 September 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin could extend the recovery to $65,000 if buyers maintain the price above short-term holders' realized price.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDkvMDE5MjEwNTAtMTNjOS03YWFmLWFiYTYtNTUyYTBjZmE5MGQz.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) reached the $64,000 level on Sept. 20, but the bulls could not maintain the higher levels. This shows that the bears have not given up and continue to sell on rallies near the overhead resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 CryptoQuant analyst Avocado_onchain highlighted that the short-term holder (STH) realized price, the average buy price of short-term investors who have held their coins for less than 155 days, is near $62,000.\par \par \uc2 The STH acts as an important support during uptrends; hence if buyers can defend the level during dips, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-rally-above-short-term-holder-metric-has-traders-calling-for-new-btc-price-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could rally higher}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0192104a-0c02-771e-936d-a6c13e255426"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Another positive for the buyers is that the institutional investors have reduced their Bitcoin shorting, according to CryptoQuant founder Ki Young Ju. Additionally, the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) recorded {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bulls-target-64k-btc-price-us-stocks-new-record"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inflows of $158 million}}}\uc2  on Sept. 19, according to Farside Investors data.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin extend its up move by crossing the $65,000 resistance? Will altcoins pick up momentum? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke out of the symmetrical triangle pattern on Sept. 18, indicating that the bulls have overpowered the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0192104a-b4d9-7687-b49b-8f7009e8c685"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($59,629) is sloping up, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is in the positive territory, indicating that the bulls have the upper hand. There is stiff resistance at $65,000, but if the bulls bulldoze their way through, the BTC/USDT pair could soar to $70,000.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is the key support to watch out for on the downside. If this support gives way, it will indicate that the bulls are losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to sink Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) below the uptrend line shows that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0192104b-75b4-71a6-bcdf-32fcfff464c7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($2,424) on Sept. 19 and the 50-day SMA ($2,527) on Sept. 20. That opens the doors for a rally to the breakdown level of $2,850, where the bears are expected to step in.\par \par \uc2 If buyers shove the price above $2,850, the ETH/USDT pair will signal that the markets have rejected the lower levels. The pair may rise to $3,400.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bears remain in charge. The pair could plunge to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the moving averages on Sept. 17, indicating that the sentiment remains positive, and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0192104c-3978-7f95-ab21-1de27d5b93a9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair is likely to rise to the $600 to $635 overhead resistance zone. The bears are expected to defend this zone with all their might, but if the bulls prevail, the pair could start a new up move to $722.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the overhead zone and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($542), it will signal that the bears have not given up. That could extend the pair\u8217\'20\'19s stay inside the range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) surged above the 50-day SMA ($141) on Sept. 19, indicating that the $116 to $210 range remains intact.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0192104c-fd41-779d-8f3f-b96514e8239a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to $164, where the bears will try to halt the up move. If the price turns down from $164 and breaks below the moving averages, it will signal that the pair may remain in the lower half of the large range.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if buyers thrust the price above $164, it will suggest that the pair could be ready for a rally to $190 and subsequently to $210. The bears are expected to fiercely defend the $190 to $210 zone.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a tight range between $0.56 and $0.60 for the past few days, indicating a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0192104d-9b85-7126-a604-bc6d6578474b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($0.57) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory indicate that the bulls have the upper hand. If the buyers overcome the $0.60 barrier, the XRP/USDT could rally to $0.64.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages. That could drag the price down to the uptrend line, which is expected to attract buyers.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to push Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line of the falling wedge pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0192104e-5d5b-7f08-824e-91687de0bafb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, it will signal that the downtrend may be ending. The bears will try to stall the up move at $0.12, but the level is likely to be crossed. The DOGE/USDT pair could then rally to $0.14.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down sharply from the current level and breaks below the moving average, it will suggest that the bears have not given up. The pair could then retest the $0.09 support.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the 20-day EMA ($5.50) on Sept. 17, but the bulls are finding it difficult to overcome the obstacle at the 50-day SMA ($5.78).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0192104e-f784-7b22-869b-c90754af03e8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The tight-range trading is unlikely to continue for long. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again try to propel the TON/USDT pair above the 50-day SMA. If they can pull it off, the pair may climb to $7. Such a move will signal the continuation of the range-bound action between $4.72 and $8.29.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the up move, they will have to swiftly pull the price back below the 20-day EMA. That could open the doors for a possible fall to the $4.72 to $4.44 support zone.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has risen to the downtrend line of the descending triangle pattern, which is an important level for the bears to defend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0192104f-fdf5-723c-9012-2136eec1c249"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel and retain the price above the triangle, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. The failure of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup is generally a positive sign. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to $0.40 and subsequently to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the downtrend line and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may remain inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the resistance line of the descending channel pattern on Sept. 19, indicating a potential trend change.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01921050-aa09-72b1-8a62-3e16066199a4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the Sept. 20 candlestick shows selling near $29. If the bulls do not give up much ground from the current level, the prospects of a break above $29 increase. The AVAX/USDT pair could rally to $33, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down sharply and breaks below the moving averages, it will signal selling on rallies. That could keep the pair range-bound between $19.50 and $29 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the $0.000013 support on Sept. 18 and rose above the moving averages on Sept. 19.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01921051-4ed8-791e-8e5b-4fb2af8560b0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the bulls are attempting a comeback. The SHIB/USDT pair is likely to rise to $0.000016, where the bears are again expected to mount a strong defense. If the price turns down sharply from $0.000016, the pair may enter a few days of range-bound action.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is at the moving averages and after that at $0.000013. Sellers will have to sink and sustain the price below $0.000013 to signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDkvMDE5MjEwNTAtMTNjOS03YWFmLWFiYTYtNTUyYTBjZmE5MGQz.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240920ek9k000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/18: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,617 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 September 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin could witness a knee-jerk reaction following the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s rate cuts, but the move is unlikely to sustain\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDkvMDE5MjA1YTgtNjdiMS03NjU3LTgxMTItNGUyYjMzOTYwOTcy.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/18: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has dropped below $60,000, indicating nervousness among the bulls. Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to rise after the interest rate decision by the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  on Sept. 18, but it is unlikely to kick start a trending move in either direction. After the initial knee-jerk reaction, the price is likely to settle down, remaining inside the large range between $52,500 and $73,777.\par \par \uc2 Analysts have different views about the short-term reaction to the rate cuts. BitMEX co-founder and Maelstrom chief investment officer \uc2 Arthur Hayes\uc2  expects the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/arthur-hayes-market-crash-rate-cut-prediction"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 markets to drop following the rate cuts}}}\uc2  as it will \u8220\'20\'1Cnarrow the interest rate differential between the US dollar and the Japanese yen.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01920592-f24f-7f98-9633-cefd62da158d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/18: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 In contrast, quantitative Bitcoin and \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  fund Capriole Investments founder Charles Edwards believes that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-can-see-64k-very-quickly-fed-rate-cut"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin is ready to resume its bull phase}}}\uc2  if the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  cuts rates, signaling the start of a dovish policy regime.\par \par \uc2 What are the critical levels in Bitcoin and altcoins that need to be crossed to indicate a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price action of the past few days has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01920593-bbd3-78d0-9d09-2982270cc559"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/18: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has turned down from the resistance line and is likely to fall to the 20-day exponential moving average ($58,639). This is an important level for the bulls to protect, because a break below it may open the doors for a fall to the support line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will improve the prospects of a rally above $61,200. If that happens, the BTC/USDT pair could start a recovery to $65,000 and subsequently to $70,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to shove Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($2,397) on Sept. 17, but the bears did not budge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01920594-6746-7b6f-b3a0-5a33aefb53df"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/18: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The uptrend line is the critical support to watch out for on the downside. If this support gives way, the selling could accelerate, and the ETH/USDT pair could plunge to $2,111 and eventually to $2,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bulls push the price above the 50-day SMA ($2,553), it will signal that the bears are losing their grip. The pair could rally to the breakdown level of $2,850. Buyers will have to clear this level to suggest a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been attempting to maintain above the moving averages, indicating a short-term positive sentiment.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01920595-0f4b-7c45-babf-2d4f7ac28b01"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/18: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to drive the price above $562 to indicate the continuation of the relief rally. The BNB/USDT pair could reach $600, where the bears are likely to pose a substantial challenge. If bulls overcome this barrier, the pair may reach $635.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the bears have overpowered the bulls. The pair could move downward toward the critical support at $460.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($134) on Sept. 17, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01920595-ab4e-75ce-911b-00471347b626"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/18: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn down and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the negative territory indicating that bears have the upper hand. Minor support at $128, but if this level gives way, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could plunge to $116.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 50-day SMA ($141), it will indicate the start of a sustained recovery. The pair may attempt a rally to $164.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($0.56) on Sept. 16, but the bulls could not push the price above the $0.60 overhead resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01920596-4ef1-76ac-ab8b-ce16d33622a7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/18: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears have pulled the price back to the moving averages on Sept. 18. If this support breaks down, the XRP/USDT pair may drop to the uptrend line. The bulls are expected to protect the uptrend line because a break below it may sink the pair to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up from the moving averages and breaks above $0.60, it will signal that the dips are being purchased. The pair could rally to $0.64, which may be a difficult hurdle to cross.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the downtrend line of the falling wedge pattern, indicating that the bulls have kept up the buying pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/01920596-ff16-7066-a84c-8f2443a24321"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/18: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns u