\par\par \b \uc2 See Why Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) and Tron (TRX) Investors Are Flooding To This Ethereum Gem\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 511 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 September 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano Sees $6 Billion Whale Activity Fueling \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  Surge}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TRON Partners with Tether and TRM Labs: TRX Sees a Slight Pump}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 FXGuys: The Ethereum Gem Gaining Popularity}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $FXG Attracts Investors by Flaunting Massive Gain Prospects!}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and \uc2 TRON\uc2  (TRX) investors are continuously turning their attention to a groundbreaking Ethereum-based project. Despite the many positive developments and constant growth in the Cardano and \uc2 TRON\uc2  network, most investors seek alternative investments to increase their profits.\par \par \uc2 The new project is rapidly gaining traction because of its innovative features, lucrative presale opportunities, and massive growth potential. Here, we discuss why \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  and TRX investors are flocking to the new crypto gem!\par \par \uc2 Cardano Sees $6 Billion Whale Activity Fueling \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  Surge\par \par \uc2 Cardano recently reported $6 billion in large transaction volume, a metric that represents whale activity. Based on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://app.intotheblock.com/?end_offset=30"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 IntoTheBlock}}}\uc2  data, Cardano's huge transaction volume hit $6.08 billion. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://messari.io/project/cardano/charts/market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 large transaction volume}}}\uc2  indicator estimates the amount transacted by institutions and whales, with a surge in \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  volume indicating that more whales are participating in the market.\par \par \uc2 Moreover, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/IntersectMBO/status/1833434041762128090"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Intersect}}}\uc2 , a member-based organization designed for the Cardano ecosystem, announced the release of Cardano GovTool, a new tool for the Cardano community. The core governance tool is a major step forward for Cardano's decentralized governance system.\par \par \uc2 With these developments on the table, analyst Nick Valdez believes \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  will surge significantly. In a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://youtu.be/WIGlS4MpHcI?si=GJ68otAFcegY7HcN"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 podcast}}}\uc2 , Valdez highlighted factors that could help push Cardano considerably higher in the coming months.\par \par \uc2 On September 11, 2024, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  was valued at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $0.3435, up 7.62%}}}\uc2  in the past week. Experts believe it will surge to $0.3615 this month, supported by developments on its network. Despite the expected gains, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  investors are turning toward a new Ethereum gem.\par \par \uc2 TRON Partners with Tether and TRM Labs: TRX Sees a Slight Pump\par \par \uc2 TRON\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price has performed remarkably since April 2024. During this time, TRX has gained {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/tron/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 over 40%}}}\uc2  despite the recent market correction. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum resulted in a new yearly high on August 25.\par \par \uc2 However, \uc2 TRON\uc2  has been corrected since then. A new announcement on September 10 increased interest in \uc2 TRON\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ecosystem but is yet to take the price above its yearly high.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.forbes.com/sites/digital-assets/2024/09/10/tether-tron-and-trm-labs-join-forces-to-combat-crypto-crime/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TRON announced}}}\uc2  that it has partnered with Tether and blockchain intelligence company TRM Labs to set up the T3 Financial Crime Unit (FCU).\par \par \uc2 Based on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/trondao/status/1833437995766321254"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the statement}}}\uc2 , the new partnership will create a safer and more secure crypto community by integrating the technical expertise of \uc2 TRON\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s blockchain and DAO, TRM Labs\u8217\'20\'19 financial crime expertise, and the extensive investigative abilities of the Tether team.\par \par \uc2 Regardless of the partnership, TRX is yet to rise considerably. On September 11, TRX was trading at$0.153, up 1.62% in the past week. Analysts say it will rise to $0.165 this month, supported by the partnerships and increased buying pressure. Nonetheless, TRX investors are also buying a new Ethereum gem to stabilize their portfolios.\par \par \uc2 BUY $FXG TOKENS HERE \par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240916ek9f00008\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Hodler's Digest\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs may face hacker threats, Ellison seeks no prison time, and more: Hodler\u8217\'20\'19s Digest, Sept. 8 \u8211\'20\'13 14\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Editorial Staff \par \uc2 2,150 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 September 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Caroline Ellison\u8217\'20\'19s lawyers say she \u8220\'20\'1Cposes no threat to public safety\u8221\'20\'1D and Bitcoin ETFs attractive to hackers due to the potential payout.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.magazine.cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/sep-14-1-scaled.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs may face hacker threats, Ellison seeks no prison time, and more: Hodler\u8217\'20\'19s Digest, Sept. 8 \u8211\'20\'13 14}}}\par \par \uc2 Top Stories of The Week\par \par \uc2 FBI\uc2  reports Americans lost $5.6B to cryptocurrency fraud in 2023\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 United States Federal Bureau of Investigation (FBI)\uc2  Internet Crime Complaint Center has released its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fbi-2023-cryptocurrency-fraud-report-americans-lost-5-billion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cryptocurrency fraud report for 2023}}}\uc2 . Americans lost $5.6 billion due to cryptocurrency fraud that year, up 45% from 2022, it said. Crypto-related complaints represented 10% of the total received, but almost 50% of the total lost that year, the \uc2 FBI\uc2  said.\par \par \uc2 The report found that of the 69,000 crypto-related complaints the \uc2 FBI\uc2  received in 2023, people over 60 were most often victimized, accounting for almost $1.6 billion of the losses. Almost 71% of the crypto fraud was related to investment schemes, and about 10% involved call center fraud and government impersonation scams.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 FBI\uc2  received complaints from over 200 countries, but the vast majority of complaints and losses were from the United States. Many of the losses were the result of confidence schemes. The \uc2 FBI\uc2  had one main piece of advice to avoid this type of scam:\par \par \uc2 There is one thing these scammers typically will not do they will not meet with you in real life. If an investment opportunity comes from someone who you have never met in person [] be extremely cautious of the advice.\par \par \uc2 Crypto becomes US election issue for the first time Survey\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrencies like Bitcoin will likely {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-us-election-issue-first-time-history-gemini"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 play a role in the coming United States}}}\uc2  presidential election, as increasing numbers of U.S. crypto investors are concerned about the candidates approach to regulating the industry.\par \par \uc2 The vast majority of crypto owners in the U.S. plan to consider the crypto \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  stance of U.S. presidential candidates in the upcoming election in November, according to a new report by Winklevoss twins-founded crypto exchange \uc2 Gemini\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Released on Sept. 10, Geminis latest Global State of Crypto report featured a survey of 6,000 adults representing a random sample of the consumer populations in the U.S., the United Kingdom, France, Singapore and Turkey. The survey was conducted online from May 23 to June 28, 2024.\par \par \uc2 According to Geminis findings, as many as 73% of U.S. respondents who currently own crypto said that a candidates stance on crypto would have some impact on their vote.\par \par \uc2 Additionally, another 37% of respondents indicated that a presidential candidates position on crypto would have a significant impact on their vote.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.magazine.cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Digest_13-09_1-1024x682.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs may face hacker threats, Ellison seeks no prison time, and more: Hodler\u8217\'20\'19s Digest, Sept. 8 \u8211\'20\'13 14}}}\par \par \uc2 Caroline Ellison asks for time served, citing cooperation with US govt\par \par \uc2 Lawyers representing former {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/caroline-ellison-sentencing-recommendation-alameda-research-time-served"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Alameda Research CEO Caroline Ellison recommend}}}\uc2  that she be sentenced to time served after pleading guilty to seven felony counts related to cryptocurrency exchange FTXs downfall.\par \par \uc2 In a Sept. 10 filing in the United States District Court for the Southern District of New York, Ellisons legal team submitted letters from friends, colleagues and family members recommending she serve a light sentence. The attorneys recommended that the former Alameda CEO, based on the Probation Departments Pre-Sentence Report (PSR) terms, be sentenced to time served with three years supervised release at her Sept. 24 hearing.\par \par \uc2 The PSR grounds this recommendation in Carolines extraordinary cooperation with the government, her otherwise unblemished record, and the numerous testimonials of Carolines honesty and ethical behavior both before she started working at Alameda and since she left Alameda, the filing said.\par \par \uc2 Caroline poses no risk of recidivism and presents no threat to public safety. It would therefore promote respect for the law to grant leniency in recognition of Carolines early disclosure of the crimes, her unmitigated acceptance of responsibility for them, andmost importantlyher extensive cooperation with the government.\par \par \uc2 Ellisons lawyers added:\par \par \uc2 Without in any way diminishing the very serious crimes here, we respectfully submit that the policy goals and interests of justice [\u8230\'20\'26] do not require sending Caroline to prison, and accordingly request a non-custodial sentence.\par \par \uc2 Vitalik: L2s that arent at least stage 1 are dead to me\par \par \uc2 Ethereum co-founder \uc2 Vitalik Buterin\uc2  has reiterated his stance on layer-2 decentralization, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-l2-not-at-stage-1-are-dead-says-vitalik"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stating that he only plans}}}\uc2  to acknowledge scaling solutions at stage 1 of his decentralization scale.\par \par \uc2 In a Sept. 12 post on X, Buterin said that he takes this seriously and that, starting next year, he only plans to publicly mention layer-2 networks that are stage 1+.\par \par \uc2 He added that there may be a short grace period for new genuinely interesting projects, stating:\par \par \uc2 It doesnt matter if I invested, or if youre my friend; stage 1 or bust.\par \par \uc2 Buterin said many zero-knowledge rollup teams have told him theyre on track to be stage 1 by year-end, and he was excited to see that happen.\par \par \uc2 The era of rollups being glorified multisigs is coming to an end. The era of cryptographic trust is upon us, he said.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs are next major target for North Korean hackers Cyvers\par \par \uc2 North Korean hackers, including the infamous Lazarus Group, may begin targeting larger financial entities, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etfs-major-target-north-korean-hackers-cyvers"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 including United States-based Bitcoin exchange-traded funds}}}\uc2  (ETFs).\par \par \uc2 The Lazarus Group is associated with some of the most notorious hacks in the cryptocurrency space, including the biggest hack in decentralized finance the $625 million Ronin bridge hack.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://servedbyadbutler.com/go2/;ID=169476;size=728x90;setID=601214;referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fcointelegraph.com%2Fmagazine%2Fwp-json%2Fwp%2Fv2%2Fposts%3F_embed%26per_page%3D100"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://servedbyadbutler.com/go2/;ID=169476;size=300x250;setID=601213;referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fcointelegraph.com%2Fmagazine%2Fwp-json%2Fwp%2Fv2%2Fposts%3F_embed%26per_page%3D100"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Hackers could start shifting their attention to the U.S. Bitcoin ETFs due to the sizable potential payout, according to Michael Pearl, vice president of \uc2 GTM\uc2  strategy at on-chain security company Cyvers.\par \par \uc2 Pearl told Cointelegraph in an exclusive interview:\par \par \uc2 Only recently the \uc2 FBI\uc2  has issued a warning that North Korean hackers are going to try to infiltrate and steal money from ETFs. So, all those ETFs [] are storing the base Bitcoin somewhere. And you can be certain that somebody is already planning and thinking of how they\u8217\'20\'19re going to steal it.\par \par \uc2 Winners and Losers\par \par \uc2 At the end of the week, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is at $60,436, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) at $2,444 and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  at $0.57. The total market cap is at $2.11 trillion, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according}}}\uc2  to CoinMarketCap.\par \par \uc2 Among the biggest 100 cryptocurrencies, the top three altcoin gainers of the week are Nervos Network (CKB) at 84.94%, Popcat (SOL) (POPCAT) at 50.15% and Bittensor (TAO) at 37.63%.\par \par \uc2 The top three altcoin losers of the week are Helium (HNT) at 2.99%, \uc2 TRON\uc2  (TRX) at +0.84% and Unus Sed Leo (LEO) at +1.13%. For more info on crypto prices, make sure to read {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraphs market analysis}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.magazine.cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/WL-sept-14-01-1024x826.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs may face hacker threats, Ellison seeks no prison time, and more: Hodler\u8217\'20\'19s Digest, Sept. 8 \u8211\'20\'13 14}}}\par \par \uc2 Most Memorable Quotations\par \par \uc2 We firmly believe that digital assets are not merely a passing trend, but a fundamental shift in the fabric of finance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/standard-chartered-crypto-custody-uae"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bill Winters}}}\uc2 , CEO of \uc2 Standard Chartered\par \par \uc2 Pump.fun and \uc2 Solana\uc2  have been the current craze to find new gems, but thats also catering to a specific type of degen trader, [\u8230\'20\'26] which is entirely different from leverage trading an established meme like Pepe on major centralized exchanges.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/major-memecoins-down-market-frenzy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ilias Salvatore}}}\uc2 , growth lead at Flooz\par \par \uc2 Insurance coverage of third-party custodians is a joke. Its simply not economical to insure the full value of these assets given the risks involved and difficulty in recovering lost funds.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-security-fbi-north-korea-hackers"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Jameson Lopp}}}\uc2 , co-founder and chief security officer at Casa\par \par \uc2 For the first time in United States history, crypto has become a significant campaign issue in a presidential election.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-us-election-issue-first-time-history-gemini"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Gemini}}}\uc2 , cryptocurrency exchange\par \par \uc2 Without in any way diminishing the very serious crimes here, we respectfully submit that the policy goals and interests of justice [\u8230\'20\'26] do not require sending Caroline to prison, and accordingly request a non-custodial sentence.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/caroline-ellison-sentencing-recommendation-alameda-research-time-served"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Caroline Ellison\u8217\'20\'19s}}}\uc2  legal team\par \par \uc2 If history repeats, Bitcoin may be heading for three straight months of positive upside Monthly returns.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-celebrate-good-news-as-btc-price-trades-above-56-k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Rekt Capital}}}\uc2 , pseudonymous crypto analyst\par \par \uc2 Prediction of The Week\par \par \uc2 VanEck\uc2 , \uc2 StoneX\uc2  analysts peg Ether price upside at $12K to $22K\par \par \uc2 Ether (ETH) spot price could potentially {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/vaneck-stonex-analysts-ether-price-upside#:~:text=Ether"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rise to between $12,000 and $22,000}}}\uc2  by the end of this decade in an upside scenario, according to two estimates from analysts at cryptocurrency brokerage StoneX Digital and asset manager VanEck.\par \par \uc2 Matthew Sigel, VanEcks head of \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  research, expects the Ethereum network to generate up to $66 billion in annual free cash flow by 2030, driving ETHs spot price as high as $22,000 per token.\par \par \uc2 David Kroger, a data scientist at \uc2 StoneX\uc2 , sees ETH prices climbing to roughly $4,600 over the next 18 months.\par \par \uc2 Read also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/block-by-block-blockchain-technology-transforming-real-estate-market/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Features Block by block: Blockchain technology is transforming the real estate market}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/laws-taxes-apply-nfts-metaverse/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Features Crazy outcomes when current laws applied to NFTs and the metaverse}}}\par \par \uc2 The upside, though, is much higher around $12,621 especially considering some of the upcoming technological upgrades that Ethereum is working on, \uc2 Kroger\uc2  said, speaking alongside Sigel at a Sept. 10 StoneX panel.\par \par \uc2 The estimates are based on anticipated value accrual to ETH holders from transaction fees as Ethereum processes a growing portion of the worlds transactions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.magazine.cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Digest_13-09_3-1024x682.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs may face hacker threats, Ellison seeks no prison time, and more: Hodler\u8217\'20\'19s Digest, Sept. 8 \u8211\'20\'13 14}}}\par \par \uc2 FUD of The Week\par \par \uc2 Brazilian bank suspends native crypto token trading following 97% \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 Nubank\uc2 , one of Latin Americas largest crypto banks and b {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/berkshire-hathaway-invests-500m-in-brazilian-digital-bank"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 acked by Warren Buffets Berkshire Hathaway}}}\uc2 , announced on Sept. 10 the immediate suspension of trading for Nucoin, its native cryptocurrency. The tokens price has dropped over 97% over the last year.\par \par \uc2 Nubank\uc2  announced the creation of the Nucoin token on the Polygon blockchain on Oct. 19, 2022. Almost two years after the announcement, the bank closed its trading. The bank has given customers who have at least 10 reals in Nucoins the option to convert them to Bitcoin or stablecoin USDC by Dec. 9.\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph Brazil reported, if a user does not proceed with the conversion, the cryptocurrencies will be kept for accumulation and future benefit from the rewards program.\par \par \uc2 To protect you and all participants from potential \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market value of Nucoins due to potential reactions to this update, we have chosen to suspend your trading immediately, \uc2 Nubank\uc2  said in an email to customers, according to the media report.\par \par \uc2 Kraken denies SEC claims, argues digital assets arent securities\par \par \uc2 Kraken, a centralized cryptocurrency exchange, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/kraken-denies-sec-unregistered-securities-allegations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 has responded to the United States}}}\uc2  Securities and Exchange Commissions (SEC) claim that it violated federal securities laws. The SEC alleged that multiple digital assets the crypto exchange offers qualify as unregistered securities.\par \par \uc2 In the legal {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.courtlistener.com/docket/68023155/91/securities-and-exchange-commission-v-payward-inc/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 filing}}}\uc2  response, Kraken firmly denied the allegations, maintaining that the assets in question do not meet the legal definition of securities under U.S. law.\par \par \uc2 Read also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/agents-of-influence-blockchain-cryptoverse/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Features Agents of Influence: He Who Controls The Blockchain, Controls The Cryptoverse}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/virtual-reality-blockchain-economics-permanence-and-scarcity/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Features Why Virtual Reality Needs Blockchain: Economics, Permanence and Scarcity}}}\par \par \uc2 The exchanges defense rests strongly on the assertion that digital assets, including Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Algorand (ALGO), Cosmos (ATOM), and others traded on Kraken, are not investment contracts.\par \par \uc2 eToro US to cease nearly all crypto trading following SEC settlement\par \par \uc2 Popular stock trading platform \uc2 eToro\uc2  is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/e-toro-cease-crypto-trading-sec-settlement"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ceasing trading for nearly all crypto assets}}}\uc2  after reaching a settlement with the \uc2 U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 EToro\uc2  was charged with operating an unregistered brokerage and clearing agency related to its crypto trading platform.\par \par \uc2 The trading platform has agreed to pay $1.5 million to settle the charges related to its unregistered brokerage and clearing agency operations, the SEC announced on Sept. 12.\par \par \uc2 As part of the settlement, \uc2 eToro\uc2  has agreed to make only a limited set of crypto assets available for trading in the U.S. and to cease violating applicable federal securities laws.\par \par \uc2 In line with the settlement, eToros U.S. customers will only be able to trade Bitcoin, Bitcoin Cash and Ether tokens, allowing customers to sell their other crypto assets for up to 180 days starting Sept. 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.magazine.cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Digest_13-09_2-1024x682.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs may face hacker threats, Ellison seeks no prison time, and more: Hodler\u8217\'20\'19s Digest, Sept. 8 \u8211\'20\'13 14}}}\par \par \uc2 Top Magazine stories of The Week\par \par \uc2 Proposed change could save Ethereum from L2 roadmap to hell\par \par \uc2 Critics say ETH is in a death spiral, with plunging fee revenue and extractive L2s. But researchers have a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/simple-change-save-ethereum-roadmap-to-hell/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 plan to Make Ethereum Great Again}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Chinas point running crypto scams, pig butchers kidnap kids: Asia Express\par \par \uc2 A new scam known as point running rises in China, Indodax responds to hack with free money, pig butchering {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/china-usdt-scam-indodaxs-free-money-damage-control-asia-express/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 scammers are kidnapping kids}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Subscribe The most engaging reads in blockchain. Delivered once a week.\par \par \uc2 Email address\par \par \uc2 SUBSCRIBE\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.magazine.cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/reading-copy.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Subscribe to Magazine by Cointelegraph Newsletter.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.magazine.cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/sep-14-1-scaled.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}