\par\par \b \uc2 Top 5 Altcoins for Long-Term Investment That Could Deliver Huge Returns\b0\par\par\uc2 Adrian Barkley \par \uc2 809 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 September 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TRON (TRX)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Avalanche (AVAX)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kaspa (KAS)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Uniswap (UNI)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Conclusion}}}\par \par \uc2 Discovering the most promising alternative cryptocurrencies can be a game-changer for future financial gains. This article highlights five digital currencies poised for substantial growth, offering an exciting glimpse into potential high-return investments. Dive in to uncover the cryptocurrencies that could redefine long-term investment strategies.\par \par \uc2 TRON (TRX)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/09/septembers-list-of-must-watch-cryptos-to-maximize-gains-as-bears-sleep"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TRON (TRX)}}}\uc2  is currently navigating a range between $0.15 and $0.16, with bears exerting pressure. Despite the current struggle to break through the $0.16 resistance, there are signs that the tide could turn in TRX's favor. With a solid 17% gain in just the past month and over 20% growth over six months, TRON has the potential to push past its key $0.17 resistance level. If this level is broken, it could signal a new phase of growth. TRX's current price action suggests that, in the long term, it may continue to build on its momentum if it holds above the $0.14 support level. Looking at the long-term, TRON could experience a surge of up to 380% by the end of Q4 if \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum strengthens.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 )\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/fair-price-for-these-under-1-cryptos-is-%24-100"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2  currently trades between $0.31 and $0.35, with the bulls showing signs of regrouping. Although the price remains below key moving averages, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has seen a 9% uptick over the last week, hinting at underlying strength. With a modest rise of 4% over the past month, the potential for further gains is clear if it breaks through the $0.37 resistance. If Cardano can move past this level, it could reach $0.40, representing a 14% increase. Given that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  isn't overbought or oversold, the coin is well-positioned for future growth, offering long-term potential for investors willing to weather the short-term market fluctuations. If key levels are breached, Cardano could see an impressive rise of 250% in the coming six months.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche (AVAX)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/09/unlock-5-key-altcoins-to-earning-big-during-market-downturns"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Avalanche (AVAX)}}}\uc2  is trading between $21 and $24, showing impressive resilience with a 12% rise over the last week and month. While it faces resistance at $25, Avalanche is building momentum that could push it towards the $28 mark, representing a potential 17% increase. The recent upward movement suggests that the bears may be losing their grip, opening the door for further growth. If \uc2 AVAX\uc2  continues on this trajectory, it could regain previous highs and reward long-term holders with significant returns. Should the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum continue, Avalanche has the potential to climb by as much as 410% by early next year.\par \par \uc2 Kaspa (KAS)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/which-cryptos-could-25x-your-investment-in-september-heres-top-5-analyst-pick"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kaspa (KAS)}}}\uc2  has maintained a stable range between $0.14 and $0.16, with bulls slowly gaining ground. Over the past week, KAS has shown a 15% increase, signaling growing momentum. If Kaspa can break through the $0.17 resistance, the coin could rise by as much as 20%, reaching towards the next resistance at $0.19. With strong buying interest reflected by an RSI above 60, the potential for long-term growth is promising. As long as Kaspa holds above its $0.13 support level, it could continue to build on this strength, making it a candidate for future growth. In a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, Kaspa could rally by 330% in the next six months.\par \par \uc2 Uniswap (UNI)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/09/best-5-memecoins-set-for-x50-returns-if-bulls-kick-off-an-autumn-rally"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Uniswap (UNI)}}}\uc2  is currently trading within the $5.73 to $6.78 range, with bulls starting to show strength. Recent gains of nearly 10% in just one week suggest a positive outlook, despite a 40% drop over the past six months. Uniswap's current price action hints at a potential breakout if it can surpass the $7 resistance level, which could lead to a 20% increase if it reaches the $8 mark. Long-term investors might see this as a key opportunity to capture future growth as the coin builds towards a recovery. With continued development and strong market support, Uniswap could potentially soar by 470% by the end of the year.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 These five altcoins \u8212\'20\'14 TRON, Cardano, Avalanche, Kaspa, and Uniswap \u8212\'20\'14 demonstrate promising potential for long-term investors looking for significant returns. While each faces varying degrees of resistance and market challenges, the underlying strength and \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  indicators suggest that these digital assets are well-positioned to experience substantial growth. Investors willing to navigate the short-term market fluctuations could see remarkable gains, with some of these altcoins showing the potential to multiply their value by the end of the year or early next. As with any investment, careful monitoring of market trends and resistance levels will be crucial for maximizing returns on these promising altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240914ek9d00004\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 sec\par \b \uc2 SEC \u8216\'20\'18regrets any confusion\u8217\'20\'19 from dubbing tokens as securities: filing\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Alex O\u8217\'20\'19Donnell \par \uc2 588 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 September 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The SEC retracts labeling tokens as "securities" in the Binance lawsuit but continues pursuing claims of unlawful securities offerings against the crypto exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDkvMDE5MWVjNmUtMDhkNS03OTVkLTgxMmItMzk5OGI3MmEyMDg2.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC \u8216\'20\'18regrets any confusion\u8217\'20\'19 from dubbing tokens as securities: filing}}}\par \par \uc2 According to a footnote in a Sept. 12 court filing, the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  has retracted its longstanding characterization of cryptocurrencies as \u8220\'20\'1Csecurities\u8221\'20\'1D and intends to use more careful language in the future.\par \par \uc2 The retraction arose from the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s ongoing lawsuit against crypto exchange \uc2 Binance\uc2  for allegedly offering and selling unregistered securities. In a 2023 complaint, the SEC identified 10 crypto assets on the \uc2 Binance\uc2  platform as \u8220\'20\'1Csecurities,\u8221\'20\'1D including the native tokens of Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 The SEC \u8220\'20\'1Cregrets any confusion\u8221\'20\'1D caused by its characterization of these tokens as \u8220\'20\'1Ccrypto asset securities\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1Cno longer uses the shorthand term,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://storage.courtlistener.com/recap/gov.uscourts.dcd.256060/gov.uscourts.dcd.256060.273.1.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according}}}\uc2  to the Sept. 12 filing.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWith its use of the term \u8216\'20\'18crypto asset securities,\u8217\'20\'19 the SEC is not referring to the crypto asset itself as the security,\u8221\'20\'1D the agency said. Instead, a token\u8217\'20\'19s status as a security \u8220\'20\'1Cconsists of the full set of contracts, expectations, and understandings centered on the sales and distribution of the [crypto asset],\u8221\'20\'1D it said, citing language from an earlier filing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191ec64-09c1-7d66-891a-cb125b9241f0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC \u8216\'20\'18regrets any confusion\u8217\'20\'19 from dubbing tokens as securities: filing}}}\par \par \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s chief legal officer has been critical of the SEC. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/iampaulgrewal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Paul Grewal}}}\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/court-denies-kraken-motion-dismiss-sec-lawsuit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Court denies Kraken\u8217\'20\'19s motion to dismiss SEC lawsuit}}}\par \par \uc2 The SEC asserts that even by this narrower definition, \uc2 Binance\uc2  remains at fault for unlawful securities offerings because the exchange\u8217\'20\'19s tokens \u8220\'20\'1Ccontinue to be offered and sold as investment contracts.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The securities regulator is advancing a similar argument against crypto exchange Kraken, which the agency {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.sec.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2023-237"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 charged}}}\uc2  in November with \u8220\'20\'1Coperating [a] crypto trading platform as an unregistered securities exchange, broker, dealer, and clearing agency.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The regulator\u8217\'20\'19s emphasis on the context around which virtual assets are sold follows its 2024 approval of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) exchange-traded funds (ETF) using a legal entity structure typically associated with funds holding commodities, not securities.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191ec65-10bf-76d2-9daf-12256fee64af"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC \u8216\'20\'18regrets any confusion\u8217\'20\'19 from dubbing tokens as securities: filing}}}\par \par \uc2 The SEC is also suing Kraken for alleged securities law violations. Source: Kraken\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19ll say it again: somehow ETH transaction[s] HAVE changed [in] a meaningful way that the Ten Crypto Assets [referenced in the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s Binance lawsuit] have not so as to avoid the agency\u8217\'20\'19s clutches,\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 Paul Grewal\uc2 , \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s chief legal officer, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/iampaulgrewal/status/1834447203680825809"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  in a Sept. 13 post on the X platform.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHow? That\u8217\'20\'19s apparently for the [SEC] to know, and the rest of us to find out only if and when we are sued,\u8221\'20\'1D Grewal said. \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  is also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-full-dismissal-sec-lawsuit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 being sued by the SEC}}}\uc2  for alleged violations of securities laws.\par \par \uc2 Pressure is mounting on US financial regulators, including the SEC and Commodity Futures Trading Commission (CFTC), to abandon what critics describe as a high-handed and confusing approach to crypto enforcement.\par \par \uc2 In a Sept. 4 statement, Summer Mersinger, one of the CFTC\u8217\'20\'19s five commissioners, chastized the CFTC for engaging in \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  through enforcement\u8221\'20\'1D and called for clearer guidance for crypto exchanges.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt [is] my hope that one day soon the commission would consider rulemaking, or at the very least guidance, making clear how DeFi protocols could comply with them,\u8221\'20\'1D Mersinger said.\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/china-usdt-scam-indodaxs-free-money-damage-control-asia-express/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 China\u8217\'20\'19s \u8216\'20\'18point running\u8217\'20\'19 crypto scams, pig butchers kidnap kids: Asia Express}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDkvMDE5MWVjNmUtMDhkNS03OTVkLTgxMmItMzk5OGI3MmEyMDg2.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240913ek9d000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
