\par\par \b \uc2 New Viral Presale Coin With 100x Potential Set To Rival Solana and Cardano\b0\par\par\uc2 Adrian Barkley \par \uc2 665 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 September 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Positive sentiment has returned to the crypto market after a long \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  period. Coins like \uc2 Solana\uc2  and Cardano are now showing gains on the monthly timeframes. Meanwhile, \uc2 Solana\uc2  network metrics are still dropping.\par \par \uc2 The Cardano Founder has given a hint on what will happen after the Chang hard fork. In other news, analysts have shared high expectations for a new project known as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://intelmarketspresale.com?utm_source=cryptodaily&utm_medium=mik&utm_campaign=01"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 IntelMarkets}}}\uc2 . They expect the price of the token will rise by 100x within the coming months.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Network Metrics Drop, SOL Price Rallies\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) meme coins have been losing their popularity in the past weeks. This loss has contributed to the drop in the overall user engagement on the Layer-1 blockchain. In recent days, the daily active addresses and transaction counts have decreased, causing low network fees.\par \par \uc2 According to data from Artemis, daily transactions on the \uc2 Solana\uc2  blockchain stood at 29 million in the last 30 days, a 22% drop. This decrease in the number of transactions resulted in a 45% decrease in fees, amounting to $523,000.\par \par \uc2 Also, the \uc2 Solana\uc2  price is on the rise in the given monthly time frame. Its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/solana/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 market cap}}}\uc2  is consolidating between $50 billion and $75 billion. Analysts forecast the value of the \uc2 Solana\uc2  coin could cross the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/SOLUSD/technicals/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 200-day SMA}}}\uc2  ($147.44) soon.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Founder Shares Thoughts on Chang Upgrade\par \par \uc2 Cardano's founder, \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 , has shared his thoughts on what is next for the project after the Chang hard fork. In an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/IOHK_Charles/status/1830626192355111002"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 X video}}}\uc2 , Hoskinson said that the Cardano blockchain is in the bootstrap phase, where the early government is established.\par \par \uc2 According to him, the bootstrap phase is a stage whereby new governments and roles are set in Voltaire's era. He pointed out that these new pillars are important to support fully functional community-driven governance.\par \par \uc2 In other news, the Cardano coin is trading in the green zone on the monthly time frame. The cryptocurrency's market valuation is ranging between $10 billion and $15 billion. Experts forecast the price of Cardano crypto could rise to test the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/ADAUSD/technicals/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 50-Day SMA}}}\uc2  ($0.373222) soon.\par \par \uc2 IntelMarkets (INTL): A New Generation Cryptocurrency Trading Platform\par \par \uc2 IntelMarkets (INTL) is a new-generation cryptocurrency that experts have given their thumbs up to compete with Solana and Cardano. The ongoing presale is a testament to better things to come. So far, IntelMarkets has raised $225k. Because of this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum, analysts have tagged IntelMarkets as the next 100x coin in the crypto market.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, IntelMarkets is developing a crypto trading platform where newbies will be able to use AI technology to trade digital currencies. Crypto trading is strongly integrated into AI, making it a perfect contender to the traditional giants in the industry.\par \par \uc2 The platform's goal is to revolutionize the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.futuremarketinsights.com/reports/crypto-trading-platforms-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $36 billion cryptocurrency}}}\uc2  trading platforms market using this AI tool. That is not all. IntelMarkets will also have advanced trading tools like advanced charts, customized indicators, and risk management tools.\par \par \uc2 Other features, such as the availability of numerous asset pairs, 1,000x leverage, and copy trading, make IntelMarkets one project you don't want to write off.\par \par \uc2 Is IntelMarkets a Good Project Like Solana and Cardano?\par \par \uc2 According to the article, IntelMarkets is an AI-based crypto trading platform where investors can trade different digital currencies. Experts are of the opinion that this makes it unique and different from the rest of the other companies.\par \par \uc2 In addition, the cryptocurrency trading market is a vast market. They think that IntelMarkets can assume the lead in no time at all.\par \par \uc2 Discover More About IntelMarkets:\par \par \uc2 Presale:{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://intelmarketspresale.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://intelmarketspresale.com/}}}\par \par \uc2 Buy Presale:{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://buy.intelmarketspresale.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://buy.intelmarketspresale.com/}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/IntelMarketsOfficial"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/IntelMarketsOfficial}}}\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/intel_markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://x.com/intel_markets}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/