\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 9-10 BTC, ETH, SOL, DOGE, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , TRX\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 2,546 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 September 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC Fails To Turn Investor Interest}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin And Ethereum ETFs Continue To Bleed Out}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kamala Harris\u8217\'20\'19 Policy Positions Don\u8217\'20\'19t Mention Crypto Or Bitcoin}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tron (TRX) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) is inching towards the $57,000 mark after registering an almost 4% increase over the past 24 hours. BTC bulls are trying to push the price back inside the range, indicating that markets have rejected the current breakdown. However, BTC\u8217\'20\'19s recent recovery has failed to rekindle investor interest in crypto or crypto startups.\par \par \uc2 According to Graph Foundation director Eva Beylin, growing interest in AI startups could be diverting funds from crypto and crypto startups, suggesting that diminished investor interest despite a growing crypto market seemingly supports this hypothesis. However, the Graph Foundation director theorized that the lack of interest could also be due to a lack of awareness about the latest crypto developments.\par \par \uc2 BTC Fails To Turn Investor Interest\par \par \uc2 Graph Foundation pointed to a significantly larger amount of capital raised by AI firms in fewer funding rounds than by crypto firms to support its theory. Xai, \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s AI firm, reportedly raised $6 billion in a single round. In comparison, data from the Pitchbook report showed crypto firms could only raise $2.7 billion in Q2 of 2024. While this was a 2.5% increase, data also showed the number of such deals declining by 12.5%. The drop in VC interest in crypto comes against a growing crypto market, reinforcing the idea that crypto markets have failed to reignite \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the time being. Another report stated that VCs were preferring to invest in early-stage startups over later-stage ones,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSince the crypto market has historically yielded strong returns for early-stage investors, many VCs continue to prioritize early-stage investments. The relatively low number of initial public offerings (IPOs) may have diminished interest \u8212\'20\'14 at least in the short term \u8212\'20\'14 in growth equity rounds, leading to a greater focus on early-stage opportunities.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin And Ethereum ETFs Continue To Bleed Out\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin (BTC) has registered an impressive recovery that has put it within touching distance of the $57,000 price level, spot Bitcoin ETFs have continued to struggle. Over the past few days, the recent weakness has resulted in outflows totaling a staggering $1.2 billion from US-based spot Bitcoin ETFs. Julien Bittel, the head of Macro Research, stated that he believes BTC\u8217\'20\'19s price action is similar to that of 2019 and could be nearing an inflection point, following which major price movements could be seen.\par \par \uc2 Spot Ethereum ETFs have also registered a negative net flow. Data from Farside Investors shows that spot Ethereum ETFs registered a net outflow of $6 million on September 6. Some ETFs, such as \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ETHA and \uc2 Fidelity\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s FETH, have registered some inflows. However, Grayscale\u8217\'20\'19s ETHE ETF has registered such significant outflows that it has pushed the net flow negative. Several factors are behind the lackluster performance of ETH ETFs.\par \par \uc2 The Ethereum-to-Bitcoin ratio has dropped 50% over the past couple of years, leading many ETH users to migrate to alternatives or switch to Layer-2 solutions. ETH has also become inflationary, and recent updates and features such as Proto-Danksharding have reduced Layer2 transaction fees, further reducing Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s overall revenue.\par \par \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 Policy Positions Don\u8217\'20\'19t Mention Crypto Or Bitcoin\par \par \uc2 Democratic presidential candidate \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  has released a list of proposed policy positions should she win the elections. However, the policy positions did not mention Bitcoin or any other cryptocurrency. The campaign website has a section that talks about supporting American innovation and workers, pledges support for the growth of the AI sector and highlights the importance of fostering cutting-edge technologies in the future.\par \par \uc2 Some market watchers have taken the paragraph as a subtle nod to crypto. However, the Democratic presidential candidate has yet to mention crypto. Crypto analysts eagerly await election results and believe the outcome could significantly impact \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the laws around crypto, and the growth of digital assets.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt is important to realize that the elections will assume paramount importance in shaping the future of digital assets, blockchain solutions, and the overall context of the crypto sphere.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/09/crypto-price-analysis-9-9-btc-eth-sol-ton-dot-wif-tia"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  registered an increase of almost 4% over the past 24 hours, briefly retaking the $57,000 mark before dropping to its current level of $56,900. BTC registered an intra-day high of $58,100 on Monday, but strong upper-level resistance forced the price back to below $58,000. BTC\u8217\'20\'19s Monday bounce came as traditional stocks also registered a strong recovery after taking a drubbing last week. However, despite Monday\u8217\'20\'19s increase, BTC remains 3% lower for September and over 20% lower since March\u8217\'20\'19s record high. According to Greg Cipolaro, the global head of research at \uc2 NYDIG\uc2 , BTC lacks a near-term catalyst to kickstart a strong \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trajectory.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CUnfortunately, potential upcoming near-term catalysts for bitcoin are sparse at the moment.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 As many have pointed out, August and September have historically been weak months for BTC prices. However, October and the fourth quarter, in general, are expected to witness strong price action. BTC\u8217\'20\'19s path to $58,000 and above is currently blocked by strong resistance around the $57,000 level.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/Qz3lGwGV/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 As we can see in the price chart, BTC dipped to a low of $52,622, potentially marking a bottom before lower-level demand pushed it back above $54,000. BTC eventually ended Friday at $54,205, down by 3.54%. However, it recovered over the weekend, registering a marginal increase on Saturday and a 1.25% increase on Sunday to settle just below the $55,000 level at $54,978. BTC reclaimed $55,000 on Monday after surging over 4% and pushing to $57,079. BTC reached a day high of $58,100 as well but fell back to $57,079 thanks to significant resistance at upper levels. The current session sees BTC down marginally as sellers look to drive BTC back below $57,000.\par \par \uc2 Bears are losing momentum at lower levels and cannot sustain the breakdown. Currently, we are witnessing a tough battle between buyers and sellers to claim the $57,000 level. Should sellers win, BTC could drop towards $55,000. If this level is breached, it could drop as low as $52,500. Alternatively, should buyers regain control of the session and push BTC above $57,000, it would indicate sellers are losing grip. In such a scenario, BTC could push toward the 20-day SMA and the $59,000 level.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) has made a slow recovery over the weekend compared to BTC and has failed to reclaim the $2,400 level so far. Buyers must now defend the $2,300 level to ensure the price does not slip back towards $2,100. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment around ETH had been growing steadily and registered a significant jump last week after a failed move to push above the 20-day SMA allowed sellers to drag the price to a low of $2,304 on Wednesday. However, ETH recovered thanks to lower-level demand, eventually registering an increase of 1.01% and settling at $2,451.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/ris2H8AP/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH fell back into \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  territory on Thursday, dropping by 3.34% to slip below $2,400 and settle at $2,369. The price continued to drop on Friday as sellers dragged ETH to a day low of $2,150, with market watchers worried ETH could collapse below $2,000 if the selloff continued. Thankfully, traders bought the dip, pushing ETH from $2,200 to $2,226. This was still a decline of over 6% compared to Thursday. The weekend saw demand pick up, with ETH rising by 221% on Saturday and 1% on Sunday to settle at $2,298. ETH reclaimed the $2,300 price level on Monday, registering an increase of almost 3% to move to $2,360. The current session sees ETH marginally down as buyers and sellers struggle to establish dominance.\par \par \uc2 Sellers will look to drive ETH below $2,300. ETH could tumble to $2,100 or even $2,000 if the price drops below this level. On their part, buyers will defend $2,300 with all their might to prevent another downturn. Should buyers reclaim $2,400, it will signal waning \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum, and we could see a push to $2,500 should bulls maintain momentum.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (SOL) is up almost 5% over the past 24 hours as strong \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum took the altcoin past $130, a level it struggled to overcome. Investor interest in SOL increased over the weekend, prompting the MACD to flip \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as seen in the price chart. SOL, which has been dropping since being rejected from the $160 level during the last week of August, may have hit a bottom on Friday when its price tanked to a low of $120. The $120 support level had been tested several times and held firm each time. This time was no different as demand picked up at $120, allowing buyers to prop SOL back above $125. SOL eventually ended Friday at $125.11, down by 3.38%.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/V9Fx8vHJ/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Demand picked up over the weekend as SOL registered an increase of 2.16% on Saturday to move to $127.81. A 1.84% increase on Sunday allowed SOL to reclaim $130, a level it had struggled to push above. Sellers attempted to drive SOL back to $120 on Monday as it fell to a low of $127. However, buyers countered the selling pressure, allowing SOL to register an increase of 3.81% and move to $135, a level where it faces strong resistance. The current session sees SOL marginally up as buyers and sellers struggle to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Should buyers come out on top, SOL could push above the 20-day SMA and $140, indicating that bulls are gaining the upper hand. However, sellers will look to retake control and push SOL back below $130.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s (DOGE) weekend recovery picked up on Monday as it finally broke above the 20-day SMA and the $0.100 level. DOGE had been struggling to push above the 20-day SMA since dropping below it on August 27, as sellers consistently thwarted every effort by buyers to go above it and reclaim $0.100. After another failed attempt on Thursday, \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment around DOGE picked up on Friday as it registered a drop of almost 7% and fell to $0.092, bringing the $0.090 support into focus.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/BtWkuNrV/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 With demand picking up at lower levels, DOGE recovered over the weekend, registering an increase of 3.36% on Saturday and 0.94% on Sunday to settle at $0.096, still short of reclaiming $0.100. That changed on Monday as DOGE surged almost 8% to break above the 20-day SMA and $0.100 to settle at $0.103. The current session sees DOGE marginally up as buyers look to consolidate and push above the 50-day SMA to $0.110. As we can see in the price chart, the MACD has flipped to \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , indicating that the bulls have the advantage and DOGE\u8217\'20\'19s upward push could continue.\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) \u8217\'20\'19s relief rally has stalled around the $0.54 mark, as it faces strong resistance around $0.55. XRP slipped below $0.55, a key support level, and the 200-day SMA on Thursday when it registered a drop of 2.43%. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment dominated on Friday as XRP fell to an intra-day low of $0.50. However, with demand picking up at this level, buyers could register a recovery of sorts, pushing XRP to $0.52. XRP eventually ended Friday with a drop of 4.40%.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/ucpQ4b2K/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The weekend saw XRP\u8217\'20\'19s relief rally take hold, as it registered a 0.77% increase on Saturday and a 0.88% increase on Sunday to settle at $0.52. The current week started with XRP continuing its push towards $0.55, with an increase of almost 2% to move to $0.53. The current session sees XRP marginally up as buyers look to build momentum for a push above $0.55.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) surged over the weekend as it reclaimed a crucial level, which is a clear indication that bears are losing their grip and bulls are gaining momentum. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  dipped below $0.32 on Tuesday, when it fell to $0.31 after a drop of 5.36. Sellers attempted to drag \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  below $0.30 on Wednesday, but bulls defended the level, eventually gaining the upper hand and pushing the price up by 1.57% to $0.32. However, with sellers having flipped this level, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could not push higher. An attempt to reclaim this level was thwarted once again on Thursday, with buyers only able to push the price up by 0.62%.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/2l24OXQk/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Selling pressure intensified on Friday as sellers drove \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  to a low of $0.30. However, buyers could defend this level thanks to strong demand at lower levels. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  eventually registered a drop of 3.08% to settle at $0.34. The weekend saw \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  make a strong recovery, registering an increase of 3.49% to move to $0.32. The price broke above this level on Sunday after registering an increase of 3.99% to move to $0.33. Buyers attempted to push above the 20-day SMA on Monday but were thwarted thanks to strong selling pressure. Despite this, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  registered an increase of 1.18% and moved to $0.34. The current session sees \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  marginally down as sellers look to push the price back toward $0.32.\par \par \uc2 If successful, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could drop to $0.32. If this level is breached, the price could tumble to $0.30 or lower.\par \par \uc2 Tron (TRX) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Tron (TRX) registered an impressive rally over the weekend. However, its upward push has stalled thanks to the resistance at the $0.155 level. TRX had been trading in a downtrend since August 26 and hit a low of $0.146 as \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment peaked. However, thanks to strong support around $0.145, TRX recovered over the weekend, starting with an increase of 2.55% on Saturday to reclaim $0.150 and move to $0.151. TRX continued to push higher on Sunday, rising by 1.30% and moving to $0.153.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/KyjnxaUf/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The current week began with bulls still in control as TRX registered a marginal increase of 0.57% and moved to $0.154. However, with strong resistance at $0.155, TRX has stalled during the current session and is down by almost 1% as sellers look to drive the price back toward $0.150.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240911ek9a00007\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/9: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,664 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 September 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recovery is likely to fuel buying in select altcoins, signaling that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDkvMDE5MWQ3YWQtMzRiOC03NTcxLThkYjEtYzMzZGRjMGI4Zjdk.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/9: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) has recovered around 1% on Sept. 9 after falling roughly 4.5% last week. Similarly, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is also finding buyers and has risen to about $56,500, after slipping near $52,500 last week.\par \par \uc2 After the initial rise, the onus is on the bulls to maintain the recovery because the weakness in the past few days has resulted in a sharp outflow from the United States-based spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs). \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  data showed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etfs-1-2-billion-outflows-8-days"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $1.2 billion in outflows from the ETFs}}}\uc2  in eight days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191d7ac-9d15-758c-9a6c-2df5d977aabf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/9: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Global Macro Investor head of macro research Julien Bittel believes that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s current price action is similar to that of 2019. If history repeats itself, Bittel anticipates that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/is-crypto-entering-a-bear-market-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could be nearing an inflection point}}}\uc2 , where big price moves may begin.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin rise and maintain above $55,724, signaling that the breakdown was a bear trap? Will that attract buying in altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index is threatening to form a double-top pattern, which will complete on a break and close below 5,119.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191d7ad-499a-7d6a-b8c3-fa695f1ce0cd"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/9: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price below the moving averages on Sept. 6, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. Sellers will try to sink the price to 5,265. Buyers are expected to fiercely defend the 5,265 to 5,119 zone. If the price rebounds off this zone, the index may swing inside a large range between 5,119 and 5,670 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to regain control, they will have to swiftly push the price above the moving averages. The index may then retest the 5,670 resistance. A break above this level will signal the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 US Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The US Dollar Index (DXY) rebounded sharply off the 100.50 level on Sept. 6, indicating that the bulls are aggressively buying the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191d7ae-04c8-75d9-920a-6af895a3c6ec"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/9: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The recovery will strengthen if buyers kick the price above the 20-day exponential moving average (101.73). The index could then climb to the 50-day simple moving average (103.14). Such a move will suggest that the index may remain range-bound between 99.57 and 108 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, the bears will make one more attempt to sink the index below 100.50. If they succeed, the next stop is likely to be the pivotal support at 99.57.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin closed below the crucial $55,724 support on Sept. 6, but the bears could not sustain the breakdown, indicating a lack of selling at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191d7ae-caa1-74ef-8a2b-0f7dff6f46f3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/9: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has recovered to the breakdown level of $55,724, which is likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears. If buyers drive the price above $55,724 and the 20-day EMA ($57,821), it will suggest that the markets have rejected the breakdown. The BTC/USDT pair may climb to the 50-day SMA ($60,608).\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $55,724 or the 20-day EMA and breaks below $52,550, it will signal the start of a new downtrend. The pair may then collapse to $49,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) relief rally is likely to face selling at $2,300, indicating that the bears are trying to flip the level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191d7af-73db-73c0-8904-e10abbc3f868"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/9: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from $2,300, the possibility of a break below $2,111 increases. If that happens, the ETH/USDT pair could tumble to the psychological level of $2,000.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to drive and maintain the price above the 20-day EMA ($2,465) to signal a comeback. The pair could then attempt a rally to the breakdown level of $2,850. A break above this resistance will suggest that the downtrend may be over.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounce off $471 suggests that the bulls are aggressively defending the $495 to $460 zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191d7b0-1587-72bb-afaa-1c604ca424a8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/9: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally is expected to face selling at the moving averages. If the price turns down from the moving averages, the bears will make another attempt to sink the BNB/USDT pair below $460.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the bulls shove the price above the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may swing between $460 and $635 for a while longer. The next trending move is likely to begin above $635 or below $460.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is trying to find support near $116 but the bears continue to sell on relief rallies. That suggests a negative sentiment in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191d7b0-ba00-7918-a801-be9cd36f5e79"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/9: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to sink the price below the $116 support but may run into significant resistance from the buyers. If the price turns up from the current level or $116 and rises above the 20-day EMA ($136), it will suggest that the bulls are buying on dips. The pair could rally toward $160.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price continues lower and breaks below $116. The pair may then slump to $100.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) fell below the $0.54 support on Sept. 6, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191d7b1-894a-722d-bccc-89090e12bf75"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/9: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.55) and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) in the negative territory suggest a likely drop to $0.46. Buyers are expected to fiercely defend the $0.46 to $0.41 zone. That could keep the XRP/USDT pair range-bound between $0.41 and $0.64 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and maintain the price above the 50-day SMA to signal a comeback. The pair may then climb to $0.64. If this resistance is taken out, the pair may ascend to $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-cardano-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) price up this week?}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) remains in a downtrend, but the bulls are trying to form a higher low at $0.09.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191d7b2-461f-7a8e-ac8a-b04982e8f415"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/9: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.10), the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to the downtrend line. This is a formidable hurdle for the bulls to cross, but if they prevail, the pair may start a move to $0.14.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA and breaks below $0.09, it will suggest that the bears remain in charge. The pair may then plummet to $0.08 and later to the support line of the falling wedge pattern.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) has risen back above the breakdown level of $4.72, signaling solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191d7b2-e860-7d73-a648-832a9848b8db"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/9: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The TON/USDT pair is likely to rise to the 20-day EMA ($5.31), an important resistance to watch out for. If the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the sentiment remains negative. A break below $4.44 could start a downtrend toward $3.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the selling pressure is reducing. The pair could rally to the overhead resistance of the 50-day SMA ($6.03). A break above the 50-day SMA will bring the range-bound action into play.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned up from the $0.31 support on Sept. 7, indicating that the bulls are trying to form a double bottom pattern, which will complete on a break and close above $0.40.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191d7b3-8bca-79f0-a9ab-555738593394"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/9: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA ($0.34) and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest that the bears are losing their grip. If buyers drive the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.35), the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to the downtrend line. A break and close above the downtrend line will suggest the start of a new up move.\par \par \uc2 The critical support to watch on the downside is $0.31. If this support cracks, the pair may plunge to $0.27 and subsequently to $0.24.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDkvMDE5MWQ3YWQtMzRiOC03NTcxLThkYjEtYzMzZGRjMGI4Zjdk.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240909ek99000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cardano\par \b \uc2 Why is Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) price up this week?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Biraajmaan Tamuly \par \uc2 661 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 September 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Broader market uptrends and \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 's proposal to partner with Bitcoin Cash are boosting Cardano prices at the start of this week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvZWUyNDI5NjYtNjU2OS00YWFhLTg0ZTEtZDAzY2FiYzMxMWIx.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) price up this week?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) price rallied by 9% over the weekend after The Artificial Superintelligence Alliance (ASI) announced that their native token, FET, has been deployed on the Cardano blockchain.\par \par \uc2 This led to renewed interest in the ecosystem, and other on-chain \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  metrics also witnessed significant activity.\par \par \uc2 SingularityNET, Fetch.ai, Ocenal Protocol\u8217\'20\'19s \u8216\'20\'18ASI\u8217\'20\'19 token launches on Cardano\par \par \uc2 On Sept. 7, the ASI alliance {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/ASI_Alliance/status/1832159161209282850"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  the deployment of its native token, FET, on the Cardano blockchain, emphasizing the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  network\u8217\'20\'19s security speed and low transaction costs as its primary reasons.\par \par \uc2 FET, which will be rebranded as the ASI ticker, is now a native Cardano token (CNT), which offers improved functionality and integration with the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ecosystem.\par \par \uc2 Both \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  and FET rallied collectively after the announcement, wth an 8.39% and 6.85% gain, respectively, since Sept. 7.\par \par \uc2 Ben Goertzel, CEO of SingularityNET, praised Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s infrastructure, explaining that its \u8220\'20\'1Cmathematical elegance\u8221\'20\'1D will play a key role in advancing Artificial General Intelligence.\par \par \uc2 Cardano active addresses hit a 5-month high\par \par \uc2 The announcement created a domino effect for Cardano, as \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  active addresses reached a 5-month high on Sept. 7. Data from Santiment, an analytics platform, highlights that active addresses reached 52,077 on Sept. 7, the highest since March, 2024.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191d6f2-fe2f-7dd4-bf8e-8ba612d0c839"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) price up this week?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano active addresses. Source: Santiment\par \par \uc2 The rise in \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  active addresses occurred before the rally, possibly helping \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  develop a short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, after a period of negative funding, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://velo.xyz/chart"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 funding rate}}}\uc2  turned green over the weekend, which means long bets possibly dominated the price action.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191d6f3-7f55-7132-b6bc-ec1b6bef1d9d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) price up this week?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano open interest, funding rate chart. Source: Velo.xyz\par \par \uc2 However, it is important to note that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  open interest has remained constant over the past month without a significant rise or decline.\par \par \uc2 This may indicate that the price is being dictated by a small group of futures traders, which means if they flip bias, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  can potentially have a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend continuation.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  shares a high correlation index with BTC\par \par \uc2 Another possible reason why \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  rallied over the past few days is its high correlation to Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price. Bitcoin managed to close above $54,000 on the weekly candle, and is currently trading above $55,000.\par \par \uc2 Data {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.blockchaincenter.net/en/crypto-correlation-tool/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 indicates}}}\uc2  Bitcoin and Cardano share a high 90-day rolling correlation index of 0.74. The correlation has risen by more than 10% since the beginning of August.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191d6f6-4bd0-7e22-8cd8-7cb2acf4560b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) price up this week?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano-Bitcoin correlation chart. Source: blockchaincenter.net\par \par \uc2 While BTC\u8217\'20\'19s returns are only 3% over the weekend, it has provided \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  with a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  base to build on from its ASI collaboration news.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price eyes 18% rally to $0.40\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price rallied to as high as $0.35 on Sept. 9. On both the 1-hour and 4-hour charts, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has successfully undergone a break of structure (BOS) of the current \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend.\par \par \uc2 On the 1-hourly chart, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has managed to retain a price position above the 200-day EMA level after a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  double-bottom pattern was formed. However, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  currently faces resistance from the same indicator on the 4-hour chart.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191d70b-5ef3-7d84-9e87-b983125e3152"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) price up this week?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano 1-hour, 4-hour chart, Source: Trading View\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price could potentially retest local highs at $0.40 over the next few days if it\u8217\'20\'19s able to breach the 200-day EMA level on the 4-hour chart as well.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvZWUyNDI5NjYtNjU2OS00YWFhLTg0ZTEtZDAzY2FiYzMxMWIx.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240909ek990008e\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/6: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\u160\'00\'A0\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,686 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 September 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s drop below $54,000 is accelerating losses in major altcoins. When will traders start buying the dips?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDkvMDE5MWM4NWMtMDQ2NS03ZjNmLWIyMjYtZWU2NTA5NzA3NDJk.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/6: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been in a sideways price action pattern for several months, but the bears are trying to seize control. The resolution of the large $55,724 to $73,777 range in favor of the sellers could start a downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Arthur Hayes, former CEO of crypto exchange BitMEX, has projected {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/arthur-hayes-sub-50k-btc-price-bitcoin-risks-trend-shift"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin to fall below $50,000}}}\uc2 . A similar view was offered by veteran trader Peter Brandt, who has a target of $46,000 for Bitcoin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191c84f-2fa6-78ad-a57b-d438ebe0c3f9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/6: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, not everybody shares the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view. Some analysts anticipate the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-september-gains-may-surprise-bears"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 macro factors to surprise the bears}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAlthough September is historically a negative month for BTC, the combination of a Fed [\uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2 ] rate cut and a relatively robust US economy could surprise the bears,\u8221\'20\'1D Tyr Capital chief investment officer Ed Hindi told Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin start a new downtrend, pulling the altcoins lower? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rebound off the $55,724 support on Sept. 4 did not find buyers at higher levels. The bears maintained their selling pressure and pulled the price below $55,724 on Sept. 6.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191c84f-b492-74a0-9744-c3639a3b1d28"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/6: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Minor support exists in the $53,500 to $54,000 range, where buyers will try to arrest the decline. However, if the bears prevail, the BTC/USDT pair could retest the $49,000 support. This is an essential level to keep an eye on because a break below it may start a downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Any rebound off the current level is likely to face strong selling at $55,724 and then at the 20-day exponential moving average ($58,804). Buyers will have to push the price above the 20-day EMA to suggest that the range-bound action may extend for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $2,300 support on Sept. 4, but the bulls could not maintain the higher levels. The bears have pulled the price below $2,300 on Sept. 6.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191c850-781b-7d2e-9c19-afdbea362a2a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/6: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is near the oversold territory, indicating that the bears are in charge. If the price closes below $2,300, the ETH/USDT pair could decline to $2,111 and thereafter to $2,000.\par \par \uc2 The bulls have an uphill task if they want to start a recovery. A break and close above the 20-day EMA ($2,530) will be the first sign of strength. The pair may then ascend to the breakdown level of $2,850.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls held the $495 support in BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) for the past two days, but they could not start a rebound. That increases the risk of a breakdown.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191c851-1544-7de7-b723-312b80afdca4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/6: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($528) and the RSI in the negative zone suggest that the bears have the upper hand. A break and close below the $495 support could sink the BNB/USDT pair to $460.\par \par \uc2 The bulls are expected to defend the $495 to $460 zone, but the recovery is likely to face selling at the moving averages. Buyers will have to clear the 50-day simple moving average ($543) to suggest that the range-bound action remains intact.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to prevent Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) from falling to the crucial support at $116, but the bears have kept up the pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191c851-c0ac-744f-9ba7-7a89ae0bceff"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/6: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($139) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory suggest that the bears have the upper hand. Sellers will try to sink the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair to the crucial support at $116. Buyers will have to defend this level with all their might because a break below $116 may drag the pair to $100.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the selling pressure is weakening. The pair may rally to the 50-day SMA ($152) and later to $164.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.56) on Sept. 4 and plummeted below the $0.54 support on Sept. 6.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191c852-6423-7a34-bc7b-2a65f3cb2e26"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/6: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 This suggests the XRP/USDT pair may slide toward $0.50. That could keep the pair stuck inside the $0.64 to $0.46 range for a while. The bulls are expected to defend the $0.46 level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Any recovery attempt by the bulls is expected to face selling at the moving averages. A break and close above the 50-day SMA ($0.57) will suggest that the bears may be losing their grip. The bulls will gain further strength above $0.64.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $0.09 support on Sept. 4, but the bulls failed to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.10).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191c853-18ff-7e61-add0-268e416f94f2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/6: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position by yanking the price below $0.09. If they can pull it off, it will signal the resumption of the downtrend. The DOGE/USDT pair may dive to $0.08 and later to the support line of the falling wedge pattern.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to push and maintain the price above the downtrend line to signal a comeback. The pair may then climb to $0.14, indicating the start of a potential up move. If this level is crossed, the rally could reach $0.18.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a tough battle between buyers and sellers near the critical support at $4.72.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191c853-b9dd-7b2f-af89-b3cca633a639"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/6: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower and breaks below $4.50, it will signal the completion of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern. That may start a downward move, pulling the TON/USDT pair to $3.50.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rises from the current level, it is likely to reach the 20-day EMA ($5.47). This is an important level to watch out for because if the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA. That may open the doors for a rally to the 50-day SMA ($6.18) and later to $7.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-xrp-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is XRP price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $0.31 support on Sept. 4, indicating that the bulls are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191c854-754d-7064-96c0-86f8c9888cab"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/6: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the long wick on the Sept. 5 candlestick shows that the bears are selling on rallies to the 20-day EMA ($0.34). If bears sink the price below $0.31, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could plunge to $0.27 and later to the crucial support at $0.24.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up from the $0.31 support and rises above the moving averages, it will suggest a short-term bottom formation. The pair could then rally to the downtrend line, where the bears are expected to offer a strong resistance.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the moving averages for the past few days, but the bears have failed to challenge the $19.50 support. This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191c855-1080-7722-b1e4-14146790a0d7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/6: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push the price above the moving averages. If they succeed, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could reach the resistance line of the descending channel pattern. A break and close above the channel will suggest that the downtrend may be over. The pair may climb to $33 and later to $37.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below $19.50. That may sink the pair to $17.29 and eventually to the channel\u8217\'20\'19s support line.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the 20-day EMA ($0.000014) and the horizontal support at $0.000013.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191c855-a579-73bb-9db2-15426593f997"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/6: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The tight-range trading signals a possible range expansion in the next few days. If the price breaks above the moving averages, the likelihood of a rally to $0.000020 increases. There is a minor resistance at $0.000016, but it is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price plummets below $0.000013, it will suggest the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The SHIB/USDT pair may plummet to $0.000011 and subsequently to $0.000010.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDkvMDE5MWM4NWMtMDQ2NS03ZjNmLWIyMjYtZWU2NTA5NzA3NDJk.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240906ek96000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
