\par\par \b \uc2 Staking Good or Bad?\b0\par\par\uc2 Adrian Barkley \par \uc2 1,065 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 September 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 What is Crypto Staking?}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Benefits of Staking Crypto}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Risks of Staking Crypto}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Staking Plans on OkayCoin}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 How to Sign Up for Staking on OkayCoin}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://okbtc.org/best-crypto-staking-platforms-2024/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto staking}}}\uc2  has massively grown as one of the innovative ways to earn passive income in the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  space. It also provides investors with an option to validate blockchain transactions alongside traditional mining while {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://okaycoin.com/?s=oc6153"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 earning rewards}}}\uc2  on stake. Like any other investment strategy, however, staking comes with its pros and cons. In this article, we are going to discuss whether staking crypto is good or bad.\par \par \uc2 What is Crypto Staking?\par \par \uc2 Crypto-staking refers to a process or act of locking a certain amount of cryptocurrency in a blockchain network through some sort of consensus, basically Proof of Stake or the like. It is by staking your crypto that you get to take part in transaction validation on that network. You get some kind of reward in return, which is usually distributed periodically.\par \par \uc2 The Benefits of Staking Crypto\par \par \uc2 Staking has a number of potential advantages that lend themselves to making it quite attractive to the many crypto investors out there, including:\par \par \uc2 Earn Passive Income: Perhaps one of the largest benefits associated with staking is, of course, the ability to earn passive income. You stand to earn regular rewards for staking.\par \par \uc2 Network Security: With staking, it contributes to the security of the blockchain network through transaction validation. The process forms an integral part of maintaining network integrity and stability, which leads to benefits accruing to all participants in the network.\par \par \uc2 Low Entry Barriers: Most staking platforms, like those on OkayCoin, have normally lower minimums required for entrance and thus are more inclusive of even small-time investors who could also receive returns.\par \par \uc2 Variety of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://okaycoin.com/plans/?s=oc6153"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 staking options}}}\uc2  : OkayCoin has different staking platforms with changing rewards and risk profiles. They have different investment strategies.\par \par \uc2 Daily Rewards: Depending on the many platforms, it pays rewards daily and, if reinvested, will compound returns over time.\par \par \uc2 Risks of Staking Crypto\par \par \uc2 While staking has some advantages, there is also the possibility to consider some potential risks as mentioned below.\par \par \uc2 Market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 : Your cryptocurrency will fluctuate in value by large margins. If the value of your staked assets falls, your reward earned may or may not cover the fall in value.\par \par \uc2 Lock-up periods: Some of the staking systems will require one to lock up his assets for a certain period. Within that time, it would not be possible even to trade his or her staked crypto, and that might be a drawback if market conditions change.\par \par \uc2 Network Risks: The security and stability of the blockchain network you stake on are important. Your staked assets could be in jeopardy when there are certain problems in the network, such as a security breach or a hard fork.\par \par \uc2 Staking Plans on OkayCoin\par \par \uc2 OkayCoin offers several different staking systems, catering to the large variety of investors in the cryptocurrency space. Some of the most popular options include the following:\par \par \uc2 Ethereum: As one of the largest Proof of Stake networks currently in operation, Ethereum can provide relatively good rewards when considering staking. ETH staked with OkayCoin contributes to security for the transition into Ethereum 2.0.\par \par \uc2 Polygon: it is a very fast network with low transaction fees. Hence, staking on OkayCoin is a go-to choice for many investors looking to gain daily rewards from MATIC.\par \par \uc2 Tron\uc2 : one such unique staking opportunity that has been focused on decentralized content creation. A stake of TRX on the blockchain using the service provided by OkayCoin contributes to the growth of this network while you earn regular rewards from it.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot: This is a multi-chain by Polkadot that offers very high staking rewards.\par \par \uc2 Celestia: This is one of the newer options to stake through OkayCoin and focuses on solving blockchains scaling.\par \par \uc2 Aptos: designs scalability and ease of use. APT staking on OkayCoin rewards daily but also contributes to the security and efficiency of network operations.\par \par \uc2 Sui: Sui provides high-performance blockchain surroundings, especially in DeFi. Staking SUI through OkayCoin, users may earn rewards while contributing to the network's growth.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche: Avalanche is renowned for fast and inexpensive transactions. OkayCoin could let \uc2 AVAX\uc2  staking yield rewards and contribute to network stability in return.\par \par \uc2 Cardano: Scientific work on the Cardano blockchain makes this project popular for staking. Staking \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  on OkayCoin yields stable rewards as a contribution to further network projects.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2 : This is indeed a very promising staking candidate, given that it features high throughput and low fees.\par \par \uc2 How to Sign Up for Staking on OkayCoin\par \par \uc2 Getting started with staking on the OkayCoin exchange is pretty easy to do:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://okaycoin.com/signup/?s=oc6153"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Sign-up}}}\uc2  : Go to the website of OkayCoin and create an account on the exchange using your e-mail address. Complete the verification steps necessary to secure your account.\par \par \uc2 Deposit Crypto: Transfer the crypto assets that need to be staked into the OkayCoin wallet. Supported assets include Ethereum, Polygon, Cardano, and many more.\par \par \uc2 Choose a Staking Pool: Browse through all the stakings available on OkayCoin and choose the pool most suitable for your investment goals. To be specific, most of the information needed for decision-making involves the rate of staking yield, lock-up period, and daily reward amount.\par \par \uc2 Start Staking: Your crypto gets locked in the selected staking pool. You can track your rewards via the OkayCoin dashboard; you might want to reinvest them to compound your rewards.\par \par \uc2 Referral Program\par \par \uc2 Finally, don't let the referral program of OkayCoin pass you by. You will invite friends to join the platform and stake on it. You get additional rewards, which means boosting returns even higher.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 Staking crypto is one of the most rewarding passive income strategies among all, especially for those who support blockchain networks. By being aware of how staking works, making a careful selection of the staking pool you are in, and basically taking full advantage of OkayCoin's intuitive interface, you'd be assured of maximum rewards with the least risks. Finally, staking may turn to be good or bad, considering some investment goals and levels of market risk one would be willing to bear.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240905ek940000k\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/4: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,639 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 September 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins are at risk of further downside as bears try to strengthen their stranglehold on the market.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDkvMDE5MWJkZWQtNDgyMi03ZWFhLWJmMjMtYTc5MDUxMzcxY2Iy.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/4: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Weakness in the United States {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-targets-50k-nvidia-crash-shakes-nikkei-gold"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 equity markets pulled the cryptocurrency markets lower}}}\uc2  on Sept. 3. The selling in the crypto markets continued on Sept. 4, but a minor positive is that lower levels are attracting buyers. Trading firm QCP Capital said to its Telegram channel subscribers that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) may enter a period of high \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Many analysts believe the expected interest rate cut by the \uc2 US Federal Reserve\uc2  on Sept. 18 will be positive for risk assets. However, \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2  analysts have a different view, as they anticipate {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/federal-reserve-rate-cut-bearish-bitcoin-price-bitfinex-analysts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin to plunge between 15% and 20%}}}\uc2  following the rate cuts. In a Sept. 2 note, they said that Bitcoin could bottom anywhere between $40,000 and $50,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191bde5-87b7-7a07-ac79-0fb471b09ed8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/4: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s risk of breaking below its long range is putting pressure on altcoins, which have continued to weaken. That pulled the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-correction-crypto-market-drop-54k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 total crypto market capitalization below $2 trillion}}}\uc2 , according to CoinMarketCap data.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin break below the range, triggering further selling in altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down from the 20-day exponential moving average ($59,655) on Sept. 3 and fell to the $55,724 support on Sept. 4.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191bde6-24f8-7f2e-82b9-4d01ad6377fb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/4: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are expected to defend the $55,724 level with all their might because if the support gives way, the BTC/USDT pair may tumble to $49,000. This level may attract solid buying by the bulls, but the bears will try to halt the relief rally at $55,724. Below $49,000, the next stop could be $42,000.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price rises from the current level and breaks above the 50-day simple moving average ($61,712). The pair could then climb to $65,000 and later to the crucial resistance at $70,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether has been swinging between $2,300 and $2,850 for a few days, suggesting buying on dips and selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191bde6-d33c-7c75-b9e8-fed52189375c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/4: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price continues higher from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA ($2,577), it will signal that the consolidation may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the relief rally turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative, and traders are selling on every minor rise. That will increase the likelihood of a break below $2,300. If that happens, the ETH/USDT pair could plummet to $2,111 and eventually to the psychological level of $2,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounce off the $495 support reached the 20-day EMA ($535) on Sept. 3, but the bulls could not overcome this barrier.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191bde7-871a-7cf4-afbb-2409a7e548a1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/4: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the $495 level cracks, the BNB/USDT pair could dive to the $460 support. This is an essential level for the bulls to protect because a break below it may intensify selling and pull the pair to $400.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to push and maintain the price above the moving averages to suggest that the range-bound action may continue for a while longer. The next leg of the up move is expected to begin on a close above $635.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has reached close to the support of the Large $116 to $210 range, where buyers are likely to step in.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191bde8-38f6-70d7-af09-1d72691a9659"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/4: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($141), which is the first sign of strength. The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could then rise to the 50-day SMA ($153). A break and close above this resistance will suggest that the pair may remain inside the range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to defend the moving averages and attempt to pull the price below $116. If they succeed, it will signal the start of a new down move to $100.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) below the $0.54 support on Sept. 4, but the long tail on the candlestick shows solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191bde8-e78b-7d5e-a7a2-ff2a9eafc287"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/4: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Any relief rally is likely to face stiff resistance at the moving averages. Suppose the price turns down from the moving averages, the possibility of a break and close below $0.54 increases. The XRP/USDT pair could then plunge toward $0.49.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if buyers propel the price above the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the $0.54 to $0.64 range for a while. A break above $0.64 will open the gates for a possible rally to $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls attempted to push Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.10) on Sept. 3, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191bde9-a3b7-7f36-97fa-bcfa0b0bf192"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/4: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to pull the price below $0.09, but the bulls are likely to aggressively defend the level. If the price rises from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that selling dries up at lower levels. The DOGE/USDT pair could then climb to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price continues lower and breaks below $0.09, the decline could extend to $0.08 and subsequently to the support line of the falling wedge pattern.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) has formed a large head-and-shoulders pattern, which will complete on a close below $4.72.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191bdea-4f68-74b9-81ca-b0342251993f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/4: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears have pulled the price below $4.72 but are likely to find buyers at lower levels. If the bears prevail and the price closes below $4.72, it will signal the start of a new downtrend. The next support on the downside is at $3.50.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price fails to close below $4.72, it will signal that bulls are active at lower levels. The bulls will have to push and maintain the TON/USDT pair above the 50-day SMA ($6.27) to signal a comeback.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears at the $0.31 support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191bdeb-636e-7763-b432-7b469efb640a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/4: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory indicate that the bears have the upper hand. If the price maintains below $0.31, the selling could pick up, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may plunge to $0.27 and later to $0.24.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up from $0.31, the recovery is likely to face resistance at the moving averages. Buyers will have to kick and maintain the price above the downtrend line to suggest the start of a new up move.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been gradually sliding toward the horizontal support at $19.50, indicating that the bears have maintained their pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191bdec-12ce-7c3f-b213-9dd939d6ff0a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/4: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers will try to strengthen their position by pulling the price below $19.50. If they succeed, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could slump to $17.29 and later to the support line of the descending channel pattern.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price bounces off $19.50, it will suggest that the bulls are trying to defend the level. Buyers will have to push and sustain the price above the channel to indicate a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) once again turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.000014) on Sept. 3, indicating that the bears remain in command.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-09/0191bdec-b74b-71c5-94ee-556b52713e0c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 9/4: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers are trying to pull and maintain the price below the immediate support at $0.000013. If they manage to do that, the SHIB/USDT pair is likely to slide to the Aug. 5 intraday low of $0.000011 and thereafter to the psychological support at $0.000010.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to prevent the downside, they will have to quickly drive the price above the moving averages. If they do that, the pair is likely to rally to the breakdown level of $0.000020.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDkvMDE5MWJkZWQtNDgyMi03ZWFhLWJmMjMtYTc5MDUxMzcxY2Iy.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240904ek94000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
