, respectively.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe continue to expect the asset class to become increasingly sensitive to interest rate expectations as the Fed gets closer to a pivot,\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  noted in its latest report.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 US Commerce Department\uc2  reported on Aug. 30 that the Personal Consumption Expenditures (PCE) price index surged 0.2% on the month and was also up 2.5% from the same period last year.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s Chang hard fork goes live as it shifts to decentralized governance\par \par \uc2 The Cardano blockchain has successfully undergone its highly anticipated hard fork, upgrading voting mechanisms and smart contracts and heralding a new era of decentralized governance.\par \par \uc2 On Sept. 1, at 21:44 UTC at block 10764778, the layer-1 proof-of-stake blockchain Cardano underwent the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/what-is-the-cardano-chang-hard-fork"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chang upgrade}}}\uc2  which ushered in what the project calls the \u8220\'20\'1CConway ledger era.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 One small step for Cardano; One giant leap for the industry {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/ENXV41XdhZ"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/ENXV41XdhZ}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Charles Hoskinson (@IOHK_Charles) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/IOHK_Charles/status/1830292210706948531?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 September 1, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 One of the key changes is transforming Cardano governance enabling any {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  holder to submit or participate in the voting process for governance actions as part of the project\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-voltaire-era-june-hard-fork"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Voltaire}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D upgrade phase.\par \par \uc2 In a post on X on Sept. 2, the Cardano Foundation {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Cardano_CF/status/1830411972460093781"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2  :\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CToday\u8217\'20\'19s Chang hard fork marks a major milestone for the Cardano blockchain, ecosystem, and community\u8211\'20\'13\u8211\'20\'13fulfilling the promise of a truly self-governing, decentralized network.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Judge suspends social media platform X\par \par \uc2 On Aug. 30, Brazilian Supreme Court Justice \uc2 Alexandre de Moraes{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/brazil-supreme-court-bans-twitter-elon-musk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ordered social media platform X to be suspended}}}\uc2  in the country after its owner, \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 , refused to name a legal representative for the firm.\par \par \uc2 According to an Associated Press report, Moraes followed through with his intention to suspend the platform after X\u8217\'20\'19s Global Government Affairs team said it \u8220\'20\'1Cwould not comply with [de Moraes\u8217\'20\'19] illegal orders to censor political opponents.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/brazil-supreme-court-threatens-suspend-x"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Musk has openly criticized Moraes}}}\uc2 , calling him \u8220\'20\'1Cevil\u8221\'20\'1D and a \u8220\'20\'1Cdictator\u8221\'20\'1D for his alleged \u8220\'20\'1Cillegal political censorship.\u8221\'20\'1D Moraes claims he was investigating the social media platform for allowing the spread of misinformation related to former President \uc2 Jair Bolsonaro\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Shortly after the suspension was announced, Brazilian users still reported they could access the social media platform.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvNzhkNzg3NjEtM2JkMi00NTY5LTk2YTctNjJhOT