ger era.\u8221\'20\'1D \u8216\'20\'18\par \par \uc2 One small step for Cardano; One giant leap for the industry {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/ENXV41XdhZ"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/ENXV41XdhZ}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Charles Hoskinson (@IOHK_Charles) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/IOHK_Charles/status/1830292210706948531?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 September 1, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 One of the key changes is transforming Cardano governance enabling any {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  holder to submit or participate in the voting process for governance actions as part of the project\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-voltaire-era-june-hard-fork"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Voltaire}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D upgrade phase.\par \par \uc2 In a post on X on Sept. 2, the Cardano Foundation {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Cardano_CF/status/1830411972460093781"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2  :\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CToday's Chang hard fork marks a major milestone for the Cardano blockchain, ecosystem, and community\u8211\'20\'13\u8211\'20\'13fulfilling the promise of a truly self-governing, decentralized network.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Judge suspends social media platform X\par \par \uc2 On Aug. 30, Brazilian Supreme Court Justice \uc2 Alexandre de Moraes{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/brazil-supreme-court-bans-twitter-elon-musk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ordered social media platform X to be suspended}}}\uc2  in the country after its owner, \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 , refused to name a legal representative for the firm.\par \par \uc2 According to an Associated Press report, Moraes followed through with his intention to suspend the platform after X\u8217\'20\'19s Global Government Affairs team said it \u8220\'20\'1Cwould not comply with [de Moraes\u8217\'20\'19] illegal orders to censor political opponents.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/brazil-supreme-court-threatens-suspend-x"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Musk has openly criticized Moraes}}}\uc2 , calling him \u8220\'20\'1Cevil\u8221\'20\'1D and a \u8220\'20\'1Cdictator\u8221\'20\'1D for his alleged \u8220\'20\'1Cillegal political censorship.\u8221\'20\'1D Moraes claims he was investigating the social media platform for allowing the spread of misinformation related to former President \uc2 Jair Bolsonaro\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Shortly after the suspension was announced, Brazilian users still reported they could access the social media platform.\par \par \uc2 Mt. Gox\uc2  and \uc2 US government\uc2  could introduce $14 billion Bitcoin selling pressure\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s sluggish momentum could carry over into September as \uc2 Mt. Gox\uc2  and the \uc2 United States government\uc2  could introduce nearly $15 billion worth of additional selling pressure.\par \par \uc2 Over $14.8 billion worth of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) could soon flood the market and put more downward pressure on price.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/breaking-us-government-moves-10-000-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 US government holds}}}\uc2  over 203,000 Bitcoin worth $12.1 billion, while defunct crypto exchange {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/mt-gox-creditors-hold-41-percent-bitcoin-distribution"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Mt. Gox is set to distribute}}}\uc2  another 46,000 Bitcoin worth over $2.7 billion.\par \par \uc2 Mt. Gox\uc2  is set to distribute the $2.7 billion before the end of 2024 on Kraken, but the repayments are unlikely to cause a significant market impact, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://research.kaiko.com/insights/moving-markets-liquidity-and-large-sell-orders"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according}}}\uc2  to an Aug. 29 report by crypto analytics provider Kaiko:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CKraken has handled BTC ETF flows with just a minor increase in slippage at the US market close. Its liquidity profile suggests that any additional selling pressure from the \uc2 Mt. Gox\uc2  repayments is unlikely to cause structural issues that could affect the broader market.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Mt. Gox\uc2  creditors have been waiting to receive over $9.4 billion worth of Bitcoin for the past 10 years, which has since appreciated over 8,500% in value, meaning that numerous investors will likely look to sell.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvNzhkNzg3NjEtM2JkMi00NTY5LTk2YTctNjJhOTdmMGExYjBh.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240902ek9200005\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
