. The \uc2 RSI\uc2  is balanced at 53.63, hinting neither side is winning yet. The next resistance is at $0.66, about a ten percent rise from its current range, and support lies at $0.52. If bulls gain strength, XRP could reach $0.73, marking a potential lift of over 20%. For now, the price movements suggest uncertainty in market direction.\par \par \uc2 Pyth Network Struggles: Bears Dominate, Bulls Nowhere to Be Seen\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/news-in-crypto/crypto-intelligence:pyth-networks-pull-oracle-launches-on-solana"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pyth Network}}}\uc2  (PYTH) cryptocurrency is struggling, with its current price hovering between $0.28 and $0.34. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trends dominate, and recent price drops of over 16% in a week and 23% in a month show the weakness of bulls. The closest resistance level stands at $0.37 while strong support is found at $0.25. For a potential growth scenario, breaking past $0.37 could push PYTH towards $0.43, representing a rise of about 20%. However, the current \uc2 RSI\uc2  and MACD indicators reflect ongoing \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pressure, suggesting more challenges ahead before any significant rebound.\par \par \uc2 Ondo (ONDO) Struggles as Bears Dominate: What\u8217\'20\'19s Next for the Crypto?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/cardano-and-ondo-trade-red-raboo-continues-to-surge-defying-current-market-dip"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ondo}}}\uc2  (ONDO) is battling between $0.66 and $0.81, showing a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend with a recent one-week drop of almost 19% and a month-long fall of nearly 32%. The cryptocurrency is struggling to break past its immediate resistance at $0.88. Its indicators suggest more downward pressure, with an RSI of around 42 and a Stochastic reading below 20. However, ONDO still holds potential, sitting above its 100-day moving average of $0.66. If bulls regain strength, it could target the second resistance at $1.03, marking an approximate 56% rise from its lower range. Keep an eye on these levels for potential rebounds or further declines.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Struggles to Stay Afloat\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is currently in the price range of $0.34 to $0.42. The recent downward trend shows that the bears may still have some control. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is below its nearest resistance level of $0.45 and above its support level of $0.30. With the \uc2 RSI\uc2  at nearly 47, the coin is neither oversold nor overbought. If the bulls gain strength and break through $0.45, Cardano could potentially reach the $0.52 mark, translating to roughly a 20% to 30% increase. However, if the bears push it down, it could fall to around $0.30, which would be a drop of about 15% from its current lower range.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 With the 2024 bull run beginning, a fair price of $100 for under $1 cryptos seems achievable. The focus is on XLM, XRP, DOGE, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and VET. Each has shown potential for significant growth. XLM offers faster transactions. XRP is gaining institutional backing. DOGE has strong community support. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is noted for its innovative blockchain. VET is trusted for supply chain solutions. Investing in these cryptos could yield substantial returns.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240901ek8v00004\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,685 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 August 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls are finding it difficult to sustain the price above $60,000, increasing the possibility of a break below $55,724.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvMDE5MWE0MzItODNhOC03MmEyLWEwNTctOTU1MjA5OWIxOTI0.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading in the lower half of its $55,724 to $73,777 range for the past few days, but instead of panicking, the whales and the shark holders have used this {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whale-buys-1k-btc-binance-selling-sub-58k-low"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 opportunity to accumulate more Bitcoin}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COver the past month, wallets with 10-10K BTC have collectively accumulated 133.3K more coins while smaller traders continue to impatiently drop their holdings to them,\u8221\'20\'1D market intelligence platform Santiment said in part of a post on X.\par \par \uc2 Another positive sign for the bulls is that Bitcoin stored on exchanges continues to dwindle. According to CryptoQuant data, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-exchange-reserves-low-price-retest-60k-bullish-analysts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin reserves on exchanges have plunged by 12.9%}}}\uc2  since the start of the year. This suggests that investors are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the long term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/0191a432-8f25-7036-9d45-a4d5745a7f13"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 An overhang on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price in the coming months could be caused by the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-sell-pressure-september-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 selling by the United States government}}}\uc2 , which holds more than 203,000 Bitcoin. Although \uc2 Mt. Gox\uc2  creditors, who have received the repayments, have not rushed to book profits, any change in their behavior could weaken sentiment.\par \par \uc2 Will the Bitcoin bulls succeed in pushing the price above $60,000? Could the altcoins follow higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down from the 20-day exponential moving average ($60,497) on Aug. 29, indicating that bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/0191a433-3683-7553-8c61-a2f71f692fb8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The immediate support on the downside is $58,000. If the price turns up from the current level, the bulls will make one more attempt to clear the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair is likely to rally to $65,000. The 50-day simple moving average ($62,020) may act as a resistance, but it is expected to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price continues lower and breaks below $58,000, it will signal that the bears remain in charge. That will increase the risk of a fall below $55,724. If this support cracks, the pair may plummet to $49,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) attempted to bounce off $2,392 met with selling near the 20-day EMA ($2,639), as seen from the long wick on the Nov. 29 candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/0191a433-f29d-747c-883b-2c73ba4637f6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The down sloping 20-day EMA and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory indicate that the bears are in control. The ETH/USDT pair may slump to $2,300, which is an important level to watch out for. If the price rebounds off $2,300 with strength, it will suggest that the pair may rise to $2,850 and remain stuck between these two levels for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, a break and close below $2,300 will signal the resumption of the downtrend. The pair could then nosedive to $2,111.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) back above the moving averages in the past two days but the bears did not relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/0191a437-90eb-7cf8-9c32-f6d85ec8c458"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower and breaks below $520, it will suggest that the bears have seized control in the near term. The BNB/USDT pair could drop to $495 and thereafter to the critical support at $460.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up and breaks above the moving averages, it will suggest advantage to the bulls. The pair may rally to $600, which is likely to behave as a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been oscillating inside a large range between $116 and $210 for several months.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/0191a438-4b45-771c-827c-454dc874fd96"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price had been stuck between $136 and $164 for the past few days, but the support gave way on Aug. 30. There is minor support at $129, but if this level also fails to hold, the next stop is likely to be $116.\par \par \uc2 The bulls are expected to guard the $116 level with all their might. A strong bounce off this support will signal continuation of the range-bound action, but if the $116 level breaks down, the pair may plunge to $100.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers failed to push XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) back above the 20-day EMA ($0.58) on Aug. 28, indicating selling on minor rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/0191a438-ef03-764b-9d29-d1c42b8496ff"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position further by pulling the price below the $0.54 support. If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair may slide toward $0.46. The pair may extend its stay inside the $0.46 to $0.64 range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $0.54 and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the bulls are fiercely defending the level. The pair may then climb to $0.64. Buyers will have to clear this hurdle to start a move to $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a falling wedge pattern for the past several months, indicating selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/0191a439-929b-7372-8cea-f7353337711a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.10) has started to turn down gradually, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the negative zone, signaling that the bears have a slight advantage. If the price turns down and breaks below $0.09, it will signal the resumption of the downtrend. The pair may then plunge to the support line.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns up and breaks above the downtrend line. The pair may then start a relief rally to $0.14.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Toncoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) Aug. 28 candlestick shows that the bears are aggressively defending the 20-day EMA ($6.01).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/0191a43a-3c5c-7f34-af40-f9f7dd1c062f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers will try to pull the price to the critical support at $4.72. This is an essential level for the bulls to defend because a break and close below it will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up sharply from $4.72 and rises above the moving averages, it will suggest that the TON/USDT pair may continue to trade inside the large range for some more time. A break above $7 will favor the bulls in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-cardano-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Cardano price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to arrest Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) decline at the uptrend line but are struggling to push the price above the moving averages. This suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/0191a43a-f319-765c-967b-347d364ec799"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.36) has started to turn down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just below the midpoint, signaling that the bears have the upper hand. If the price breaks below the uptrend line, the bears will try to pull the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair to $0.31 and subsequently to $0.28.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the downside, they will have to shove the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.38). If they do that, the pair may climb to the downtrend line. Buyers will have to overcome this barrier to suggest that the downtrend may be over.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day SMA ($24.72) for the past two days, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/0191a43b-b49c-7f6b-a9d0-41a76845d0d1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($23.62) has started to turn down and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just below the midpoint, indicating a minor advantage for the bears. If the price continues lower, it is likely to find support near $19.50.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls push the price above the 50-day SMA, it will suggest the formation of a higher low. That will increase the likelihood of a rally above the descending channel. The AVAX/USDT pair may then rally to $33.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 The weak bounce off the uptrend line in Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) shows a lack of aggressive buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/0191a43c-7f90-7c7b-906e-95b4b4f0b49c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to take advantage of the situation and sink the price below the uptrend line. If that happens, the SHIB/USDT pair could drop to $0.000012. This is a crucial level for the bulls to defend because a break below it may pull the price to $0.000010.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to drive and maintain the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.000015) to suggest that the selling pressure is reducing. The SHIB/USDT pair may then climb to the breakdown level of $0.000020.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvMDE5MWE0MzItODNhOC03MmEyLWEwNTctOTU1MjA5OWIxOTI0.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240830ek8u000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
