\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 8-26 BTC, ETH, SOL, DOGE, DOT, XRP, SEI\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 2,367 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 August 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Sitting Above $64,000}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto Markets Surge In 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Telegram CEO Pavel Durov\u8217\'20\'19s Arrest Impacts Toncoin (TON)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Binance Faces More Legal Woes}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-11"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEI Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) saw a significant jump over the weekend, moving above $64,000. The world\u8217\'20\'19s largest cryptocurrency shed its recent sluggish price movement due to two positive developments.\par \par \uc2 The first catalyst was Federal Reserve Chairman \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  confirming a monetary easing cycle beginning next month. The second catalyst was crypto-friendly RFK Jr. throwing his weight behind Trump in the presidential elections after suspending his own campaign.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Sitting Above $64,000\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC), already up around 3% on the news of the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  confirming a monetary easing cycle, was buoyed further following the news of RFK Jr. announcing his support for Trump. Other major cryptocurrencies, including Solana (SOL), Ethereum (ETH), and several others, also recorded notable gains. However, despite RFK Jr.\u8217\'20\'19s endorsement, the presidential race is still a 50/50 contest. However, the removal of Kennedy from the so-called battleground states presents Trump with a significant advantage.\par \par \uc2 Trump and Kennedy have promised a crypto-friendly outlook that is much friendlier than what has been witnessed under the Biden administration. Trump has even suggested the US create a Bitcoin strategic reserve. He also promised the immediate firing of \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  Chief \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2  if elected to office. However, Democrats have also taken notice, with the Harris campaign stating that her administration would be supportive of crypto.\par \par \uc2 Crypto Markets Surge In 2024\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency markets registered a staggering growth of $623 billion since the beginning of 2024, with the current market cap at a staggering $2.25 trillion. BTC, the largest and most popular cryptocurrency in the market, has seen its value soar over $20,000 since the beginning of the year. Ethereum (ETH) also saw a $500 jump in value, while Tether (USDT) maintained its dominance in the stablecoin market, with its market cap climbing from $91 billion to over $117 billion.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Ripple (XRP) has dropped one position to seventh, and Dogecoin (DOGE) has moved to eighth. This position was previously occupied by Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ). Toncoin (TON) and Tron (TRX) take the last remaining spots in the top ten major cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 Telegram CEO Pavel Durov\u8217\'20\'19s Arrest Impacts Toncoin (TON)\par \par \uc2 The arrest of Telegram CEO Pavel Durov in France significantly impacted Toncoin (TON), which registered an 18% drop. French authorities linked Durov to crimes facilitated via Telegram and the platform\u8217\'20\'19s lack of moderation. As a result, TON slipped below $5.55. Bitcoin (NOT) also tanked over 20% following the news of Durov\u8217\'20\'19s arrest. Durov was detained at France\u8217\'20\'19s Bourget airport after he arrived from Azerbaijan, with the arrest executed under a warrant issued by OFIM.\par \par \uc2 The arrest is part of an ongoing investigation into Telegram\u8217\'20\'19s alleged lack of moderation, which has allowed criminals and criminal activities onto the platform. Officials have claimed Telegram\u8217\'20\'19s lack of oversight has enabled these illicit activities and raised significant concerns about Telegram\u8217\'20\'19s role in facilitating them.\par \par \uc2 Binance\uc2  Faces More Legal Woes\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, \uc2 Binance\uc2  has continued to face legal troubles. Multiple individuals filed a class action lawsuit against the exchange and its founder, \uc2 Changpeng Zhao\uc2 , for allegedly enabling money laundering. Zhao, who remains in custody, was recently moved to a halfway house, a move that precludes his imminent release.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/crypto-price-analysis-8-23-btc-eth-sol-doge-ada-dot-wif"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  broke above the overhead resistance on Friday as it climbed above $64,000, buoyed by market developments. These include the Federal Reserve Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  announcing an easing of monetary policy next month and RFK Jr. throwing his weight behind Donald Trump for the presidential elections, handing the Republican candidate a significant advantage. BTC had been gathering \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum last week, as demonstrated in the price chart, which shows a significant jump to a day high of $61,401 on Tuesday. While sellers thwarted this move above $60,000, the overall sentiment around BTC remained \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/CMtDXAIn/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC broke above the 20-day SMA on Wednesday with an increase of 3.50%, settling at $61,134, but dropped by 1.16% on Thursday as the 50-day SMA acted as a resistance level, preventing the price from moving higher. However, with market factors coming into play, BTC surged by almost 6% on Friday, pushing above the 50 and 200-day SMAs and settling at $64,032. The price consolidated over the weekend, registering a marginal increase on Saturday and a marginal decrease on Sunday to settle at $64,085. Both buyers and sellers attempted to take control of the markets on Sunday but were unable to do so.\par \par \uc2 The current session sees BTC down by 0.49% as sellers took to push the price back below the 200-day SMA. Buyers must keep BTC above the 200-day SMA if they want to attempt a move to $65,000 or above. If buyers regain momentum and break above $65,000, BTC could rally towards $70,000. However, should sellers push BTC below the 200-day SMA, it could drop back to the $60,000 price level. The MACD is currently \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , indicating that buyers have an advantage.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) finally broke above the 20-day SMA and $2,700 on Friday as markets registered a sharp uptick. As we can see in the price chart, ETH was relatively muted over the past week and was struggling to break above the 20-day SMA as sellers actively defended the level. ETH registered a 2.21% increase on Wednesday, rising to $2,631. However, buyers lost steam as before, and ETH registered a marginal drop on Thursday. Sentiment changed on Friday as buyers took control, pushing ETH above the 20-day SMA. As a result, ETH registered an increase of 5.36%, breaking past the $2,700 resistance level and settling at $2,764.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/x9LJCyVs/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers attempted a move towards the crucial $2,850 resistance on Saturday, with ETH reaching a high of $2,820. However, ETH lost steam as sellers pushed the price back down to $2,769. Despite the selling pressure, ETH registered a marginal increase. Buyers pushed ETH down by 0.75% on Saturday as they attempted to drive the price back below $2,700. Despite this, ETH remained above $2,700 and ended Sunday at $2,749. The current session sees ETH marginally down as buyers and sellers struggle for control. Buyers will attempt to regain control and push ETH towards $2,850. A break and close above this crucial level could open the doors for a move towards $3,000. However, should sellers continue to retain control, ETH could slip back below $2,700 and towards the $2,500 support level. The MACD, which is currently in the green, indicates that buyers have an advantage at the moment.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (SOL) surged over the weekend, breaking past several resistance levels and moving averages. The jump in price also saw SOL reclaim the crucial $150 price level. SOL had been relatively subdued over the past week, especially compared to the price movements we generally see associated with SOL. Buyers and sellers struggled to exert influence, as sellers were unable to drive SOL below $140 while buyers could not push above the 20-day SMA. However, this changed on Friday as buyers seized control, and SOL surged over 7%, breaking past the 20 and 200-day SMAs and the $150 price level. SOL eventually ended Friday at $153, with buyers firmly in control.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/biOhN0C4/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment persisted on Saturday as SOL pushed above the 50-day SMA after a 4.82% increase to climb above $160 and settle at $160.78. However, with sellers defending this level of resistance, SOL fell to a day low of $155 on Sunday, but buyers could wrest control at lower levels and drive the price back towards $160. SOL eventually settled at $159 after a drop of 1.04%. The current session sees DOL marginally up as buyers attempt to push SOL back above $160.\par \par \uc2 SOL sits at a crucial juncture regarding any future price movements. If it can break and close above $160, it could indicate buyers are in control and could push towards $190. However, sellers could look to drive SOL back below $150 if sentiment changes.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) tested the $0.110 and the 50-day resistance levels over the weekend but was unable to break past these levels. DOGE had bounced off the $0.100 support level last week and maintained a steady upward trajectory. It pushed above the 20-day SMA, which had been acting as a dynamic level of resistance, on Wednesday after a 2.81% increase, which took the price to $0.106. After countering selling pressure and registering only a marginal drop on Thursday, DOGE registered a 6.52% increase on Friday, pushing above the resistance at $0.110 and settling at $0.112.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/mCVoRyDr/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Here, the 50-day SMA acted as a resistance level, preventing buyers from pushing the price higher. As a result, DOGE faced significant selling pressure, leading to a 0.62% drop on Saturday. Sellers continued to dominate on Sunday as DOGE dropped a further 2.41% to slip back below the $0.110 level as buyers failed to flip it into support. The current session sees DOGE remain in the red with the price trading at $0.109. Sellers will look to drive DOGE back below the 20-day SMA and toward its $0.100 support level. However, if buyers keep DOGE above the 20-day SMA, they could retest the resistance at $0.110 and the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) \u8217\'20\'19s recent recovery hit a hurdle this weekend after it was rejected at the $5 level, with buyers unable to conquer this price level. Buyers lost momentum as DOT faced selling pressure, with the price dipping over the past couple of sessions. DOT, which hit a low of $4.22 on August 15, bounced off this level as it steadily increased toward $5. By August 20, DOT reclaimed the $4.50 price level, settling at $4.52, and on August 21, it moved above the 20-day SMA after an increase of 3.32% to settle at $4.67.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/qrDbLbfK/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 After a marginal increase on Thursday, DOT registered a substantial uptick on Friday, rising by 4.26% to move to $4.89 as buyers set their sights on $5. DOT surpassed $5 on Saturday, reaching an intra-day high of $5.11. However, buyers lost momentum above $5, and sellers were able to drag DOT back below $5. DOT eventually settled at $4.98 after an increase of 1.84%. Sellers were expected to defend the $5 level, an expectation that led to DOT\u8217\'20\'19s resurgence losing steam as it dropped by 3.01% on Sunday to settle at $4.83. The current session sees DOT down by 1.86% and trading around the $4.74 price level.\par \par \uc2 So does this mean it\u8217\'20\'19s curtains for DOT\u8217\'20\'19s recent resurgence? This depends on lower-level demand. If buyers can regain momentum and prevent DOT from slipping back below the $4.50 price level and the 20-day SMA, we could see a recovery and DOT could retest $5. A recovery from DOT\u8217\'20\'19s current levels will indicate buyers have not lost momentum yet. However, should DOT continue to drop, we could see it slip back below $4.50 and continue to drop towards $4. However, DOT is not expected to give up these levels easily.\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) broke above the $0.60 resistance level on Friday as buying activity picked up following relatively muted price action. XRP had surged over 6% last Monday, breaking above the 20-day SMA and settling at $0.599. However, with sellers defending the $0.60 price level, buyers could not sustain a push above it. As a result, XRP fell back on Tuesday, dropping 0.87% to $0.594. XRP could only push above $0.60 on Friday after buyers took control and pushed the price up by 2.24% to $0.611.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/Mx2WXWhd/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers attempted to push higher on Saturday but were unable to sustain momentum thanks to strong selling pressure at higher levels. As a result, XRP reached a day high of $0.631 before sellers drove it down to $0.613, allowing only a marginal increase. Selling pressure took hold on Sunday, driving XRP down by 2.02% as buyers managed to barely keep the price above $0.60. However, the current session sees XRP slip below $0.60, with the price down by 0.32%. XRP\u8217\'20\'19s future price movement depends on whether buyers can keep the price above the moving averages. If buyers keep XRP above the 20-day SMA, we could see the price test $0.60 again. However, should it dip below the moving averages, XRP could drop to the $0.55 support level.\par \par \uc2 SEI Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 SEI surged over the weekend, breaking above the 50-day SMA and crucial resistance levels. On Wednesday, it broke above the 20-day SMA and maintained its upward trajectory on Thursday to settle at $0.28. It registered a staggering increase on Friday, rising by 15.80% to push above the resistance at $0.30 and the 50-day SMA to settle at $0.32. SEI continued to push higher over the weekend, registering a 5.56% increase on Saturday and a 1.02% increase on Sunday despite considerable selling pressure.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/gKiOIsAn/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The current session sees SEI up by 0.48% as buyers attempt to push above $0.35.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240827ek8q00006\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/26: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,640 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 August 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally above $60,000 boosted investments into BTC exchange-traded products last week, signaling improving sentiment.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvMDE5MThmODEtN2M5My03MjcyLTgzMTMtZTRjMzUwMGFiYjQ1.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/26: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has made a sharp comeback from its August low of $49,000, but history does not support the continuation of the recovery in September. According to CoinGlass data, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-dip-gone-september-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin has dropped an average of 4.78%}}}\uc2  since 2013. In the past seven years, Bitcoin has witnessed a positive monthly gain only in 2023.\par \par \uc2 However, that has not deterred investors from buying Bitcoin-related exchange-traded products (ETP). \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 latest report shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-investment-largest-inflows-5-weeks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin-related ETPs witnessed $543 million in inflows}}}\uc2  last week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/01918f7f-4593-7e12-a6b9-6e58b9cbafd2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/26: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has largely been stuck inside the $55,724 to $73,777 range for the past several months, indicating a tough battle between the bulls and the bears for supremacy. The longer the time spent inside the range, the greater the force needed for the price to break out from it.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin rise above $65,000 and march toward $70,000? Will altcoins also march higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index continued its northward march last week and reached near the overhead resistance of 5,670\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/01918f7f-c4fb-7658-a154-bd7af4fb1154"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/26: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average (5,509) has started to turn up and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is in the positive zone, signaling advantage to buyers. A break and close above 5,670 could start the next leg of the uptrend to 6,000.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to make a comeback, they will have to swiftly yank the price below the moving averages. If that happens, the index may get stuck between 5,119 and 5,670 for a while.\par \par \uc2 US Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 Sellers took charge of the US Dollar Index (DXY) last week and pulled the price below the crucial support at 101.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/01918f80-92e7-7168-866d-d85bc11534a8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/26: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sharp fall has sent the \uc2 RSI\uc2  into the oversold territory, indicating that the bears are firmly in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. Any recovery attempt is likely to face selling at 101.50 and again at the 20-day EMA (102.40).\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower or turns down from the overhead resistance, it will signal that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The next stop on the downside is 99.57. Buyers will have to drive the price above the 20-day EMA to gain strength.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is finding it difficult to rise above the $65,000 resistance, but a positive sign for the bulls is that they have not ceded ground to the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/01918f81-6167-7ef1-8f74-1c5e12b1d269"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/26: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($61,353) has started to turn up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is maintaining in the positive territory, indicating that the bulls have the advantage. If the BTC/USDT pair rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the likelihood of a rally to $70,000 increases. The bears are expected to mount a strong defense in the $70,000 to $73,777 zone.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a break and close below the moving averages could open the doors for a fall to $55,724, where the buyers are likely to step in.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the breakdown level of $2,850, indicating that the bears are trying to flip the level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/01918f82-3aed-7686-b0a3-a944860635f9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/26: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers do not allow the price to sustain below the 20-day EMA ($2,717), it will signal that the dips are being bought. That will improve the prospects of a rally above $2,850. A break and close above the 50-day SMA ($2,971) will suggest that the downtrend may be over.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, a sharp break below the 20-day EMA will suggest that the bears remain in control. The ETH/USDT pair may then consolidate between $2,500 and $2,850 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $600 on Aug. 23, indicating that the bears are attempting to keep the price inside the $460 to $635 range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/01918f8c-f837-7343-a9a4-2cf48d573b03"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/26: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are likely to act as a strong support. If the price rebounds off the moving averages with strength, it will suggest a positive sentiment where the dips are being purchased. The BNB/USDT pair may then attempt a rally to the significant hurdle at $635.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price continues lower and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the bulls have given up. The pair may then slump to the strong support zone between $495 and $460.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the 50-day SMA ($155) on Aug. 24, indicating that the selling pressure is reducing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/01918f82-eb9b-7cb2-bf19-395e229856be"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/26: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($150) has started to turn up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  has risen into the positive territory, suggesting that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers kick the price above $164, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair is likely to pick up momentum and surge to the overhead resistance at $186.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are active at higher levels. The pair may then slide to the $136 support.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) returned from the $0.64 resistance on Aug. 24, signaling that the bears are aggressively defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/01918f84-65c6-7aa6-a99c-e37240371596"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/26: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The first support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($0.58) and then the 50-day SMA ($0.56). If the price turns up from the moving averages, it will signal that the bulls are buying on minor dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $0.64. If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair may reach $0.74.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below $0.54. That will keep the pair inside the $0.41 to $0.64 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 50-day SMA ($0.11), indicating that the bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/01918f85-8585-72a5-a058-7d5f0c713b0b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/26: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to defend the 20-day EMA ($0.11) to improve the prospects of a break above the downtrend line. A break and close above the falling wedge pattern will suggest a trend change. The DOGE/USDT pair may then start a new up move to $0.14 and later to $0.18.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price skids below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the pair may remain inside the wedge for some more time. The bears will try to sink the price to $0.09, which is expected to attract buyers.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) turned down and plunged below the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on Aug. 24, indicating that the bears have overpowered the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/01918f86-4504-7dd0-8aae-4012bf94c7bf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/26: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the Aug. 25 candlestick shows that the bulls attempted a bounce off the $5.25 support but failed to build upon it. The bears are again trying to sink the pair below $5.25. If they can pull it off, the TON/USDT pair may slump to $4.72. A close below $4.72 will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA ($6.34). The pair may then climb to the 50-day SMA ($6.66).\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) climbed above the 50-day SMA ($0.38) on Aug. 23, but the bulls could not push the price to the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/01918f86-f107-7e72-86da-bad3a037857a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/26: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 That may have tempted short-term traders to book profits, pulling the price below the 50-day SMA. The bulls will try to defend the 20-day EMA ($0.36) because a break below it may tug the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair to $0.31.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the moving averages, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying on dips. That will increase the possibility of a break above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvMDE5MThmODEtN2M5My03MjcyLTgzMTMtZTRjMzUwMGFiYjQ1.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240826ek8q000bb\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin bulls run risk of \u8216\'20\'18Bart Simpson\u8217\'20\'19 BTC price dip to $62K\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 658 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 August 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin traders warn of a BTC price correction next week with targets extending to $60,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvOTVmODU3NGUtY2QwMy00YzViLWE1ODktZDE3MGExYWVjOThjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin bulls run risk of \u8216\'20\'18Bart Simpson\u8217\'20\'19 BTC price dip to $62K}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin circled $64,000 into the Aug. 25 weekly close as analysis warned that BTC price gains could soon be wiped.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/9e4feddf-4cf3-4c3f-987d-b9c56ea5c0c5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin bulls run risk of \u8216\'20\'18Bart Simpson\u8217\'20\'19 BTC price dip to $62K}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 BTC price faces struggle to preserve gains\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://subscription.cointelegraph.com/?_gl=1*7499wx*_ga*MTQ0MzQ0NzI4Ny4xNzE2MzY1NTA0*_ga_53R24TEEB1*MTcxNjM2NTUwNC4xLjEuMTcxNjM2Njg2MC4wLjAuMA.."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed a flat weekend for Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) after rapid gains at the end of the previous Wall Street trading session.\par \par \uc2 These {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-62k-sell-wall-analyst-up-only-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 followed promising signals}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-62k-sell-wall-analyst-up-only-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-62k-sell-wall-analyst-up-only-crypto}}}\uc2  from the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  regarding policy easing in September, specifically the first interest rate cuts since 2019.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin was initially slow to react but ultimately hit two-week highs of nearly $65,000 before consolidating lower.\par \par \uc2 Analyzing the potential moves for the coming days, however, popular trader CrypNuevo was cautious.\par \par \uc2 In a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/CrypNuevo/status/1827687057210192355"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 thread}}}\uc2  on X, he determined that order book liquidity favored a drop to support, which would liquidate late longs.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe levels with more liquidations are $63.5k (1h50EMA) & $62.2k,\u8221\'20\'1D he summarized, referring to the 50-period exponential moving average on the 1-hour chart.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/83dd2020-d12d-419b-8c0c-f676fc4905fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin bulls run risk of \u8216\'20\'18Bart Simpson\u8217\'20\'19 BTC price dip to $62K}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC liquidation levels for Binance. Source: CrypNuevo\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD could thus print a classic \u8220\'20\'1CBart Simpson\u8221\'20\'1D pattern, heading back to the 50-period EMAs on one-hour and four-hour timeframes.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt would make sense because they\u8217\'20\'19d be filling the wick, stopping short positions and trapping some breakout traders,\u8221\'20\'1D he explained.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThen the drop would flush the delta liquidations with a long squeeze to support.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/085bd1f7-d3ce-4da5-9533-a77ed3a98bde.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin bulls run risk of \u8216\'20\'18Bart Simpson\u8217\'20\'19 BTC price dip to $62K}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 1-hour chart with 1-hour, 4-hour 50-period EMA. Source: CrypNuevo\par \par \uc2 Other popular social media traders agreed with the idea, among them Trader ELM, who saw a dip to $62,700 before upward continuation.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/5cf34350-48fc-4ce8-ab44-0db42a6a17ad.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin bulls run risk of \u8216\'20\'18Bart Simpson\u8217\'20\'19 BTC price dip to $62K}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: Trader ELM\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBuying "clean retests\u8221\'20\'1D such as 62.7K after BTC pumps are historically very low hit rate,\u8221\'20\'1D fellow trader Crypto Chase nonetheless {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Crypto_Chase/status/1827649195546652971"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 countered}}}\uc2  on the day.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhen BTC is ready to rip, it RARELY offers clean retests.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Crypto Chase suggested that a breakout above $65,700 would offer a clearer indication of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum, while conversely, keen observation was needed in the event of a drop back to $60,000.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWatch how PA responds if 60K-61K is retested (to determine whether to long for another test of daily resistance 65K or short towards 57.5K~),\u8221\'20\'1D he wrote alongside an explanatory chart.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/53da72b5-c414-46c5-b604-a68c0658a3d4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin bulls run risk of \u8216\'20\'18Bart Simpson\u8217\'20\'19 BTC price dip to $62K}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT perpetual swaps 1-day chart. Source: Crypto Chase\par \par \uc2 Analyst: Bitcoin seeks return to post-halving norm\par \par \uc2 Zooming out, trader and analyst Rekt Capital offered an optimistic take on BTC price performance.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-8-23-btc-eth-bnb-sol-xrp-doge-ton-ada-avax-shib"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin, he noted, was close to reclaiming the area it had previously occupied following its April block subsidy halving \u8212\'20\'14 one he called the \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/6-months-sideways-bitcoin-price-action-mimics-2023-lull"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 post-halving reaccumulation range}}}\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe importance of this technical event cannot be understated,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/rektcapital/status/1827701037387399533"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 argued}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CEssentially, Bitcoin is resynchronising with historical Post-Halving price tendencies.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/34b2099e-f98e-48e6-a28a-fee3ada060ae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin bulls run risk of \u8216\'20\'18Bart Simpson\u8217\'20\'19 BTC price dip to $62K}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-week chart comparison. Source: Rekt Capital\par \par \uc2 An accompanying chart compared this year\u8217\'20\'19s post-halving price behavior to that after the previously halving in 2020.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvOTVmODU3NGUtY2QwMy00YzViLWE1ODktZDE3MGExYWVjOThjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240826ek8p0000a\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin bulls run risk of 'Bart Simpson' BTC price dip to $62K\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 649 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 August 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin traders warn of a BTC price correction next week with targets extending to $60,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvOTVmODU3NGUtY2QwMy00YzViLWE1ODktZDE3MGExYWVjOThjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin bulls run risk of 'Bart Simpson' BTC price dip to $62K}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) circled $64,000 into the Aug. 25 weekly close as analysis warned that BTC price gains could soon be wiped.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/9e4feddf-4cf3-4c3f-987d-b9c56ea5c0c5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin bulls run risk of 'Bart Simpson' BTC price dip to $62K}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 BTC price faces struggle to preserve gains\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://subscription.cointelegraph.com/?_gl=1*7499wx*_ga*MTQ0MzQ0NzI4Ny4xNzE2MzY1NTA0*_ga_53R24TEEB1*MTcxNjM2NTUwNC4xLjEuMTcxNjM2Njg2MC4wLjAuMA.."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed a flat weekend for BTC/USD after rapid gains at the end of the previous Wall Street trading session.\par \par \uc2 These followed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-62k-sell-wall-analyst-up-only-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 promising signals}}}\uc2  from the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  regarding policy easing in September, specifically the first interest rate cuts since 2019.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin was initially slow to react but ultimately hit two-week highs of nearly $65,000 before consolidating lower.\par \par \uc2 Analyzing the potential moves for the coming days, however, popular trader CrypNuevo was cautious.\par \par \uc2 Order book liquidity, he determined in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/CrypNuevo/status/1827687057210192355"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 thread on X}}}\uc2 , favored a drop to support which would liquidate late longs.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe levels with more liquidations are $63.5k (1h50EMA) & $62.2k,\u8221\'20\'1D he summarized, referring to the 50-period exponential moving average on the 1-hour chart.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/83dd2020-d12d-419b-8c0c-f676fc4905fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin bulls run risk of 'Bart Simpson' BTC price dip to $62K}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC liquidation levels for Binance. Source: CrypNuevo/X\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD could thus print a classic \u8220\'20\'1CBart Simpson\u8221\'20\'1D pattern, heading back to the 50-period EMAs on 1-hour and 4-hour timeframes.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt would make sense because they'd be filling the wick, stopping short positions and trapping some breakout traders,\u8221\'20\'1D he explained.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThen the drop would flush the delta liquidations with a long squeeze to support.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/085bd1f7-d3ce-4da5-9533-a77ed3a98bde.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin bulls run risk of 'Bart Simpson' BTC price dip to $62K}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 1-hour chart with 1-hour, 4-hour 50-period EMA. Source: CrypNuevo/X\par \par \uc2 Other popular social media traders agreed with the idea, among them Trader ELM, who saw a dip to $62,700 before upward continuation.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/5cf34350-48fc-4ce8-ab44-0db42a6a17ad.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin bulls run risk of 'Bart Simpson' BTC price dip to $62K}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: Trader ELM\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBuying "clean retests" such as 62.7K after BTC pumps are historically very low hit rate,\u8221\'20\'1D fellow trader Crypto Chase nonetheless {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Crypto_Chase/status/1827649195546652971"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 countered}}}\uc2  on the day.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhen BTC is ready to rip, it RARELY offers clean retests.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Crypto Chase suggested that a breakout above $65,700 would offer a clearer indication of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum, while conversely, keen observation was needed in the event of a drop back to $60,000.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWatch how PA responds if 60K-61K is retested (to determine whether to long for another test of daily resistance 65K or short towards 57.5K~),\u8221\'20\'1D he wrote alongside an explanatory chart.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/53da72b5-c414-46c5-b604-a68c0658a3d4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin bulls run risk of 'Bart Simpson' BTC price dip to $62K}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT perpetual swaps 1-day chart. Source: Crypto Chase/X\par \par \uc2 Analyst: Bitcoin seeks return to post-halving norm\par \par \uc2 Zooming out, trader and analyst Rekt Capital offered an optimistic take on BTC price performance.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-8-23-btc-eth-bnb-sol-xrp-doge-ton-ada-avax-shib"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin, he noted, was close to reclaiming the area it had previously occupied following its April block subsidy halving \u8212\'20\'14 one he called the \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/6-months-sideways-bitcoin-price-action-mimics-2023-lull"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 post-halving reaccumulation range}}}\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe importance of this technical event cannot be understated,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/rektcapital/status/1827701037387399533"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 argued}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CEssentially, Bitcoin is resynchronising with historical Post-Halving price tendencies.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/34b2099e-f98e-48e6-a28a-fee3ada060ae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin bulls run risk of 'Bart Simpson' BTC price dip to $62K}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-week chart comparison. Source: Rekt Capital/X\par \par \uc2 An accompanying chart compared this year\u8217\'20\'19s post-halving price behavior to that after the previously halving in 2020.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvOTVmODU3NGUtY2QwMy00YzViLWE1ODktZDE3MGExYWVjOThjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240825ek8p000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
