llish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum continues, \uc2 AVAX\uc2  might soar to $50, reflecting a remarkable 128% gain from its current range. With the RSI of 68.44 hinting at a near-overbought condition, this could set the stage for a powerful surge.\par \par \uc2 Stellar (XLM)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/cryptos-safest-bet-stellar-xlm-and-vechain-vet-investors-turn-to-rising-presale-star-rollblock-rblk-for-stability"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Stellar (XLM)}}}\uc2  is trading between $0.090 and $0.098 and is on the verge of a potential breakout. With a 7.18% rise in the past week, XLM is showing positive signs. Should it overcome the $0.10 resistance, it could climb to $0.111, a 12% increase. More notably, if XLM continues its momentum, it could reach $0.30, marking an impressive 206% gain from its current levels. The coin's recent \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  presents an opportunity for substantial growth.\par \par \uc2 Mantle (MNT)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/whales-are-accumulating-despite-bitcoins-challenges-3-best-affordable-altcoins-to-buy-before-the-bull-run"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Mantle (MNT)}}}\uc2  is currently priced between $0.56 and $0.63. Despite recent challenges, the coin has demonstrated resilience with a 10% gain last week. If it breaks through the resistance level at $0.68, it could rise to $0.75, representing a 20% increase. Looking further, if Mantle gains traction, it could potentially reach $1.50, offering a striking 138% gain from its current range. The coin\u8217\'20\'19s high \uc2 RSI\uc2  indicates a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  phase could be on the horizon.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/doge-vs-mpepe-who-will-provide-the-best-return-on-investment-in-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE)}}}\uc2  is trading between $0.0951 and $0.1074. Despite struggling with resistance at $0.1146, the coin has seen a 12% rise in the past week. If DOGE builds on this momentum and breaks through $0.1269, it could see a 21% increase. With sustained \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum, DOGE could potentially surge to $0.35, representing a substantial 226% gain from its current highest value. The \uc2 RSI\uc2  around 59 suggests that the coin could be gearing up for a significant rally.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 )\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/turn-100-into-10000-with-these-4-altcoins-if-the-market-bounces-back"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2  is trading between $0.32 and $0.35. With an 18% increase over the past week, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  shows promising potential. If it breaks the $0.36 resistance level, it could rise to $0.39, marking a 10% gain. Looking further, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  might reach $1.00, representing a remarkable 186% increase from its current range. Despite recent \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trends, the coin\u8217\'20\'19s recent gains hint at a possible \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  surge.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 As we head into the upcoming week, several altcoins like Avalanche (AVAX), Stellar (XLM), Mantle (MNT), Dogecoin (DOGE), and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) show promising potential for significant gains. Each coin is displaying key signs of growth, from breaking resistance levels to maintaining \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. Investors should stay alert and consider these opportunities for potential profits. Keep an eye on these top altcoins and be prepared to act on their emerging trends.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as le