\par\par \b \uc2 Analyst Who Hasn\u8217\'20\'19t Been Wrong Since 2021 Calls Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) a Crapshoot, Predicts 2000% Bull Move for Trending Dogecoin (DOGE) Rival\b0\par\par\uc2 Adrian Barkley \par \uc2 875 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 August 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano: A High-Risk Gamble}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MoonTaurus: A Dogecoin Rival with 2000% Potential}}}\par \par \uc2 A crypto analyst with a track record of accurate predictions since the 2021 bull run has recently slammed Cardano, calling the altcoin a "crapshoot." The analyst views the once-favored asset as a high-risk gamble to steer clear of as investors prepare for a market rally in Q4 2024. The analyst has also identified an opportunity in a recently viral Dogecoin competitor, MoonTaurus (MNTR). According to this expert, the meme coin could see a 2000% surge in value, making it one of the most promising investments in 2024.\par \par \uc2 Cardano: A High-Risk Gamble\par \par \uc2 Once hailed as a revolutionary platform with the potential to challenge Ethereum, Cardano has faced criticism for its slow development and unfulfilled promises. The analyst in question hasn\u8217\'20\'19t held back in expressing skepticism about Cardano's future, labeling it as a "crapshoot" \u8212\'20\'14 a high-risk gamble with uncertain outcomes.\par \par \uc2 According to data from IntoTheBlock, Cardano's user base has stagnated over the last year, a concerning sign for a project that once boasted significant growth. The metric of interest is the total number of Cardano addresses holding a non-zero balance. During the 2021 bull run, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  experienced notable growth in its holder base, but this increase slowed during the 2022 bear market and eventually plateaued over the past year. This implies that, while Cardano saw significant adoption in 2021, new investors no longer find the network attractive.\par \par \uc2 IntoTheBlock also notes that the previous cycle's growth was driven by \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's positioning as a strong alternative to Ethereum. However, investors are now attracted to other networks, like \uc2 Solana\uc2 . Adoption has traditionally been critical for any asset, as a larger user base provides a solid foundation for long-term growth. With \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's holder count hovering around 4.45 million, the coin appears to be weakening.\par \par \uc2 Cardano's current price is $0.358271, with a 24-hour trading volume of $495.67 million and a market cap of $12.79 billion. Despite a 5.13% gain in the last 24 hours, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  remains down 88% from its all-time high. The asset has been outperformed by 62% of the top 100 crypto assets over the past year. While there\u8217\'20\'19s still potential for price appreciation, the analyst believes better opportunities exist elsewhere in the market, particularly in the newcomer MoonTaurus (MNTR).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://mntrmeme.com/rwcali"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click here}}}\par \par \uc2 MoonTaurus: A Dogecoin Rival with 2000% Potential\par \par \uc2 While Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s future remains uncertain, the analyst is incredibly \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on MoonTaurus (MNTR), whose presale started in late July. In just two weeks, the presale has raised over $360,000 with more than 1,000 investors participating. This early momentum has fueled speculation that MoonTaurus could become the next big meme coin, taking on giants like Dogecoin.\par \par \uc2 One of the major draws of MoonTaurus is the project's tokenomics, which are designed to reward early investors. MNTR has a capped supply of 3 billion tokens, with 40% of this supply allocated to participants in the presale. The presale is structured into 10 phases, each with increasing prices. For instance, the price per token in phase one was $0.005. This has already seen a 100% increase to $0.01 in the ongoing phase two. These increases will continue through the remaining 8 stages until MNTR launches at $0.07. This setup guarantees investors who buy in today a 7x return as the meme coin enters the market. MoonTaurus has also implemented a deflationary token model. This means that the total supply of MNTR tokens will decrease over time, potentially driving up the price as demand grows.\par \par \uc2 Another factor working in MoonTaurus\u8217\'20\'19 favor is its market timing. The meme coin presale has begun at a time when the overall cryptocurrency market is showing signs of recovery. With a sharp market rally expected in Q4 2024, MoonTaurus is well-positioned to capitalize on renewed market optimism.\par \par \uc2 The analyst\u8217\'20\'19s endorsement of MoonTaurus adds significant credibility to the project. Notably, a 2000% rally from the current price would see the meme coin break above $1 by the end of 2024. This translates to a 100x ROI for phase two investors. With a track record of accurate predictions dating back to 2021, this analyst\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  stance on MNTR has caught the attention of both retail and institutional investors. High-profile endorsements like this can have a substantial impact on a coin\u8217\'20\'19s price trajectory, especially in the early stages of its development.\par \par \uc2 While Cardano remains a high-risk gamble, the analyst sees far greater potential in MoonTaurus. The coin\u8217\'20\'19s low initial price, combined with its tokenomics and market timing, creates the perfect conditions for explosive growth. If you are looking to capitalize on the next potential 2000% gainer, MoonTaurus is definitely worth adding to your portfolio.\par \par \uc2 Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://moontaurus.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://moontaurus.com/}}}\par \par \uc2 Linktree\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://linktr.ee/moontaurus"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://linktr.ee/moontaurus}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240826ek8n00005\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
