\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 8-23 BTC, ETH, SOL, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOT, WIF\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 2,387 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 August 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Still Sluggish}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Is A Parabolic Rally On The Cards?}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH Sentiment Still \b  \highlight22Bearish\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogwifhat (WIF) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) has held firm above $60,000, although its price has not seen much movement. The asset is trading around the $60,700 price level. The crypto market cap currently stands at $2.15 trillion, an increase of 0.72% over the past 24 hours.\par \par \uc2 While BTC has gained around 21% since dipping below $50,000 on August 5, it has struggled to stay above $60,000. BTC\u8217\'20\'19s sluggishness could be blamed on investors looking to balance risk, who have pivoted to bonds and stocks as Bitcoin futures registered a dip.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Still Sluggish\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is facing several conflicting trends, resulting in low investor interest. Macroeconomic indicators suggest traders are moving towards safer investments, such as stocks, and shifting away from cash positions for the moment. The stock market gains have coincided with a decline in \uc2 US Treasury\uc2  yields, indicating strong demand for traditionally safe assets. Investors are willing to settle for lower returns on fixed-income assets. However, Bitcoin derivatives metrics are displaying resilience and an upside potential.\par \par \uc2 Is A Parabolic Rally On The Cards?\par \par \uc2 2024 has been mixed for Bitcoin (BTC), with several crucial events taking place. These include the launch of spot Bitcoin ETFs and the halving event. Unlike previous halving events, this time, BTC hit a new all-time high before the halving event. Almost four months after the halving, BTC has yet to hit its pre-halving all-time high. On the contrary, BTC has lost 13% over the past month. This has brought Q4 into focus, with analysts wondering if BTC could see a rally in this quarter.\par \par \uc2 Coinglass data shows that BTC has always had positive returns in Q4 during halving years. The cryptocurrency recorded gains of 58% in 2016 and 168% in 2020. BTC also posted positive returns in 8 out of 11 years between 2013 and 2023, with average gains of 88%. If we look at historical data, there is a 73% chance of a BTC rally in Q4 2024. Ki Young Ju, the founder and CEO of CryptoQuant, stated that BTC\u8217\'20\'19s 2020 rally began in Q4 2024, and BTC\u8217\'20\'19s current phase suggests it could be setting up for a parabolic rally in Q4.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIn the last Bitcoin halving cycle, the bull rally began in Q4. Whales won\u8217\'20\'19t let Q4 be boring with a flat YoY performance.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 ETH Sentiment Still \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 ETH\u8217\'20\'19s price trend has remained \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  despite a drop in gas fees. The world\u8217\'20\'19s second-largest cryptocurrency has struggled to stay above $2,600 but has registered an increase of $1.75 in the past 24 hours. Gas fees on Ethereum fell under 1 gwei, their lowest level in five years. The drop in gas fees can be attributed to a sluggish market, recent network updates, and a significant increase in Layer2 adoption.\par \par \uc2 While a reduction in gas fees can be considered a good thing, it raises concerns due to a decrease in token burning and an increase in the supply of ETH.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/crypto-price-analysis-8-22-btc-eth-sol-trx-dot-sei-matic"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  has managed to stay above the $60,000 mark despite strong resistance around the $62,000 price and sluggish demand as Bitcoin whales adopt a wait-and-watch stance. The current week has been mixed for BTC as it notched up notable price jumps and substantial declines. After ending the previous week on a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note with a 1.90% drop on Sunday, BTC started the current week by almost erasing Sunday\u8217\'20\'19s losses. The cryptocurrency rose by 1.73% and settled at $59,501. Buyers attempted to overwhelm sellers on Tuesday and push towards $60,000, meeting initial success as BTC rose to an intra-day high of $61,401. However, intense selling pressure at higher levels allowed the bears to retake control and push BTC back below $60,000 and the 20-day SMA. BTC eventually ended Tuesday at $59,068 after a drop of 0.73%.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/v81Lv4C1/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC was back in the green on Wednesday as markets rallied following the release of the FOMC meeting minutes. Thanks to the overall positive sentiment, BTC was able to climb back above the 20-day SMA and $60,000 to settle at $61,134. With the 50-day SMA and its associated resistance coming into play on Thursday, buyers lost momentum as BTC dipped by 1.16% to settle at $60,423. Crucially, however, buyers were able to keep BTC above $60,000. The current session sees BTC up by 1.32% as it makes another attempt to push past the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 BTC faces strong resistance at the 50-day SMA, a level buyers must overcome to push towards $65,000 and beyond. The next level of resistance buyers must overcome is the 200-day SMA. A break above these levels could indicate the return of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment and set BTC up for a push above $65,000. However, for this to happen, BTC needs a significant uptick in demand, which is currently lacking, given that crypto whales have reduced buying. Sellers, on their part, will look to drive BTC back below $60,000 and towards the $58,000 support.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) has broken past the 20-day SMA in what can be seen as a positive development after weeks of sluggishness. ETH buyers had repeatedly failed to push the price above the 20-day SMA but finally found the required momentum this week. As you can see from the price chart, ETH has been quite subdued since a 3.50% drop on August 15, with the price mainly trading sideways since. The current week began with an increase of 1% as buyers strived to keep ETH above $2,600. ETH eventually settled at $2,639. However, sellers took control on Tuesday and drove ETH below $2,600 as it settled at $2,574 after a drop of 2.44%.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/HDxfb9ha/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The crypto markets saw a positive Wednesday, and ETH registered a 2.21% increase to push back above $2,600 and settle at $2,631. Sellers attempted to drive ETH back below $2,600 on Thursday but could not, with demand picking up at lower levels. As a result, ETH only dropped marginally and, crucially, settled above the 20-day SMA. The current session sees ETH up by 1.95% as buyers look to push ETH above $2,700.\par \par \uc2 With bears failing to push ETH below $2,600, bulls will look to regain momentum and push the price toward $2,850, a crucial level of resistance. However, sellers are expected to defend both levels vigorously and look to regain control and push ETH down toward its $2,500 support level.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (SOL) is attempting to break out of its recent horizontal market trend, which has seen it make modest gains compared to its recent price action. The cryptocurrency has been struggling to push above $150 and trading below the moving averages but has registered an uptick during the ongoing session as it works its way above the 20-day SMA. SOL has been on a steady upward trajectory since the weekend, but bulls have been unable to sustain momentum, losing steam close to the $150 price level, as can be seen on the price chart.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/uOldaSES/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL reached an intra-day high of $147 on Sunday before sellers forced the price down to $142. The current week began with a 1.35% increase, allowing SOL to move to $144. Buyers attempted a move past the 20-day SMA on Tuesday as SOL reached an intra-day high of $148.91. However, buyers lost momentum, allowing sellers to retake control and push SOL back below the 20-day SMA. SOL eventually settled at $142 after a drop of 1.42%. SOL saw considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday and Thursday as sellers attempted to drive the price below the $140 support level while buyers attempted to push above the 20-day SMA. However, neither could establish control, and SOL eventually settled at $143, registering only a marginal increase.\par \par \uc2 The current session sees SOL attempting a move above the 20-day SMA, with the price currently at $145. So, is SOL finally going to reclaim $150? Data from LookOnChain suggests activity in Solana markets is picking up. Should bulls gain momentum, SOL will test the resistance above $150. However, buyers must keep SOL above the 20-day SMA for such a scenario to play out. Sellers are expected to defend resistance levels vigorously, and if SOL is rejected from these levels, it would indicate that bears are in charge. If buyers can maintain control and move above the moving averages, SOL could attempt a move to $160.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) broke above the 20-day SMA this week as buyers finally gathered momentum and broke out of the meme coin\u8217\'20\'19s recent narrow trading range. Buyers had ensured DOGE stayed above $0.100 but could not push it beyond $0.102 thanks to the 20-day SMA acting as a dynamic resistance level. A similar script played out over the weekend, with DOGE ending the previous week at $0.100. Buyers were able to push DOGE up by 1.60% to $101 on Monday and attempted a move above the 20-day SMA on Tuesday. Despite reaching a day high of $0.106, sellers took control and pushed DOGE back below the 20-day SMA. Despite the selling pressure, DOGE registered an increase of 1.47% and settled at $0.103.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/uwVIqOIk/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE finally broke past the 20-day SMA on Wednesday after a 2.81% increase propelled it to $0.106. Buyers attempted to retake control on Thursday and drive DOGE back below the moving average. However, with demand picking up at lower levels, DOGE registered only a marginal decline. The current session sees the price up by 1.13% and trading at $0.107, as buyers look to move towards $0.110.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has surged this week, breaking past the 20-day SMA and the $0.35 resistance level, indicating that bulls currently have complete control. The current surge puts \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the verge of the $0.40 price level, with buyers having pushed \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  above the 50-day SMA as well. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  started the current week with a marginal increase of 0.60% on Monday. Buyers gained further momentum on Tuesday as \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose above the 20-day SMA after a 2.08% increase to settle at $0.34.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/HQOebMzW/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  registered a surge of 7.56% on Wednesday as crypto markets saw an uptick. This allowed \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  to push above $0.35 and settle at $0.37. Buyers also attempted a move above the 50-day SMA but were thwarted, as seen in the price chart. Despite the 50-day SMA acting as a dynamic resistance level, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  registered a 1.89% increase on Thursday to settle just below the moving average. The current session sees \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  up by over 2%, having moved above the 50-day SMA and trading at $0.38. If \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  continues its upward trajectory, it could reclaim the $0.40 price level.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) has continued its upward trajectory as it nears the crucial $5 level. After its recent price struggles had shaken investor confidence, reclaiming this level will be crucial for DOT. However, analysts had always backed the asset and its potential, stating it was massively undervalued. DOT has been in the green since last Friday, steadily climbing as it sheds its recent \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment with buyers taking control. By Sunday, DOT had risen to $4.39, with buyers attempting to push above $$4.50. DOT remained positive on Monday, registering an increase of 2.05% to settle at $4.48. On Tuesday, it reclaimed the $4.50 price level after a 0.89% increase pushed it to $4.52.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/xyJc4dkR/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT broke above the 20-day SMA on Wednesday after a 3.32% increase and settled at $4.67, and a marginal increase on Thursday pushed DOT to $4.69. The current session has seen buyers continue to push DOT towards $5. DOT is currently up by 1.92% and trading at $4.78. After enduring a downward trajectory that began in March, DOT\u8217\'20\'19s recent upward trajectory could mark the end of sustained \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment that has plagued the altcoin. Buyers will now look to reclaim the crucial $5 level, which DOT lost at the beginning of August.\par \par \uc2 Dogwifhat (WIF) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Unlike DOGE, Dogwifhat (WIF) has steadily increased this week, pushing it above crucial resistance levels as buyers look to build on recent \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. WIF bounced off the $1.40 support level on Monday, rising to $1.43 after a 3.24% increase. The popular meme coin continued its upward trajectory on Tuesday, surging by 8.13% to push above $1.50 and settle at $1.55. Sellers attempted to retake control at this level and drove WIF to a low of $1.47, but with lower-level demand picking up, WIF was quick to recover. Despite the selling pressure, WIF managed to register a marginal increase, although it could not push above the 20-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/WoUKiMmN/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 WIF overcame the 20-day SMA on Thursday, posting an increase of 3.69% and settling at $1.61. The current session sees WIF up by 1% and trading at $1.63. Buyers must ensure WIF stays above the 20-day SMA for its current rally to continue. Should the price continue increasing, WIF will test the resistance at the 50-day SMA. Sellers will look to regain control and drive the price back below the 20-day SMA and the $1.50 level.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240824ek8n00008\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,720 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 August 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin seems to be getting ready for a rally above $63,000, triggering buying in select altcoins.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvMDE5MTgwM2YtNDdmYi03ZjMwLTk3ZTUtODA0YmNkMDEzNzQ2.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) rose above the overhead resistance near $63,000 and it appears that bulls are now ready to push prices higher. Risk assets received a boost after the Federal Reserve Chair Jerome Powell confirmed during his keynote address in Jackson Hole, Wyoming, that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-62k-sell-wall-analyst-up-only-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 interest rates will start to come down}}}\uc2 . However, Powell refrained from committing to the timing and the pace of the rate cuts.\par \par \uc2 A technical market update from Kraken, said that Bitcoin must cross and maintain above the $62,000 level to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-resistance-level-crypto-black-monday-kraken-crypto-update"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 avoid a retest of $49,000}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe price action suggests a corrective pattern rather than a strong \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  reversal,\u8221\'20\'1D the update added.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/0191808b-8eca-78c2-9828-34c0979bd698"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Total crypto market performance. Daily chart. Source. Coin360.com\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin remains stuck inside the large range between $55,720 and $73,777. Generally, the price swings between the support and the resistance levels in the range. Bitcoin is attempting to rise toward the resistance of the range after the bears failed to sustain the price below the $55,724 support.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin maintain above $60,000, or will bears pull the price lower and trap the aggressive bulls? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Sellers defended the 50-day simple moving average ($61,440) on Aug. 21, but they could not pull the price below the 20-day exponential moving average ($60,195).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/01918035-ffec-714e-9602-72d8448710fc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to maintain the price above the 50-day SMA. If they can pull it off, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to $65,660 and, after that, to the psychological resistance at $70,000. Buyers may face significant hurdles between $70,000 and $73,777.\par \par \uc2 The upside narrative will take a back seat if the price turns down sharply from the 50-day SMA and slides below $60,000. That may accelerate selling and open the doors for a fall to critical support at $55,724.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been squeezed between the 20-day EMA ($2,700) and the horizontal support at $2,500 for the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/01918036-c9b1-7e6c-bdeb-7cc29558a2e6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure to sink the price below $2,500 increases the likelihood of a break above the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the ETH/USDT pair is expected to rally to $2,850, which is an important level to watch out for.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $2,850 and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will signal a range formation in the near term. Buyers will have to propel the price above the 50-day SMA ($2,984) to suggest the start of a sustained recovery.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned up sharply from the downtrend line on Aug. 21, indicating that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/01918038-9b01-7eb4-aa7f-08a6df4f4f8d"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($546) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that the bulls have the edge. There is a minor resistance at $606, but it is likely to be crossed. The BNB/USDT pair may then attempt a rally to $635.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages, it will indicate that the pair may remain stuck inside the $460 to $635 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears held \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day EMA ($147) for the past several days but failed to sink the price below $136. This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/0191803b-171a-7897-bc8b-1fcda6d16ebe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will again try to kick the price above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($154) and later to $164. The bears are expected to fiercely defend the level, but if the bulls prevail, the pair may rally to $189.\par \par \uc2 The crucial level to watch on the downside is $136. If this support cracks, it will suggest that the bears are keeping up the pressure. The pair may then slump to $130 and eventually to $116.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is struggling to sustain above $0.60, but a positive sign is that the bulls have not ceded ground to the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/0191803b-c237-7270-a628-b521699ad006"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory indicate advantage to buyers. The XRP/USDT pair is likely to reach the $0.64 level, which may pose a strong challenge. If the price turns down from $0.64 but does not fall below the 20-day EMA, it will improve the prospect of a breakout.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to swiftly yank the price below the 50-day SMA ($0.55). If they do that, it will signal that the pair may remain stuck inside the $0.41 to $0.64 range for a while.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has jumped above the 20-day EMA ($0.10), and the bulls are trying to stretch the recovery to the 50-day SMA ($0.11).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/0191803e-41d6-7522-bfd2-2201f9b09458"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to stall the relief rally at the 50-day SMA, but it is likely to be crossed. The real challenge for the bulls will be at the downtrend line. If the price turns down from the downtrend line and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the DOGE/USDT pair may remain inside the falling wedge pattern for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if buyers drive the price above the downtrend line, it will signal the start of a new up move. The pair may climb to $0.14 and later to $0.18.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) price action in the past few days has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating a balance between demand and supply.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/0191803f-39ac-7eb2-beb4-9c79cdd7bac6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($6.54) and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. A break and close below the support line will suggest that the bears have overpowered the bulls. That may start a move down to $6 and later to $5.50.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price rises above the resistance line, it will signal that the bulls have seized control. The TON/USDT pair may rally to $7.65 and subsequently to the pattern target of $8.11.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-bottoming-bitcoin-chart-fractal-500-rally-setup"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Is XRP bottoming out versus Bitcoin? Chart fractal mirrors 500% rally setup}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to stall Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) relief rally at the 50-day SMA ($0.38), but the bulls scaled the level on Aug. 23.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/01918041-b868-7347-847a-2188bc36ac03"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A close above the 50-day SMA will open the doors for a possible rise to the downtrend line. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break above it will suggest that the downtrend may be over. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then start a rally toward $0.52.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the current level or the downtrend line, it will suggest that the bears continue to sell on rallies. That may pull the price to the 20-day EMA ($0.35), which is an important level for the bulls to defend.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) continued its recovery and rose above the 50-day SMA ($24.88) on Aug. 22, indicating demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/01918042-9b5c-7505-a29a-e25272a20c64"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The AVAX/USDT pair is likely to reach the resistance line, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense. If the price turns down sharply from the resistance line and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the descending channel for some more time.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to enforce a trend change, they will have to push and maintain the price above $29. That could trap the aggressive bears, pushing the price toward $33.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the 20-day EMA ($0.000014) on Aug. 21, indicating that the bears are losing their grip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/01918043-3d7b-78c8-a0de-b02c58f572bd"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. Buyers will have to drive and retain the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.000015) to signal strength. The SHIB/USDT pair could then rally to the breakdown level of $0.000020.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to defend the 50-day SMA and pull the price below the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the pair may retest the $0.000012 support.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvMDE5MTgwM2YtNDdmYi03ZjMwLTk3ZTUtODA0YmNkMDEzNzQ2.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240823ek8n000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal6