\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 8-21 BTC, ETH, SOL, DOGE, XRP, UNI, TIA\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 2,289 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 August 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto Markets Await Federal Reserve Comments}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Impact On Crypto}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Institutional Ownership Of Bitcoin ETFs Up}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Celestia (TIA) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) briefly climbed above $61,000 on Tuesday but could not stay above this level as sellers immediately drove the price back towards $60,000. Growing selling pressure forced BTC back below $60,000, with the cryptocurrency currently trading around the $59,500 mark.\par \par \uc2 Crypto markets registered a notable increase on Tuesday, with all major cryptocurrencies registering gains. However, markets have hit a rough patch, with most coins in the red at present. The anticipation around the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  meeting minutes and the Jackson Hole symposium is also playing a crucial role in the prevailing scenario in crypto, with traders adopting a conservative approach.\par \par \uc2 Crypto Markets Await Federal Reserve Comments\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s July meeting minutes will be released on Wednesday. They will be followed by the Jackson Hole symposium, which will be held on Thursday. Traders will be waiting in anticipation for the annual economic symposium, which could provide clarity on the interest rate outlook. Federal Reserve Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  is also scheduled to speak at the event. Markets are expecting a rate cut in September. However, the odds of a 50 basis point reduction have been reduced to 28.5%, according to \uc2 CME\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s FedWatch.\par \par \uc2 During the meeting at Jackson Hole, Wyoming, Wall Street and the crypto markets anticipate that Federal Reserve Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  will confirm interest rate cuts. However, investors are still processing last week\u8217\'20\'19s announcement of US retail sales numbers for July and weekly initial unemployment claims, both of which have been stronger than anticipated. The statistics also eased concerns about the strength of the US economy, giving a breather to global stocks. However, Powell could choose to remain tight-lipped about the timing of the rate cut.\par \par \uc2 Impact On Crypto\par \par \uc2 The crypto market has had a mixed week so far, with BTC climbing above $61,000 at one point only to be dragged back below $60,000 thanks to selling pressure. The global crypto markets have declined 1.99% in the past 24 hours, with the total market capitalization currently at $2.1 trillion. Major cryptocurrencies have registered significant declines over the past week, with BTC down almost 2%, Ethereum (ETH) down almost 5%, Solana (SOL) down by 1.15%, and Dogecoin (DOGE) down almost 2%.\par \par \uc2 However, some cryptocurrencies have defied the markets and registered notable gains. These include Ripple (XRP) (up 4%), Tron (TRX), which is up a staggering 22%, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), up almost 6%, and Polkadot (DOT), which is up almost 2%.\par \par \uc2 Institutional Ownership Of Bitcoin ETFs Up\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, institutional ownership of Bitcoin ETFs reached 24% during the previous quarter despite a drop in BTC prices and a challenging market environment. According to the available data and filings, this is a noticeable jump from the 21.4% recorded during the previous quarter. Notable investors in spot Bitcoin ETFs include \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2 , holding $412 million in ETF shares, and \uc2 Morgan Stanley\uc2 , which holds $188 million in ETF shares. Spot Bitcoin ETFs have registered significant inflows of over $61 million on August 19. This was despite Bitwise\u8217\'20\'19s BITB and Invesco Galaxy\u8217\'20\'19s BTCO registering considerable outflows.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/crypto-price-analysis-8-20-btc-eth-sol-bch-mkr-dot-wif"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  registered a brief jump over $61,000 on Tuesday, buoyed by a jump in network usage and increased derivatives market activity. The anticipation of Federal Reserve Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s speech also led to an uptick in the price. However, it could not stay at that level and dropped back below $60,000 during the same session. BTC has had a mixed week so far despite entering the weekend positively, thanks to a 1.20% increase on Saturday. However, it fell back in the red on Sunday as buyers could not sustain momentum due to the 20-day SMA acting as a dynamic resistance level. As a result, BTC dropped almost 2% on Sunday to slip below $59,000 and settle at $58,492.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/JWLasBKZ/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Thanks to robust lower-level demand, BTC recovered on Monday, registering an increase of 1.73% to move to $59,501. However, it was unable to move above the 20-day SMA yet again. On Tuesday, BTC finally broke above the moving average and the $60,000 price level thanks to a price jump driven by increased network and derivatives market activity. As a result, BTC surged to an intra-day high of $61,402. However, buyers lost momentum as the price was rejected at the 50-day SMA, allowing sellers to wrest control. With sellers in control, BTC fell back below the 20-day SMA. However, it was able to stay above the $59,000 mark and settle at $59,068. The current session sees BTC up by almost 1% and trading at $59,650.\par \par \uc2 So, is another push above $60,000 on the cards? This depends on the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s July meeting minutes and Powell\u8217\'20\'19s speech at the Jackson Hole symposium. If the speech buoys the markets, BTC could climb back above the $60,000 level and retest the resistance at the 50-day SMA. A break above this level could see BTC test $62,000. However, sellers are expected to defend these levels, and should BTC turn \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , a drop to $58,000 can be expected.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) remains in a consolidation phase despite a breakout to $2,697 on Tuesday, which sellers quickly reversed. This indicated intense selling pressure around the $2,700 level. Looking at the daily chart, we can see neither bulls nor bears have been able to take the initiative and dictate price movements. Since losing the $2,700 level on August 12, ETH has struggled to build momentum, with buyers unable to mount a substantial push to higher levels. However, they have kept ETH above $2,500, indicating strong support at this level. ETH has been relatively muted since Friday when it registered an increase of 9.93% to move to $2,594. Saturday saw yet another marginal increase that allowed ETH to settle above $2.600 at $2,614.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/5qENrZec/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A push towards $2,700 failed to materialize on Sunday as sellers could drive the price back down from an intra-day high of $2,684. Sellers attempted to push ETH lower on Monday, but buyers were able to retake control and push ETH to $2,639 after an increase of 1%. Buyers made a strong push to break above $2,700 on Tuesday as ETH reached an intra-day high of $2,697. However, with sellers actively defending this level and the 20-day SMA also coming into play, \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment waned as ETH fell back by 2.44% to $2,574. The current session sees ETH up by almost 1% and trading at $2,599.\par \par \uc2 ETH is trading within a narrow range, oscillating between the $2,500 support level and the $2,700 resistance level. ETH must break and close above the 20-day SMA and the $2,700 price level for any substantial upward price action. Buyers must also defend the $2,500 support level. Should this level be breached, ETH could tank to $2,200.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (SOL)\u8217\'20\'19s push to $150 stalled on Tuesday despite a strong push by buyers. SOL lost momentum as it faced considerable selling pressure around the $150 level, with the 200-day SMA acting as a dynamic resistance level. SOL had been trading in a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trajectory since August 8, when its price hit $163. However, buyers lost momentum, and the price quickly dropped below the 50 and 200-day SMAs to settle at $141. Buyers attempted a push to $150 but could not move above the 200-day SMA. Instead, SOL dropped to $139 by Friday as selling pressure intensified.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/6Wy9Lgsl/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, support at this level allowed buyers to enter the market, allowing SOL to reclaim $140 after a 2.04% increase, which pushed the price to $141. Buyers attempted a move to $150 on Sunday but were thwarted. As a result, SOL fell to $142 from an intra-day high of $147, a marginal increase of 0.37%. Buyers also remained in control on Monday, with SOL rising by 1.35%. Buyers attempted another push above $150 on Tuesday as SOL rose to $148.91. However, sellers pushed the price back below the 20-day SMA to $142. The current session sees buyers and sellers struggling to establish control, with the price at $142.\par \par \uc2 Buyers must push above $150 to reclaim pre-August 5 levels. However, with sellers active, they must also defend the $140 support level. A break below this level could yank SOL down to $130 or even lower.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE)\u8217\'20\'19s positive start to the week continued as the popular meme coin continued its upward trajectory. DOGE\u8217\'20\'19s price could see further upward momentum after it emerged that DOGE miners have acquired 140 million DOGE over the past 20 days. DOGE has been in a consolidation phase for the past couple of weeks. Despite sellers attempting to breach $0.100, DOGE\u8217\'20\'19s support has held firm with buyers, ensuring DOGE stays above its critical level of support.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/7qcvIjlX/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE has done well to recover from an intra-day low of $0.098 on Thursday, having climbed back above $0.100 by Saturday to settle at $0.102. Sellers attempted to drive DOGE back below $0.100 on Sunday but could not do so despite dragging the price down by 2.05%. Instead, buyers were able to take control on Monday, pushing DOGE up by 1.60% to $0.101. Momentum picked up on Tuesday, allowing DOGE to push above the 20-day SMA and settle at $0.101. The current session sees DOGE up by 0.68% and trading at $0.104.\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) had a strong start to the week after spending several days unable to gather momentum and break above the 20-day SMA. The altcoin had been trading with relatively little \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  since Tuesday (August 13), with neither buyers nor sellers unable to influence the price to a significant degree. The 20-day SMA acted as a dynamic level of resistance, preventing a move toward $0.60, while buyers could defend the $0.55 support. This began to change on Sunday as buyers mounted a strong push towards $0.60. However, they lost momentum as XRP approached higher levels, allowing sellers to retake control. XRP eventually dropped by 0.49% to $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/FlvKT9AG/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The current week began with buyers firmly in control as XRP surged past the 20-day SMA after an increase of 6.32% to settle at $0.59. Sellers were expected to defend this level, and while buyers attempted to push higher on Tuesday, they could not do so as sellers drove the price down by 0.87%. The current session sees XRP marginally up. If buyers can gather momentum and push above $0.60, XRP could move toward $0.65, a crucial resistance level. However, sellers are expected to defend both levels and attempt to push XRP down towards $0.55.\par \par \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) has broken past the 20-day SMA after failing to do so on Friday. UNI had registered a sharp increase on Friday, registering a 4.92% jump to settle at $6.51. However, with sellers defending this level, UNI could not push above the 20-day SMA. Instead, it turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the weekend, dropping by 1.48% on Saturday and a further 3.76% on Sunday to settle at $6.17. Sellers attempted to drag UNI below the $6 support level. However, strong lower-level demand allowed buyers to regain control and push UNI up to $6.20 on Monday.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/mIVJgf5B/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 On Tuesday, buyers attempted to move above the 20-day SMA as UNI reached an intra-day high of $6.47. However, sellers pushed the price below the moving average to $6.26.\par \par \uc2 The current session sees UNI up over 2% as buyers attempt another move to push above $6.50. If UNI can break and close above $6.50, buyers will attempt a move towards $7. However, sellers are expected to defend both levels.\par \par \uc2 Celestia (TIA) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Celestia (TIA) has turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  since its rally faltered on August 13 after it broke above the 20 and 50-day SMAs to reach $6.20. Since then, TIA has dropped back below the moving averages and lost the $6 level to slip to $5.15. By Sunday, TIA hit a low of $4.99 as \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment took hold after TIA lost crucial support levels. Buyers are struggling to keep TIA above $5 as weak demand meant it could only register a marginal increase on Monday. However, sellers also have lost momentum and could push TIA marginally down as it held on to its $5 support level. The current session sees buyers attempting a move towards the 20-day SMA. However, TIA has only been marginally up so far.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/3BCDeT7M/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 TIA must push above the 20-day SMA for sustained buying momentum to take hold. However, if it loses its $5 support level, the price could drop towards $4.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240822ek8l0000g\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/19: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,712 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 August 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and several major altcoins are finding it difficult to break above their respective overhead resistance levels, indicating selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvNTkyNGJhZjgtYzhkMy00N2JkLThhNTktMTBkMWE4ZmU2MjNiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/19: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound for several months, but that has not shaken the resolve of the long-term holders. Glassnode\u8217\'20\'19s hodl wave chart shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/75-percent-bitcoin-hodled-6-months-hodl-wave-chart"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 74% of Bitcoin has not moved}}}\uc2  in the past six months or more.\par \par \uc2 The central question bugging investors is which way will Bitcoin breakout. Aurelie Barthere, the principal research analyst at Nansen onchain analytics platform, told Cointelegraph that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ether-price-drop-investor-sentiment-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto bull market would continue}}}\uc2  if the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  cuts rates while growth holds. However, if growth decelerates sharply, the upside will be limited for risk assets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/bf6ceaef-a8de-4637-b6b2-2e69bac164d7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/19: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 In contrast, popular analyst Rekt Capital said in a post on X that Bitcoin could be \u8220\'20\'1Cjust over a month away from breakout\u8221\'20\'1D if it follows its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-analysts-converge-september-btc-price-breakout-86k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 historical pattern of starting its parabolic phase}}}\uc2  roughly 160 days after halving.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin break above $60,000, or will it slump to $55,724 in the near term? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index continued its V-shaped recovery last week, indicating solid buying by the bulls. The rally above the moving averages suggests that the correction is over.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/aacad8db-5f05-4db8-98fc-de70f3275164.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/19: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 There is minor resistance at 5,585, where the bears will try to stall the up move. If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the moving averages are likely to act as strong support. If the price turns up from the moving averages, it will increase the possibility of a rally to 5,670.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to quickly yank the price back below the moving averages. That could open the doors for a fall to 5,265. Such a move could suggest a range-bound action between 5,119 and 5,585 in the near term.\par \par \uc2 US Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The US Dollar Index (DXY) tried to start a recovery but turned down from the 20-day exponential moving average (103.27) on Aug. 15. This shows that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/fefb232a-a418-4c46-bfc8-f0e26fb8cec0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/19: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI near the oversold territory suggest that the path of least resistance is to the downside. There is support at 101.90 from where the bulls may try to start a relief rally, but the up move is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the likelihood of a drop to 101 increases.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price rises and breaks above the 20-day EMA. That could clear the path for a rally to 103.50 and then to the 50-day simple moving average (104.43).\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been oscillating between the 50-day SMA ($61,425) and the $55,724 support level for the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/47658420-2705-406b-9c28-f489d11ebfec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/19: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($59,908) and the RSI just below the midpoint indicate a minor advantage to the bears. If bulls want to seize control, they will have to kick the price above the 50-day SMA. If they do that, the BTC/USDT pair is expected to rise to $65,660 and then to $70,000.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from the current level or the moving averages, the bears will again try to sink and sustain the pair below $55,724. If they succeed, the pair may plunge to $49,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the $2,500 support on Aug. 15, but the bulls are having trouble pushing the price above the 20-day EMA ($2,729).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/2b304455-3c91-40d8-b365-e2964263d25d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/19: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, the ETH/USDT pair is likely to break below $2,500. The pair may then slump to $2,309, where the bulls will again try to arrest the decline.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if buyers kick the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to the breakdown level of $2,850. This level is again expected to attract sellers, but if the bulls prevail, it will suggest that the downtrend may be over.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long wick on \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) Aug. 18 candlestick shows that the bears are defending the 20-day EMA ($148).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/c589f70d-740a-4416-afad-c377852f8fb5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/19: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position by pulling the price below $136. If they do that, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the crucial support at $116. This is an important level to keep an eye on, as a strong bounce off it will signal that the pair may extend its stay inside the range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break above the moving averages could push the price to $164. This level may act as a resistance, but if the buyers overcome it, the pair could reach $185.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has reached the downtrend line, which is an essential short-term resistance to watch out for.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/976e176f-5066-4a63-b9a9-32a18bf13995.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/19: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($529) and the RSI near the midpoint suggest that the selling pressure is reducing. Buyers will try to build upon their position by pushing the price above the downtrend line. If they can pull it off, the BNB/USDT pair may attempt a rally to $600.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down sharply from the downtrend line and closes below the 20-day EMA. The bears will then try to sink the pair to the $495 support.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 After trading near the 20-day EMA ($0.57) for the past few days, XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is trying to resume its up move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/f21161f6-b161-4084-a915-c3be1d911fa1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/19: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up if buyers sustain the price above $0.59. That could propel the price to the overhead resistance at $0.64. Sellers are expected to defend this level with all their might because if they fail to do that, the XRP/USDT pair may climb to the next hurdle at $0.74.\par \par \uc2 The 50-day SMA ($0.54) is the solid support to watch out for on the downside. If this level cracks, the pair may plunge to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to push Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.10), indicating that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/27e61b3b-e845-40f2-ae7e-8998f8b8b5b4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/19: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure to rise higher may increase the selling pressure by the bears, who will try to sink the price below $0.09. If they manage to do that, the DOGE/USDT pair could decline to the support line near $0.08.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls are in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The pair may then attempt a rally to the downtrend line. Buyers will have to overcome this barrier to signal a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day SMA ($6.84) on Aug. 18 but failed to achieve a close above it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/274144e6-dcdc-40b9-849c-89ec0a9a61aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/19: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears have pulled the price back below the 50-day SMA on Aug. 19, indicating selling at higher levels. Buyers are expected to vigorously defend the 20-day EMA ($6.52). If the price turns up from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will signal buying on dips. That will improve the prospects of a rally above the 50-day SMA. The TON/USDT pair may then climb to $7.65.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break and close below $6 will signal that the bulls have given up. That may increase selling and pull the pair to $5.26.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) continues to trade below the 20-day EMA ($0.34), indicating that the bears are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/ccc832e6-a466-4d77-91d3-184f0fec2fa8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/19: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling could accelerate if bears sink the price below $0.31. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then tumble to $0.27 and eventually to the crucial support at $0.24. This level is likely to attract solid buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the 20-day EMA will be the first sign that the bulls are on a comeback. The pair may rise to the 50-day SMA ($0.38) and later to the downtrend line. Buyers will have to clear this hurdle to signal the start of a new up move.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvNTkyNGJhZjgtYzhkMy00N2JkLThhNTktMTBkMWE4ZmU2MjNiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240819ek8j000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 ADA\par \b \uc2 Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) loses top 10 crypto spot as Tron sees growth\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 414 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 August 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Cardano drops from the top 10 on CoinMarketCap as Tron sees an uptick in network activity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvSEklMjBXaGF0X3MlMjBoYXBwZW5pbmclMjB3aXRoJTIwWFJQJTIwQ2FyZGFubw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) loses top 10 crypto spot as Tron sees growth}}}\par \par \uc2 According to CoinMarketCap, Cardano has fallen out of the top 10 cryptocurrencies by market capitalization after dropping approximately 3% over the last seven days.\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), once ranked third in crypto rankings during the 2021 bull cycle, is currently 11th after Tron ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tron-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TRX}}}\uc2  ). Tron currently has a market cap of $12.04 billion, while Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s market cap sits at $11.89 billion.\par \par \uc2 This is not the first time Cardano has dropped out of the top 10. In May, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/memecoin-mania-cardano-out-top-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Toncoin flipped \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  after TON jumped 30% in two weeks.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/Screenshot%202024-08-19%20at%2016.36.44%20Medium"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) loses top 10 crypto spot as Tron sees growth}}}\par \par \uc2 Performance of top 10 cryptocurrencies by market capitalization. Source: CoinMarketCap\par \par \uc2 This comes amid a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-the-crypto-market-down-today#:~:text=Today%2C%20the%20cryptocurrency%20market's%20losses,over%20%241%20billion%20in%20liquidations."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 marketwide correction}}}\uc2  that has seen most cryptocurrencies drop below key support levels. Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), the largest crypto by market capitalization, led the drop by losing 11% and 2.5% over the last 30 days and 24 hours.\par \par \uc2 The drop in \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s position can be attributed to current market dynamics, which are fueled by various factors, including market trends, \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and overall market conditions.\par \par \uc2 According to data from Alternative.me, the Crypto Fear & Greed Index remains in the \u8220\'20\'1CFear\u8221\'20\'1D zone at 28. Although this is a slight increase from the \u8220\'20\'1CExtreme Fear\u8221\'20\'1D experienced last week, it suggests that investors are still in a risk-off mode.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/Screenshot%202024-08-19%20at%2017.24.24"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) loses top 10 crypto spot as Tron sees growth}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto Fear & Greed Index. Source: Alternative.me\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tron-network-leads-in-stablecoin-market-share-amid-growing-monthly-transfer-volume"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tron network leads in stablecoin market share amid growing monthly transfer volume}}}\par \par \uc2 The Cardano Blockchain has been referred to as a \u8220\'20\'1Cghost network\u8221\'20\'1D with only 23,807 active addresses compared to Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s 350,000 and Tron\u8217\'20\'19s 1.9 million, per data from DefiLlama. The total value locked on the network is $178.07 million, making up less than 1% of the DeFi market share and ranking at 29, as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/what-is-ethereum-a-beginners-guide-to-eth-cryptocurrency#:~:text=Ethereum%20is%20a%20decentralized%20blockchain,media%20and%20so%20much%20more."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-is-solana-and-how-does-it-work"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana}}}\uc2  and Tron take the top three spots.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/Screenshot%202024-08-19%20at%2017.53.35%20Medium"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) loses top 10 crypto spot as Tron sees growth}}}\par \par \uc2 Top chains ranked by total value locked. Source: DefiLlama\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvSEklMjBXaGF0X3MlMjBoYXBwZW5pbmclMjB3aXRoJTIwWFJQJTIwQ2FyZGFubw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240819ek8j000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Solana\par \b \uc2 Why is Solana (SOL) price down today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 885 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 August 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price is at risk of making new lows as network activity and the ecosystem\u8217\'20\'19s TVL drop.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvMTg3ZjE5ZWItZGRkOS00YzZiLWIxYTctZDA1ZDQ0ODg3MThkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Solana (SOL) price down today?}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2 , the native cryptocurrency of the Solana network, has dropped over 15% in the last seven days to reach a low of $138.22 on Aug. 16. \uc2 SOL\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s 30-day losses stand around 14% and 18% in the 90-day timeframe.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/644eacd6-cbca-4327-ace2-8b21b12e116b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Solana (SOL) price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/DeCZfJio/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s performance over the last day has been accompanied by a leap in its trading volume, which has increased by 50% to $3.26 billion, asserting the intensity of the sell-side activity. The decrease in price and high trading activity has seen its total market capitalization drop to $64.52 billion, but according to data from CoinMarketCap, \uc2 SOL\uc2  still maintains its position as the fifth-largest cryptocurrency.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s look at the top catalysts driving \uc2 SOL\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price lower.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  memecoins are bleeding\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  is trading in a third consecutive \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  session on Aug. 16, coinciding with an ongoing sell-off in the prices of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/over-one-million-new-tokens-memecoins-launch-april-solana-base"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 memecoins on its network}}}\uc2 . Most are posting double-digit losses, as shown in the figure below.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/fa315b60-ba1a-4344-801b-89814dbe59f7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Solana (SOL) price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  memecoins performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coingecko.com/en/categories/solana-meme-coins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinGecko}}}\par \par \uc2 For instance, Dogwifhat ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/dogwifhat-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 WIF}}}\uc2  ), the leading Solana memecoin by market capitalization, has dropped by over 13.5% on a 24-hour adjusted timeframe. Similarly, Bonk ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bonk-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BONK}}}\uc2  ), Book of Meme ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/book-of-meme-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BOME}}}\uc2  ) and Popcat ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/popcat-sol-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 POPCAT}}}\uc2  ), have dropped 12%, 13% and 23%, respectively, in the same period.\par \par \uc2 This drop in the prices of memecoins accompanies a decline in onchain activity within the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/solana-sol-ecosystem-overview"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana ecosystem}}}\uc2 , according to the data provided by Dune dashboard {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://dune.com/hashed_official/pumpdotfun"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pump.fun}}}\uc2 . Today\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 SOL\b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  was preceded by a sharp drop in the number of transactions deployed on the network.\par \par \uc2 The chart below shows that daily transactions on the \uc2 Solana\uc2  blockchain decreased from 20,465 to 4,332 between Aug. 13 and Aug. 16.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/a8d94b3d-07e6-43d0-8c07-52e3e17ee373.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Solana (SOL) price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s deployed transactions performance chart. Source: Pump.Fun\par \par \uc2 The drop in the number of transactions on \uc2 Solana\uc2  indicates suppressed network activity and a drop in user interaction with the platform leads to decreased network usage and lower revenues.\par \par \uc2 Additional data from Dune reveals a sharp reduction in \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s daily revenue, which currently stands at 4,159 SOL (~$575,000) on Aug. 16, down from a year-to-date high of 35,076 SOL (~4.85 million) on Aug. 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/f9d403d9-5fbe-4bea-a0bc-0b66d518ebe8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Solana (SOL) price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily revenue raised on the Solana network. Source: Pump.Fun\par \par \uc2 Solana TVL has decreased over the last month\par \par \uc2 Data from DefiLlama shows {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/base-surges-past-solana-total-value-locked#:~:text=The%20total%20value%20locked%20(TVL,at%20the%20time%20of%20writing."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s total value locked}}}\uc2  (TVL) has been on a downward trend over the last week. The chart below shows that \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s TVL has fallen by 5.2% over the last seven days, from $5.02 billion on Aug. 9 to $4.76 billion at the time of publication.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/5f208435-0946-4627-878c-789e3f2e39a6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Solana (SOL) price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  total value locked. Source: DefiLlama\par \par \uc2 This drop in TVL has occurred in tandem with the decrease in \uc2 SOL\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price, which is more than 15% over the same period.\par \par \uc2 Taking a closer look at \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s TVL decrease, several layer 2 protocols, such as Jito and Sanctum, have posted substantial losses in total value locked over the last month, contributing to the drop in the value of the underlying network.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/90976bdf-2fda-421a-94c0-35d727e11d06.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Solana (SOL) price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Top blockchains: percentage change in TVL. Source: DefiLlama\par \par \uc2 The declining TVL reflects traders\u8217\'20\'19 fading interest and could be a sign that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/solana"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana}}}\uc2  struggles to attract new users despite its lower traction costs.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-8-14-btc-eth-bnb-sol-xrp-doge-ton-ada-avax-shib"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/14: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s market structure hints at a retest of $122\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price action in the daily timeframe has painted an inverted V-shaped pattern, as shown in the chart below. The supplier congestion zone between $150 and $155 is acting as an area of stiff resistance on the upside. Note that this is where the 50-day, 100-day and 200-day {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-ways-traders-use-moving-averages-to-read-market-momentum"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 exponential moving averages}}}\uc2  (EMAs) currently sit.\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is dropping toward the 30 mark, asserting the sellers\u8217\'20\'19 dominance in the market. The bears now focus on the immediate support at $135 and, later, the neckline of the prevailing chart pattern at $130.\par \par \uc2 A daily candlestick close below this level would confirm the continuation of the downtrend. The next logical move would be to the July 5 range low at $122.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/948766b7-d820-45a3-a313-b16beca4900c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Solana (SOL) price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/SpYM1OsZ/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 On the upside, holding above $135 would signal the inability of the sellers to extend the uptrend. If this happens, \uc2 SOL\uc2  could rise above the $150 to $155 supply zone and later to the pattern\u8217\'20\'19s high at $165, invalidating the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDUvMTg3ZjE5ZWItZGRkOS00YzZiLWIxYTctZDA1ZDQ0ODg3MThkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240816ek8g000e4\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/16: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,718 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 August 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls are trying to hold on to the $55,500 support, but the bears are maintaining their pressure and increasing the chance of another correction to the downside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvY2E0YmM2YTItZDMwZS00ZWQ5LThjMzYtYWM3ZjdkZGYzY2IyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/16: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck in a sideways price action phase for several months, but that has not stopped institutional investors from buying. According to K33 Research senior analyst Vetle Lunde, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutional-bitcoin-etf-adoption-rises-q2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 more than 262 new firms invested}}}\uc2  in the United States spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) during the second quarter of 2024.\par \par \uc2 It is encouraging to note that the institutional investors have largely held on to their positions or increased them. Bitwise chief investment officer \uc2 Matt Hougan\uc2  said in a post on X that 44% of asset managers {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/two-thirds-institutional-bitcoin-etf-holders-held-bought-more-q2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 boosted their Bitcoin ETF positions}}}\uc2  while 22% held steady. Only 13% exited their positions, and the remaining 21% reduced positions. Hougan called this as \u8220\'20\'1Ca pretty good result, on par with other ETFs.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/5a9c98d1-9e3b-45ad-8300-b6003993b19a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/16: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While the long-term remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , analysts are turning \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the near term. Cryptocurrency analysis platform Coinglass cautioned in a post on X that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-room-to-fall-unusual-open-interest-coinglass"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rising open interest}}}\uc2  suggests there is \u8220\'20\'1Croom to fall.\u8221\'20\'1D Additionally, analysts are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-bounces-4-triple-death-cross-sub-50k-warning"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 closely watching the death cross}}}\uc2  as the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) has dipped below the 200-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin plummet below the $55,724 support, starting a fall to $50,000? Are altcoins at risk of breaking down? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down from the 50-day SMA ($61,577) on Aug. 14 but bounced off the solid support at $55,724 on Aug. 15, suggesting buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/53a473f6-a27a-47b3-98a2-8a5fa06c9391.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/16: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will again try to propel the price above the 50-day SMA. If they manage to do that, it will suggest that the selling pressure is reducing. The BTC/USDT pair may then attempt a rally to $65,659 and thereafter to $70,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will signal that the bears are active at higher levels. The pair may then consolidate between the 50-day SMA and $55,724 for some time. The pair may tumble to $49,000 if the $55,724 support gives way.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the support near $2,500 on Aug. 16, suggesting that the bulls are trying to form a higher low.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/cd21d70f-6030-4a4c-af03-d5082605cb4d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/16: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to start a recovery, but the ETH/USDT pair is expected to face strong selling in the 20-day EMA ($2,772) to $2,850 zone. If the price turns down from the overhead zone, it will suggest that the bears are trying to flip the $2,850 level into resistance. That will increase the risk of a break below $2,500.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break and close above $2,850 will suggest that the markets have rejected the lower levels. The pair may rise to the 50-day SMA ($3,085) and later to $3,400.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the 20-day EMA ($526) for the past few days, indicating that the bulls are trying to push the price above it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/166304f2-8713-4c61-a85f-776daf7f65d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/16: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could reach the downtrend line. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close above it will suggest the start of a robust recovery to $605.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level or the downtrend line, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative. The bears will then try to sink the pair to the critical support at $460.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) dipped below the $141 support on Aug. 15, and the bears have continued the fall on Aug. 16.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/3ef84776-b5b6-4847-823c-44414db3d8c0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/16: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to $130, which is an important support to watch out for. If the price rebounds off $130, the bulls will again try to push the pair above the moving averages. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is likely to pick up above $164.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price breaks below $130, it will signal that the selling pressure is increasing. The pair may retest the critical support at $116. The bulls are expected to defend this level with all their might because a break below it may start a new downtrend.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the 20-day EMA ($0.57) for the past few days, indicating a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/1223744e-131a-495e-9301-029e42081391.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/16: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break and close above $0.58 will tilt the short-term advantage in favor of the buyers. The XRP/USDT pair could then rally to the overhead resistance of $0.64. The bears have previously defended the level aggressively and will try to do the same again.\par \par \uc2 This short-term optimistic view will be negated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 50-day SMA ($0.54). That could increase the selling pressure, pulling the pair toward $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to sustain Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) below the $0.10 support, but the bulls have held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/53730196-c5a5-48ce-b802-33e069bbf8c9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/16: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will again attempt to kick the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.11). If they manage to do that, the DOGE/USDT pair is likely to pick up momentum and reach the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, if the price remains below $0.10, it will indicate that the bears are trying to take control. There is a minor support at $0.09, but if this level fails to hold, the next stop is likely to be the support line.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 50-day SMA ($6.89) on Aug. 14, but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/ebb5ad96-4844-4103-ad40-3bcd9860b8fb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/16: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below the 20-day EMA ($6.45), it will suggest that the higher levels are attracting sellers. There is a strong support at $6, but if this level breaks down, the TON/USDT pair may tumble toward $5.25.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA or $6.05, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying on dips. A close above the 50-day SMA will open the doors for a possible rally to $7.65.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/is-bitcoin-price-going-to-crash-again"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Is Bitcoin price going to crash again?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to push Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.35), indicating selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/f1777ad5-a44d-410f-b3e8-78323410a6c3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/16: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive in favor of the bulls is that they have not allowed the price to slip below $0.31. The bulls will again try to drive the price above the 20-day EMA. If they can pull it off, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may climb toward the downtrend line. The bulls will have to push and retain the price above the downtrend line to signal a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price continues lower and breaks below $0.31. That could start a slide to the vital support at $0.24.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside the descending channel pattern for the past few days, indicating a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/6ce10b45-349a-45f2-b0a8-6bc0ea3c9789.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/16: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the sellers are finding it difficult to sink the price below the $19.50 support. This suggests that the bulls are trying to form a higher low. A break and close above the 20-day EMA ($22.46) will be the first sign of strength. The AVAX/USDT pair may rise toward the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and breaks below $19.50, it will signal that the bears have asserted their supremacy. The pair may then slump to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) remains below the moving averages, but the bears have failed to sink and maintain the price below $0.000012.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/e8f5c19a-723f-4bb7-8fb3-995e3b349a78.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/16: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to make a comeback by pushing the price above the moving averages. If they succeed, the SHIB/USDT pair could reach the breakdown level of $0.000020. This level is likely to attract selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns down from the moving averages. If that happens, it will suggest that the bears remain in control. The first support on the downside is $0.000012. If this level cracks, the selling could pick up, and the pair may drop to $0.000010.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvY2E0YmM2YTItZDMwZS00ZWQ5LThjMzYtYWM3ZjdkZGYzY2IyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240816ek8g000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
