\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 8-13 BTC, ETH, \uc2 SOL\uc2 ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , BCH, DOGE, and MKR\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 2,291 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 August 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 A Battle Between Bulls And Bears}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Economic Downturn A Risk For BTC}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin Cash (BCH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Maker (MKR) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) market sentiment remains erratic, as the wild \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  experienced this month looks set to continue. BTC had seen a spectacular collapse to a six-month low but quickly regained ground.\par \par \uc2 However, it now finds itself struggling to restore its \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  narrative. Some analysts have speculated BTC could drop as low as $52,000 as worsening US macroeconomic data and changes in the Bitcoin options market could intensify BTC\u8217\'20\'19s price weakness.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is currently trading just above the $59,000 price level and has increased by 1.25% over the past 24 hours.\par \par \uc2 A Battle Between Bulls And Bears\par \par \uc2 As Bitcoin (BTC) and other major cryptocurrencies face a volatile market, the stage is set for a tussle between the bulls and the bears. However, several factors could dictate price movements and spring up a surprise. One of the biggest among these is the macroeconomic data from the United States. The Consumer Price Index (CPI), due on August 14, will be on every analyst\u8217\'20\'19s radar amid controversy and uncertainty around the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s handling of global market instability. The CPI comes just a day after the Producer Price Index, while the end of the week will see job data rollout.\par \par \uc2 The CPI and PPI data could not come at a worse time for traders. This is because any surprise in the numbers will add to an already complicated scenario when it comes to US inflation, with the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  already under pressure to lower interest rates in September. The Kobeissi letter summarized all the key events set for this week, outlining that it was a busy week ahead. However, with the CPI predicted to continue to drop, the Fed looks likely to consider a rate cut. Charlie Billelo, the chief market strategist at wealth management firm Creative Planning, put fuel as a factor in the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s dovish stance.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CGas prices in the US have moved down to $3.45 per gallon (national average) from $3.82/gallon a year ago (10% decline). If this holds, it will likely be a factor in pushing down headline CPI for August (\uc2 Cleveland Fed\uc2  is currently forecasting 2.7%), solidifying the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s rate cut.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Economic Downturn A Risk For BTC\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) traders are wondering if the cryptocurrency could retest the $49,000 low, given the declining interest in leveraged BTC long positions and the risk of a correction in the global stock markets. \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2  also increased the probability of a US recession, citing weak labor market conditions and a restrictive Fed policy. Fed Governor Michelle Browman stated on August 10 that the inflation risk persists and the labor market remains weak, reducing the chances of a September rate cut.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/crypto-price-analysis-8-12-btc-eth-sol-dot-xrp-ton-wif"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  is currently trading under the $60,000 price level, having been unsuccessful in reclaiming it so far despite a recovery on Monday. Bulls attempted to push the price above $60,000, but with increased levels of \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders remained on edge. The Crypto Fear and Greed Index, which had hit a low of 17/100 on August 6, recovered on August 9. However, it has slid back into the fear zone and was at 25/100 on August 12. Currently, it sits at 31/100, which indicates that bearishness still prevails in the market. The question market watchers are asking is if BTC can reclaim the $60,000 price level. So far, the outlook remains uncertain. Spot Bitcoin ETFs have reported significantly lesser inflows over the past few days, hinting at investor uncertainty. According to LookOnChain, institutions have also halted stablecoin purchases, further fueling negative sentiment.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/YrJwMY7p/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 As we can see in the price chart above, BTC dipped to a low of $49,351 last Monday but quickly recovered despite heightened market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Buyers had achieved an intraday high of $57,833 before bears pushed it down to $55,144. BTC made a stellar recovery on Thursday as markets became \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , rising by 12% to $61,763. However, it could not push above the 200-day SMA, which acted as a dynamic resistance level. As a result, the price turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday, dropping to $60,932, although buyers managed to keep it above $60,000.\par \par \uc2 However, they lost the level on Sunday after BTC plunged by almost 4% to $58,775. The market\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  was on full display on Monday as BTC reached an intra-day high of $60,749 and a low of $57,724. Eventually, BTC could register an increase of 1.08% and settle at $59,410. However, the $60,000 price level proved a bridge too far under present conditions, with BTC marginally down during the current session. If BTC can consolidate above $59,000, buyers could attempt a break above the $60,000 level. A strong breakout above the $60,000 and $62,000 price level could hint at a reversal and signal the end of the current downward trend.\par \par \uc2 However, BTC\u8217\'20\'19s current \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook looks strong, as it faces stubborn resistance at $60,000 and $62,000. A break below current levels could see BTC drop below $57,000. A drop below this level could accelerate BTC\u8217\'20\'19s decline towards $50,000 and a retest of its $49,000 support level.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) is finding it challenging to push above the $2,700-$2,800 zone, with sellers defending upper levels fiercely. However, the price has found support around the $2,500 mark, with bulls preventing ETH from slipping below this price level. After a staggering drop that saw ETH hit a low of $2,131 on August 5, ETH managed to make a strong recovery and climbed above $2,500 on Thursday after an increase of almost 15% and settled at $2,684. However, the recovery lost steam as markets slipped into the red on Friday. As a result, ETH dropped by just over 3% to $2,601. The weekend remained \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , with ETH registering a marginal increase on Saturday before dropping by 2.09% to finish the weekend at $2,556.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/q4OsVt4a/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 With the market recovery on Monday, ETH registered an increase of 6.52%, pushing the price above $2,700 and settling at $2,723. However, with sellers defending upper levels, ETH has fallen back in the red during the ongoing session and is currently down by almost 3% and trading at $2,648. Buyers must keep ETH above $2,500 if any push above the $2,700-$2,800 zone is to materialize. Sellers are expected to mount a strong defense of this level. However, if buyers can push above them, it could open the doors to an ascent to the $3,000 level. However, if the price drops from the $2,800 level, ETH could drop to $2,500. If sellers manage to breach this support level, a drop towards $2,200 can be expected.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) is looking to reclaim the $150 price level to counter growing \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment. \uc2 SOL\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s breakout on Thursday saw the altcoin register a staggering jump of almost 13%, which allowed it to push above the $160 price mark and settle at $163. However, \uc2 SOL\uc2  turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as strong selling pressure at these levels pushed the price down over 4% on Friday to $156. \uc2 SOL\uc2  remained in the red on Saturday as well, dropping by 1.48% to settle at $154.11, managing to stay just above the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/17FeIHwl/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2  slipped below $150 on Sunday as \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified, driving the price down by 8.12% to $141.59. The price recovered on Monday, registering an increase of 4.79% to $146.38. Buyers attempted a move above $150, but intense selling pressure forced the price down, as can be seen in the price chart. The current session sees \uc2 SOL\uc2  marginally down as buyers and sellers attempt to take control. Bulls have failed to push \uc2 SOL\uc2  above the moving averages, indicating that sellers currently have the advantage.\par \par \uc2 If sellers take control, they will attempt to yank \uc2 SOL\uc2  towards the $130 support level. If this level is breached, \uc2 SOL\uc2  could drop towards $110. However, buyers are expected to defend both levels because a break could mark the beginning of increased selling pressure, which could drag SOL below $100. What happens if buyers take control? If buyers take control of the session, \uc2 SOL\uc2  will look to reclaim the $150 and $155 price levels. A break above both levels could open the door for a push above $160.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) registered a strong rally on Thursday, rising to $0.35 after an 8.32% increase. However, the price turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  after reaching this level, indicating strong selling on rallies. Bears drove the price to an intra-day low of $0.337 on Friday before buyers propped the price up to $0.349, a marginal decline compared to Thursday. After registering another marginal decline on Saturday, sellers took control after sellers failed to push above the resistance at $0.35 once again. As a result, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  dropped by 5.20% to $0.328. The price recovered on Monday, rising by 3.66% to $0.340.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/RI6ioqKl/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, it is back in the red during the current session and is down by just over 1%. Sellers will attempt to drag \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  towards $0.30. A break below this level could see \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  drop towards $0.25. If buyers are able to regain control and break above $0.35, it means sellers are losing momentum. In such a scenario, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could push up to $0.40.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash (BCH) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Cash (BCH) has been resilient in the face of several factors that could have negatively impacted its price. The altcoin is up almost 9% after enduring a testing time during the recent market downturn. However, it has recovered well, and even \uc2 Mt. Gox\uc2  payments involving BCH have not had too much of an adverse impact on its price. BCH has been trading between $300 and $370, facing strong upper-level resistance. BCH registered a strong recovery on Thursday after spending considerable time in the red, rising over 13% to $353. Buyers were able to push BCH to an intra-day high of $371, but sellers forced the price back down.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/PiMocfZu/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price saw a decline of 1.47% on Friday and an increase of 2.01% on Saturday to settle at $354. However, markets turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  once again on Sunday, as BCH fell over 7% to slip below $350 and settle at $329. A quick recovery followed on Monday, allowing BCH to erase the previous session\u8217\'20\'19s losses and climb to $355, an increase of 7.69%. The current session sees BCH down by almost 3% as bears took control after a failed push above the moving averages. If sellers continue to control the session, they could push the price down to $300, a level that buyers are expected to defend vigorously. Buyers could mount a move towards $400, but only if they can push the price above the moving averages, something they have failed to do so far.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) has been unable to make any substantial push above $0.100 as it faces considerable selling pressure at $0.110. After surging over 12% on Thursday, DOGE encountered selling pressure at higher levels. As a result, the price turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and DOGE dropped by almost 4% on Friday. Saturday saw a marginal recovery before the price fell back in the red, falling by 4,17% to $0.101. Despite selling pressure, buyers kept DOGE above $0.100.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/n3fsCyLm/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE registered a strong recovery on Monday, rising by 6.44% to $0.107. However, buyers were once again unsuccessful in pushing above $0.110. The current session sees DOGE down by almost 3% and trading at $0.104. If buyers push DOGE above $0.110, we could see the price move towards $0.120. However, a downturn and a break below $0.100 would suggest that sellers are in control.\par \par \uc2 Maker (MKR) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Maker (MKR) is struggling to reclaim the $2,000 price level as sellers look to drive the price towards $1,800 and below. MKR had been facing significant \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pressure, which saw its \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  from above $2,700 to a low of $1,757 on Wednesday. MKR recovered from this level, surging over 14% on Thursday to push above $2,000 and settle at $2,052. However, the price fell back on Friday due to significant selling pressure, dropping to $2,006. MKR continued to drop over the weekend by 1.59% on Saturday and 4.45% on Sunday to settle at $1,886.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/VpRNKcD1/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The current week began with MKR making a strong recovery, rising by almost 7% to move back above $2,000 and settle at $2,017. However, sellers have retaken control during the current session, pushing the price down by just over 1% to $1,995. MKR must break and close above $2,000 to recover the losses from the beginning of August. If the current selling pressure continues, MKR could drop back to $1,800.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240814ek8d00004\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 SUI, Zcash (ZEC) and Helium (HNT) outperform everything except memecoins \u8212\'20\'14 Here is why\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 976 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 August 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 A handful of altcoins are moving asymmetrically to the wider crypto market. Cointelegraph explains why.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvZTZlZDM2ZDctYjA5Zi00NDNkLWE4NTUtZWRlYWJkMDNjZGZkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SUI, Zcash (ZEC) and Helium (HNT) outperform everything except memecoins \u8212\'20\'14 Here is why}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price has rallied 6% over the past seven days, underperforming the broader crypto market, whose total value rose by nearly 10% in the same period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/bb52fb68-ab53-41f2-b97b-0630b6345516.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SUI, Zcash (ZEC) and Helium (HNT) outperform everything except memecoins \u8212\'20\'14 Here is why}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD weekly chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has seen modest gains over the last week for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 several reasons}}}\uc2 , but there are altcoins that have attained double digit returns over the same period.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s take a closer look at the three altcoins that are outperforming Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 SUI books a 100%+ gain\par \par \uc2 SUI ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/sui-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SUI}}}\uc2  ), the thirtieth-largest crypto by market cap, has outperformed Bitcoin over the last seven days, rising 109% from a low of $0.5349 on Aug. 6 to a five-week high of $1.118 on Aug. 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/4114b7f9-f0c5-41f3-86cf-739dfa548bcc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SUI, Zcash (ZEC) and Helium (HNT) outperform everything except memecoins \u8212\'20\'14 Here is why}}}\par \par \uc2 SUI/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/iMId0pNE/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 SUI\u8217\'20\'19s rally follows the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-bittensor-sui-trust-products-launch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launch of the Grayscale Sui Trust}}}\uc2  by Grayscale Investments on Aug. 7. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Grayscale/status/1821170731478356476"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 decision}}}\uc2  to add SUI to the company\u8217\'20\'19s portfolio is considered a vote of confidence in the future of the token, resulting in an increase in buying pressure witnessed over the last week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/221a1b47-fdf4-4c28-a3b7-bb4b9adedf10.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SUI, Zcash (ZEC) and Helium (HNT) outperform everything except memecoins \u8212\'20\'14 Here is why}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Grayscale/status/1821170731478356476"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Grayscale}}}\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-8-12-spx-dxy-btc-eth-bnb-sol-xrp-doge-ton-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/12: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 From a technical perspective, SUI has established a strong support at $0.86, which lies between the 50-day {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-trading-momentum-strategies-with-different-moving-averages"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 exponential moving average}}}\uc2  (EMA) at $0.8096 and the 100-day EMA at $0.9086.\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is sitting in the positive region at 64, suggesting that the market conditions still favor the upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/2cda207c-ab0d-45d3-b5db-cb726a6f77b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SUI, Zcash (ZEC) and Helium (HNT) outperform everything except memecoins \u8212\'20\'14 Here is why}}}\par \par \uc2 SUI/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/VwgZbADf/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 As a result of this technical setup, SUI\u8217\'20\'19s price could rise above the 200-day EMA at $0.9944 to revisit the local high at $1.118. Breaching this barrier could see SUI rise to retest the April 21 range high at $1.4355 over the next few days.\par \par \uc2 Helium\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s HNT is up more than 50%\par \par \uc2 Hemium\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/helium-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HNT}}}\uc2  price has surged over 50.98% over the last seven days. Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://subscription.cointelegraph.com/?_gl=1*7499wx*_ga*MTQ0MzQ0NzI4Ny4xNzE2MzY1NTA0*_ga_53R24TEEB1*MTcxNjM2NTUwNC4xLjEuMTcxNjM2Njg2MC4wLjAuMA.."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  shows that HNT rose from recent lows at $3.47 reached during the Aug. 5 market crash, rising as much as 104% to reach an intraday high of $7.11 on Aug. 13.\par \par \uc2 There was an increase in its trading volume, which has jumped by 86.6% from $13.78 million to $25.72 million between Aug. 6 and Aug. 13, reinforcing the intensity of the demand-side activity.\par \par \uc2 This surge follows a major {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/helium/status/1821968144422072814"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announcement}}}\uc2  that two prominent US carriers are conducting trials to offload their mobile traffic to the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/depin-helium-mobile-post-roadmap-progress-update"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Helium Network}}}\uc2 , potentially leading to a shift toward a more decentralized network infrastructure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/ae33a8d9-1570-41e0-bef4-2866bc4a4841.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SUI, Zcash (ZEC) and Helium (HNT) outperform everything except memecoins \u8212\'20\'14 Here is why}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/helium/status/1821968144422072814"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Helium}}}\par \par \uc2 The tests showed positive results and are a major step in \uc2 Helium\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s mission to decentralize network infrastructure.\par \par \uc2 This development has sparked renewed interest in Helium, driving up demand and prices.\par \par \uc2 Technically, HNT price action had produced a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/golden-cross-vs-death-cross-explained"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 golden cross}}}\uc2  on the daily chart, indicating that high \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could continue driving the token higher. The value of the RSI at 68, close to the overbought region reinforces buyers\u8217\'20\'19 dominance in the market.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/be5b8fc6-f078-4fc0-9570-36e3c13cb542.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SUI, Zcash (ZEC) and Helium (HNT) outperform everything except memecoins \u8212\'20\'14 Here is why}}}\par \par \uc2 HNT/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/exlv8xG0/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 HNT price may continue the uptrend, rising toward its March 2024 range high at $9.60. A decisive close above this level could have bulls retest its multi-year high at $11.16 as their next upside target.\par \par \uc2 Zcash jumps 51%\par \par \uc2 Zcash ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/zec-price-index#:~:text=%2436.89&text=This%20chart%20shows%20the%20price%20only%20in%20USD."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ZEC}}}\uc2  ) has jumped 51.15% over the last seven days, from a low of $29 on Aug. 6 to an intraday high of $44 on Aug. 13. This rally is largely fueled by a push for a hybrid {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/proof-of-authority-vs-proof-of-stake-key-differences-explained"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 proof-of-stake}}}\uc2  (PoS) upgrade by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/what-is-zcash-zec"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Zcash}}}\uc2  founder, Zooko Wilcox, upon {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-price-up-95-december-avax-inj-near-even-higher"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 joining Shielded Labs}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In a blog post on Aug. 10, Wilcox {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://medium.com/@zooko/zcash-is-winning-48579b89770e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  that after eight years of using proof-of-work (PoW) mining, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/privacy-tokens-under-attack-aleph-zero"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 privacy currency}}}\uc2  needs to move to a proof-of-work and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/delegated-proof-of-stake-dpos-explained"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 proof-of-stake}}}\uc2  protocol.\par \par \uc2 This development received support from Tyler Winklevoss, co-founder of Gemini Exchange. Winklevoss has openly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/tyler/status/1822741558992543949"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 supported}}}\uc2  Zcash, describing it as one of the "most important and underrated" crypto projects available.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/a5f03026-815e-4573-8091-b7d5c267c733.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SUI, Zcash (ZEC) and Helium (HNT) outperform everything except memecoins \u8212\'20\'14 Here is why}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/tyler/status/1822741558992543949"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tyler Winklevoss}}}\par \par \uc2 A hybrid model aims to solve problems brought on by the PoW mechanism, by opening up staking opportunities for ZEC holders and further reducing the circulating supply, stabilizing its value and positively impacting ZEC price.\par \par \uc2 From a technical point of view, ZEC risks correction due to its overbought status. Notably, the token\u8217\'20\'19s daily \uc2 RSI\uc2  reading has been above 70 since Aug. 9. At the same time, its price is trading near a stubborn resistance at $44, raising its possibilities of undergoing a correction or consolidation phase next.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/18e95249-05a8-45e9-a2b0-60fb284b738f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SUI, Zcash (ZEC) and Helium (HNT) outperform everything except memecoins \u8212\'20\'14 Here is why}}}\par \par \uc2 ZEC/USD daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/4iStkyQd/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A pullback from the current level could have traders eye a decline toward the 23.6% Fibonacci retracement level at $39.68.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvZTZlZDM2ZDctYjA5Zi00NDNkLWE4NTUtZWRlYWJkMDNjZGZkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240813ek8d000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/12: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,704 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 August 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls are struggling to hold BTC price above $60,000 and this week's tranche of economic data could complicate their efforts.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvYTQ4ZDViOTQtZTA3NS00NDk0LWJjMzMtNWE2NWM1NzQ5MTQxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/12: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 (SPX) Index rebounded sharply from its intra-week lows to end the week on a flat note. Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) also made a similar recovery from its weekly lows to finish with marginal gains of about 1%. The failure of the bears to capitalize on the weakness suggests that the lower levels are attracting buyers.\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to deepen the pullback on Aug. 12, but the bulls purchased the dip in Bitcoin and are trying to maintain the price above the psychological level of $60,000. Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  is keeping traders on the edge. The Crypto Fear & Greed Index, which hit a low of 17/100 on Aug. 6, rose to 48/100 on Aug. 9 and is again {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/more-extreme-fear-ftx-crash-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 back into the extreme fear zone}}}\uc2  at 25/100 on Aug. 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/c8cd4ee5-ba05-4ba7-a946-15927d510a59.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/12: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The next big question is will the recovery sustain? Inflows into the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds have been sketchy over the past few days, indicating uncertainty among investors. Another short-term negative is that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-drops-below-59k-institutional-stablecoin-pause"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 institutions seem to have halted their stablecoin purchase}}}\uc2 , according to onchain analytics platform Lookonchain.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins extend their up move, or will higher levels attract sellers? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index is attempting a recovery that is likely to face resistance at the 20-day exponential moving average (5,393).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/ca41bef4-0b71-42ac-97c1-152e4f0e0799.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/12: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA but finds support at 5,265, it will indicate that the selling pressure has reduced. That will increase the possibility of a break above the moving averages. The index may then climb to 5,566.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are selling on rallies. A break below 5,265 will increase the risk of a break below 5,119. The next support on the downside is at 5,000.\par \par \uc2 US Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The US Dollar Index (DXY) has been trading below the moving averages for the past few days, indicating that the bears have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/e8a14553-624a-4386-8508-502e2125903e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/12: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push the price back into the channel on Aug. 8, but the bears held their ground. This suggests that the bears are trying to flip the support line into resistance. If they do that, the index may decline to 102.16.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated if the price turns up and re-enters the channel. That will indicate the markets have rejected the lower levels. The index may then rise to the 50-day simple moving average (104.63).\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down from the moving averages on Aug. 11, indicating that the bears are not willing to give up without a fight.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/1dd360cb-10e5-4f6e-8c4b-17863896bc5d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/12: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The $55,724 level is the crucial support to watch out for on the downside. If this level breaks down, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. That will open the doors for a fall to $49,000.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the bulls push the price above the moving averages, it will signal buying on dips. The BTC/USDT pair may then start its march toward $70,000. The sellers are expected to fiercely defend the $70,000 to $73,777 zone.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are finding it difficult to push Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $2,753, but they have not allowed the price to dip below $2,500.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/02dc5639-6a8d-4e32-b59a-516a8a023e25.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/12: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers overcome the obstacle at $2,724, the ETH/USDT pair is likely to jump to the breakdown level of $2,850. This level is expected to attract solid selling by the bears, but if the bulls prevail, the pair may reach the 50-day SMA ($3,145).\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from $2,850, it will signal that the bears have flipped the level into resistance. That may start a move down to the strong support of $2,500 and then to $2,300.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) recovery hit a wall at the 20-day EMA ($529) on Aug. 11, indicating that the bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/4e7c3ffb-bfcb-44ac-b68b-24a8c930c7f2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/12: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to tug the price below the $495 support on Aug. 12, but the bulls successfully defended the level. Buyers are again trying to push the price above the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the BNB/USDT pair will attempt a move toward $600.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA and breaks below $495, it will suggest intense selling pressure. The pair may slump to $460, which is an important level to watch out for because a break below it may start a downtrend to $400.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to maintain Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the moving averages suggests that the bears are trying to gain the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/4550a83f-f869-4d40-ae16-93c4ec59fbc7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/12: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers will try to pull the price to $129 and then to $116. Buyers are expected to fiercely defend the $116 level because a break and close below it will signal the start of a downward move to $100 and then $80.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up from the current level or the support zone, it will suggest that the bulls are aggressively buying at lower levels. A break above $164 could propel the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair to $189.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down and broke below the 20-day EMA ($0.57) on Aug. 11, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/ec4ace3d-61aa-4c41-b9fc-617717714d49.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/12: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest that the XRP/USDT pair may remain inside the $0.41 to $0.64 range for some more time. There is minor support at the 50-day SMA ($0.53), but if this level crumbles, the pair may plummet to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if buyers push and maintain the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair may climb to $0.64. This is a crucial resistance to watch out for because a break and close above it will clear the path for a rally to $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-solana-sol-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Solana (SOL) price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) pulled back to the 20-day EMA ($0.11) on Aug. 11, but the bulls could not overcome this barrier.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/0ec100b8-74af-481d-bea1-4ee7c0f89cc6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/12: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor advantage for the bulls is that they did not allow the price to dip below $0.10. This suggests that every minor dip is being purchased. Buyers are again attempting to shove the price above the 20-day EMA. If they can pull it off, the DOGE/USDT pair may rise to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA and breaks below $0.10, it will suggest that the bears are in control. The pair may slump to $0.09 and eventually to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers could not push Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day SMA ($6.97), indicating selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/0dba5dee-0a7a-4868-b49e-c870a280606f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/12: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($6.41) has flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. Buyers will have to push the price above the 50-day SMA to gain the upper hand. The TON/USDT pair may then rally to $7.65 and eventually to $8.29.\par \par \uc2 The immediate support on the downside is $6. If this level cracks, the selling may pick up, and the pair could drop to $5.26.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.36) on Aug. 10, indicating that minor relief rallies are being sold into.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/39a8e46b-476b-4329-81a2-7e23b9da94f1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/12: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price to $0.31 and, after that, to the critical support at $0.24. Buyers are expected to defend this level with all their might because a slide below it may sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair to $0.20 and $0.18.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price continues higher and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bulls are on a comeback. The pair could then rise to the downtrend line. If bulls overcome this barrier, it will signal the start of a new up move.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvYTQ4ZDViOTQtZTA3NS00NDk0LWJjMzMtNWE2NWM1NzQ5MTQxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240812ek8c000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
