\par\par \b \uc2 Amidst Market  \highlight22\uc2 Volatility \highlight\uc2 : Current Key Insights on the Top 5 Cryptocurrencies\b0\par\par\uc2 Adrian Barkley \par \uc2 828 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 August 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin Shows \b  \highlight22Bullish\b0 \highlight22  Potential Despite Minor Dips}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum Price Movement Suggests Bears Are Still in Control}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Shows Stable Growth Amid Market Uncertainty}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Toncoin Price Movement: Are Bulls Still in Play?}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Tests Bulls' Patience Amid Market Uncertainty}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Conclusion}}}\par \par \uc2 As the crypto market experiences significant fluctuations, understanding the top-performing digital assets becomes crucial. This article delves into the latest developments of the leading cryptocurrencies. It uncovers which ones are showing strong potential for future gains. Readers will discover which coins to keep an eye on during these unpredictable times.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Shows \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Potential Despite Minor Dips\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/2019-pattern-repeats-analysts-forecast-bitcoins-all-time-high-best-memecoins-to-buy-now-for-maximize-profits-on-bull-run"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin's price}}}\uc2  currently ranges between $53,848 and $66,333, suggesting a tug of war between bulls and bears. Despite a slight dip of 1.12% over the past week, the coin has surged nearly 27% in the last six months. Trading above its 10-day and 100-day moving averages, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s RSI of 60.34 hints at lingering \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. Bulls eye breaking through the resistance at $74,365, aiming for the sky-high mark of $86,851 - a potential boost of 44%. If Bitcoin holds above the support level at $49,394, investors remain hopeful for continued growth.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinMarcketCap}}}\par \par \uc2 Ethereum Price Movement Suggests Bears Are Still in Control\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/crypto-price-analysis-8-9-btc-eth-sol-xrp-doge-avax-sei"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH)}}}\uc2  is trading between $2418 and $3179, showing signs of bear dominance. The 10-day moving average is close to $2613, suggesting short-term sluggishness. The \uc2 RSI\uc2  near 60 hints at neither overbought nor oversold conditions. Despite a 6-month gain of around 5%, recent downturns of 11.74% in the past week and 14.91% over the month show weakness. Resistance looms at $3669, and if it breaks, ETH might climb to around $4430, a rise of about 30%. However, if support at $2148 fails, it could tumble towards $1387, a drop exceeding 40%.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinMarcketCap}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Shows Stable Growth Amid Market Uncertainty\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/solana-aiming-for-new-highs-after-reclaiming-150-rollblock-and-wif-price-see-huge-jumps"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL)}}}\uc2  continues its steady rise, currently priced between $115 and $177.76. The cryptocurrency has grown by over 44% in six months and about 9% in the past month. However, its Simple Moving Average (SMA) for the last 10 days is slightly above the 100-day average, signaling upward momentum. The nearest resistance level is around $217.24, while support rests at $91.94. With the Relative Strength Index (RSI) sitting near a neutral 51.26 and MACD slightly negative, buyers seem more active than sellers. If \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum continues, \uc2 SOL\uc2  could rise to its first resistance level, representing a potential gain of 30%.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/solana/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinMarcketCap}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin Price Movement: Are Bulls Still in Play?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/altcoin-special-can-render-recover-is-the-ton-rally-finished"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Toncoin (TON)}}}\uc2  is trading between $5.54 and $6.68. The bulls and bears are both at play. Bulls are pushing for higher prices, but immediate resistance looms at $7.36. If they clear that, $8.50 is the next big hurdle. The \uc2 RSI\uc2  and Stochastic indicators, both high, suggest potential overbought conditions. This could indicate a cooldown soon. However, the coin has risen 227% in the past six months, showing strong past growth. For now, watch out for price fluctuations between support at $5.08 and resistance at $7.36. A break above $7.36 might lead to a 22% increase to hit the $8.50 mark.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/toncoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinMarcketCap}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Tests Bulls' Patience Amid Market Uncertainty\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/are-solana-sol-and-cardano-ada-on-track-to-upstage-bitcoin-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano}}}\uc2  is currently trading between $0.31 and $0.40, showing a mixed picture. Bears seem to have the upper hand with a recent weekly drop of over 4%. The nearest resistance is at $0.46, while the nearest support lies at $0.28. If \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  can break past $0.46, it has the potential to rise to $0.55, a jump of roughly 38%. However, if it falls below $0.28, it could slide down to $0.18. The 10-day and 100-day moving averages are close, suggesting sideways movement, while the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is mildly \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 56.37. Overall, the market lacks clear direction, making \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's short-term growth potential uncertain.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinMarcketCap}}}\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 In the face of market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , key cryptocurrencies show varying degrees of potential. Bitcoin remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  despite minor dips, with a possible 44% gain if it breaks $74,365. Ethereum is under bear control, but could rise 30% if it surpasses $3,669, though it risks a 40% drop if support fails. \uc2 Solana\uc2  shows stable growth with a potential 30% increase if \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum continues. Toncoin may see a 22% gain if it clears $7.36 but is near overbought territory. Cardano presents mixed signals, with potential for a 38% rise or a significant drop, depending on market direction.\par \par \uc2 Investors should closely monitor these resistance and support levels to navigate the current market landscape effectively.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240811ek8a00006\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,630 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 August 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recovery has brought the bulls back in the game, but the bears are unlikely to give up without a fight.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvZDJhNWM2MjctNTlkMy00ZjVkLWJkOGYtZWE1MjY4MGQxODU2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is close to completing a death cross, where the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) falls below the 200-day SMA. Although the death cross is believed to be \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , analyst Timothy Peterson said in a post on X that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-s-impending-death-cross-might-not-be-so-deadly-for-btc-bulls-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin has recorded a median return of 18%}}}\uc2 , two months after the eight death cross occurrences since 2015.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin whales also seem to be sensing a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook. Whales with total holdings between 10 and 1,000 Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whale-transactions-highest-level-since-april-crypto-black-monday"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 aggressively purchased on Aug. 5 and Aug. 6}}}\uc2 . However, the same cannot be said for the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds buyers who sold during those two days, resulting in a net outflow, per Farside Investors data.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/ecaffe7f-9ad5-4ded-be5f-c97b0a5c597f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The panic selling and the subsequent recovery in Bitcoin in the past few days suggest that the bulls and the bears are battling it out for supremacy. The price action is likely to remain volatile in the near term until a new directional move begins.\par \par \uc2 Will buyers drive Bitcoin toward $70,000, or could bears pull the price to $55,000? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled Bitcoin below $55,724 on Aug. 7, but the bulls bought the dip and pushed the price to the moving averages on Aug. 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/47bf920f-a6f1-476f-828e-19e1726d80f2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are unwilling to give up without a fight and are defending the moving averages. If the price continues lower from the current level, the BTC/USDT pair could retest the solid support at $55,724.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if buyers do not give up much ground from the moving averages, it will suggest that every minor dip is being purchased. That will improve the prospects of a rally to the $70,000 to $73,777 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned up sharply on Aug. 8 and broke above the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $2,602, indicating solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/a2118850-df40-4359-915a-7c35b355256a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to extend the recovery to the breakdown level of $2,850, which is expected to behave as a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from $2,850, it will suggest that the bears are trying to flip the level into resistance. The ETH/USDT pair could then turn down toward $2,111, where buyers will try to arrest the decline.\par \par \uc2 Buying near $2,111 and selling close to $2,850 could result in a range-bound action for a few days. The bulls will be back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat on a break above the 50-day SMA ($3,197).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to sink BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) below the $460 level attracted buyers, who pushed the price above $495 on Aug. 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/78e9d6ba-7561-4496-86d4-155b8d866e76.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($533) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory suggest that the bears are at an advantage. Sellers will try to pull the price back below $495 and retest the critical support at $460.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below $460 will signal the start of a downtrend. The BNB/USDT pair could plunge to $400 and thereafter to $360. On the contrary, a break above the moving averages will extend the stay inside the range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rallied and closed above the 20-day EMA ($157) on Aug. 8, indicating solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/1907c64c-0b16-4a32-ad5c-80a6e3754430.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest that the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT may continue consolidating for the next few days. If the price maintains above the 20-day EMA, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could reach the overhead resistance of $189. This level is expected to pose a solid challenge to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a break and close below the moving averages will suggest that the bears are selling on rallies. The pair could then slump toward $116.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) soared above the moving averages and reached the overhead resistance of $0.64 on Aug. 7, signaling aggressive buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/d064dc6e-b68c-4042-991e-574ac0dd8a47.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to stall the up move at $0.64, but a minor advantage in favor of the bulls is that they have not allowed the price to dip below the 20-day EMA ($0.57). If the price turns up from the current level, it will improve the prospects of a rally above $0.64. The XRP/USDT pair may then reach $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break and close below the 20-day EMA will signal that the pair may remain stuck between $0.41 and $0.64 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) remains in a downtrend, but the bulls are trying to start a recovery to the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/1629e17d-faf4-4ea4-b4d1-23a4a3f94fbe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers are likely to face stiff resistance at the breakdown level of $0.12, but if they prevail, the DOGE/USDT pair could start a rally to $0.14. The bears are expected to defend this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 The $0.09 support is an essential level to watch out for on the downside. If bears tug the price below $0.09, the pair may drop to the crucial support at $0.08. This level is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) picked up momentum after it broke above the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $5.81 on Aug. 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/43acdbb9-ce7b-4733-9c07-308d7f41464f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls continued their buying on Aug. 9 and pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($6.39). This suggests that the bears are losing their grip. The TON/USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($7.02) and eventually to the stiff overhead resistance of $8.29. Sellers are expected to defend this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 The pair is likely to remain stuck inside the large range between $4.72 and $8.29. A break above or below the range could start the next trending move.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whale-games-traders-12k-btc-appears-for-sale"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin whale games get traders nervous as 12K BTC appears for sale}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is trying to move up, but it is likely to face strong selling at the 20-day EMA ($0.37) and again at the 50-day SMA ($0.39).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/f1801040-04da-475f-99c0-e990db362b04.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears want to retain control, they will have to defend the moving averages and pull the price lower. Minor support is at $0.30, but if this level cracks, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could reach $0.24.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, if buyers propel the price above the moving averages, the pair could reach the downtrend line. The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to signal a potential trend change in the short term.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) back above $21.80 on Aug. 8 but are struggling to sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/4e027faa-5d81-4720-aef0-fe8eb3f8b801.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($24.16) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory suggest that the bears have the upper hand. If the price turns down and maintains below $21.80, the bears will try to sink the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair to $19.51 and then to $17.29.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if buyers drive the price above the 20-day EMA, it will signal solid demand at lower levels. The pair may rise to the 50-day SMA ($26.26) and later to the breakdown level of $29.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) has pulled back toward the moving averages, signaling that the bulls are attempting a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/25b76449-3ee1-4159-a3a5-49fda3e95b02.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are expected to defend the moving averages because a break and close above it will open the doors for a rally to the breakdown level of $0.000020. Such a move will signal that the markets have rejected the lower levels.\par \par \uc2 If the SHIB/USDT pair turns down sharply from the moving averages, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then try to yank the price down to $0.000010.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvZDJhNWM2MjctNTlkMy00ZjVkLWJkOGYtZWE1MjY4MGQxODU2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240809ek89000bb\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin Reserve\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin as a US reserve asset is \u8216\'20\'18great for price\u8217\'20\'19 but poses significant risks \u8212\'20\'14 \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Zoltan Vardai \par \uc2 669 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 August 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 US Bitcoin reserve plan could boost prices but risks centralization, warns \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 . 19% of Bitcoin supply controlled by \uc2 US Treasury\uc2  may pose significant risks.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvNDMyYThhYTMtMDJlZC00OTE4LTg5Y2QtYmNmZGU3MzYwNzYxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin as a US reserve asset is \u8216\'20\'18great for price\u8217\'20\'19 but poses significant risks \u8212\'20\'14 Charles Hoskinson}}}\par \par \uc2 The idea of Bitcoin becoming the reserve asset of the United States poses significant centralization risks for the world\u8217\'20\'19s first cryptocurrency despite being an optimistic price catalyst, according to \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Making Bitcoin a reserve asset for the US was recently floated by presidential candidate Robert F. Kennedy Junior, who said that he would sign an executive order for the \uc2 US Treasury\uc2  to purchase a total of 4 million Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) worth over $242 billion at today\u8217\'20\'19s valuation.\par \par \uc2 Notably, that would represent 19% of the Bitcoin supply, said \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 , co-founder of Input Output Global and Cardano.\par \par \uc2 Hoskinson told Cointelegraph:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt's a mixed bag. On one hand, it would be great for the price of Bitcoin, and it would be great for U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Bitcoin because the United States would be pro-Bitcoin in a certain respect.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has recently staged a 21% recovery above the $60,000 mark after this week\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/top-50-cryptos-lose-2024-gains-510b-selloff"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $510 billion crypto market sell-off}}}\uc2  nuked BTC price to a five-month low of $49,500 on Aug. 5, before the market started to recover.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tether-usdt-mint-bitcoin-65k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tether mints $1.3B USDT since market bottom \u8212\'20\'14 Can it push Bitcoin above $65K?}}}\par \par \uc2 US could influence geopolitical power over Bitcoin\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s decentralized supply distribution is among its core benefits, which makes the world\u8217\'20\'19s first cryptocurrency tamper-proof and secure.\par \par \uc2 However, the US holding 19% of BTC supply could introduce unwanted consequences, warned Hoskinson:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COn the other hand, it also means that if things happen the US disagrees with, because it has a strategic interest in the asset, it may use its geopolitical power to change that. So be careful who you welcome in, and be careful of the powers of those people\u8230\'20\'26\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 As of Aug. 9, the largest single Bitcoin wallet holds 1.26% of the supply, or 248,000 BTC worth $15 billion. The wallet belongs to \uc2 Binance\uc2 , the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest crypto exchange, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://bitinfocharts.com/top-100-richest-bitcoin-addresses.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according}}}\uc2  to Bitinfocharts.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/3cdfad13-4b0e-41e2-9d2c-2da87aa90de9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin as a US reserve asset is \u8216\'20\'18great for price\u8217\'20\'19 but poses significant risks \u8212\'20\'14 Charles Hoskinson}}}\par \par \uc2 Top 10 Richest Bitcoin Addresses. Source: Bitinfocharts\par \par \uc2 While the exact implications of the US holding a majority of the Bitcoin supply aren\u8217\'20\'19t clear, this is usually a sign of concern with other global assets, explained Hoskinson:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CTraditionally, this is done by conventional regulators, especially with commodities. We don't like the idea of somebody buying up 20% of the world's oil supply or something like that. So that would be a cartel.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/lamborghini-animoca-brands-web3-engagement"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Wen Lambo? Lamborghini answers with new Animoca Web3 partnership}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto ETFs open retail access to digital assets: Hoskinson\par \par \uc2 The new Bitcoin and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/different-types-of-etfs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 exchange-traded funds (ETFs)}}}\uc2  make cryptocurrency more accessible to retail investors, said Hoskinson:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThey\u8217\'20\'19re going to make it more accessible to certain geographies, certain age groups, and also certain risk profiles. And that\u8217\'20\'19s where Wall Street makes all of its money.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Moreover, the crypto ETF floodgates have opened on Wall Street and Hoskinson expects an array of new crypto ETFs in the future, including an \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) ETF. He added:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CYou can't stop people from buying or creating financial products to aggregate things together or allow accessibility to happen. So ETFs are an organic thing, and they occur after the markets reach a certain level of maturity, both in terms of participation and \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the European markets could pave the way for the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/european-markets-first-ether-staking-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 first Ether staking ETF}}}\uc2 , which would signal another significant development for \b \highlight22\uc2 crypto adoption\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Charles d\u8217\'20\'19Haussy, CEO of the dYdX Foundation, told Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/china-crypto-ban-investors/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 How Chinese traders and miners get around China\u8217\'20\'19s \b  \highlight22crypto ban\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvNDMyYThhYTMtMDJlZC00OTE4LTg5Y2QtYmNmZGU3MzYwNzYxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240809ek890008h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
