\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 8-8 BTC, ETH, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , TON, DOT,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , WIF\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 2,354 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 August 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Time To Accumulate BTC And ETH?}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 What Next For The Crypto Markets?}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Toncoin (TON) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogwifhat (WIF) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 The recovery in the crypto markets has lost steam, with Bitcoin (BTC) and Ethereum (ETH) struggling to push above resistance levels, indicating that sellers are active at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 Markets are expected to remain volatile in the face of continued economic uncertainties, although analysts believe the downside may be limited. Some analysts have also suggested that the dip in major cryptocurrencies presents an excellent buying opportunity for investors.\par \par \uc2 Bitwise Chief Investment Officer \uc2 Matt Hougan\uc2  suggested investors ignore short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and price cues and instead focus on long-term investing, especially when it comes to BTC.\par \par \uc2 Time To Accumulate BTC And ETH?\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s (BTC) drop saw several leverage trades flushed out, with some market watchers hinting that panic selling could have resulted in a short-term bottom for BTC and ETH. According to QCP Capital, it is an excellent time to start thinking about accumulating BTC and ETH. However, there are contrasting views, with another set of analysts, such as 10x Head of Research, Markus Thielen, who believes that a good entry point for BTC is in the low $40,000 zone, from where the cryptocurrency could attempt a significant rally.\par \par \uc2 David Gokhstein, the founder of Gokhstein Media, shares this opinion, stating that a drop to $50,000 or $40,000 is an excellent opportunity to buy BTC. However, the broader crypto markets do not look too optimistic. The Bitcoin bull-bear market cycle indicator has flashed a bear signal for the first time since January 2023. According to CryptoQuant founder Ki Young Ju, if this indicator remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for two weeks or more, it could suggest a sustained \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  phase.\par \par \uc2 What Next For The Crypto Markets?\par \par \uc2 The dramatic selloff in the crypto markets over the weekend and Monday left investors spooked and tested Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s reputation as a safe haven asset. The crypto selloff proved that BTC isn\u8217\'20\'19t as cut off from price swings in the traditional markets as once thought. Many questioned the asset\u8217\'20\'19s reputation of \u8220\'20\'1Cdigital gold.\u8221\'20\'1D As stock markets crashed, the crypto markets were also impacted, with BTC dropping over 18% and slipping below $50,000. While it eventually recovered to push back above $55,000, it remains some way off from the previous week\u8217\'20\'19s levels.\par \par \uc2 ETH registered a dramatic fall as well, almost slipping below $2,100. Hougan urged traders to watch for signs such as forced crypto liquidations, the financial health of major crypto firms, and inflows/outflows for spot crypto ETFs. According to Grayscale\u8217\'20\'19s Head of Research, \uc2 Zach Pandl\uc2 , BTC will decline to some extent should there be a recession in the US.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDownside risks to token prices are lower than in the previous cycle, in our view, due to relatively low altcoin valuations, limited credit/leverage in crypto markets, and institutional demand for spot #Bitcoin and #Ethereum ETPs.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 However, analysts at Bernstein were more optimistic, stating,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf rate cuts and monetary liquidity is the usual template response to US recession fears, we expect \u8216\'20\'18hard assets\u8217\'20\'19 such as bitcoin (digital gold) to reprice up.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/crypto-price-analysis-8-7-btc-eth-sol-doge-bch-uni-mkr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s (BTC)}}}\uc2  recovery has stalled around the $57,000 price level, indicating the presence of sellers at this price point. While BTC\u8217\'20\'19s recovery from multi-month lows is a relief for investors, the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest cryptocurrency still faces significant challenges ahead. The short-term outlook remains choppy, although accumulation by BTC whales suggests a strong belief in the asset\u8217\'20\'19s long-term prospects. Data shows that whales bought over 358,000 BTC in July, with the trend continuing into August.\par \par \uc2 However, BTC\u8217\'20\'19s recent price movements have concerned some market observers who sense market uncertainty despite the asset recovering from its multi-month lows. The price chart shows BTC\u8217\'20\'19s recovery stalling around the $57,100 mark, with sellers active at these levels preventing a sustained price increase. According to trading resource Material Indicators, markets could go either way given current buy and sell liquidity. With current market sentiment, it\u8217\'20\'19s no wonder BTC traders have adopted a wait-and-watch approach. QCP Capital has also communicated to traders to monitor macro correlations.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhile the initial shock may have passed, we foresee continued selling pressure in the coming days as systematic funds continue to pare exposure in light of the heightened \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . We recommend keeping a close eye on Nasdaq, Nikkei, and USDJPY as cross-asset correlations remain high in the near term.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Looking at the price chart, we can see BTC\u8217\'20\'19s collapse on Monday, which saw the price dip to a low of $49,351. The price recovered from this level as demand picked up at lower levels, allowing BTC to settle at $54,274. As markets recovered on Tuesday, BTC registered an increase of 3.50% and climbed above $55,000 to settle at $56,172. However, its recovery stalled on Wednesday, indicating that sellers were still active. The price fell by 1.83% after sellers thwarted a move towards $60,000 and settled at $55,144. The current session sees BTC up by just over 4% as it looks to consolidate above $57,000 and set itself up for a push to $60,000.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/aqSBbmou/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to maintain the recovery, they must consolidate above $57,000. A close above this level could allow BTC to push towards $60,000. However, if the price turns \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , it could drop below $55,000, possibly sliding to $50,000. If BTC drops but stays above the $49,000-$50,000 level, it would indicate a bottom has been made, and we could see a strong rebound from these levels. However, bulls must defend this level, as losing it could open the doors to a drop below $45,000.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s relief rally has also stalled as it struggles to get past $2,500. ETH opened the week with a significant crash of 9.95% as the price tumbled on the back of a marketwide selloff. ETH hit a low of $2,131 before recovering and settling at $2,421. The price recovered on Tuesday as markets showed signs of recovery, with ETH hitting a high of $2,554. However, with sellers still active, ETH\u8217\'20\'19s recovery stalled, with sellers forcing the price back below $2,500 and settling at $2,464. ETH fell back in the red on Wednesday as sellers attempted to drive the price back below $2,400. ETH eventually settled at $2,343, a drop of almost 5%.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/YjfMlHvM/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The current session sees ETH up by 3.77%, recovering and moving back above the $2,400 price level. While ETH is struggling, on-chain data has shown signs of bullishness. Spot Ethereum ETFs recorded inflows of 44,447 ETH worth around $110 million on Wednesday. Additionally, data from Santiment has shown increased activity in long-dormant wallets. ETH retains considerable buyer interest at the $2,100 level. As such, it is crucial that bulls keep the price above this level to see sustained \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum that could fuel a move above $2,500 to $2,800. If both these levels are surpassed, the next level of resistance sits at $3,000.\par \par \uc2 However, this outlook would be invalidated if ETH slips below $2,000. Such a scenario would bring $2,000 into focus. Bulls must keep ETH above this level to prevent a price breakdown.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) impressive recovery has continued, with the altcoin rallying 39% from its crash low to surpassing the $150 mark. The market crash saw \uc2 SOL\uc2  hit a low of $110, only to make a stunning recovery in subsequent sessions. \uc2 SOL\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s recovery can be gauged by looking at the chart, with the price already at its pre-weekend levels. After slipping below $150 over the weekend, \uc2 SOL\uc2  and other cryptocurrencies crashed on Monday, hitting a low of $109. However, it recovered to some extent on Monday itself, as lower-level demand pushed the price up to $129.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/sahkGwMG/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2  skyrocketed on Tuesday, surging by 11.33% to settle at $144, but faced substantial \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday. Buyers pushed the price to a high of $155 on Wednesday but lost momentum at higher levels, allowing bears to capitalize and drive the price back below $150 to $144.77. However, \uc2 SOL\uc2  has recovered during the current session and is up by over 6% to push above the 50 and 200-day SMAs and the $150 mark. If \uc2 SOL\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s current rally continues, it could attempt to go above $160. However, sellers are expected to defend this level. If sentiment does turn \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , sellers will try to drive the price to $120. On the other hand, a break above $160 could open the doors for a potential move towards $180. For this to happen, \uc2 SOL\uc2  must close above $150.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) has surged past the resistance at $6.04, hitting pre-weekend levels as the altcoin makes a strong recovery despite facing a significant pullback on Tuesday. TON hit a low of $4.86 on Monday as markets crumbled. However, it rebounded quickly, suggesting that bulls were aggressively defending the level. Buyers pushed TON back above $5, allowing it to settle at $5.30. Bulls took control on Tuesday, as the price surged by almost 10% to $5.81. Buyers did attempt to move above $6, but with sellers active at this level, TON fell back below $6.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/aqMF4KZT/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment returned on Wednesday as TON dropped by 6.51% to $5.43. However, TON has surged by a staggering 17.56% during the current session, as buyers eye $6.50 after breaking past the $6.04 resistance. Analysts had expected a steady upswing to $6.50 if TON could push above $6, but the current rally has defied expectations. If TON\u8217\'20\'19s current rally remains intact, it could surge past $6.50 as well and set itself up for a move to $7. However, if sellers are able to reverse the price, we could see a drop back to $6.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) plunged during the market rout on Monday, dipping to its multi-year support of $3.6. Selling pressure on Monday pushed DOT down by over 10% to $4.21. However, sellers had managed to drive the price below $4 to a low of $3.61 before demand picked up. DOT recovered and pushed back above $4 to close at $4.21. As markets recovered, so did DOT, registering an increase of just over 7% to settle at $4.51. The price increased to $4.58 on Tuesday and is up by almost 4% during the current session as buyers look to reclaim $5.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/zn84U1Ue/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT\u8217\'20\'19s support at $3.6 has been intact since October 2020, with the bottom being established just before DOT\u8217\'20\'19s staggering 233% rally. The long tail behind the candle on Monday shows the strength of demand at this level, allowing DOT to rebound above $4. DOT\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 RSI\uc2  is also just above the oversold zone, meaning DOT\u8217\'20\'19s availability at discounted prices is attracting buyer interest. Network activity on DOT has also picked up, according to data from into-the-block. Active addresses on Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s Relay Chain have also increased from 5,630 to 7,030.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has been trading in a downward trend since July 21. However, \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment increased over the weekend and Monday as markets underwent a significant correction. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  dropped to a low of $0.277 on Monday before buyers could prop the price back above $3 to $0.312. Bulls attempted a relief rally on Tuesday, and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose by 6.41% to $0.332. However, bulls lost momentum, and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell back in the red on Wednesday, dropping by 2.41% to $0.324. The current session sees \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  up by 3.40%. If buyers can sustain momentum, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could move above $0.350.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/M9dOrlpi/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A close above this level could allow \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  to test the resistance around the 20 and 50-day SMAs. However, if the price turns \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , it could retrace back to $0.300.\par \par \uc2 Dogwifhat (WIF) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogwifhat (WIF) and other Solana-based meme coins have seen a sharp recovery as \uc2 SOL\uc2  made a staggering recovery following Monday\u8217\'20\'19s crash. WIF, which was trading in the red since July 22, has registered a 22% jump after weeks of decline. Like other altcoins and meme coins, WIF collapsed on Monday, dropping by almost 13%. The popular meme coin nearly lost the $1 level as sellers yanked the price to a low of $1.07. However, it recovered from this level to end Monday at $1.26.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/iJALI9v7/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment took control as markets and \uc2 SOL\uc2  recovered on Tuesday, strongly impacting WIF. As a result, WIF registered an increase of 12.50% to settle at $1.41. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment intensified on Wednesday, with WIF reaching a high of $1.77. However, with sellers active at higher levels. WIF fell back, eventually settling at $1.60, an increase of over 13%. The current session sees WIF up by almost 5% and trading at $1.67. However, while WIF has made impressive gains over the past few days, its overall outlook remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The asset is down almost 17% over the past week, and trading volume has also declined.\par \par \uc2 Analysts were worried about a drop below $1, but the recent surge has allayed those fears for now. If bulls can maintain momentum, WIF could push above the 50-day SMA and test the $2 price level.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240809ek880000c\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/7: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,673 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 August 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Today\u8217\'20\'19s dip in Bitcoin price is a sign that the market could remain volatile for the foreseeable future.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvMGQ4OTY3MTAtZThhNy00ZDhjLWIwNDQtYjI5MTZjZmViMmNiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/7: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) recent fall on Aug. 5 flushed out several leverage trades. Trading firm QCP Capital believes that the panic selling could have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-chart-bitcoin-match-49-5-k-lows-days"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 resulted in a short-term bottom}}}\uc2  in Bitcoin and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ). QCP told its Telegram channel subscribers that it was \u8220\'20\'1Cpossibly time to start thinking about accumulating BTC and ETH spot.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 However, a few other analysts have a different view. According to 10x Research head of Research Markus Thielen, a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-40k-price-bull-market-entry-10xresearch-crypto-traders"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 good entry point for Bitcoin}}}\uc2  could be in the low 40,000 zone from where a major rally is likely to be attempted.\par \par \uc2 Similarly, Gokhstein Media founder David Gokhstein said in a post on X that a drop to $50,000 or even to $40,000 in Bitcoin \u8220\'20\'1Cwould be a perfect opportunity to scoop up some more.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/dc773865-8e4c-4b55-a3e0-22b388fe10ec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/7: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 It is not all positive for the cryptocurrency market. The Bitcoin bull-bear market cycle indicator is flashing a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bull-bear-market-cycle-signals-potential-bear-market-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bear signal for the first time}}}\uc2  since January 2023, according to CryptoQuant head of research, Julio Moreno. If this indicator remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for two weeks, it could signal a sustained bear phase, said CryptoQuant founder Ki Young Ju in a post on X.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recovery sustain, pulling the altcoins higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is recovering after the sharp fall on Aug. 5. The bulls pushed the price back above the breakdown level of $55,724 on Aug. 6, indicating aggressive buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/9bbc6e08-679b-47d7-8bdd-18a8b2ce7e94.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/7: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally is likely to reach the moving averages, where the bears will try to stall the up move. If the price turns down from the current level or the moving averages, it will signal that the sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies. The BTC/USDT pair could then drop toward the crucial support at $49,000.\par \par \uc2 If the next fall maintains above $49,000, it will signal that a bottom has been made. Instead, if the price slips below $49,000, it will open the gates for a fall to $42,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) relief rally is facing strong selling near the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $2,602, signaling that bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/127fea92-f6fe-4424-9afc-a75ad4723980.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/7: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below $2,400, the bears will try to drag the ETH/USDT pair toward the $2,111 support. The bulls are expected to defend this level with all their might because if they fail in their endeavor, the pair may plunge to $2,000 and then $1,600.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns up and rises above $2,602, it will suggest that every minor dip is being purchased. The pair may then attempt a rally to the breakdown level of $2,850.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) below the $460 level on Aug. 5 but failed to sustain the lower levels. This suggests solid buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/52c9c6ee-6721-405a-a3f2-144cf739c395.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/7: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to push the price above $495. If they do that, the BNB/USDT pair could rise to the moving averages, which are likely to act as a stiff resistance. However, if the bulls prevail, it will signal that the pair may oscillate between $460 and $635 for a while.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated if the price turns down and breaks below $460. If that happens, the pair may retest the Aug. 5 intraday low of $400. A break below this support could sink the pair to $360.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) below the $116 to $210 range on Aug. 5, but the bulls successfully defended the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/16e7ca30-8a22-4c0f-b5ea-25ca505f924e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/7: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has reached the 20-day EMA ($157), where the bears will try to halt the recovery. If the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, the bears will again try to pull the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair below $116.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a break above the 20-day EMA will suggest that the bulls are trying to make a comeback. Buyers will try to push the price to $189, where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside the large range between $0.41 and $0.74 for several months, indicating buying on dips and selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/eb19a9dd-c9ec-4368-b58c-831ed0c353cb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/7: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair started a rebound from the $0.46 to $0.41 support zone, which is facing resistance at the 50-day SMA ($0.52). If the price slides below $0.48, the pair could retest the $0.46 to $0.41 support zone, where the buyers are expected to step in.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break above the 50-day SMA could push the pair to the 20-day EMA ($0.55). Buyers will have to pierce this resistance to signal that the pair\u8217\'20\'19s range-bound action may continue for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) started recovering off the $0.08 support, but the bulls are struggling to drive and maintain the price above $0.10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/a7a8e1d2-4bc2-4bc2-bb4a-0eda0cc2351a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/7: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.11) and the RSI near the oversold territory signal that the bears have the upper hand. A shallow bounce will increase the likelihood of a drop below $0.08. If that happens, the DOGE/USDT pair may tumble to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rises above $0.10, it will suggest that the selling pressure is reducing. The pair may then climb to the breakdown level of $0.12, which is likely to act as a strong barrier.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $4.72 level on Aug. 5, indicating that the bulls are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/2ba722d0-29f5-421b-8066-e6281ebea349.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/7: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally is facing resistance near the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $5.81. If the price continues lower, the bears will again try to yank the TON/USDT pair below $4.72. If they succeed, the pair may plummet to $4.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up and breaks above $5.81, it will suggest that traders are buying the dips. The pair may then rally to the 20-day EMA ($6.38), which remains the key resistance to keep an eye on.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-58k-cme-gap-analysis-2-bitcoin-death-crosses"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC price eyes $58K CME gap as analysis flags 2 Bitcoin 'death crosses'}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been in a downtrend for several days. The bulls are trying to start a relief rally from $0.27 on Aug. 5.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/26b5dd82-c9fa-4797-a2f3-e580d1dffe97.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/7: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The first obstacle on the upside is the moving averages, but if buyers overcome this, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could reach the downtrend line. Sellers are expected to vigorously defend the downtrend line. If the price turns down sharply from the moving averages or the downtrend line, the pair may slide toward $0.24.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the short term if the bulls push and maintain the price above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) fell below the $21.80 support on Aug. 4, but the bears are struggling to sustain the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/5bd284e7-6105-47d4-b8fc-1974cb3b438b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/7: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair turned up from $17.29 and has reached the breakdown level of $21.80. If bears flip the $21.80 level into resistance, it will increase the possibility of a drop below $17.29. The pair could then drop to $16.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price rises above the $21.80 resistance, it will suggest that the bears are losing their grip. The pair may then climb to the moving averages, which is an important level to watch out for.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) rebounded from the strong support near $0.000010 on Aug. 5, indicating solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/1ef87588-2707-4a9f-82ee-e9881f5322d8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/7: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The recovery could reach the moving averages, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense. If the price turns down sharply from the moving averages, it will signal that the bears continue selling on rallies. That will increase the likelihood of a drop below $0.000010.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if buyers drive the price above the moving averages, it will signal that the downtrend could be ending. The SHIB/USDT pair could then climb to $0.000020.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvMGQ4OTY3MTAtZThhNy00ZDhjLWIwNDQtYjI5MTZjZmViMmNiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240807ek87000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
