\par\par \b \uc2 Post-Crash Opportunities: Top 3 Altcoins Set to Rise in the Next 3 Months\b0\par\par\uc2 Adrian Barkley \par \uc2 506 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 August 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Render (RENDER)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Conclusion}}}\par \par \uc2 The recent downturn in the crypto market has opened doors for strategic investors. Certain altcoins are showing strong signals of a potential rebound. Readers will discover which digital currencies are primed for significant growth in the next quarter. These promising investments could offer substantial returns as the market stabilizes.\par \par \uc2 Render (RENDER)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/render-render-is-this-the-time-to-buy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Render (RENDER)}}}\uc2  has been navigating through a challenging market, but there are several indicators that suggest a potential recovery in the near future. Despite recent declines, the current resistance and support levels indicate a relatively stable price range, providing a solid foundation for upward movement. Over the next three months, RENDER has the potential to rise by more than 20% if \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum picks up. Key technical indicators, like the \uc2 RSI\uc2 , are hinting at a possible turnaround, making this a critical period for potential gains. Investors could see a significant rebound as market sentiment shifts positively.\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/crypto-price-analysis-8-5-btc-eth-sol-xrp-ton-dot-tia-pepe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2 , currently trading between $0.47 and $0.62, shows promising signs despite recent \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trends. The cryptocurrency has displayed resilience with a 13.32% increase over the past month, highlighting its potential for recovery. If the bulls can push the price past the $0.71 resistance level, XRP could target $0.85, representing a potential gain of around 37% from the upper end of its current range. The \uc2 RSI\uc2 's neutral reading of 46.61 suggests that XRP is poised for a potential breakout. With positive market momentum, XRP could see significant growth in the next three months.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 )\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/crypto-price-analysis-7-29-btc-eth-sol-xrp-ada-doge-dot-uni"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2  has faced some recent struggles, but there are strong indicators that a recovery could be on the horizon. Trading between $0.31 and $0.40, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has a clear path to significant gains if it can break through its resistance at $0.46. Achieving this milestone could set \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  on course to reach $0.56, marking substantial growth. The current market sentiment is challenging, but Cardano's robust technology and community support provide a strong foundation for future gains. Investors should watch closely as \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has the potential to regain stability and rise considerably in the coming months.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 The recent crypto market downturn, while challenging, has presented strategic investors with unique opportunities to capitalize on potential rebounds. Render (RENDER), XRP, and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) stand out as altcoins with strong indicators suggesting significant growth in the next three months. Render shows promise with a stable price range and key technical indicators pointing to a potential 20% rise. XRP demonstrates resilience and the possibility of a 37% gain if \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum continues. Cardano, despite its recent struggles, has the foundation for substantial growth, potentially reaching $0.56. As the market stabilizes, these altcoins offer promising prospects for investors seeking substantial returns.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240806ek8500004\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/5: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,727 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 August 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins fell below their respective support levels, but a positive sign is that lower levels are attracting buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvMWJkYTZiMjQtNmExOC00MmU1LWJjNjctMmVjYjkzYjBmNTc5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/5: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) fell below the psychological level of $50,000 on Aug. 5 as panic gripped traders following the crash in the Japanese stock market. Coinglass data shows {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-market-crash-1b-liquidations-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $1.08 billion in liquidations in leveraged positions}}}\uc2  or collateral trades.\par \par \uc2 Will the correction deepen, or is it time for a relief rally to begin? That is a big question for traders. Popular analyst Rekt Capital said in a post on X that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Cdownside deviation\u8221\'20\'1D could {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-downside-last-2-months"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 last for about two months}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Some analysts believe the correction could deepen further. FXPro senior market analyst Alex Kuptsikevich told Cointelegraph that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/analysts-warn-bitcoin-downside-btc-revisit-42k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s selling could sink it to $42,000}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/353b9d04-abf2-4e64-b957-ac38ee0f91df.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/5: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has broken down from its large range, but several times, the first break tends to be a fake move. Markets quickly reverse direction and catch the traders off guard. If that happens, Bitcoin may witness a short squeeze within the next few days.\par \par \uc2 What important resistance levels the bulls need to conquer to trap the aggressive bears? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index fell and closed below the 50-day simple moving average (5,448) on Aug. 2, indicating a short-term trend change.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/0a2238fb-cdd2-4059-8b5b-617aca3ccbc9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/5: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The index gapped down sharply on Aug. 5, but a positive sign is that the lower levels are attracting buyers. If the price rises and maintains above 5,265, the index could rally to the moving averages, which is a crucial resistance to watch out for on the upside.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the moving averages, it will signal that the sentiment has turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the rallies are being sold into. The bears will then try to tug the price to the psychological level of 5,000.\par \par \uc2 US Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The US Dollar Index (DXY) turned down from the 20-day exponential moving average (104.22) on Aug. 2 and fell below the channel\u8217\'20\'19s support line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/2d6948f2-b3d5-4679-b425-39a23eeafc45.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/5: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The index is trying to find support at 102.35. Buyers will try to push the price to the channel\u8217\'20\'19s breakdown level. If the price turns down from the breakdown level, it will signal that the bears have flipped the level into resistance. That will increase the likelihood of a drop to 102 and then to 101.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to prevent the downside, they will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s sideways price action resolved to the downside with a drop below the solid support of $55,724, signaling that the traders are rushing to the exit.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/12643989-fc38-40e0-bab1-c3bf72f9286a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/5: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the long tail on the candlestick shows that the bears are struggling to sustain the lower levels. This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels. The bulls will try to make a comeback by pushing the price back above $55,724.\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, it will signal that the markets have rejected the breakdown. That may result in a short squeeze, pushing the BTC/USDT pair to the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to maintain control, they will have to fiercely guard the $55,724 level. If they do that, the pair may again slide toward the vital support at $49,000 and eventually to $42,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) nosedived below the $2,850 support on Aug. 4, completing a descending triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/e432f57c-913b-4473-8141-4e15d7cf8384.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/5: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling picked up on Aug. 5, pulling the price toward the psychological support at $2,000. A minor positive is that the bulls bought the dip, as seen from the long tail on the candlestick.\par \par \uc2 The oversold levels on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  also suggest that a relief rally is likely in the near term. The ETH/USDT pair could reach the breakdown level of $2,850.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price fails to reach $2,850, it will signal a lack of aggressive buying by the bulls. That may increase the possibility of a break below $2,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) range-bound action between $495 and $635 resolved to the downside on Aug. 5, indicating that bears are trying to seize control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/0bbe3772-336c-45f6-8880-ee24033507ce.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/5: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the long tail on the candlestick shows aggressive buying near $400. The oversold level on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  also suggests that the selling may have been overdone in the short term, and a relief rally could be around the corner.\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair will attempt to rise back above the breakdown level of $495. If that happens, it will signal that the markets have rejected the breakdown.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated if the price turns down sharply from $460. Such a move would suggest that the bears have flipped the level into resistance. The pair may then sink to $400 and subsequently to $350.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been oscillating between $116 and $210 for several months, indicating buying on dips and selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/518986ea-f7ab-47b8-b8cb-0b8a17a5f81f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/5: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price rebounded off the solid support at $116, signaling that the bulls are active at lower levels. The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could reach the moving averages, which are the key resistance level to keep an eye on.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the moving averages, the bears will try to sink the pair below $116. If they succeed, the fall could reach $100 and then $80.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a close above the moving averages will suggest that the selling pressure is reducing. The pair may extend its stay inside the large range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) fall below the 50-day SMA ($0.52) on Aug. 5 indicates that the price may remain stuck inside the large range between $0.41 and $0.64 for some time.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/99f405c7-bea2-48c6-8a5b-941db651dbc4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/5: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 In a large range, traders generally buy the dips near the support and sell close to the resistance. The bulls are likely to defend the $0.46 to $0.41 zone with all their might because a break below it may open the doors for a fall to $0.35 and then to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break and close above the 50-day SMA will be the first sign that the range-bound action may continue for a while longer. After failing to break below the range, the XRP/USDT pair may then climb toward the resistance at $0.64.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-the-crypto-market-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is the crypto market down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) plummeted below the $0.10 psychological support on Aug. 5, indicating that the bears are in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/a6c25cb5-135b-41e6-897f-ca5db26d4af7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/5: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned up from the $0.08 support, signaling that the bulls are trying to stall the decline. The DOGE/USDT pair could rise to $0.10 and then to the moving averages. A sharp rebound will suggest that the downtrend may be over, and the pair could enter a base building period by trading in a range.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from $0.10, it will indicate a lack of buyers. That will increase the risk of a fall to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) completed a double top pattern when it fell below $6.77 on July 25. The failure of the bulls to push and maintain the price back above $6.77 intensified selling on Aug. 2.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/8b163d83-c4c2-44b8-af64-7ecd7624bedd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/5: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The TON/USDT pair reached the crucial support at $4.72 on Aug. 5, which is likely to act as a solid support. Buyers have started a relief rally, which could reach $5.50 and then $6.36. The oversold level on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  also points to a possible bounce in the near term.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated in the near term if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and breaks below $4.72. That could intensify selling, pulling the pair to the next support near $3.50.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) fell below the crucial support at $0.32 on Aug. 5, but lower levels attracted buying, as seen from the long tail on the candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-08/9631b87a-0bf3-47c2-a7b4-7b8dbcd35f88.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/5: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sharp selling of the past few days has pulled the \uc2 RSI\uc2  into the overbought zone, suggesting that a relief rally may be around the corner. The recovery could reach the moving averages, where the sellers are likely to step in. If the price turns down sharply from the moving averages, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the $0.24 support.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to drive and maintain the pair above the downtrend line to signal a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDgvMWJkYTZiMjQtNmExOC00MmU1LWJjNjctMmVjYjkzYjBmNTc5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240805ek85000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
