\par\par \b \uc2 Experts Say BTC Will Stay Over $60,000 and Possibly Hit All-Time High Price Next 3 Month \u8211\'20\'13 Top 5 Altcoins to Invest Before the Bull Run\b0\par\par\uc2 Adrian Barkley \par \uc2 909 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 August 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Toncoin (TON)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Arbitrum (ARB)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kaspa (KAS)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Conclusion}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is projected to retain its value above $60,000 and may even reach new heights in the next three months, according to industry experts. In light of this, attention shifts to other promising cryptocurrencies that could see significant gains. This article will reveal the top five altcoins poised for a potential bull run.\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/crypto-price-analysis-8-1-btc-eth-sol-ada-xrp-ton-pepe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP's current price}}}\uc2  sits between $0.58 and $0.63, with a promising outlook for a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  run. The nearest resistance is at $0.66, while support lies at $0.55. Over the past month, the coin has surged by more than 20%, showcasing its strong potential despite a minor 5% dip last week. The \uc2 RSI\uc2  is around 52, indicating balanced market conditions poised for growth. If bulls gain momentum, XRP could swiftly push past $0.66 and aim for the $0.71 mark, representing a potential 20% rise from its current range. Holding above the $0.55 support strengthens the case for a positive upward trajectory.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/08/margex-announces-integration-of-ton-toncoin-for-deposits-and-withdrawals"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Toncoin (TON)}}}\uc2  is currently trading between $6.31 and $7.07, presenting a promising opportunity for growth in the near future. Although the cryptocurrency has experienced a nearly 22% decline in the past month, it is poised for a potential rebound. The current price is below the 100-day simple moving average of $6.60, and with a low RSI around 33, TON might be oversold and ready for a recovery.\par \par \uc2 If TON can break past the nearest resistance at $7.52, it has the potential to climb to $8.28, representing a 17% increase from the upper range. With the right momentum, this could signify a robust \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend over the next three months. While there is support at $6.01, keeping an eye on these key levels will be crucial for anticipating any significant moves. Overall, Toncoin shows strong potential for growth in the upcoming months.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 )\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/crypto-price-analysis-7-29-btc-eth-sol-xrp-ada-doge-dot-uni"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2  is currently priced between 38 and 44 cents, presenting a promising opportunity for growth despite recent declines. The coin faces significant resistance at 48 cents and has strong support at 34 cents. While \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has experienced an 11% drop in the past week and nearly 10% over the last month, and a 25% decline over six months, analysts see potential for a strong rebound.\par \par \uc2 The 10-day average is at 37 cents, with the 100-day average slightly higher at 39 cents, suggesting stability. The Relative Strength Index (RSI) is at 48.26, indicating neutral territory and the possibility for upward movement. If \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum returns, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could target the 55-cent resistance, representing an impressive 35% increase from its current range. While bears have held the upper hand recently, the potential for a substantial recovery is on the horizon.\par \par \uc2 Arbitrum (\uc2 ARB\uc2 )\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/05/solana-sol-and-arbitrum-arb-holders-explore-3000-potential-with-rollblock-rblk-revenue-share-model"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Arbitrum (ARB)}}}\uc2  is currently trading between $0.65 and $0.80, presenting a promising opportunity for a significant upward movement. While the past week has seen a decline of nearly 14% and an 18% drop over the past month, these levels could be setting the stage for a robust recovery. The nearest resistance is at $0.89, with strong support at $0.58.\par \par \uc2 If bulls gain traction, \uc2 ARB\uc2  could rise to $0.89, and with continued momentum, it could test $1.05, representing potential gains of around 15% and 45% from its current range. The RSI at 60.88, high Stochastic value of 94.39, and a negative MACD level indicate that while bears have been dominant, a shift in buying interest could swiftly reverse the downtrend. Investors should watch for stronger buy signals as \uc2 ARB\uc2  has the potential for impressive gains.\par \par \uc2 Kaspa (KAS)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/render-rndr-and-kaspa-kas-biggest-altcoin-gainers-but-which-is-the-best-bet"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kaspa (KAS)}}}\uc2  is currently trading in a tight range between 17 and 20 cents, suggesting a balanced market with the potential for an upward movement. The nearest resistance level is at 21 cents, while support is at 16 cents. The coin's 10-day Simple Moving Average is 19 cents, and the 100-day SMA is 20 cents, reflecting recent stability.\par \par \uc2 With an RSI of 48.01, Kaspa is in a neutral position, and its MACD level of zero indicates a lack of strong momentum. However, over the past week, the price has increased by nearly 4%, and the one-month rise shows an 8.6% gain, demonstrating positive movement.\par \par \uc2 If Kaspa can break through the 21-cent resistance, it has the potential to reach 23 cents, representing a 15% increase. This possible growth, coupled with recent positive trends, indicates that Kaspa is well-positioned for further gains.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 Summing up, as Bitcoin is expected to stay above $60,000 and possibly hit an all-time high in the next three months, investors should consider diversifying into other promising altcoins. XRP, Toncoin (TON), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Arbitrum (\uc2 ARB\uc2 ), and Kaspa (KAS) each present strong potential for significant gains. Monitoring key resistance and support levels, along with market indicators like \uc2 RSI\uc2  and SMA, can help identify optimal investment opportunities. With strategic planning and careful analysis, these altcoins could offer substantial returns during the anticipated bull run.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240804ek8300005\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
