\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 8-1 BTC, ETH, \uc2 SOL\uc2 ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, TON, PEPE\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 1,985 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 August 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Sees Significant Drop Amid Middle East Tensions}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC Needs A Trigger}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Toncoin (TON) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 PEPE Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 The Bitcoin (BTC) price has tumbled below $65,000 as rising geopolitical tensions came into focus once again as the Middle East stands on the precipice of a broader conflict after Iran reportedly ordered retaliatory attacks against Israel. As a result, spooked investors turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , sending prices crashing.\par \par \uc2 Before the drop, Bitcoin bulls were eying the $70,000 level, but sellers fiercely defended the upper levels of BTC\u8217\'20\'19s trading range. Analysts were closely watching the $69,000 level, believing it to be crucial for the bulls to flip it into support for the asset to push on above $70,000 and $72,000.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Sees Significant Drop Amid Middle East Tensions\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin failed to recover as it lost the $65,000 level on Wednesday when it dropped to $64,671, as tensions flared in the Middle East, drawing investor attention after the conclusion of the July Federal Reserve meeting. Other major altcoins, including Ethereum (ETH), Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Avalanche (AVAX), and several others, also registered notable declines. The primary reason behind the selloff was reports that Iran\u8217\'20\'19s leadership had ordered retaliatory airstrikes on Israel, raising the specter of broader conflict in the Middle East.\par \par \uc2 Earlier in the day, the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  left benchmark interest rates unchanged and gave few indications that an expected rate cut in September is guaranteed. Fed Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  stated that no decisions had been made regarding a rate cut; the broad sense is that we are moving closer to reducing rates.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf we were to see inflation moving down ... more or less in line with expectations, growth remains reasonably strong, and the labor market remains consistent with current conditions, then I think a rate cut could be on the table at the September meeting.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 While digital assets registered considerable losses, their traditional counterparts saw gains over the course of the day. The 10-year US bond yield also dropped by ten basis points, while gold registered a 1.5% increase, rising to $2,450, just below its record high, while WTI crude oil prices surged by 5%. Equities also registered significant gains over the day, led by \uc2 NVidia\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s 12% gains.\par \par \uc2 BTC Needs A Trigger\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) needs a strong trigger to push it out of its current trading range, one it has been in for the past five months. Analysts are confident that once it does so, the cryptocurrency will cross $100,000 by the end of the year. However, another subset of analysts believe that the asset will hit $100,000 only in 2025, believing that the $35 trillion US national debt will be crucial in driving greater BTC adoption.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/crypto-price-analysis-7-31-btc-eth-sol-mkr-aave-bch-dot-jup"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  is facing significant selling pressure due to the flare-up of Middle East tensions. The \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s decision to leave its interest rate of 5.25-5.50% unchanged also factored in, but this was along expected lines, with BTC recording a 2% drop to resume its correction. Analysts had expected BTC to rebound from the $65,000 support level. However, bears were able to breach this level, sending BTC tumbling to $64,671. In fact, BTC has been in the red since Monday, when the price faced a strong rejection from the $70,000 mark.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/tdeyEExc/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC began Monday with a surge toward $70,000. However, the price turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  almost immediately after reaching that level, as sellers forced the price down. Sellers eventually overwhelmed buyers, with BTC dropping by 2.12% and ending the day at $66,810. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pressure continued on Tuesday as BTC dipped by 0.83% to settle at $66,252. Wednesday began with analysts expecting a rebound from the $65,000 level, with the 20-day SMA also sloping upwards. However, bears could overwhelm this level, as BTC dropped below $65,000 and the 20-day SMA to settle at $64,671. The current session sees BTC remain in the red, with sellers pushing the price to a low of $63,578. However, BTC has been able to rebound from this level and is currently trading at $64,305.\par \par \uc2 If BTC rebounds from its current levels, we could see the price reclaim $65,000 and attempt another push toward $70,000. However, if the price faces another drop, it indicates that traders are booking profits at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) has registered an 8% decline during the past month as its price continues to dip, with bears eying the $3,000 mark. ETH started the week on a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note, as buying activity picked up, helping ETH surge past the 20 and 50-day SMAs, targeting $3,500. However, ETH faced rejection at $3,400, as the price tumbled back below the 20 and 50-day SMAs and settled at $3,319, an increase of just 1.19%. ETH faced significant selling pressure on Tuesday, dropping to a day low of $3,195 as buyers exerted control. Despite the strong \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment, ETH recovered to a certain extent and settled at $3,280, dropping by 1.17%.\par \par \uc2 Buyers attempted to push ETH above $3,400 on Wednesday but were unsuccessful once again as sellers took control and pushed the price down to $3,200. The current session sees ETH down by almost 2%, losing the crucial $3,200 level. If selling pressure continues, ETH could drop to $3,000 or its longstanding support level of $2,850. But what will it take for ETH to return to the heady highs of $4,000, a level it was trading at in March?\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/UNqcjMyV/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 While the crypto markets have been underwhelming in recent months, ETH has its own problems. The initial hype around spot Ethereum ETFs has died down, with the investment vehicles witnessing significant outflows, dampening sentiment. The Ethereum network\u8217\'20\'19s TVL has also remained stagnant and currently stands at around 17.8 million ETH, almost unchanged from the past two months. For ETH to reclaim $4,000, it must attract interest from institutional investors. Increased institutional interest will reflect an increase in spot ETH ETF inflows or at least a reduction in outflows.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 With the larger cryptocurrency markets recording a fourth consecutive day, Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) continued to drop, slipping below the crucial $170 level. \uc2 SOL\uc2 , which was incredibly \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  coming into the week, failed to hold on to its bullishness, with the losses during the week erasing all gains made during the previous week. \uc2 SOL\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trajectory has led to the asset dropping over 8% during the past 24 hours. Let\u8217\'20\'19s look at its price chart.\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2  ended Sunday at $185 and began Monday on a highly \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  note, surging toward $200. \uc2 SOL\uc2  reached a high of $194 but could not push any higher after facing intense selling pressure. As a result, \uc2 SOL\uc2  fell back considerably and settled at $182.65, a drop of 1.30%. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment continued on Tuesday as well, with \uc2 SOL\uc2  dropping by almost 2% to $179.25. Buyers attempted a recovery on Wednesday, as \uc2 SOL\uc2  rose to $184, but could not sustain momentum. As a result, \uc2 SOL\uc2  fell back, dropping by 4.18% and settling at $171. The current session sees \uc2 SOL\uc2  down by almost 2%, having lost the $170 level, with the price currently trading at $168.66.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/cF4tbqf6/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If \uc2 SOL\uc2  recovers from its current level, buyers could attempt to reclaim the $170 level. However, if selling pressure continues, \uc2 SOL\uc2  could drop to $150.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has been on a downward trajectory since its price hit $0.451 on July 22. Since then, \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment has taken over, and by July 25, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  lost the $0.40 level, dropping to $0.395. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  made a strong recovery following this drop, surging by almost 6% on Friday and settling at $0.418. However, \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment took over during the weekend, and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tumbled, closing at $0.403 on Monday. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  continued to drop on Tuesday and Wednesday, losing the $0.40 support level once again, with sellers dragging the price to a low of $0.387 on Wednesday. The current session sees \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  down by 0.77%, with the price firmly rooted in \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  territory.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/UcutNtcY/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If current conditions persist, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  will see further declines. If sellers continue to dominate the markets, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could drop to $0.35 or further to $0.30, which would be a yearly low for the asset. However, analysts remain optimistic and have urged traders to buy the dip, expecting the asset to recover strongly from current levels.\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) has defied market expectations to a certain extent, registering a significant increase during the beginning of the week despite \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment prevailing in the markets after witnessing a few days of sideways movement, where the price consolidated around the $0.60 mark, ending the weekend up by 1.01%. After facing significant \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday, XRP rose sharply on Tuesday, rising by 4.27% and settling at $0.62.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/gdqdqFaM/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP began Wednesday with a significant surge, as buyers pushed the price above $0.65. However, with sellers active at higher levels, XRP fell back, eventually settling at $0.623 after a drop of 0.72%. The current session sees XRP down by 2.37%, with sellers in control. Despite the selling pressure, XRP has remained above $0.60, having recovered from a day low of $0.596.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) has seen a slight uptick during the week as buyers prevented the price from falling below $6.60. TON ended the weekend at $6.63, after which buyers strongly pushed the price towards $7. However, sellers were able to defend this level, and TON fell back, eventually registering a marginal decline and settling at $6.63. TON recovered on Tuesday, rising by 1.82% and pushing to $6.75. A marginal increase on Wednesday saw TON rise to $6.77. The current session saw sellers attempt to push TON down towards $6.50. However, buyers were able to withstand the selling pressure, allowing TON to recover. TON is currently trading at $6.81, up by 0.57%.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/nnrTvjWy/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If TON can remain \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , it could attempt to test $7 and move above the 20-day SMA. Such a scenario would set it up for a move towards $7.50. However, should sentiment turn \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , TON could drop back to $6.50.\par \par \uc2 PEPE Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 PEPE has seen a dramatic plunge this week, with its price slipping below the 20- and 50-day SMAs and the meme token is facing intense selling pressure. After rising to $0.0000121 on Saturday, PEPE turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dropping to $0.0000117 on Sunday. The price registered a marginal increase on Monday but fell back in the red on Tuesday, dropping by over 5% to $0.0000112. Buyers attempted a brief rally on Wednesday but lost momentum, allowing sellers to retake control and push the price below the 20 and 50-day SMAs to $0.0000110. The current session saw PEPE down by almost 5% as sellers looked to drive the price below $0.00001.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/703Azm91/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Should sellers breach this level, PEPE could significantly drop to the 200-day SMA at $0.0000080. However, if the price rebounds, it could start a relief rally that could push the price back up toward $0.000015.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240802ek8100005\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/31: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,642 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 July 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin's macro trend remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  but traders need to recapture the range high in order to keep it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvYTJhYTc5NjQtOGRmYi00NTczLTk5OGQtNjg1NDQ1ZDMwMTA2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/31: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) faced strong rejection near $70,000 on July 29, indicating that the bears are fiercely defending the upper boundaries of the $55,724 to $73,777 range. Several analysts are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-trader-60k-bears-btc-price-rejection"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 closely watching the $69,000 level}}}\uc2  as they believe it is crucial for the bulls to flip this level into support before Bitcoin takes out $72,000 and challenges the all-time high near $74,000.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin will need a strong trigger to shake it out from its five-month-long trading range. Once it does, analysts are confident that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-breakout-september-100k-doubts-crypto-traders"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin will cross the $100,000 mark}}}\uc2 . However, some analysts believe that six figures may hit only in 2025.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/965d20f9-3991-4f5f-8846-15e05f0e9f4c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/31: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Analysts believe the $35 trillion national debt of the United States will bolster Bitcoin adoption. Turbofish CEO Matt Bell {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-debt-bitcoin-adoption-hard-money"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told Cointelegraph that the ballooning US debt}}}\uc2  will boost the importance of Bitcoin as \u8220\'20\'1C\u8216\'20\'18hard money\u8217\'20\'19 \u8212\'20\'14 a decentralized and deflationary asset that offers a hedge against currency devaluation.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin rise from the current level and challenge the $70,000 resistance, or will bears pull the price lower? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down from $70,080 on July 29 and reached the 20-day exponential moving average ($65,390) on July 30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/9c7062f1-57ba-4f6d-9dc0-29da3c2a573f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/31: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to start a strong rebound off the 20-day EMA to maintain a positive sentiment. If they do that, the likelihood of a break above $70,000 increases. The BTC/USDT pair may ascend to $72,000, which is again likely to behave as a significant barrier.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the bulls are booking profits. The pair may slide to the 50-day simple moving average ($63,294).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 50-day SMA ($3,348) on July 29, but the buyers did not cede much ground to the sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/54653610-191a-4e2a-8b07-3894a71ee564.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/31: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are again trying to push the price above the 50-day SMA. If they manage to do that, the ETH/USDT pair could rise to $3,563.The bears are expected to fiercely defend the zone between $3,563 and the downtrend line. If the price turns down from this zone, it will signal that the pair may remain inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move is likely to begin on a break above the downtrend line or below the support at $2,850.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the moving averages on July 30, indicating a positive sentiment where the bulls are buying the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/773acbb0-a8e6-4140-8220-72128784b376.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/31: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 There is a minor resistance at $606, but if this level is crossed, the BNB/USDT pair could reach $635. This level is expected to attract strong selling by the bears. If the price turns down from $635 but rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will improve the prospects of a breakout. The pair may then reach $722.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and dives below $553. That could keep the pair range-bound between $495 and $635 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned up from $175 on July 30, indicating that the sentiment is positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/b8c02bdd-a20a-4e84-a1d7-a2fa66451448.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/31: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will make another attempt to propel the price above the $194 resistance. If they can pull it off, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair will attempt a rally to $210, which is expected to act as a solid resistance.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from the overhead resistance and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the pair may remain stuck inside the $116 to $210 range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned up sharply on July 30, and the bulls extended the up move on July 31 by pushing the price above the $0.64 resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/c6e5ff3d-73bd-433c-a7db-66aa5ec6c35c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/31: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains above $0.64, the XRP/USDT pair is likely to start its northward journey toward $0.74. This level has acted as a strong barrier on three previous occasions hence the bears are expected to defend it with vigor.\par \par \uc2 The critical support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($0.58). Sellers will have to tug the price below the 20-day EMA to suggest that the up move may be over. The pair may then tumble to the 50-day SMA ($0.51).\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been gradually slipping toward the solid support at $0.12, where the buyers are likely to step in.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/facc1826-5585-47ad-854b-e7d8670d22f1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/31: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($0.12) and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. If the price rebounds off $0.12, the DOGE/USDT pair may rise to the overhead resistance at $0.14. If buyers clear this hurdle, the pair is likely to start a rally toward $0.18.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price continues lower and breaks below $0.12, it will signal advantage to the bears. The pair may then sink to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to maintain Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) above the breakdown level of $6.77, signaling a lack of sellers at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/f68da7ad-3d55-4bca-be09-e2ab56ed0a74.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/31: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to prevent the recovery at the 20-day EMA ($6.94), but if the bulls prevail, the next stop is likely to be the 50-day SMA ($7.30). That will indicate the price is stuck inside the large range between $6.36 and $8.29.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated in the near term if the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA and breaks below the $6.36 support. The TON/USDT pair could then slump to $6 and later to $5.50.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-xrp-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is XRP price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have been trying to push Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.41) for the past few days, but the bears have held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/5263a74c-1717-4ab1-a7d2-d97c6da1e710.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/31: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor advantage in favor of the bulls is that they have not allowed the price to slip below the 50-day SMA ($0.40). Buyers will again try to achieve a close above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could jump to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price closes below the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that the bulls are losing their grip. There is minor support at $0.38, but if this level breaks down, the pair may decline to the solid support at $0.35.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the $29 level for the past few days, suggesting that the bears are maintaining the pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/27928cb6-dbf8-436b-99a9-a41429f20d52.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/31: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The AVAX/USDT pair could drop to the strong support at $24, where the buyers are expected to defend the level aggressively. A bounce off $24 could push the pair to $29 and keep the pair stuck between these two levels for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move could begin on a break above $29 or below $24. If the $29 level is taken out, the pair may rally to $33 and then to $37. On the downside, a break below $24 could sink the pair to $21.80.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.000017) on July 29, indicating that the bears are selling on minor rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/e78838b5-66d4-45d7-9571-9f9ce353505c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/31: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers will try to strengthen their position further by pulling the price below the $0.000015 support. If they do that, the selling could intensify, and the SHIB/USDT pair could plummet to $0.000013.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the downside, they will have to quickly push the price above the moving averages. If they do that, it will signal demand at lower levels. The pair may climb to $0.000018 and later to $0.000020.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvYTJhYTc5NjQtOGRmYi00NTczLTk5OGQtNjg1NDQ1ZDMwMTA2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fl