\par\par \b \uc2 Bull Market Alert: Russia Joins Crypto, America Planning Bitcoin Reserves \u8211\'20\'13 Top Coins to Buy Now\b0\par\par\uc2 Adrian Barkley \par \uc2 848 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 July 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Uniswap (UNI)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polygon (MATIC)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Notcoin (NOT)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Conclusion}}}\par \par \uc2 Big moves are on the horizon as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/evading-sanctions-russia-mulls-over-stablecoin-legalization-for-global-trade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Russia steps into the world of cryptocurrency}}}\uc2 . Initially, Russia imposed strict regulations, banning crypto payments and controlling exchanges. However, recent developments indicate a policy shift, with the government preparing to adopt a law on cryptocurrency payments and aiming to launch international crypto transactions by year's end. Meanwhile, America is exploring the idea of holding Bitcoin reserves and candidate in president {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/7-best-crypto-to-buy-before-donald-trump-wins-us-election"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump}}}\uc2  has a crypto narrative.These developments could ignite a new bull market. Which coins are poised to benefit the most? Delve into the details to uncover the top picks set to soar.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/pear-protocol-launches-revolutionary-pair-trading-platform-on-arbitrum-backed-by-leading-vcs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Arbitrum (ARB)}}}\par \par \uc2 Arbitrum's price is currently between $0.65 and $0.80, indicating potential for growth despite recent bear pressure. The nearest resistance is at $0.89, and support is solid at $0.58. While short-term indicators show a 10-day moving average of $0.70 and a 100-day moving average of $0.72, the current market conditions suggest opportunity. The \uc2 RSI\uc2  is at 35.89, and the Stochastic is 9.52, pointing to an oversold market ripe for a rebound. If bulls can push past the $0.89 resistance, ARB could rise to $1.05, marking a 35% increase. Despite a 60% dip over six months, there's significant potential for a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  turnaround.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 )\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/cardano-ada-shiba-inu-shib-bounce-back-whilst-clandeno-cld-launches-with-huge-hype"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2  is currently trading between $0.3757 and $0.4447, offering potential opportunities for growth. The nearby support at $0.3443 is holding strong, providing a foundation for a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  push. Although \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has faced resistance at $0.4823, it has still managed a 4% gain over the past month, showing resilience. Despite a six-month decline of nearly 20%, there's optimism among investors. If bulls can break through the resistance, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could aim for the second resistance at $0.5513, potentially rising by over 20%. Sentiment is cautious but hopeful, as traders watch for signs of a trend reversal.\par \par \uc2 Uniswap (UNI)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/cardano-and-uniswap-holders-left-feeling-defeated-as-they-turn-to-100x-raboo-for-profits"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Uniswap (UNI)}}}\uc2  is currently trading between $6.99 and $8.11, presenting a potential opportunity for investors. Although the price has dipped by over 14% in the past month, the low RSI of 35.60 and Stochastic at 7.88 suggest that UNI is oversold, hinting at a possible rebound. The nearest resistance is at $8.69, with strong support at $6.46. If bulls regain momentum, UNI could rise to the second resistance at $9.81, marking a potential increase of about 40%. While there is a possibility of further \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  movement toward the second support level at $5.35, the current indicators provide hope for a positive turnaround.\par \par \uc2 Polygon (MATIC)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/06/polygon-rapidly-causing-investor-unrest-xrp-holders-look-to-raboo-for-profits"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polygon (MATIC)}}}\uc2  is experiencing a slight downward movement, currently trading between $0.47 and $0.55. Despite this, there are promising signs for potential growth. The price has only fallen by just over 2% in the past week and more than 5% this month, indicating resilience in a challenging market. Both the 10-day and 100-day simple moving averages are at $0.52, showing a stable trend. Key resistance is at $0.59, with support levels at $0.44 and $0.36. The relative strength index of 53.41 suggests a balance between buying and selling pressures. If the bulls manage a breakout, MATIC could rise to $0.59 or even $0.67, offering potential gains of around 20% to 30%. The overall outlook holds promise for a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  reversal.\par \par \uc2 Notcoin (NOT)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/analysts-believe-notcoin-not-and-mpeppe-mpepe-are-two-tokens-that-will-pump-past-030"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Notcoin (NOT)}}}\uc2  is currently trading between $0.0115 and $0.0158, offering potential for growth despite recent challenges. The coin's value has dipped by close to 20% over the last week and nearly 6% for the month, but its impressive six-month growth of over 550% highlights strong long-term potential. The nearest resistance is at $0.0184, and a breakout could see Notcoin reaching the next level at $0.0227, marking a potential increase of more than 40% from its current range. With a relative strength index of 46.3 and a slightly \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  MACD, the market is poised at a crucial turning point, and the coming days could see a positive shift if the bulls regain strength.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 The 2024 bull run is fueled by increasing global interest in crypto. The evolving crypto environment with Russia's policy shift towards adopting cryptocurrency payments and America's plan of Bitcoin reserves suggests a potential soon bull market. Key coins to watch include Arbitrum (ARB), which, despite recent bear pressure, shows significant rebound potential. Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) displays resilience and potential for breaking resistance levels. Uniswap (UNI) and Polygon (MATIC) both indicate promising signs for recovery with potential gains. Notcoin (NOT), despite recent dips, demonstrates substantial long-term growth potential. These developments could lead to substantial opportunities in the crypto market.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240731ek7u00004\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
