\par\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin Nears $70K, Ripple (XRP) and Solana (SOL) Show Growth Last Month - What About Other Promising Coins?\b0\par\par\uc2 Adrian Barkley \par \uc2 689 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 July 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP (XRP)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TRON (TRX)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Uniswap (UNI)}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Conclusion}}}\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrencies continue to show promising trends, with \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum evident across various assets. XRP, \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), TRON (TRX), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), and Uniswap (UNI) are all experiencing dynamic {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/crypto-price-analysis-7-29-btc-eth-sol-xrp-ada-doge-dot-uni"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 price movements}}}\uc2 , with bulls striving to push prices higher. This detailed analysis explores their current trading ranges, support and resistance levels, and potential future gains, highlighting the optimism and opportunities within the market.\par \par \uc2 XRP (XRP)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/important-news-crypto-market-faces-major-decline-ethereum-down-8-whats-going-on-with-xrp-amid-the-sec-meeting"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  is trading between $0.58 and $0.63, showcasing a strong battle with bulls making notable advances. Over the past month, XRP has surged by 28%, reflecting significant \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum despite a modest one-week rise of 0.77%. The current support level is $0.55, and a breakthrough above the $0.66 resistance could propel the price to $0.71. Simple moving averages indicate stability, while a neutral \uc2 RSI\uc2  suggests balanced market sentiment. Overcoming the $0.66 resistance may result in a 10% increase, demonstrating the potential for further \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  gains.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/is-it-worth-staking-solana-rewards-risks-and-reality"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL)}}}\uc2  currently trades between roughly $171 and $194, showing promising signs for bulls. While the nearest resistance at $202.50 remains unchallenged, a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  rally could push \uc2 SOL\uc2  to $225.32, marking a substantial 25% rise. The 10-day SMA of about $192 indicates recent stability, and the 100-day SMA around $182 provides mid-term confidence. The \uc2 RSI\uc2  sits at a balanced 50.39, suggesting a neutral market sentiment. Despite a modest weekly gain of 2.45%, the impressive 35.22% rise over the past month highlights significant potential for continued growth.\par \par \uc2 TRON (TRX)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/crypto-price-analysis-7-26-btc-eth-sol-dot-trx-doge-wif-atom"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TRON (TRX)}}}\uc2  is currently trading between $0.13 and $0.14, with bulls poised to challenge the resistance at $0.14. The coin's Relative Strength Index (RSI) at 33.29 indicates it is oversold, suggesting potential for a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  reversal. The Stochastic indicator, with a low reading of 7.41, also points to an undervalued state. Despite a modest weekly increase of 1.51%, TRX has risen by 10.61% over the past month and 21.62% over the past six months. If bulls gain strength, TRX could target the next resistance at $0.15, representing a potential 7% or more rise from its current range.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 )\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/cardano-investors-eye-raboos-tactical-roadmap-to-233-roi-as-notcoin-tumbles"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2  is trading in a tight range between $0.37 and $0.44, with bulls gearing up for a potential breakout. Despite a nearly eight percent drop over the last week, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has recovered more than seven percent over the past month, indicating a positive trend. For substantial growth, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  needs to surpass the resistance at $0.48, aiming for $0.55, which would mark an impressive 25% increase. Key support levels to watch are at $0.34 and $0.27. The near-term outlook shows promise if bulls can regain their momentum.\par \par \uc2 Uniswap (UNI)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/uniswap-freefall-continues-as-notcoin-follows-suit-raboo-presale-shoots-past-2-million-mark"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Uniswap (UNI)}}}\uc2  is navigating a challenging market, with its price fluctuating between $6.99 and $8.11. However, bulls have reasons for optimism. Despite recent declines of nearly 4% in the last week and over 13% in the past month, UNI has achieved a remarkable 24% gain over six months. If bulls can break through the nearest resistance at $8.69, UNI could target the second resistance at $9.81, representing a potential increase of over 20%. While market sentiment suggests caution, overcoming these resistance levels could signify renewed \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market continues to display \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum, with notable growth in assets like XRP, \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), TRON (TRX), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), and Uniswap (UNI). XRP and \uc2 SOL\uc2  have shown impressive monthly gains, reflecting strong \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment, while TRX and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  demonstrate potential for breakouts despite recent \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . UNI, despite recent declines, shows promise for significant gains if resistance levels are surpassed. The market's optimism and dynamic price movements highlight opportunities for future growth across these promising coins.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240730ek7t0000k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
