\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 7-29 BTC, ETH, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, UNI\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 2,427 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 July 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Resumes March To $70,000}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Caution Advised}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) saw a slight pullback last week, dropping the price to a low of $65,117. However, it registered a strong recovery and, besides facing significant \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Saturday, resumed its push towards the psychologically crucial $70,000 mark.\par \par \uc2 BTC\u8217\'20\'19s rally could be the result of several developments over the weekend, notable being former president \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s supportive remarks for the asset during the 2024 Bitcoin conference. Trump also proposed allocating a portion of BTC currently held by the \uc2 US Department of Justice\uc2  to the country\u8217\'20\'19s strategic reserves. Speculations are also rife about potential US rate cuts, which have given a further boost to the BTC market.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Resumes March To $70,000\par \par \uc2 After a pullback the previous week, Bitcoin (BTC) looks set to conquer the hugely significant $70,000 mark. According to CryptoQuant CEO Ki Young Ju, BTC\u8217\'20\'19s quick recovery following its pullback indicates buyers are purchasing every dip, even minor ones. Data has shown that Bitcoin whales are on a buying spree, with permanent holders boosting their BTC balances by a staggering 358,000 BTC in July. According to the CEO of CryptoQuant, the current trend shows that BTC is clearly in an accumulation phase.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin is in an accumulation phase. Over the past month, 358K BTC has moved to permanent holder addresses.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Marathon Digital\uc2 , the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest Bitcoin miner, revealed the addition of $100 million worth of BTC to its holdings over the past month. This brings the total BTC in the company\u8217\'20\'19s holdings to over 20,000 BTC. According to \uc2 Marathon Digital\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s CEO and Chairman, \uc2 Fred Thiel\uc2 , the company now plans to go on full HODL mode and keep BTC as their strategic reserve treasury asset.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CToday, Marathon is proud to announce that to strengthen our strategy of holding Bitcoin as our strategic treasury reserve asset, we have purchased $100 million in BTC over the past month and will now go full HODL.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Caution Advised\par \par \uc2 While most market participants and analysts are incredibly \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  about Bitcoin (BTC) in the long term, some have advised caution in the near term. One such figure is Charles Edwards, the founder of Capriole Investments. According to Edwards, the launch of spot Ethereum ETFs in a weak market could create selling pressure in BTC should \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  institutional holders plan to diversify their holdings.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/crypto-price-analysis-7-26-btc-eth-sol-dot-trx-doge-wif-atom"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  is on the verge of reclaiming the $70,000 mark, although sellers are expected to mount a significant defense of this level and the overhead resistance at $72,000. BTC\u8217\'20\'19s quick recovery from intra-week lows indicates a positive sentiment around the asset, with traders buying the dip. In the short term, traders expect BTC to push above $70,000 and set a new all-time high. However, in the long term, traders and market watchers are hugely \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the asset. Some, such as \uc2 SkyBridge Capital\uc2  founder \uc2 Anthony Scaramucci\uc2 , have stated that BTC\u8217\'20\'19s market capitalization could potentially overtake the market capitalization of gold. Gold\u8217\'20\'19s current market capitalization is between $15 and $16 trillion, while BTC is roughly $1.3 trillion.\par \par \uc2 As mentioned earlier, BTC saw a dip last week, which pushed the price down to $65,142 by the end of Wednesday. Sellers continued to push BTC lower on Thursday as well, with BTC slipping below $65,000 and dropping to a day low of $63,486. However, with traders buying the dip, BTC was able to make a strong recovery from this level, eventually rising by 0.69% to climb back above $65,000 and settle at $65,845. BTC continued to climb on Friday, rising by 3.12% to settle at $67,899 and breaking above the resistance at $67,500.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/ttV79bO3/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The weekend began with BTC facing significant selling pressure on Saturday as buyers and sellers attempted to wrest control of the market. BTC saw considerable fluctuations as it registered a low of $66,610 and a high of $69,332 before eventually settling at $67,833. Bulls took control on Sunday and pushed BTC up by 0.62%, with the price climbing above $68,000 and settling at $68,254. The current session sees BTC trading above $69,500 as BTC bulls attempt to push the price above $70,000. However, as the wick suggests, BTC is facing selling pressure at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day SMA is currently upsloping, while the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is also in positive territory, indicating strong \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment. Bulls will try to push above $70,000 and, if successful, will push towards $72,000. However, if sentiment reverses, BTC could see a significant drop that could drive the price to $65,000 or lower.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) has made a strong recovery over the past 24 hours, registering an increase of almost 5%. However, it has faced rejections at crucial resistance levels such as $3,500 and, more recently, at the 20-day SMA. ETH registered significant drops of 4.25% and 4.82% on Wednesday and Thursday, respectively. The drop also saw ETH slip below the 20, 50, and 200-day SMAs. ETH dipped to a low of $3,089 on Thursday before buyers could push the price up to $3,175. ETH recovered on Friday as buyers entered the market, rising by 3.20%. However, it was unable to push above the 20-day SMA and settled at $3,277.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/pdQHVeiN/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The weekend began with a drop of 0.83%, which saw ETH drop to $3,250 before buyers could register a marginal increase, allowing ETH to settle at $3,272. The current session has seen buyers wrest control, with ETH up by nearly 3%. Buyers will look to push the price above $3,400 and retest the resistance at $3,500. Let\u8217\'20\'19s look at some indicators to gauge potential price movements. The \uc2 RSI\uc2  has risen above its mid-point, indicating that ETH could see a gradual appreciation in price this week. If ETH is able to push above $3,400, it will look to test $3,500. A break above this level could open the doors for a potential surge to $3,700. However, should sentiment reverse, we could see the \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  back to $3,200.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) has registered an incredible recovery after dropping to a low of $165 during the previous week. After dropping the previous week, \uc2 SOL\uc2  displayed significant strength over the weekend and set $200 firmly in its sights. \uc2 SOL\uc2  dipped below the $170 support level on Thursday, but strong demand at lower levels allowed buyers to push the price back above $170, with \uc2 SOL\uc2  eventually closing at $171.87. Friday saw buyers flip the sentiment to \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , with \uc2 SOL\uc2  recording a 6.56% increase and moving above $180 to $183.15.\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2  witnessed significant \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Saturday as bulls attempted to push above $185. Despite strong selling pressure, buyers were able to register a marginal increase but could not push above $185, instead settling at $183.96. \uc2 SOL\uc2  finally pushed above $185 on Sunday after an increase of 0.60 allowed it to settle at $185.06. Buyers also remain in control during the current session, with \uc2 SOL\uc2  up almost 4% and trading above $190. If \uc2 SOL\uc2  can stay and close above $190, it can surge above $200 and look to move above $210. However, bulls must maintain momentum for such a scenario, especially with sellers expected to defend $200.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/TtP25qTj/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, if sentiment turns and \uc2 SOL\uc2  dips back below $185, it could indicate that demand is drying up at higher levels, with selling pressure dominating. \uc2 SOL\uc2  could drop back to $170 or even $160 in such a scenario.\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) had registered an incredible surge in the middle of July, allowing it to push above $0.60. However, momentum has slowed since XRP trading between $0.55 and $0.65. Bulls made a strong attempt to go above $0.65, with XRP reaching a high of $0.63. However, with intense selling pressure at higher levels, the price was turned down and eventually settled at $0.61. Sellers took control on Thursday, driving XRP down by almost 3% before buyers could help XRP register a marginal increase that kept the price above $0.60.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/zwwzWmzW/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP had a mixed weekend, registering a drop of 1.16% on Saturday, which led to the price dipping below $0.60 and settling at $0.69. However, buyers were able to push back on Sunday, and XRP ended the weekend back above $0.60. The current session sees XRP up by almost 1% as bulls attempt to break above $0.60. With the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in positive territory, bulls have the edge for now. If buyers can push above $0.65, it could open the doors for a move to $0.70 and above. However, if the price turns and drops to the 20-day SMA, it could indicate profit booking. Should this be the case, we could see a further drop to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) spent the majority of the previous week in the red, facing significant selling pressure after getting rejected from $0.45. By Thursday, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  had slipped below the 20 and 50-day SMAs and its support level of $0.40 to settle at $0.39. Sellers had pushed the price to a low of $0.38, but with demand picking up at lower levels, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  was able to stem the drop with demand picking up at lower levels. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose by almost 6%, pushing back above $0.40 and settling at $0.41. With the 20-day SMA acting as a dynamic level of resistance, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  was unable to register any increase on Saturday but fell back in the red on Sunday as sellers drove the price down by 2.63%. The current session sees \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  up by 3.44% as buyers look to push above the 20-day SMA and attempt a move towards $0.45.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/fV0tsymJ/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is able to achieve such a move, it would suggest that sentiment is turning positive. A break above $0.45 would set the stage for a move to $0.50. However, a reversal could see \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  drop back to its support level of $0.40.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) faced significant \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pressure during the previous week, as sellers yanked the price down to a low of $0.120 on Thursday, a crucial support level for the asset. DOGE was able to bounce off this level, indicating that buyers are defending this level and there is demand at lower levels. The price eventually settled at $0.124. DOGE registered a significant jump of 7.21% on Friday, rising to $0.133, with buyers attempting a push above $0.140. However, with sellers active at higher levels, DOGE fell back, eventually settling at $.0131. Sunday saw another marginal drop that pushed DOGE below $0.130 to $0.129.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/jZDAaJb8/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The current session sees DOGE up by just over 4% as buyers attempt a move above the 200-day SMA. DOGE must push and close above the 200-day SMA for a move towards $0.140 to materialize. A break above this level could open the doors for a move above $0.150. However, if sellers regain control, the price could return to its support level of $0.120.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) has struggled since losing the crucial $6 level, with the price struggling to gain momentum. As a result of its recent struggles, DOT has lost over 6% in the past week, dipping to a low of $5.66 on Wednesday. The price faced significant selling pressure on Thursday, falling to a low of $5.54. However, the price was able to make a strong recovery from this level, as buyers negated the losses, allowing DOT to settle at $5.76, a marginal increase. This increase hinted at strong demand at lower levels, although demand at higher levels has dried up.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/gLP3t6Lo/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT was able to push up by 1.91% on Friday but fell back in the red over the weekend, dropping by 0.51% on Saturday and 2.05% on Sunday to end the weekend at $5.72. The current session sees DOT trading at $5.85, an increase of 2.27%. So, where does DOT go from here? So far, DOT has been unable to push back above $6, a crucial level if it wants to see a recovery. However, there is strong support at $5.50, and if demand builds, we could see DOT attempt to move above $6. If it cannot do so, we could see the \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  back towards $5.50 and trade between the two levels for the time being.\par \par \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) has been experiencing a downward trend since June, when it reached a high of $12. Since then, the asset has lost nearly half its value, reaching a low of $7.04 the previous week. In fact, UNI spent most of the previous week in the red, losing a crucial level of support on Wednesday. However, the price rebounded on Friday, rising by 5.40% to reclaim its support level of $7.50 and settle at $7.67. Buyers attempted a move to $8 on Saturday as UNI rose to a high of $7.95, but with the 20-day SMA acting as a dynamic level of resistance, sellers were able to push the price back down. UNI eventually settled at $7.69, recording only a marginal increase.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/xAk3qJoK/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Sellers attempted to push UNI below $7.50 on Sunday but could not do so, with the price settling at $7.53 after a 2% drop. The current session sees UNI up by just over 4% as buyers attempt a move above $8. A break above $8 could allow UNI to surge to the next resistance level at $8.80.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240730ek7t00007\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/29: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , BNB, XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,706 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 July 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price is contending with a tough battle between buyers and sellers at $70,000 but altcoins look set to rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvYTJlMjM4ZGMtOGM0ZC00ZDVjLWJjYWEtNWJjZmE3NTE5MTJmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/29: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $70,000 on July 29, indicating that the bears are defending the zone between $70,000 and $73,777. However, the traders do not seem to be worried about Bitcoin hitting a new all-time high. Santiment said that a survey it conducted on X revealed that the majority of the participants expect {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-national-debt-passes-35t-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin to hit a new all-time high}}}\uc2  by October.\par \par \uc2 Investors have been buying Bitcoin, anticipating a breakout from the sideways price action. According to the latest \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  report, Bitcoin witnessed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-etf-launch-drives-2-2b-inflows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 healthy inflows of $519 million}}}\uc2  last week. That takes the July inflows to $3.6 billion and the year-to-date inflows to $19 billion. The firm believes that talks of Bitcoin becoming a strategic reserve asset in the United States and a likely September Federal Reserve rate cut may have boosted confidence.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/75e7d3de-924d-4883-8ae0-d7153394cdc4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/29: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Another \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  voice was that of Global Macro Investor founder and CEO \uc2 Raoul Pal\uc2  who said in a X post that macro conditions are improving, which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-gold-price-breakout-macroeconomic-improvement"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 should start a rally in Bitcoin}}}\uc2 . He expects the rally to \u8220\'20\'1C last at least for the rest of 2024 and into 2025.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin turn up from the current level and break above $70,000? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index fell below the 50-day simple moving average (5,439) on July 25, but the bears could not sustain the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/ccd472c7-a2bc-4c5f-a713-75d6df3b4e38.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/29: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price back above the 50-day SMA on July 26. Buyers will try to strengthen their position further by pushing the index above the 20-day exponential moving average (5,508). If they do that, the index could rise to 5,585 and later retest the all-time high at 5,670.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the index turns down from the overhead resistance and breaks below 5,390, it will suggest the start of a deeper correction. The index may drop to 5,265 and thereafter to 5,192. A sharp fall could delay the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 US Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The US Dollar Index (DXY) has been trading inside the descending channel pattern for the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/0879ea1b-e642-4f53-a8a7-f5905bb5909b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/29: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally from the support line has reached the moving averages, which are likely to act as a strong barrier. If the price turns down sharply from the moving averages, the bears will make another attempt to sink the index below the channel. If they can pull it off, the index could tumble to 102.50.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated if the price breaks above the moving averages. The index could then rally to the channel\u8217\'20\'19s resistance line.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin reached $70,000 on July 29, but the bulls failed to sustain the higher levels. The long wick on the candlestick shows that bears are fiercely defending the $70,000 level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/c8c57cc7-61c6-464b-8ee0-2d0b01f77dc3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/29: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price to the 20-day EMA ($65,304). If the price turns up from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the dips are being bought. The bulls will then make another attempt to kick the BTC/USDT pair to $72,000 and eventually to $73,777.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to swiftly drag the price back below the moving averages. If they do that, it will suggest that the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke below the moving averages on July 24, but the bears could not sink the price to the psychological support at $3,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/cf554513-66c6-4ab6-88c3-23547cb5bab7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/29: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 That shows the bulls are buying at lower levels. The buyers are attempting to maintain the price above the moving averages. If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the downtrend line. This level is likely to act as a formidable hurdle. If the price turns down from the downtrend line, it will signal that the pair may remain inside the triangle for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break and close above the downtrend line will invalidate the negative setup. That may catapult the price to $4,094.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the downtrend line on July 25, indicating that the bulls have flipped the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/d039152b-0d22-4c27-8980-1aba9a65bd20.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/29: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price above the $185 to $189 resistance zone on July 29, but the long wick on the candlestick shows the bears are selling at higher levels. The bears will try to pull the price to the 20-day EMA ($169), which is likely to act as a solid support.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will increase the possibility of a close above $189. The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could then travel to $210, where the bulls are expected to face solid selling from the bears.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading above the 20-day EMA ($574) for the past few days, but the bulls are struggling to push the price above $605.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/1f27ab95-d4cc-4b8f-807f-264ec857f031.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/29: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls have given up. That is likely to keep the price range-bound between $495 and $635 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if buyers clear the obstacle at $605, the BNB/USDT pair may climb to $635. This is an important level for the bears to defend because a break above it could clear the path for a rally to $722.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck between $0.57 and $0.64 for the past few days, indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/645ce27a-baf2-4a47-81d6-4c16ab86307a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/29: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.57) and the RSI near 63 suggest that the bulls have the edge. The XRP/USDT pair could rise to $0.64, which is an important level to watch out for. If buyers clear this hurdle, the pair may pick up momentum and surge to $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bears have seized control. That may start a slide to the 50-day SMA ($0.51).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-ethereum-eth-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Ether (ETH) price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($0.13) on July 28, suggesting that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/84b20ad5-058b-43a3-9acf-d62104315594.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/29: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive zone suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside. Buyers will try to drive the price above $0.14 and start the journey to $0.18.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to pull the price below the solid support at $0.12. If they manage to do that, the selling could pick up, and the DOGE/USDT pair may plunge to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) fell below $6.77 on July 25, but the bears could not extend the decline. This suggests demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/cd0df6fe-1c73-465e-88f6-1d20185b9459.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/29: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to push the price back above $6.77. If they do that, the TON/USDT pair could reach the 20-day EMA ($6.99), where the bears are likely to sell aggressively. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will strive to start a downward move to $6.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if buyers kick the price above the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the markets have rejected the lower levels. The pair could climb to the 50-day SMA ($7.32) and subsequently to $7.72.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 50-day SMA ($0.40) on July 25, but the bears could not sustain the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/b56bf909-a087-4977-913c-96b09d0f2d01.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/29: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip and pushed the price above the moving averages. Both moving averages are flattening out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, suggesting that the bears are losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may reach $0.46, where the bears will again try to stall the up move. However, if the bulls prevail, the next stop could be $0.52. If bears want to prevent the up move, they will have to tug the price below $0.38.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvYTJlMjM4ZGMtOGM0ZC00ZDVjLWJjYWEtNWJjZmE3NTE5MTJmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240729ek7t000e5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/26: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,638 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 July 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s bounce from $63,500 shows a positive sentiment where lower levels are being purchased, but $70,000 may act as a stiff barrier.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvMWMwYjFiNzgtODgwNy00YWMwLWJmMjQtMTZkM2M5NzJkZTJhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/26: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 After a short pullback, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has resumed its march toward the psychological resistance of $70,000. This suggests that every {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-unprecedented-23b-july-buying-spree"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 minor dip is being purchased}}}\uc2 . CryptoQuant CEO Ki Young Ju said in a post on X that \u8220\'20\'1C358K BTC has moved to permanent holder addresses\u8221\'20\'1D in July, suggesting that Bitcoin is \u8220\'20\'1Cin an accumulation phase.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 World\u8217\'20\'19s largest Bitcoin miner, \uc2 Marathon Digital Holdings\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/marathon-digital-buys-100m-bitcoin-hodl-strategy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added $100 million in Bitcoin}}}\uc2  to its Bitcoin holdings over the past month to take its total to more than 20,000 Bitcoin. The firm\u8217\'20\'19s CEO and chairman, \uc2 Fred Thiel\uc2 , said in a July 25 X post that Marathon will \u8220\'20\'1Cnow go full HODL\u8221\'20\'1D in keeping Bitcoin as their strategic treasury reserve asset.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/70de22c4-3aa6-4bf4-9d36-6c566fdcc990.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/26: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While most analysts are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the long term, some have turned {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-warn-btc-price-dip-62k-even-lower"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cautious in the near term}}}\uc2 . Capriole Investments founder Charles Edwards told Cointelegraph that the launch of Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) exchange-traded funds (ETFs) in a somewhat weak market may {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-ethereum-etfs-risks-taking-capital-away-from-bitcoin-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 create sell pressure in Bitcoin}}}\uc2  if some \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  institutional investors plan to diversify their holdings.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin reach $70,000, or could higher levels witness aggressive selling by the bears? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rebounded off the 20-day exponential moving average ($64,283) on July 25, signaling that the sentiment remains positive.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/6456d2b6-2824-4b21-bdae-f0850360c963.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/26: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to clear the hurdle at $68,500 and reach the overhead resistance at $72,000. Sellers are expected to mount a fierce defense in the $72,000 to $73,777 zone. If the price turns down sharply from the zone but finds support at the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bulls remain in control. That will improve the prospects of a break above $73,777.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA remains the key level to watch out for on the downside because a break below it will suggest that the bulls have given up. That may sink the BTC/USDT pair toward $60,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether broke below the moving averages on July 24 and extended the slide on July 25, indicating that the bears are trying to form a lower high at $3,563.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/41b938a3-c6cc-4d6c-89bf-2ffa56d2b30c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/26: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have started to turn down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just below the midpoint, suggesting a minor advantage for the bears. If the current recovery falters at the moving averages, it will increase the possibility of a drop to $3,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if buyers push the price above the moving averages, it will signal that lower levels continue to attract buyers. The ETH/USDT pair may climb to $3,563 and subsequently to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 20-day EMA ($570) on July 25, but the long tail on the candlestick shows buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/25eeb85b-e713-4e47-aa71-bb9bbb0cd990.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/26: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will make another attempt to propel the price toward the overhead resistance of $635. Sellers are expected to defend this level with all their might because a break above it will clear the path for a rally to $722.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be negated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below $550. Such a move will signal that the BNB/USDT pair is likely to spend some more time inside the $495 to $635 range.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the downtrend line on July 25, indicating that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/1920a8b9-0bbd-40c9-9e01-dd6102703c3b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/26: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day SMA ($163) and the RSI in the positive territory suggest that the bulls have the advantage. A break and close above $189 will open the doors for a rally to the overhead resistance of $210.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from $189 and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the demand dries up at higher levels. The pair may then drop to the 50-day SMA ($149).\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance of $0.64 on July 25, indicating that the bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/a476526d-fc05-491d-8076-d8fc155fdd5e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/26: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair is stuck between $0.57 and $0.64. The upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.56) and the RSI in the positive zone suggest that the bulls have the edge. If the price breaks above $0.64, the pair could start its journey toward the formidable hurdle at $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the short-term bulls are booking profits. That may start a move down toward the 50-day SMA ($0.50), signaling a large range formation between $0.41 and $0.64.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the critical support at $0.12 on July 25, indicating that the buyers are trying to guard it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/3314457f-8d05-43c3-b209-ad339cbd3743.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/26: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to strengthen their position further by pushing the price above the $0.14 resistance. If they can pull it off, the DOGE/USDT pair could rise to $0.18, where the bulls are likely to face solid selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down sharply and plummets below $0.12. That may accelerate selling and sink the pair to $0.10, where the bulls are expected to step in.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the $6.77 support on July 25, completing a double-top pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/976bef11-faec-4d83-aec7-962c3336a4b7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/26: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to push the price back into the range on July 26, but they are likely to face stiff resistance from the bears at higher levels. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA ($7.12), the bears will make another attempt to sink the TON/USDT pair to $6 and eventually to $5.50.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to prevent the downside, they will have to swiftly drive the price above the moving averages. The pair could then climb to $7.72, where the bears will try to stall the recovery.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) pulled back below the moving averages on July 25, but the lower levels are attracting buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/3645e6a9-cb6c-4e32-957c-35b96f3509a7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/26: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rises and maintains above the moving averages, it will suggest that the sentiment is turning positive and traders are buying on dips. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to $0.46 and then to $0.52.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down sharply from the moving averages, it will suggest that the bears are trying to gain the upper hand. The pair could slide to the strong support at $0.35.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) broke below the moving averages on July 25, but the bears are struggling to sustain the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/b325ad1b-9bf4-4bef-99b5-854ecf5365e6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/26: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to push the price back above the moving averages and the resistance at $29. If they succeed, it will suggest that the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair has formed a higher low. The pair may then climb to $34 and later to $37.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from $29, it will suggest that the markets have rejected the higher levels. The bears will then try to pull the price down to the strong support at $24 and thereafter to $21.80.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 50-day SMA ($0.000017) on July 23, but the bears have been unable to sink the price below $0.000015.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/5c8a1aa8-1165-458c-9d9e-8e0ae4345fea.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/26: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to push the price back above the moving averages. If they do that, it will suggest that the SHIB/USDT pair may consolidate between $0.000015 and $0.000020 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that the bears remain in charge. That will increase the likelihood of a break below $0.000015. The pair may then retest the support at $0.000013.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvMWMwYjFiNzgtODgwNy00YWMwLWJmMjQtMTZkM2M5NzJkZTJhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240726ek7q000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, DOGE, TON,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,667 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 July 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins may continue oscillating inside a range, indicating the lack of a decisive trigger.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvNzgxNzA1OWMtYjg3OS00YjIyLWE4ZGQtOTE5YzljOWMwN2FkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto exchange Kraken said in a July 24 X post that it had distributed all the funds to the \uc2 Mt. Gox\uc2  creditors. However, that has not boosted Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , suggesting that the recipients of the repayments {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/kraken-completes-mt-gox-bitcoin-distribution-credits"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 are not rushing to book profits}}}\uc2  as anticipated by a few analysts.\par \par \uc2 Similarly, the launch of spot Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) exchange-traded funds (ETFs) failed to start any fireworks in Ether, suggesting that the markets are in a wait-and-watch mode. A minor positive is that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-etf-inflows-106-million-first-day-trading"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ether ETFs witnessed net inflows}}}\uc2  of $106.6 million on the first day, even after $485 million in outflows from Grayscale\u8217\'20\'19s freshly converted Ethereum Trust.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/dff0645c-dc9d-4911-9161-f032ea25c82c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select major altcoins have been consolidating for some time, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears about the next directional move. The longer the range, the stronger the trigger needed for the price to break out from it.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin continue its range-bound action, or could buyers propel the price above the range? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin remains stuck in sideways price action between $56,552 and $73,777, indicating buying on support and selling near resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/89fe9a5d-e7e8-4e23-93d1-62a2ad21d575.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day simple moving average ($61,887) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate that the short-term trend favors the buyers. The bulls will try to propel the price to $73,777 but may encounter stiff resistance at $70,000 and again at $72,000.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, if the $65,000 support cracks, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to the moving averages. This is an essential support for the bulls to defend because a break below it could open the doors for a fall to $60,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether turned up from the 50-day SMA ($3,411) on July 23, but the bulls are struggling to sustain the bounce. This suggests that the bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/ad1c5c2b-2770-48eb-86f1-a2c36bff9e90.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price skids below the 50-day SMA, the ETH/USDT pair could drop to the 20-day SMA ($3,272). This is an important level to watch out for because if this support breaks down, the selling could pick up, and the pair may plummet to $3,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $3,563, it will suggest that the short-term trend remains positive. The pair could rally to $3,722 and thereafter to $4,000. Sellers are expected to fiercely defend the $4,000 to $4,094 zone.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls attempted to push BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) toward the overhead resistance at $635, but the bears pulled the price back to the 50-day SMA ($583).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/e9687705-eb4d-4225-b37d-1610377e19fa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 50-day SMA with strength, it will indicate that the bulls are buying on every minor dip. That will improve the prospects of a break above $635. If that happens, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to $722.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks and closes below the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that the bears are trying to keep the price inside the $495 to $635 range for some more time. The pair could then tumble to the 20-day SMA ($552).\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $185 on July 22 and is retesting the breakout level from the descending triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/1c35e77f-415a-4449-a1a5-17609a006321.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day SMA ($154) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory suggest that the bulls are in command. If the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $185, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could reach $210.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price re-enters the triangle. The bears will gain strength after they sink the price below the moving averages as it will signal the recent breakout may have been a bull trap.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) below the $0.57 support on July 23, but the bulls held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/7761b552-5a10-4bb0-a454-0e4aa9c5e450.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buying picked up on July 24, and the bulls are trying to overcome the barrier at $0.64. If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair is likely to pick up momentum and surge toward the formidable resistance of $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to prevent the up move, they will have to successfully defend the $0.64 level and then yank the pair below $0.57. If they do that, the pair may slide to the 20-day SMA ($0.52).\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) pulled back to the 50-day SMA ($0.13) on July 23, which is likely to attract buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/9d3a3fd3-0b6d-4f3f-9397-f3605049e28f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day SMA ($0.12) has started to turn up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the positive territory, indicating that the bulls have a slight edge. If the bounce off the 50-day SMA sustains, the bulls will try to kick the DOGE/USDT pair to $0.15 and then to $0.18.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the 50-day SMA cracks, it will signal that the bears have overpowered the bulls. The pair may then slump to the 20-day SMA, which is again likely to act as a support. A break below this level will tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) dropped to the support of the range at $6.77, which is an important level to watch out for.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/718799c3-87dd-46cf-a07a-8c98961a2273.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A weak rebound off the current level will signal a lack of aggressive buying, increasing the likelihood of a break below $6.77. If that happens, the TON/USDT pair will complete a double-top pattern. That may start a decline to $6 and subsequently to $5.50.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up sharply from the current level, it will signal solid demand from the bulls. The pair may then climb to $7.72, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-retest-72k-bitcoin-7b-liquidation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC price to retest $72K as Bitcoin sets up $7B liquidation showdown}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) dropped to the moving averages on July 23, where the buyers are expected to step in to arrest the decline.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/0cd92c54-9f83-42b0-bbcd-e1b3cae96cdf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up sharply from the current level, it will suggest a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips. The bulls will then try to propel the price above $0.46, starting a move to $0.52.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the bears are trying to assert their supremacy. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the strong support near $0.35.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $33 on July 21 and reached the moving averages on July 24, indicating a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/5ee81904-c6cf-4f93-9e78-970c76242e94.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day SMA ($27.55) and the RSI just above the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price breaks below the 20-day SMA, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair may drop to $24 and eventually to $21.80.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off the moving averages, it will signal that the bulls are trying to form a higher low. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $33 to suggest the start of a stronger recovery toward $37 and then $42.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the moving averages for the past few days, but this tight-range trading is unlikely to continue for long.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/779fde93-5047-42b1-80b3-011c947c24ac.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOGE, TON, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains below the 20-day SMA, it will open the doors for a fall to $0.000015 and then to $0.000013. A bounce off this level will keep the price stuck between $0.000013 and $0.000020 for some time.\par \par \uc2 The SHIB/USDT pair is likely to gain strength after buyers drive the price above $0.000020. Such a move will suggest that the markets have rejected the lower levels. The pair could then attempt a rally to $0.000026.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvNzgxNzA1OWMtYjg3OS00YjIyLWE4ZGQtOTE5YzljOWMwN2FkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240724ek7o000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
