\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Price Analysis 7-22 BTC, ETH, SOL, DOT, DOGE, UNI,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , WIF\b0\par\par\uc2 Amara Khatri \par \uc2 2,340 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 July 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Smart Money Continues BTC Buying Spree}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogwifhat (WIF) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) registered an impressive increase over the weekend, with the price overcoming a crucial resistance level to move above $65,000. The move above $65,000 came after a slight pullback. However, spot Bitcoin ETFs continued to receive inflows, indicating that while markets were cautious, they had not turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 BTC\u8217\'20\'19s recovery could set it on the path to $70,000 and a new all-time high, with the price on an upward trajectory since it closed above the 200-day SMA on July 14.\par \par \uc2 Smart Money Continues BTC Buying Spree\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) registered a strong weekend, climbing over the crucial $65,000 mark, as bulls seized the initiative after a slight pullback. The cryptocurrency has registered an 8% increase over the past week, with the $70,000 level in its sights. BTC\u8217\'20\'19s recovery can be attributed to significant inflows into spot Bitcoin ETFs and whale accumulation. If BTC\u8217\'20\'19s current surge continues, we could see a push toward a new all-time high.\par \par \uc2 According to data from Lookonchain, an on-chain data tracer, BTC whales have been on a buying spree and have accumulated a considerable amount of the cryptocurrency. It highlighted a single BTC whale who purchased 213.78 BTC in the past 24 hours. The whale in question has bought a total of 677 BTC over the past four days, with the total value of the whale\u8217\'20\'19s holdings a staggering $45.6 million.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis smart money bought 215.5 $BTC($14M) again 16 minutes ago and currently holds 463.16 $BTC($30M).\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 According to analysts, such large-scale purchases highlight the confidence of major investors in BTC\u8217\'20\'19s potential. Nate Geraci, president of the ETF Store, also highlighted the crucial role of spot Bitcoin ETFs in the US. According to Geraci, US-listed spot Bitcoin ETFs hold 900,000 BTC, which is approximately 4.3% of the total BTC supply, with their current valuation a staggering $60 billion.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Looking at the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/07/crypto-price-analysis-7-19-btc-eth-sol-ton-dot-bonk-tia"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC)}}}\uc2  price chart, we can see a V-shaped recovery. BTC registered a strong upward trajectory after hitting a low of $53,591 on July 5, representing an increase of just over 26%. BTC had attempted to push above $65,000 on Wednesday but faced considerable selling pressure. As a result, BTC fell by 1.49% to $64,156 after reaching a day high of $66,135. Thursday saw a notable spike in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  as buyers and sellers attempted to establish control. BTC eventually registered a marginal decline and settled at $64,027.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/W843oWcP/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 With strong support at $64,000, BTC rallied on Friday as buyers entered the market, propelling it past the resistance at $65,000 after a 4.10% increase which saw it settle at $66,652. BTC continued to be \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the weekend, rising by 0.65% on Saturday and 0.84% on Sunday to move to $67,654. However, Sunday also saw BTC overcome significant selling pressure as sellers attempted to push BTC back below $65,000. As a result, BTC fell to a day low of $65,730, managing to stay above $65,000. The current session sees BTC down marginally, with sellers having pushed the price down from $68,000. We could see selling pressure increase during the ongoing session, with sellers attempting to push the price below $65,000 once again. However, if BTC is able to stay above $65,000, we could see a retest of the $68,000 resistance zone and a push towards $70,000.\par \par \uc2 However, the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is close to the overbought zone, indicating a short-term correction.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) registered a strong recovery over the weekend, which saw the price climb above $3,500 ahead of the launch of the sp[ot Ethereum ETFs. While bulls tried to extend the recovery, ETH faced significant selling pressure, as can be seen in the price chart. While ETH may be in the red in the current session, it has registered an impressive increase over the past week. It surged by 7.37% at the beginning of last week, rising to $3,486. However, with sellers active at this level, ETH was down to $3,389 by Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 ETH made a strong push towards $3,500 on Thursday, reaching a day high of $3,490, but sellers were able to push the price down to $3,426, an increase of 1.09%. Friday saw strong demand as ETH moved past the 50-day SMA and $3,500 to settle at $3,501. The price remained in the green over the weekend, although it faced significant selling pressure, as seen in the price chart. Sellers pushed ETH to a day low of $3,413 on Sunday, but the price recovered and pushed back above the 50-day SMA, eventually settling at $3,537.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/o35BvesQ/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The current session sees ETH down by 1.75% as sellers look to push ETH below $3,500 once again. Some analysts have predicted that should the initial hype around spot ETH ETFs wear off, it could lead to a drop in the price of ETH. So far, ETH has managed to remain above the 50-day SMA. Should buyers continue to remain above it and reclaim $3,500, it could propel ETH to $3,700. Bears are expected to defend this level, but a push to $4,000 cannot be ruled out if bulls win out. However, if sellers are able to push ETH below the 50-day SMA, we could see ETH drop to $3,300, where the 20-day SMA could act as support. With Cboe confirming that spot Ethereum ETFs will begin trading on July 23, we can anticipate a spike in the price of ETH.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (SOL) has registered a remarkable recovery over the past couple of weeks. The last seven days have seen the cryptocurrency surge by almost 17% as buyers eye the $200 level. The price has seen a remarkable recovery since dropping by 3.23% on Wednesday, with bears unable to push the price below $150. SOL made a strong push towards $160 on Thursday, rising by 2.35%. However, despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment, it was unable to do so and settled at $159.25. A 6.30% increase on Friday allowed SOL to push above $160 and settle at $169.29, putting the bulls firmly in control.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/m1Dafh1V/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 As a result, the weekend saw a significant push towards $180. SOL registered a 2.62% increase on Saturday, allowing it to break above the resistance at $170 and settle at $173.73. Sellers attempted to push SOL back below $170, but the price rebounded after hitting a day low of $170.93, surged by 6.20%, and pushed above $180 to settle at $184. With sellers active at this level, SOL has registered a drop during the ongoing session and is down by 3.35%, trading below the $180 mark. With the 20-day SMA on the up, it is an indication that the bulls have the edge. However, the \uc2 RSI\uc2  suggests we could see a drop in the short term.\par \par \uc2 If SOL is able to withstand \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pressure and stay above $170, we could see a rebound and a push towards $200. However, if the bears are able to push SOL below $170, we could see a drop down to the $160 support level.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) has yet to capitalize on the crypto market bull run, with its price movement being rather underwhelming compared to other major altcoins. The cryptocurrency has struggled to push above the $6.50 level, having failed to go above this resistance level a number of times. The previous week saw considerable \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and while DOT recovered, it found itself in the red once again during the current session. DOT had been extremely positive over the previous weekend and rose to $6.49 the previous Monday. However, it could not move any higher thanks to significant \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pressure and was down to $6.90 by Thursday. Thankfully for DOT, it has strong support at $6, and as a result, it made a strong recovery on Friday, pushing above the 20 and 50-day SMAs and settling at $6.35.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/6lWwtDrY/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The weekend saw DOT make yet another attempt to push above $6.50, rising to $6.44 despite facing considerable selling pressure. However, buyers were unable to sustain the momentum, with DOT falling back in the red during the ongoing session. Currently, DOT is down by almost 3% and trading at $6.26. If the current \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment continues, DOT could drop back to its support level of $6, after which we could recover. If this level is breached, the price could drop to $5.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) saw a significant increase in July as buyers attempted to push the meme coin above $0.140. DOGE saw a slight correction during the past week and dropped to $0.119 on Thursday. However, bears were unable to push DOGE below the 20-day SMA, and the price rebounded on Friday, registering a 5.46% increase to settle at $0.125. DOGE also remained \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the weekend, surging past the 50 and 200-day SMAs on Saturday to settle at $0.133. However, DOGE faced significant selling pressure on Sunday as sellers attempted to establish control. Despite this, DOGE registered an increase of 5.09% and climbed above $0.140.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/jYUHEY5w/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The current session sees DOGE down by 1.78% as sellers defend the $0.140 level. Should sellers continue to control the session, DOGE could drop towards $0.130. If this level is breached, it could open the doors to a drop towards the 20-day SMA. However, we could see another move to $0.140 if the price recovers. Buyers must reclaim and consolidate above this level if they want the price to move to $0.150.\par \par \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) had a mixed performance the previous week, starting positively but then experiencing a significant drop that wiped out earlier gains. UNI closed at $8.60 the previous Monday but could not push any higher, falling into the red on Tuesday. By Thursday, sellers had pushed UNI below $8 to $7.83 before a 1.99% increase on Friday saw the price move to $7.99. UNI experienced significant \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Saturday but was able to push above $8 on Sunday despite facing considerable selling pressure. Bears were able to drop UNI to a day low of $7.64 before buyers pushed it above $8 to $8.12. However, UNI is back in the red during the current session as sellers look to push it back below $8.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/Ze910EEL/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Should sellers continue to dominate the session, UNI could drop to $7.50, a level with strong support.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) encountered strong resistance at the $0.45 level, which halted an incredible surge for the altcoin. As a result of this resistance, bears were able to take over during the previous week, pushing \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  down to $0.42 by Thursday. However, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  was able to bounce back from this level on Friday, indicating strong demand around $0.40. As a result, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose by 3.78% on Friday to move to $0.43. Saturday saw a marginal drop before \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  was back in the green on Sunday despite facing significant selling pressure, which pushed the price to a day low of $0.41. However, once again, demand picked up at lower levels, allowing \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  to register an increase of 2.29% and settle at $0.44.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/Bnc4mCC9/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The current session sees \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  back in the red thanks to strong resistance at $0.45. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is presently down by 2.46% and trading at $0.43. Should sellers continue to control the session, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could drop to $0.40. Bulls will attempt to push above $0.45. A break above this level could cause the price to push to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 Dogwifhat (WIF) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogwifhat (WIF) has been extremely \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  since hitting a low of $1.49 on July 11. The meme token has rallied an incredible 49% over the past 7 days, with bulls eying the $3 resistance level. WIF has undoubtedly been one of the top gainers of the previous week, a trend that could potentially continue during the previous week as well. After a brief slowdown in the middle of the previous week, WIF surged past the 50-day SMA and a crucial resistance level on Thursday to settle at $2.43. Sellers attempted to regain control on Friday, pushing WIF to a low of $2.31. However, buyers were able to push the price higher, with the meme token registering an increase of 4.40% to settle at $2.54.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/BxKlxQdm/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The weekend saw bulls remain in control, and WIF registered an increase of 3.68% on Saturday to settle at $2.63. WIF faced selling pressure once again on Sunday as sellers pushed the price down to a low of $2.40. However, once again, buyers were able to prop up the price. WIF eventually registered an increase of 6.89% to settle at $2.82. The current session sees sellers back in control, making yet another attempt to push WIF below $2.50. However, buyers will defend this level and look to consolidate above it as they eye the crucial $3 level.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/investment-disclaimer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investment Disclaimer}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240723ek7m0000k\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/22: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP, TON, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,684 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 July 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally is facing selling above $68,000, indicating that the range-bound action may continue for some more time.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvZWUzZGY4NjQtYzRhNC00NTJiLTg4Y2EtMDRhNDMwNjVhODA1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/22: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) plunged about 2% last week, but the weakness in the equity markets could not dampen the enthusiasm of the cryptocurrency traders. Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) made a strong comeback, rising roughly 12% for the week.\par \par \uc2 According to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  da, \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment products witnessed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-leads-1-35b-weekly-digital-asset-inflows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 strong inflows of $1.35 billion last week}}}\uc2 , taking the total inflows in the past three weeks to $3.2 billion. Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s strength also resulted in outflows of $1.9 million from short-Bitcoin exchange-traded products.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/e8716ac7-3910-48ff-bccd-f22fecf0d482.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/22: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Even after the recent rally, Bitcoin remains stuck inside a sideways price action. As the price nears the resistance, the bears are likely to pose a strong challenge. However, analysts are optimistic about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-trader-2-months-all-time-high-china-cuts-rates"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin hitting a new all-time high}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin rise to $70,000, or will traders pull the price back below $65,000? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index is correcting in an uptrend, suggesting that the short-term traders are booking profits after a strong rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/d8f9c16c-485b-4725-ab47-e9f0afdc5c82.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/22: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The index plunged below the 20-day simple moving average (5,504) on July 19, but the bears could not continue the downward move. Buyers are trying to push the price back above the 20-day SMA on July 22 but may find it difficult to do so.\par \par \uc2 If the index closes below the 20-day SMA, the next stop is likely to be the 50-day SMA (5,416). Contrarily, a rise back above the 20-day SMA will signal that the recent breakdown may have been a bull trap. The index may then again climb toward 5,670.\par \par \uc2 US dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The US dollar index (DXY) has been falling inside a descending channel pattern for several days, indicating a negative sentiment.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/548d6160-1a07-4c9a-ac4f-3f47828577e3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/22: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price bounced off the channel\u8217\'20\'19s support line on July 18, signaling that the bulls are aggressively defending the level. If the price rises above 104.50, the index could reach the 20-day SMA (104.95), which is likely to act as a solid resistance. If the price turns down from the 20-day SMA, it will increase the possibility of a break below the channel. If that happens, the index could decline to 102.50.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if buyers propel the price above the moving averages, it will suggest that the index may continue to oscillate inside the channel for a while. A break and close above the channel could start a rally to 108.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bounced off the $66,000 level on July 21, but the recovery faltered near $68,500 on July 22, indicating that bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/d92e017e-f3e8-432c-bf8c-9d6b2cd4fbb9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/22: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the $66,000 level breaks down, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($63,799) support. A solid bounce off the 50-day SMA will indicate that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to kick the price to the stiff overhead resistance zone between $72,000 and $73,777.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price dives below the 50-day SMA, it will signal that the bears are in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The pair could then drop to the 20-day SMA ($61,126).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 50-day SMA ($3,425) on July 19, but the momentum did not pick up. This suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/3d27ad81-1979-4d2e-8b4c-09361ecc1a15.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/22: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to pull the price back below the 50-day SMA. If they do that, the possibility of a drop to the 20-day SMA ($3,246) increases. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if it breaks, the ETH/USDT pair may slide to $3,000.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the fall, they will have to defend the moving averages and drive the price above $3,600. The pair could then attempt a rally to the $4,000 to $4,094 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside the large range between $495 and $635 for several days, indicating buying on dips and selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/6f5ecb90-eff2-4df8-9640-0677d6c862a7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/22: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price above the 50-day SMA ($586) on July 19 but are finding it difficult to extend the rally to $635. Sellers will again try to pull the price below the 50-day SMA. If they do that, the BNB/USDT pair may tumble to the 20-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 The critical resistance to watch out for in the near term is $635. If bulls overcome this barrier, it will signal that the uptrend is resuming. The pair may then attempt a rally to $722, where the bears may mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke above the downtrend line on July 20, opening the doors for a possible rally to $210.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/a5d30e25-9050-41e1-bc3d-00e9ea323374.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/22: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. They will try to stall the rally near $189 and pull the price toward the downtrend line. If the price rebounds off the downtrend line, it will signal that the bulls have flipped the line into support. That will increase the likelihood of a rally to $210.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and breaks below the downtrend line, it will suggest that the bears are making a comeback. The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could then plummet to the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) below the breakout level of $0.57, but they could not sustain the lower levels. This suggests aggressive buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/3e61949c-d1f2-496d-bbaa-a3b3dc269106.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/22: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to push the price above $0.64, setting the stage for a move to $0.67 and later $0.74. Sellers are expected to defend the $0.74 level with all their might. If the XRP/USDT pair turns down from $0.74, it will signal that the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The $0.57 to $0.54 zone is expected to act as a strong support on declines. A break below the zone will tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-solana-price-up-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Solana (SOL) price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/toncoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TON}}}\uc2  ) has turned down from the moving averages, indicating that the bears are defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/70426479-329c-46c3-a176-0431871d2d7d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/22: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day SMA ($7.29) has started to turn down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just below the midpoint, indicating a slight advantage to the bears. The TON/USDT pair could slide to the solid support at $6.77. This level is expected to attract strong buying by the bulls, which could keep the pair inside the $6.77 to $7.72 range for a while.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below $6.77 will complete a double-top pattern, starting a downtrend. On the other hand, a rise above $7.72 could challenge the stiff overhead resistance of $8.29.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the 20-day SMA ($0.12) on July 19 and broke above the 50-day SMA ($0.13) on July 20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/c33834a8-e49a-4469-840e-fa0b6563d39e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/22: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day SMA has started to turn up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the overbought zone, indicating that bulls have the edge. The DOGE/USDT pair could attempt a rally to the overhead resistance at $0.18.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the 50-day SMA and then the 20-day SMA are likely to act as strong support. If the price rebounds off the moving averages, it will improve the prospects of the resumption of the relief rally.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading above the moving averages, but the bulls are struggling to push the price above $0.46. This suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-07/ad96a5d8-c120-4251-a74d-609314e71489.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/22: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, TON, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could remain stuck between the moving averages and $0.46 for some time. If the range resolves to the upside, it will signal the start of an up move toward $0.52, where the bears may mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price continues lower and plummets below the moving averages, it will signal that the bears remain active at higher levels. The pair may then slump to the strong support at $0.35.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDcvZWUzZGY4NjQtYzRhNC00NTJiLTg4Y2EtMDRhNDMwNjVhODA1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240722ek7m000b7\par }\par \b \uc2 Search Summary\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (ADA) AND ("market reaction" OR "price drop" OR "price rise" OR "volatility" OR "bullish" OR "bearish" OR "investor sentiment" OR "regulation" OR "ETF approval" OR "crypto ban" OR "crypto adoption" OR "digital\u160\'00\'A0asset")\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdr